window.FWN_CULTIVATION_CHAT_GROUP_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_CULTIVATION_CHAT_GROUP_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":2901,"title":"Chapter 2901: I didn’t expect you to be like this, Senior Song!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2901: I didn’t expect you to be like this, Senior Song!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Golden Trigram’s memories had been ‘sealed’ before, and he knew this very well—because he didn’t have any memories before he joined the Heavenly Court!","Not long ago, when he was inheriting the position of the Heavenly Emperor, the Heavenly Emperor had personally answered his doubts about sealing his memories. According to the Celestial Thearch, he was once a disciple that the Celestial Thearch had secretly taken in before establishing the celestial heavens. His cultivation techniques, knowledge, and methods were all taught by the Heavenly Emperor. This was also the reason why he was unable to take the final step on the path to immortality. This was because his path was actually the path of the Heavenly Emperor! Under the premise that the Celestial Thearch had a master, he could not attain immortality.","According to the Heavenly Emperor’s explanation, the reason for sealing his memories was to prevent him from being involved in the disaster during the process of building the Heavenly Court. Later, after the Heavenly Court was successfully established, the Celestial Thearch brought him into the Heavenly Court. However, he brought him into the Heavenly Court as a ‘newbie’ and built his own celestial palace for him. The Celestial Thearch’s explanation was generally reasonable and there was nothing to doubt.","However, after the Heavenly Emperor passed the Heavenly Emperor’s seat to him, he still did not undo the seal on his memory. Back then, it was because the Heavenly Emperor had used the topic of ‘Senior Song’ to divert his attention, causing him to forget about the matter of the ‘memory seal’.","And now... Just as Island Master Golden Trigram turned around and glanced at Song Shuhang, the memories in Golden Trigram’s mind began to surface with the help of the ‘laws of time’, ‘the path of the Heavenly City’, ‘Tyrannical Song’s special physique’, and other factors.","He discovered that the first time he met Song Shuhang wasn’t on the mysterious island.","“The Ghost God Fragment was originally a female. However, after my modification, I naturally had to change the settings and turn the female into a male... Hmm, Heavenly Emperor. From today onwards, you are the Heavenly Emperor!” A mechanical voice sounded.","However, at this moment, Golden Trigram found that his vision was completely dark. And then... The ‘image’ he saw jumped. This was because the scene he was seeing now was centered around ‘Song Shuhang’. It was the memories related to Song Shuhang that had been extracted.","In his memory, Golden Trigram found that he was a boy around six years old.","“Is this how I looked like when I was young? Is it my childhood memory?” Golden Trigram was moved. “Could it be that I came into contact with ‘Tyrannical Song’ when I was six years old?”","“Could it be... The Celestial Thearch didn’t trick me. Is she telling the truth? The one who is really lying is Tyrannical Song?!”","But why would Tyrannical Song lie? Many thoughts flashed through Golden Trigram’s mind.","As his thoughts raced, the scenes in his memory slowly unfolded. In his memory, a strange person with ‘dual-pupils’ appeared. He began to teach the six-year-old Golden Trigram about cultivation and assisted him in his cultivation. The cultivation method taught by the strange man was extremely compatible with the young Golden Trigram. It was as if it was tailor-made for him.","“Could this strange person be the Heavenly Emperor? Was it her incarnation? Is she teaching me how to cultivate?” Golden Trigram guessed after combining it with the explanation given by the Heavenly Emperor. Because it was a memory, the images flashed through his mind very quickly.","In any case, he cultivated day and night and ate pills... Then, there was the scene of day cultivation, night cultivation, and eating pills. In just four short years, he had advanced to the Fourth Stage Realm! If this cultivation speed was placed in the myriad worlds, it would be so fast that it was terrifying!","In the next five years, he condensed a Supreme Golden Core with nine dragon patterns and advanced to the Fifth Stage! His cultivation was extremely smooth!","“Strange, where’s Tyrannical Song?” Island Master Golden Trigram asked curiously.","Since the memory was centered around Song Shuhang, it meant that Song Shuhang had always been by his side in this scene. However, ever since he started cultivating at the age of six, he hadn’t found any trace of Tyrannical Song.","“Wait, could it be... This weirdo with dual-pupils is Tyrannical Song?”","Because in the picture, there was only the young him and the strange man with dual-pupils!","“If this weirdo with dual-pupils is Tyrannical Song, then he is indeed my ‘senior’... However, the Celestial Thearch’s words were suspicious. Isn’t she the one who accepted me as her disciple? Tyrannical Song or Heavenly Emperor, who is lying?” Golden Trigram frowned and continued reading. As long as his memories were fully unfolded, the truth would be revealed!","The scene was still progressing slowly. After reaching the Fifth Stage Realm, the strange man with dual-pupils left. He left... He left just like that!","However, the scene of the memory still hadn’t ended. The memory with Song Shuhang as the center was still unfolding!","“Isn’t the dual-pupiled freak Tyrannical Song? And Tyrannical Song is still hidden in my memories? Where is he?” Island Master Golden Trigram was completely confused. His memories were still progressing rapidly...","The young him quickly entered the segment of the Golden Core composition. The Golden Core Formation was not a problem for him. He used the nine dragon patterns as ink to construct a Golden Core Heavenly City Formation!","“It’s indeed the path of the Heavenly Court... When I was at the Fifth Stage Spiritual Emperor Realm, my path was already set. The Celestial Thearch did not lie about this.”","The progress of the Golden Core composition was very fast. It did not take long for it to reach 99%. Now, it was only missing the finishing touch! For cultivators of the cultivation system, the finishing touch of the Golden Core was extremely important. A golden core determined the great path, and this finishing touch was the most important part of the golden core.","The young man’s smooth cultivation finally met a bottleneck. He was stuck in the ‘Finishing Eye’. This stroke required an epiphany.","“Tyrannical Song still hasn’t appeared,” Golden Trigram frowned. “So, where was Tyrannical Song?”","Just as Golden Trigram was feeling puzzled... The young man in the picture made a shocking move.","“Right, at this time, you can pray to ‘God’!” the youth said.","Golden Trigram was dumbfounded.","“What the hell was praying to God? This can’t be me! I can’t be this funny!” But the young man in his memory had taken action. He began to build an altar and prayed seriously, “God, I pray to you here. Please guide me in the next direction. It’s best if it’s close to me, because if it’s too far, I won’t be able to find the direction.”","Then, it was the process of the young man praying seriously. What shocked Golden Trigram was that the young man seemed to have received feedback from a certain voice. As the young man continued to ask questions, a clear sentence finally appeared in Golden Trigram’s ears.","“Courting death is a virus called Thrice Reckless Disease. It was terrifyingly contagious. If you really want to try to court death, then go to the highest mountain peak, seal your spiritual qi, and jump down with all your might. Leap of Faith. During the process of landing, you will experience the feeling of ‘death’ approaching.”","Golden Trigram:","Then, the young man in his memory happily ran to the highest peak—he came to the cliff where he would definitely be crushed if he jumped down. Then, he began to seriously seal his spiritual power.","“No, don’t be so stupid!” Golden Trigram shouted. He was about to cry from this youth’s stupidity.","“None of this is a problem!” The young man shouted and jumped into the cliff under Golden Trigram’s desperate gaze!","“Is this the feeling of death?” the young man asked excitedly as he jumped down. “Something in my body seems to have awakened. I feel like I can enter the last stroke of the Golden Core composition. It’s time to stop.”","“Not good, I don’t know how to stop!”","Other than cultivating, the young man had never refined a magic weapon... Moreover, he had sealed his spiritual energy.","Hong","As Golden Trigram’s stomach ached, the young man’s body smashed into the ground, creating a huge pit. He was covered in blood and spat out large mouthfuls of blood. He was trembling as he tried to get up... However, after only two steps, the young man fainted.","The memory ended.","“It’s you, Senior Song!” Golden Trigram stared at Song Shuhang. The voice that tricked him into sealing his spiritual energy and jumping off the cliff was Tyrannical Song!"]},{"number":2902,"title":"Chapter 2902: So, It Is!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2902: So, It Is!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Even now, Golden Trigram hadn’t figured out what he experienced when he was young. He didn’t know who his parents were or how he was born. After all, in his memory, when the plot started, he was already six years old.","However, he was certain that the voice that had tricked him into jumping off the cliff in his memory was the voice of ‘Tyrannical Song’!","The Heavenly Emperor was right about Senior Song.","Tyrannical Song had existed since ancient times!","In ancient times, when he was still young and ignorant, Tyrannical Song had always been by his side in a mysterious and undetectable way.","It was the real Senior Song.","Opposite him, Song Shuhang was dumbfounded.","The effect of the ‘scene backtracking’ of the Dao of Time was mutual. When Island Master Golden Trigram opened his memories, Song Shuhang could also receive the scene of this part.","“Senior Song!” Island Master Golden Trigram tightly hugged the rabbit in his arms and stared at Song Shuhang.","“Wait... why do you have this memory?” Song Shuhang rubbed the space between his eyebrows and stretched out his palm toward Golden Trigram, indicating for him to pause.","This person didn’t match up with his memories.","Shouldn’t this memory about his ‘dream’ be targeted at the Heavenly Emperor?","Why did the Island Master, Senior Golden Trigram, also have this memory?","“Shouldn’t I be the one asking you this question, Senior Song?” Island Lord Golden Trigram said slowly, his voice carrying a hint of resentment.","In his memories, he was a cute and stupid boy when he was young, but Senior Song actually cruelly tricked him into jumping off the cliff!","Was this something humans did?","As he spoke, Immortal Fairy White Bones, Zither Master Fengyi, Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword, Senior Turtle, and the others all recovered from their ‘Scene Rewind’ state.","The memories of their encounter with Song Shuhang were very normal, and there were no surprises.","After leaving the influence of the ‘Dao of Time,’ they looked at Song Shuhang and Golden Trigram in confusion. Why did Golden Trigram suddenly change his mind and call Song Shuhang ‘Senior Song’?","Next, Pavilion Master Chu’s hair regained its vitality.","Afterward, Senior White and Soft Feather also recovered.","“There’s something wrong with this memory...because it is the memory of Heavenly Emperor Da Da Zi,” Song Shuhang said to Golden Trigram.","“Are you sure?” Golden Trigram was stunned.","“Yes, I’m sure,” Song Shuhang said.","The conditions to activate his dreamland talent were also traceable. At the very least, before entering the dream, he would have a certain degree of ‘contact’ with the person in the dream.","Whether it was blood contact, soul contact, or law contact... In short, there would always be an opportunity to come into contact before the dreamland talent took effect.","At that time, when he was dreaming of the young Heavenly Emperor, Song Shuhang only had the opportunity to enter the dream with Heavenly Emperor Zi. It had nothing to do with the Island Master Golden Trigram.","But now...under the influence of the Dao of Time, Island Master Golden Trigram suddenly controlled this part of his memory.","“So, Golden Trigram, what is the secret between you and Tyrannical Song?” Immortal Fairy White Bones’ interest in gossip was piqued, and she asked curiously.","Golden Trigram ignored White Bones Immortal Fairy’s gossiping and guessed, “Could it be that I inherited the Dao of Heavenly Emperor, so I inherited a part of her karma?”","“It’s possible,” Song Shuhang said.","At the same time, he carefully recalled the memories of the young Heavenly Emperor who had entered his dream.","He had once thought that the memories of the young Heavenly Emperor that he had dreamt of might have a continuation. In the end, even now that the Heavenly Emperor had died, there was still no clue as to what to do with the sequels.","Now, even if he entered the dream again, it wouldn’t be of much help to Song Shuhang.","After carefully recalling, Song Shuhang still found a few interesting points.","There were a few important details in the dream.","The Heavenly Emperor’s original form was a fragment of the ‘Ghost God Cheng Lin,’ and she should be in a female form. However, after the manipulation of the Heavenly Dao Ball’s big boss, he turned from a female into a male and fiddled with the young Heavenly Emperor.","In addition, there was a six-year blank period in the memories of the young Heavenly Emperor. It was the period of the young Heavenly Emperor from infancy to the age of six. When Song Shuhang entered the dream, this period of memory was skipped.","But... Song Shuhang had a vague feeling that the young Heavenly Emperor before the age of six had already sensed ‘his’ existence.","Later on, when the young Heavenly Emperor encountered a difficult problem, the first thing he thought of was the option of praying to God.","After the young Heavenly Emperor turned six years old, no one had ever mentioned the existence of a ‘god’ to him. No one had ever mentioned the operation of praying to a god to him.","Therefore, the answer was very likely to be in the six years of memory that had disappeared.","In addition, according to the information that Song Shuhang had obtained after coming into contact with the Heavenly Emperor, it could be verified with the memories of the dream.","After the Heavenly Emperor had officially occupied Soft Feather’s ghost spirit, he had been in his female form.","According to the memories of the White Dragon and the others, the ‘Celestial Emperor’ of the ancient Heavenly City was in a male form.","The Celestial Thearch herself had mentioned that her origin was female. Therefore, the resurrected Celestial Thearch should have been restored from the fat ball’s method of turning a female into a male.","Combining the clues and deducing, the identity of the Island Master Golden Trigram was intriguing.","“Speaking of which...can the path to immortality be inherited by others?” Song Shuhang suddenly said.","“It can’t be,” Immortal Fairy White Bones said.","“The path to immortality is the comprehension and sublimation of one’s own path. There are no two identical leaves in this world, and it’s the same for life. Different experiences would lead to different Daos. Thus, no one’s Dao can completely fit with another’s,” Pavilion Master Chu said thoughtfully.","She suddenly thought of Fairy Cheng Lin and Slow-Witted Song.","Slow-Witted Song had personally mentioned to her that he had mastered Cheng Lin’s path to immortality and the path to nurturing new life.","“The Celestial Thearch said that the path of the celestial heavens is very special. Therefore, it can be inherited to other people in the celestial heavens like inheriting the throne,” said Island Lord Golden Trigram.","“Then, can you pass the path of the Heavenly Emperor to me? It can’t be, right?” Song Shuhang was like a detective who had found the truth. “So, why did the Heavenly Emperor inherit the path to immortality for you?”","“You’re not a member of the ancient Heavenly City,” Pavilion Master Chu said in a daze.","“Cough, but the path of the Heavenly Emperor can’t be inherited by others, right? For example, I can’t inherit it to Fairy Virtue?” Song Shuhang pulled Fairy? out.","Island Master Golden Trigram said, “It seems that it can’t.”","“So, Senior Island Master, have you ever thought that actually... you’re the Heavenly Emperor!” Song Shuhang finally voiced out his guess.","Island Master Golden Trigram was speechless.","“If this is the case, everything makes sense. You and the Celestial Thearch will have the same childhood experience. You will lose your memories, but you will be able to perfectly inherit the Celestial Thearch’s Dao without any rejection.” Song Shuhang shook his head and said, “There are no two identical leaves in the world, but a leaf can have two sides. Senior Island Master, you might be the other side of Tiandi Zi!”"]},{"number":2903,"title":"Chapter 2903: Soft Feather and Senior White Are Coming Home for New Year’s","paragraphs":["Chapter 2903: Soft Feather and Senior White Are Coming Home for New Year’s","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Hearing this, Soft Feather’s eyes lit up. “So, Senior Island Master, are you going to jump up as well?”","Fairy Creation interjected, “Divination!”","“It’s really possible,” Song Shuhang nodded.","Island Master Golden Trigram: “???”","Why did the topic suddenly shift?","At the same time, he began to seriously consider Song Shuhang’s suggestion.","Could it be... Was he really the opposite side of the Celestial Thearch?","The more he thought about it, the more plausible it seemed.","“So, am I actually a fairy?” Island Master Golden Trigram asked after a long pause.","He was starting to doubt himself.","Because Senior Song’s deduction was reasonable, he couldn’t find a point to refute.","“To be honest, there’s no point in us guessing here. If Senior Island Master has the patience, you might as well wait for a while. When Da Da Zi is resurrected, you can get the answer from her no matter what questions you have,” Song Shuhang reminded.","“How much of her words do you think we can trust?” Island Master Golden Trigram sighed.","“That’s right... The more beautiful a woman is, the better she is at lying. Mother Zhang’s quote,” Song Shuhang nodded.","“Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, are you saying that all the fairies here are liars?” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet suddenly smiled.","Song Shuhang was dumbfounded","In an instant, he felt that the surrounding fairies were looking at him with unfriendly gazes.","This was a question of death.","A. “Fairy, you’re not liars.”","B. “Fairy, you’re all beautiful.”","If you choose A, do you mean that the fairies here are not beautiful?","Choosing B, are you saying that all the fairies here are dishonest and like to lie?","“Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, are you a mental demon?” Song Shuhang said.","“No, I’m Tombstone,” replied Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet honestly.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","After the New Year, he had to think about which big shot he should go against next and make a list.","For example, the other incarnations of Void Sun in the universe?","Or the one who created the stellar destruction virus?","“Senior Song.” At this time, Island Lord Golden Trigram said in a deep voice.","“Senior Island Master, do you have any other questions?” Song Shuhang asked.","“No matter what happened in the past, Senior Song, I’ll think about how you induced me to jump off the cliff in ancient times when I get back,” said Island Lord Golden Trigram.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","The Island Master Senior holds a grudge.JPG","“At that time, I will welcome Senior Song to the mysterious island.” “Fellow Daoists, I’ll go first,” Island Lord Golden Trigram continued.","There were still people who were thinking about his mysterious island, so he had to be wary.","After the fairies and Golden Trigram returned the greeting and bade farewell, Island Master Golden Trigram hurriedly opened a spatial gate and left with Rabbit in his arms.","They came and went in a hurry.","After Island Master Golden Trigram left, Soft Feather curiously asked, “Ancient times? Senior Song, did you come into contact with Senior Island Master in ancient times?”","“No, I didn’t. I only inserted myself into the Celestial Thearch’s memories through some special method?” Song Shuhang tried to organize his words.","As his realm and vision increased, Song Shuhang became more and more aware of how unreasonable his talent in the Dreamland was.","Therefore, other than the pendant on his body and the seniors of the Nine Provinces Number One Group that he trusted, he didn’t want more people to know about his innate ability to enter the dream.","It was not that he was worried about what others would do to him. With his current combat strength, there were not many big shots in the myriad worlds who could press him to the ground.","It was purely to avoid unnecessary suspicion and trouble.","His ambiguous words made Zither Master Feng Yi, Immortal Fairy White Bones, and the other fairies even more confused.","Pavilion Master Chu’s hair curled up slightly, and she began to spin like a bamboo dragonfly.","Ye Si hugged Song Shuhang’s neck and floated in the air. Then, she would blow Pavilion Master Chu’s hair from time to time, making it spin faster.","“Is Fairy Chu thinking about something?” Immortal Fairy White Bones had been secretly paying attention to Pavilion Master Chu’s dazed state, so she asked.","“I’m too lazy to think, so I’m in the air. Don’t disturb me,” Pavilion Master Chu said lazily.","Immortal Fairy White Bones was confused.","“Shuhang, where are we going next?” Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword was full of energy as he asked.","“This matter is over. Next, I want to return to the main world, Earth. It’s the New Year,” Song Shuhang said. “I want to go home and take a look.”","It was also time to introduce his “daughter” to his parents. Song Shuhang looked at the mechanical girl in his hand, whose upper body had turned into a human shape, and whose lower body was still in the shape of a ball.","Then, he would spend the last peaceful New Year with his parents.","After saying this much, Song Shuhang looked at the few seniors beside him and said, “Seniors, what are your plans?”","After pondering for a moment, Zither Master Feng Yi flew to Song Shuhang’s shoulder and stopped. Her main body hadn’t been resurrected yet, and she had nowhere to go. Therefore, she wanted to move together with Song Shuhang.","“New Year? Bring me along!” Immortal Fairy White Bones replied. While Song Shuhang was killing the three corpses, she had vaguely sensed some information and wasn’t planning to leave for the time being.","“I have to follow you and get first-hand information about Lady Onion at any time,” Senior Turtle said worriedly.","“Senior Song, my father is still in seclusion on the World Tree. I don’t know if he will wake up during the New Year, so... I’ll go back to the modern world with you for the New Year,” Soft Feather raised her hand to sign up.","“Alright, Soft Feather, you guys follow me. I’ll bring everyone back to the main world in a while,” Song Shuhang said.","After saying that, he looked at Senior White.","“Oh.” Senior White came back to his senses and nodded. “After the New Year, I’ll have to shut myself up for a longer period of time. So, enjoy the New Year to your heart’s content.”","“Me too,” Song Shuhang nodded.","Perhaps this would be his last New Year.","Therefore, he had to be thick-skinned and ask for the most red packets this year.","Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and pressed in the air.","The spatial gate opened, and it was the coordinates leading to the vicinity of the world of the golden lotus.","The most convenient function of a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender was that they could save a lot of traveling time.","Not long after Song Shuhang and the others disappeared...","Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly and Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue rushed to the place where they had disappeared.","“Where is he?” Senior Spirit Butterfly looked at the empty place and the wooden blade stuck in the ground with a puzzled expression.","Where’s my daughter?","“I’ll ask in the group.” Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue opened the “cultivation chat” client and the “Nine Provinces Number Two Group.”","[Envious Senior Style] Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue: “Are Soft Feather and the others with you?”","“Eh? Senior Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue, you’re awake.” [Server. Cheng Goudan. Group Leader] Song Shuhang replied, “Soft Feather and I went home for the New Year.”","Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue was speechless.","He turned to look at Fellow Daoist Spirit Butterfly.","“Go back... Go home... New Year?” Lord Spirit Butterfly gradually lost his soul and became Lord Butterfly.","[Always-on Saint Seiya] Northern River’s Loose Cultivator saw the content of the chat and quickly added thoughtfully from afar, “Is Senior White with you, Shuhang?”","“Yes, Senior White also came home with me to celebrate the New Year,” Song Shuhang replied.","At the same time, Song Shuhang contacted the White Dragon through private chat, “Sister White Dragon, has Sixteen finished her seclusion?”","However... The White Dragon didn’t reply immediately.","[Mother Yellow Mountain·Group Owner] Venerable Yellow Mountain: “This year, there are more members online. It’s quite rare. How about... we get together during the New Year? It just so happens that I’ve already sent out the red packets that little friend Shuhang and I prepared for everyone.”","The members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group didn’t really care about the concept of “New Year” anymore.","After all, they were all cultivators.","At this time in the past, most of the members who were online were either cultivating in seclusion, refining pills in seclusion, or going out to search for treasures.","This year, the number of people who were awake online had reached a new high.","[CPU[Pluto] Young Master Phoenix Slayer said, “Then why don’t we... go to Shuhang’s place for the New Year?”"]},{"number":2904,"title":"Chapter 2904: Quickly Withdraw, Don’t Give Shuhang a Chance to Show Off!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2904: Quickly Withdraw, Don’t Give Shuhang a Chance to Show Off!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","[Dog Food Medicine King] Medicine Master: “Going to Shuhang’s house for the New Year? Ziyan and I are fine with it. We are traveling everywhere now, so we can go anywhere. [Medicine Master + Riverly Purple Mist heart emoji] But where is Shuhang’s house now? Is he going to his hometown, Wenzhou City, for the New Year? Or should we go to the scholarly faction’s world of the golden lotus?”","Senior Medicine Master’s parents were still alive, but they had also lived for hundreds of years and were already indifferent to the concept of the New Year. In addition, Medicine Master and Riverly Purple Mist were still in their honeymoon period, so even during the traditional New Year, Medicine Master and Riverly Purple Mist would go out for a stroll. His parents would be secretly happy, wishing they would come back with two chubby babies.","[Steel Friend] Doudou: “Woof~ Medicine Master, even if I’m a dog, can you guys not force me to eat dog food? It’s too deliberate! The way you show off your affection is too deliberate! Woof, there are still kids in the group. Be careful!”","[The Man Who Likes Making Wishes] Palace Master Seven Lives Talisman: “How about we go to Wenzhou City for the New Year? I have a wish in my wish book to accompany the most important person to Wenzhou City to see the sea. Going to Wenzhou for the New Year is perfect to fulfill this wish. Damn it, I don’t even know when I made this wish! Damn it!”","[Cave Lord] Snow Wolf: “Manor Head, are you going to force us to eat dog food? That’s enough. It’s the New Year. Why must I eat your dog food? Isn’t my wolf food fragrant?”","Palace Master Seven Lives Talisman: “???”","When did I feed you guys dog food? You’re not my dog, so why should I feed you dog food?","[Gravitational Wave] Fairy Firefly: “Prefecture Master, which fairy is the most important person you want to accompany to Wenzhou to see the sea? Why haven’t we received any news?”","I haven’t heard of Palace Master Seven Lives Talisman dating any fairies recently.","Palace Master Seven Lives Talisman said, “The most important people I’m talking about are you guys! What are you thinking?”","[Master of Emoticons] Abbot Profound Principle: [thumbs up emoji]","[CPU Young Master Phoenix Slayer]: “[bashful emoji] Oh my, I actually became the most important person to the Palace Master. My heart is beating a little faster than usual. I look so shy.”","[Song of the Stupid Yellow Mountain] Dongfang Snow: “Oh my, I’m also the most important person to the Manor Head!”","Palace Master Seven Lives Talisman was speechless.","[Racing God] Fairy Dongfang Six: “If I go to Wenzhou for the New Year, I won’t turn around. I’m at Hu Jian’s Land near Wenzhou City. I can go directly from Hu Jian to Wenzhou.”","[Zhiyin Pathogen] Thrice Reckless Mad Saber: “Liu Zi, do you want to bring two Hu Jianren over for the New Year banquet?”","[Black Panther Friend Dog Head Building Owner] Sun Splitting Halberd Guo Da: [Angry Rubbing Upstairs Dog Head emoji]","This dog-headed emoji was obviously a last-minute change, with the name ‘Thrice Reckless Mad Saber’ written in red above the dog’s head.","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber:","Sun Splitting Halberd Guo Da: [Angry Thrice Reckless Dog Head Rubbing emoji]","This emoji was an evolved version of the previous dog’s head. The dog’s head in the dynamic emoji had been photoshopped into Thrice Reckless Mad Saber’s head.","Fairy Dongfang Six said, “Uncle Guo is Hu Jianren.”","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber was speechless.","I didn’t know that Self-deprecating Guo had Hu Jianren’s attributes.","[Always-on Saint Seiya] Northern River’s Loose Cultivator couldn’t help but send a warm reminder. “Pay attention when you’re driving. Don’t divert your attention to chatting.”","He didn’t want to see Liu Zi pushing a group of corpses to Song Shuhang’s house during the group chat in Wenzhou City.","[God of Racing] Fairy Dongfang Six: “A few days ago, I wanted to drive to the neighboring country’s Mount Qiu Ming. However, halfway through the journey, the water-proof formation wasn’t properly controlled. The car leaked and sank to the bottom of the sea. I haven’t managed to get it out yet.”","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator: “!!!”","Fairy Dongfang Six then sent another selfie. At this moment, she was riding her bicycle on a mountain road.","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber added an emoticon in time: [It’s a pity that I don’t ride a three-wheeled motorcycle with such long legs. .JPG]","Sun Splitting Halberd Guo Da: [Angry rubbing Thrice Reckless Dog Head emoji]","It was another evolved emoticon. Thrice Reckless Mad Saber’s long hair was fluttering in the wind, and he was shaking it as he rubbed the dog’s head.","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber was speechless.","Was Hu Jian and Guo Hei Zi eyeing him?","Every time he posted in the group, Heizi Guo would immediately add Thrice Reckless Dog Head Building?","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator comforted him, “Don’t be sad, Liu Zi. The car will be found sooner or later... It’s good that the main person is fine. Besides, the bicycle is also very good. It’s eco-friendly!”","[White-skinned Reliable Junior] Soft Feather: “Then it’s settled. Let’s gather in Wenzhou City.” Senior Song and I will go to the world of the golden lotus first and bring Uncle Song and the others to Wenzhou City. My father is still in seclusion, so I can spend the New Year in Wenzhou City this year.”","Song Shuhang added, “In that case, seniors can meet up at Wenzhou... We’ll open a spatial gate and go over later.”","In the Dream Realm.","Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue stretched out his hand and gently patted Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly, who was beside him, and said, “Fellow Daoist Spirit Butterfly, why don’t you go back and enter seclusion?”","After all, Soft Feather had already said in the group chat that her father was still in seclusion.","If Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly suddenly jumped out at this time, wouldn’t Soft Feather lose face?","Lord Spirit Butterfly was speechless.","[I’m Senior White’s Brainless Fan] True Monarch White Crane: “I’ll spend the New Year with Senior White, and I’ll return to the country as soon as possible.” He really envied Shuhang, who was with Senior White. If he wanted to go back, he only needed Senior White to use a spatial secret technique. He didn’t have to rely on his wings to fly like me.”","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber: “White Crane, quickly withdraw the message. Don’t give Shuhang a chance to show off!”","Sun Splitting Halberd Guo Da: [Angry Thrice Reckless Upstairs emoji]","True Monarch White Crane:","[Very Delicious] Immortal Fairy Bie Xue said, “Then Chuchu and I will prepare the dishes for the New Year banquet.” In addition, I agree with Thrice Reckless. Fellow Daoist White Crane, quickly withdraw the message. Don’t let Shuhang see it.”","True Monarch White Crane said, “Although I don’t know what’s going on... However, since you all said so, I’ll withdraw it. Does the Cultivation Chat client have the function to recall messages?”","After a little operation, True Monarch White Crane really found the option to withdraw the message.","[I’m Senior White’s Brainless Fan], True Monarch White Crane, has withdrawn a message.","True Monarch White Crane replied, “O, a big K.”","[Server. Cheng Goudan. Group Owner] Song Shuhang restored True Monarch White Crane’s ‘recall message.’","In the next moment, the message that True Monarch White Crane had just withdrawn popped up again.","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber was speechless.","True Monarch White Crane was speechless.","Immortal Fairy Bie Xue was speechless.","This was too much!","The retracted message actually had a restore function!","Song Shuhang: “Ahahaha, you didn’t expect that I would have such a function!”","[Golden Dragon Scarf] The White Dragon was speechless.","Song Shuhang: “True Monarch White Crane, I don’t need Senior White’s help to open the spatial gate anymore!”","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber: “You little brat, shut up! Stop talking!”"]},{"number":2905,"title":"Chapter 2905: All of the Group Comes to the Hang Family for Dinner","paragraphs":["Chapter 2905: All of the Group Comes to the Hang Family for Dinner","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","True Monarch Tyrant Flood Dragon was puzzled. “Fellow Daoist Thrice Reckless is acting strange today. He keeps targeting little friend Song Shuhang and won’t let him finish speaking...”","True Monarch Tyrant Flood Dragon fell into deep thought. He pulled out the chat log and deduced what True Monarch White Crane had said, extracting the keywords “space gate,” “stop Song Shuhang from acting up,” and “no longer need Senior White’s help.”","Oh, crap...","True Monarch Tyrant Flood Dragon felt that he might have guessed the truth. But the heavenly tribulation from the First to Eighth Stage was fine, yet wouldn’t the Ninth Stage tribulation take a thousand days?","“Senior Thrice Reckless, it’s almost the New Year.” Song Shuhang even sent a shy smile emoji.","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber was startled.","Did Shuhang take the initiative to change the topic?","Such a cooperative Tyrannical Song couldn’t help but remind Thrice Reckless of that shivering newbie who had just joined the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","At that time, Tyrannical Song was so cute. Because he didn’t know anything, he was especially cautious and gave people a feeling of cowardice and cuteness.","Moreover, whenever he encountered a small matter, he would immediately go to the group to seek help from the seniors.","Could it be that the New Year was coming, so Tyrannical Song had returned to his newbie character?","“So, Senior Thrice Reckless... I want a red packet for the New Year.” Song Shuhang still didn’t give up.","At present, the thought of getting a red packet from the seniors of the Nine Provinces Number One Group had become Tyrannical Song’s obsession.","If you don’t have the conditions, then create your own conditions!","As long as one was thick-skinned enough, they could get as many red packets as they could.","If he didn’t get a red packet for the New Year this year, it would be even more impossible next year!","Song Shuhang was very self-aware.","This year was definitely his last chance to ask for a red packet.","After this New Year, no matter how thick-skinned he was next year, he definitely wouldn’t be able to beg his seniors for red packets.","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber was confused.","Shameless!","He thought that Tyrannical Song would return to being a newbie during the New Year, but in the end, he wanted to use this matter to threaten him!","The newbie who was once timid in the group had now learned such dirty tricks.","“Sorry, what did you say just now?” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber asked.","“I want a red packet for the New Year,” Song Shuhang said shamelessly.","“No, the sentence above,” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber said.","Song Shuhang copied and pasted the words on the screen. “So, Senior Thrice Reckless?”","“Who is your Senior Thrice Reckless? Senior Song, don’t talk nonsense! I’m clearly your junior Little Three Reckless!” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber said righteously.","Song Shuhang and Fairy Lychee were both flabbergasted.","[Su Clan’s Big Horse Monkey] Su Clan’s Seven: “???” Crap, I haven’t changed my nickname back?","[White-skinned, reliable junior] Soft Feather: “Senior Thrice Reckless, don’t learn from me.”","In the Nine Provinces Number One Group, she was the only one who called Song Shuhang that... If Thrice Reckless also learned how to shout, it would feel very strange.","[Beautiful Fishman·Little Black Room] Yu Jiaojiao: [Did I transmigrate?] Why did Senior Thrice Reckless become Shuhang’s junior as soon as I finished today’s lesson?","When I was in seclusion, did the world line change?","“Has Yu Jiaojiao finished her cultivation? Can you come over for the New Year? Long time no see,” Song Shuhang said.","Yu Jiaojiao pondered for a moment and said, “I’ll apply for a two-day leave. @True Monarch Tyrant Flood Dragon, right, Dad, do you want to take advantage of the New Year to coax Mom back?”","True Monarch Tyrant Flood Dragon: “Private chat, private chat!”","[Heaven’s Summoning Voice] Dharma King Creation: “It’s not easy for Senior Tyrant Flood Dragon to give birth to a football team.”","[Mother Yellow Mountain·Group Owner] Venerable Yellow Mountain said tiredly, “Shuhang, stop fooling around. This year’s red packet has already been agreed upon by everyone. It will be given to your disciple. In addition, we and your Steel Doppelganger are preparing to come out of the ruins in advance... After the New Year, we can return to the ruins.”","Even with the help of Song Shuhang’s steel clone, it was not possible to clear the ruins in a short period of time.","“Mother Yellow Mountain, I haven’t received any red packets from the seniors in the group since I started cultivating.”","Venerable Yellow Mountain was speechless.","He looked at the red packet he had secretly prepared for Song Shuhang and, after thinking for a while, he stuffed it back.","As a qualified group leader, it was basic to occasionally give some benefits to the group members.","The considerate Senior Yellow Mountain had long since considered the fact that Song Shuhang might not be able to receive a red packet this year, so he secretly prepared a red packet for him.","But now that he thought about it... As expected, Song Shuhang’s red packet should be forgotten!","Moreover...","Venerable Yellow Mountain also specially reminded him, “@Song Shuhang, this time, we took out a lot of materials from the ruins that can upgrade the weak consciousness of the magical treasure spirit. @All members, Shuhang and I have prepared a gift for everyone during the New Year. It’s a substance that can help weapon spirits upgrade. Together with the Heavenly Dao Eye Drops from before, they would strive to let everyone’s magical treasures give birth to weapon spirits as soon as possible. This is the red packet Shuhang and I prepared for everyone during the New Year.”","Not only would you not receive red packets, but you would also have to give red packets to everyone!","Song Shuhang raised his head and looked at the sky.","At this moment, he suddenly had the urge to block the word “red packet” from the cultivation chat system.","As the main server, he did have the authority to do so.","[Poop-picker] Hidden Heaven Hook Zhou Li: “@Venerable Yellow Mountain, Big Boss Yellow Mountain, can you bring your relatives with you to Shuhang’s place for the New Year?”","Immortal Fairy Bie Xue’s New Year’s feast, as well as the red packet that could upgrade the magic tool... Zhou Li immediately thought of his scholarly lover and wanted to bring him to Tyrannical Song’s family’s New Year celebration.","“Yes,” Venerable Yellow Mountain nodded.","“The whole group is going to the Hang family for dinner. It feels so good.” Yang Xian of the Heavenly Mansion Equipment Refining Sect nodded and praised.","Song Shuhang was confused.","Wait, Senior Yang Xian!","It’s very easy for people to misunderstand.","The whole group coming to my house for dinner...","It’s as if I’m dead, and you guys are all here for a funeral meal.","It’s clearly the New Year, but you’re still talking about the feeling of death.","In addition, if so many people were to come at once, his home in Wenzhou City would definitely not be able to accommodate them.","Fortunately... He had his Inner World!","At that time, he only needed to open an entrance to the Inner World and place it in his own home.","The size of the Inner World was enough for the members of the group to have fun.","Perhaps he could even sell a piece of land in the Inner World and earn some spirit stones?","Although he had promised Senior Beifang that he would lend his Inner World to them in a few days to hold the ceremony, he was still very worried. However, judging from the time, it shouldn’t clash with the New Year’s program.","“Speaking of which, where is Senior White?” True Monarch White Crane asked in puzzlement. Senior White should be very interested in programs like the New Year’s party.","But this time, Senior White didn’t say anything.","Could he be in seclusion?","“I’m thinking about something,” Senior White replied.","[Sister complex] Island Master Tian Tian: “Senior White, what troubles do you have?”","“No, I didn’t. I was thinking... If it was the New Year, should it be more lively? For example, prepare some New Year programs?” Senior White said slowly.","Just like Song Shuhang, Senior White was also cherishing this opportunity to celebrate the New Year.","He hoped that the members of the group would try their best to come and celebrate the New Year. He hoped that the New Year would start with a lot of noise and that they would enter next year happily.","Dharma King Creation said, “I have a new song for the New Year’s program! I’m willing to be the first to perform on stage!”","[Undersea Graveyard Football Team] True Monarch Tyrant Flood Dragon: “Undersea Graveyard, 50% discount! Buy the big one and get the small one free!”","Dharma King Creation was speechless."]},{"number":2906,"title":"Chapter 2906: A Fake Server","paragraphs":["Chapter 2906: A Fake Server","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","True Monarch Tyrant Flood Dragon was simply going too far!","This advertisement was suddenly inserted. Wasn’t it hinting that listening to his songs would kill her?","Dharma King Creation couldn’t hold back his temper anymore. “@Venerable Yellow Mountain, Mother Yellow Mountain, ban Tyrant Flood Dragon! It’s the New Year, and it’s unlucky to promote an underwater cemetery! Bad luck, pui!”","Even in the Nine Provinces Number Two Group, Venerable Yellow Mountain was still the group leader—Song Shuhang was just a server for the host.","[System Notification: [Server. Cheng Goudan. Group Owner] Song Shuhang has been muted by the group owner, Venerable Yellow Mountain, for 60 minutes.]","Song Shuhang was dumbfounded.","Am I a fake server?","Besides, why did you suddenly ban me?","Why am I suddenly the scapegoat?","Cave Lord Snow Wolf: [Senior Yellow Mountain is awesome~]","I didn’t expect even the server, little friend Song Shuhang, to be muted!","The facts proved that killing the chicken to warn the monkeys was a very effective method.","[System Notification: Dharma King Creation has withdrawn a message from [Summoning Voice of Heaven].]","Dharma King Creation cowered.","Then, he reorganized his words and said, “Brother Yellow Mountain, look at that Tyrant Flood Dragon. He’s still promoting the underwater cemetery on New Year’s Eve. He’s not a human being. Brother Yellow Mountain, please uphold justice!”","[System Notification: Dharma King Creation, Thrice Reckless Mad Saber, Xuan Nu Sect’s Skylark, Immortal Master Copper Trigram, monster dog Doudou, and Dongfang Snow have been silenced by the group leader Venerable Yellow Mountain for 60 minutes.]","Everywhere in the world.","Dharma King Creation was speechless. He knew that he was too late!","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber: “???”","Skylark: “???”","Copper Trigram, who had been silent the entire time, was speechless.","Doudou was dumbfounded. “???”","Fairy Dongfang Snow was speechless.","Thrice Reckless, Skylark, Copper Trigram, Doudou, and Fairy Dongfang Snow couldn’t understand.","Dharma King Creation and Song Shuhang were courting death.","But they were very obedient today, right?","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber immediately used the VIP function to secretly invite Fairy Dongfang Snow, Doudou, Copper Trigram, and Skylark to a temporary discussion group. “Doudou, what’s wrong with Senior Yellow Mountain today?”","Could it be a relative? So irritable?","“I don’t know either. I’m also very confused! Huang Shan’s face is so serious right now, I don’t even dare to ask him what’s going on.”","Doudou was afraid that he would ask more. If Yellow Mountain chased him out of Yellow Mountain Prefecture before the new year and sent him to his own Doudou Prefecture, how lonely would he be?","Immortal Master Copper Trigram said, [Forget about the few of you, at least you’ve all posted in the group.] I haven’t sent a single word today.”","Copper Trigram felt even more wronged than Dou E.","He was no longer lying down and getting shot. He had dug a hole to bury himself and even got bombarded!","“I think Senior Yellow Mountain is doing this as a precaution,” Fairy Dongfang Snow said slowly.","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber: “Precaution for what?”","“I think it’s to prevent heart disease.” “It’s the new year,” Fairy Dongfang Snow said. “Senior Yellow Mountain must have muted us to prevent us from provoking him. If you look carefully at the list, you’ll find that... we’ve always been the most energetic in the group.”","“Hahaha, that makes sense,” Skylark admitted generously. She was very self-aware. After all, she knew how much she was courting death.","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber: “I’ve already turned over a new leaf. I’m already called Frice Reckless.”","“Frice Reckless, you’re better than Thrice Reckless and First Reckless.” Doudou replied.","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber was speechless.","Immortal Master Copper Trigram: “I’m not convinced. If they wanted to ban me, why didn’t they ban Old Northern River as well?!”","“Wake up, shady fortune teller.” Doudou said, “You’re one of the top three players on the Death Seeking List in the group. Old Northern River is the only one left with a conscience in the group. Do you have anything to compete with him?”","Old Northern River, Fellow Daoist Eternal Fire of the scholarly faction, Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue, and Yellow Mountain were the conscience of the Nine Provinces Number One Group, and they were the ones who held up the bottom line of the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","Even Doudou had to admit that if the Nine Provinces Number One Group didn’t have these people, they would have been finished long ago.","Immortal Master Copper Trigram was speechless.","Even Doudou was hurting his heart so much, how could he talk today?","They couldn’t continue chatting!","“My master, Silver Trigram, has summoned me. I’m going offline now.” Immortal Master Copper Trigram waved his hand.","In the Nine Provinces Number Two Group.","After silencing the few people who were the most suicidal, Senior Yellow Mountain felt a cool aura coming from his lungs, pouring into his heart and spreading to his limbs.","I should have done this a long time ago!","Senior Yellow Mountain felt his heartbeat become happier, and every time his heart beat, it exuded a blissful aura.","“If there’s anything going on during the new year, report it to me. You can report it to Senior White, Northern River, Eternal Fire, Senior Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue, or True Monarch Rain Moon. When the time comes, we will summarize the program and celebrate the New Year in a lively manner. Senior Yellow Mountain said.","After muting those habitual criminals, even Senior Yellow Mountain’s words revealed a sense of joy.","Fairy Dongfang Six asked, [Do you want to organize another race during the new year?] Just like the tractor race, this time it’s a bicycle race?”","[Nuclear Explosion Great Immortal] Scholar Xian Gong: [Should we add fighting elements to the racing process?]","Young Master Phoenix Slayer’s eyes lit up. My Phoenix Slayer’s system has been upgraded, and it’s enough to create a super mecha!”","[Gravitational Wave] Fairy Firefly: “Time is too tight for Transformers. One and a half days is not enough for us to modify the car into a mecha. At that time, we can’t let you, Phoenix Slayer, drive your mecha and beat us up crazily, right?”","Palace Master Seven Lives Talisman said, “Then... Why don’t we just use excavators, road rollers, bulldozers, and the like and then stage a chaotic battle?”","“Withdraw the Seven Lives Talisman. Don’t let Liu Zi see this!” Cave Lord Snow Wolf hurriedly called out. The memory of Fairy Dongfang Six crushing everyone in the hand-guided tractor competition still felt like yesterday.","Fairy Dongfang Six said, [I already saw it.]","Cave Lord Snow Wolf gritted his teeth. “Fellow Daoist Seven Lives Talisman,” he said with a thick face, “quickly withdraw your proposal. Let me speak of such a wonderful suggestion!”","If this suggestion was really accepted, what if he was targeted by Fairy Dongfang Six? Therefore, it had to think of a way to make up for it. Regardless of whether it was useful or not, he had to work hard.","Hard work might not necessarily lead to results, but if one did not work hard, there would definitely be no results!","Palace Master Seven Lives Talisman was speechless.","Within the world of the golden lotus.","Song Shuhang looked at the content of the chat in the Nine Provinces Number Two Group, and his heart itched. He wanted to speak, but he was silenced.","He could only project the contents of the chat so that the pendants on his body could take a look and then chat with them.","He saw Huang Shan collecting new year programs.","Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword’s heart skipped a beat. “Fairy @#%×, let’s perform a sword-swallowing performance on the New Year’s program!”","The virtuous lamia was speechless.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","At this moment.","On the other side of the world of the golden lotus.","Daozi was currently meeting with several of his junior brothers, as well as the various Patriarchs of the scholarly faction. He needed the fragment of the ancient Heavenly City of the scholarly faction."]},{"number":2907,"title":"Chapter 2907: Discussing with Tyrannical Song","paragraphs":["Chapter 2907: Discussing with Tyrannical Song","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Daozi had arrived in the scholarly world before Song Shuhang.","At this moment, five of the thirteen Tribulation Transcenders of the scholarly faction were sitting quietly in front of him.","There was the gentle and refined Second Tribulation Transcender, Wen Zi.","The fresh and handsome Third Tribulation Transcender, Yan Zi.","Seven Dumb, who looked like a bookworm.","The high-spirited Eleventh Tribulation Transcender, Yu Zi.","And finally, there was Yuan Zi, whose physical body remained while a wisp of King Kun’s consciousness was stored deep within his mind.","After the incident where King Kun was blown into an egg by Tyrannical Song, the Tribulation Transcenders of the scholarly faction all knew that King Kun was hidden in the depths of Yuan Zi’s consciousness. Therefore, the four Tribulation Transcenders of the scholarly faction were now closely watching over Yuan Zi, keeping him by their side at all times.","In addition to these five of the thirteen Tribulation Transcenders, there were also a few family heads with the highest status in the scholarly faction. Venerable Eternal Fire should have been there as well, but upon hearing that Song Shuhang was coming, he got up and went to welcome him.","The Sage Name Tyrannical Song had a very special meaning in the scholarly faction.","Now, all the disciples of the scholarly faction believed that Tyrannical Song was the reincarnation of the Scholarly Sage. Even if this wasn’t the case, Tyrannical Song had saved the scholarly faction several times, which was a great favor to the scholarly faction. If he wanted to come over, the scholarly faction would naturally welcome him.","When the thread of King Kun’s consciousness in Yuan Zi’s body saw Daozi, it almost cried—the scholarly faction had actually produced another Immortal.","Furthermore, this Daozi’s aura was extremely terrifying, and he had obtained the true teachings of the Scholarly Sage. Facing him was like facing the reincarnated Scholarly Sage, causing King Kun to recall an unbearable past.","“Eldest Senior Brother is useless. I’ve made you suffer,” Daozi felt bitter when he saw his four junior brothers who hadn’t been completely resurrected.","The scholarly faction was facing a great calamity, and as the eldest brother, he was unable to protect his junior brothers.","Now, although the four junior brothers were resurrected, their bodies were incomplete.","At this moment, Daozi had accumulated thousands of years of self-blame in his heart, almost devouring his soul.","“Big Dumb, you don’t have to take it to heart. As disciples of the scholarly faction, we have never regretted our actions,” Chi Zi, the Seventh Tribulation Transcender, said seriously.","Daozi:","Dumb?","The self-reproach in his heart, which was like a huge wave, was interrupted for a moment.","The Second Tribulation Transcender, Wen Zi, raised his head and looked at the sky. Ever since he met his junior sister, Dumb Seven had been completely stunned.","The Eleventh Tribulation Transcender, Yu Zi, covered the Seventh Senior Brother’s mouth. He smiled at Daozi and said, “Eldest Senior Brother, Master has always taught us to be one with the inside and the outside. A strong appearance is not really strong. A strong heart is truly strong. We are not that weak.”","“We are already very satisfied to be able to use the resurrection array left behind by Master to reappear in the human world,” Wen Zi, the Second Tribulation Transcender, said slowly. “What’s more, with Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song’s support, our time in the world has been extended. Such a long time is enough for us to make up for our regrets.”","The Third Tribulation Transcender, Yan Zi, nodded. “The scholarly faction is missing a lot of legacies, and the time Tyrannical Song gave us is enough for us to complete the missing legacies. Moreover, there is still time to spare. We have no regrets.”","As the thirteen Tribulation Transcenders of the scholarly faction, their hearts were as strong as their appearances. Therefore, even if they did not have much time left, they had never been afraid. It was their wish to have a chance to complete their teacher’s legacy and complete the missing cultivation techniques and scriptures of the scholarly faction.","“Moreover, now that we know that you have already achieved immortality, we are even more at ease,” Seven said in a daze.","With the Immortality Realm Great Dumb around, even if the four of them disappeared, Great Dumb would still be able to protect the scholarly faction. Moreover, Yuan Zi’s body would be able to lend him a hand.","“However, I can’t be so without regrets,” Daozi looked at his four junior brothers and said in a deep voice, “That’s why I still want to give it a try. This is also the reason why I came to look for you.”","“Eldest Senior Brother, what do you want?” Second Tribulation Transcender Wen Zi frowned.","“If you want to do something dangerous, we won’t allow it,” Yan Zi, the Third Tribulation Transcender, added, “The Dao Child of the Longevity Realm is the future guardian of the scholarly faction.”","Now that the Heavenly Dao, which had a grudge against the scholarly faction, had collapsed, Daozi was able to protect the scholarly faction for generations to come.","Therefore, they would not allow Daozi to suffer any losses.","“What I want to do is to resurrect everyone completely without any flaws. This is my duty as the eldest senior brother... Besides, you don’t have to persuade me. Master also agrees to this,” Daozi said slowly.","If he wanted to convince his junior brothers, he had to bring up his master.","Seven was stunned for a moment, then he said happily, “Master agrees? Could it be... Master?”","Daozi shook his head. He then took out the Confucian Classics and flipped open the message left behind by the Scholarly Sage.","“Confucian Classics? Why is it with you, Eldest Senior Brother?” Third Junior Brother Yan Zi asked doubtfully.","Wen Zi, the Second Tribulation Transcender, took the Confucian Classics and looked at the notes and messages left behind by the Scholarly Sage. Tears welled up in his eyes.","It was indeed the last words of the Scholarly Sage.","Master had already arranged everything. Even their resurrection was flawed, and Master had already calculated it and arranged a way out for them.","“Big Dummy, is what you are about to do dangerous?” “If it’s dangerous,” Seven asked stiffly, “we won’t agree even if it’s Master’s idea.”","“It’s not dangerous, I promise,” Daozi said with a smile. “Master left me a method to guarantee my safety. Even if I fail in what I’m about to do next, the method Master left behind is enough to revive me. Therefore, you can rest assured. The Confucian Classics came from the sky. It’s the backup plan that Master left for me.”","“The Confucian Classics came through space?” Third Tribulation Transcender Yan Zi’s expression became even more strange. The four Tribulation Transcenders of the scholarly faction all knew that the Confucian Classics was in Tyrannical Song’s hands, and that his junior sister was in charge of it.","But now, the Confucian Classics had crossed from Tyrannical Song to Eldest Senior Brother Daozi.","At this moment, even the four Tribulation Transcenders of the scholarly faction began to suspect Tyrannical Song’s identity.","Could it be that Tyrannical Song was really the reincarnation of his master?","“And after this, I’m here to borrow a fragment of the Heavenly City from the scholarly faction. What I’m going to do next will require the help of the Heavenly City fragment,” Daozi said in a deep voice.","The four Tribulation Transcenders of the scholarly faction looked at the message left by their master on the Confucian Classics and then at their eldest senior brother, who had already made up his mind. The four of them looked at each other and sighed. “In that case, we have no objections.”","The other scholarly patriarchs behind him nodded in agreement. In truth, given his status as a Dao Child, he only needed to say a word if he wanted a fragment of the Heavenly City.","The thirteen Tribulation Transcenders of the scholarly faction held an extraordinary status for the scholarly faction.","“Then, it’s settled,” Daozi revealed a gentle expression.","This time, he would definitely resurrect his junior brothers in one piece.","Also...","While he was free, he should go see Tyrannical Song!","At this time, Daozi still didn’t know that the Great Northern Emperor had already negotiated with Tyrannical Song about the Heavenly City fragment.","Therefore, since Tyrannical Song had come to the scholarly faction, he might as well go and talk to him about the fragment of the Heavenly City.","Daozi knew that Song Shuhang had a portion of the fragments of the ancient Heavenly City in his hands, and that he had given a few of them to Tyrannical Song."]},{"number":2908,"title":"Chapter 2908: Is It Possible to Evolve Another Monkey Like Song Shuhang?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2908: Is It Possible to Evolve Another Monkey Like Song Shuhang?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","He wondered if he could discuss with Tyrannical Song and borrow the fragment of the ancient Heavenly City.","After talking with his junior brother and the other parents of the scholarly faction, Daozi got up and went to Song Shuhang’s place.","“If Tyrannical Song is really willing to lend the Heavenly City fragment, shouldn’t I prepare a gift for him?” Daozi thought seriously as he walked.","Confucians valued etiquette, so they naturally had to repay kindness.","“Just in time for the New Year, why don’t I give Tyrannical Song a red packet as a gift?” Daozi mused.","On the other side of the golden lotus world.","Song Shuhang, Senior White, Soft Feather, and a group of pendants helped his parents pack their things and prepare to return to Wenzhou City.","Mama Song had been looking good recently and was even enjoying her stay in the scholarly faction.","Mama Song had been worried that she wouldn’t be able to get used to staying in the scholarly faction, but after a few days, she couldn’t bear to leave.","“This place is really good,” Mama Song said to Song Shuhang.","Every day, the scholarly disciples would affectionately call her Fairy Zhao when they saw her.","Just like most men dream of being heroes, most women hope to be beautiful fairies forever.","After hearing the scholarly disciples call her “Fairy Zhao” every day, Mama Song, who was about to become a mother for the second time, felt as if she had become several years younger. She was just short of becoming an immortal.","“Your mother’s current state is like when I lived in Guangdong. Every day people called me Handsome, and gradually I lost myself,” Papa Song laughed.","“Uncle, when you were young, you must have been like Senior Song, a handsome boy,” Soft Feather said.","“Soft Feather, your words have helped me regain a little bit of confidence,” Song Shuhang continued—it should be known that every time he faced Goudan’s father, he would be despised for his appearance.","As time passed, Song Shuhang lost confidence in his looks.","Papa Song looked at his son... His son had indeed become more and more handsome recently. He had gradually lost the ordinary and good-looking genes of the Song family and was beginning to approach the handsome genes of his mother.","“Has the disaster outside been resolved?” Mama Song asked after preparing her luggage. When Song Shuhang sent them to the scholarly faction, disasters were happening all over the world.","“I’ve already cleaned up the evil disaster from before. Now, there’s only a small after-effect of the ‘abundant spiritual energy’ in the outside world. However, after the New Year, I still hope to bring you back to the scholarly faction and stay there for a while,” Song Shuhang replied.","At the very least, he had to wait until the Heavenly Dao competition was over.","“You don’t have to force yourself. You’ve already done very well,” Mama Song said.","Perhaps it was her mother’s intuition, but Mama Song felt that Song Shuhang seemed to have decided to do something, and it might be something very important.","Song Shuhang smiled. “Mom, don’t worry. I will never do something that I can’t do.”","In order to prevent his mother from continuing this topic, Song Shuhang took out the semi-human mechanical girl from his pocket and said, “Right, Mom, look... your granddaughter. To a certain extent, she is my biological daughter. Little Ling Xiao, call me grandma.”","Ling Xiao was the Chinese name that the mechanical blonde girl had given herself.","“Grandma,” the mechanical girl called out obediently.","The serious and obedient mechanical girl, coupled with her half-egg, half-human appearance, was lovable.","“Huh?” Mama Song asked.","Song Shuhang’s method of changing the topic was very successful.","When Mama Song saw the half-human mechanical girl, she suddenly had the urge to give her son a good beating. However, when she saw this obedient girl, she forcefully suppressed her emotions.","“What’s wrong with her?” Mama Song carefully took the mechanical girl and asked.","Song Shuhang replied, “Premature labor.”","Mama Song was confused.","“Speak like a human!” Papa Song said.","“The whole process is hard to describe in a few words,” Song Shuhang explained with a smile. “Her existence is very complicated. You can think of her as a mechanical alien creature, similar to the Transformers.”","Mama Song was speechless.","Saying it was equivalent to saying nothing.","She and Papa Song never dreamed that the first granddaughter of the Song family would make her debut in such a way... Moreover, she was born by her own son...","This complicated emotion was like a mixture of sour, sweet, bitter, and spicy, various seasonings, and various red, white, yellow, and blue drinks. The taste was really indescribable.","A month ago, Papa Song and Mama Song were just ordinary people. Now, every time they met their son, they had to endure a huge impact of information.","Even with their ancestral heart, the couple did not know how long they could last.","“Although Little Ling Xiao is very cute...” Papa Song dotingly took the robot girl from his wife’s hands and sighed from the bottom of his heart. “But your mother and I still hope that the next time we meet, you can tell us the good news that you’re getting married or that your lover is going to give us a granddaughter. You don’t have to give birth yourself.”","“Are you kidding me? I’ll only be nineteen years old after the New Year,” Song Shuhang said.","Zither Master Fengyi’s claws were speechless.","Immortal Fairy White Bones was speechless.","“Then tell us the news in a few years,” Papa Song was also a law-abiding man, so he followed good advice.","“It doesn’t exist,” Song Shuhang waved his hand. “It’s mainly because I’ve already been sterilized.”","Mama Song was speechless.","Papa Song was startled.","What are you saying to us so proudly? Sterilized?","“After reaching the Eighth Stage Realm, it’s almost impossible for cultivators to produce offspring,” Soft Feather explained to Papa Song and Mama Song. “It’s mainly because cultivators of the Eighth Stage Realm have already come into contact with laws and adapted to them. The nature of the law would affect the nature of a cultivator’s life. It was also because the laws that every cultivator comprehended were special and unique to themselves. Under the influence of the laws, the nature of a cultivator’s life will also become unique.”","“Soft Feather, can you describe it in a simpler way?” Mama Song said gently. If it was her son, she would have said something like ‘speak humanly.’ However, since she was explaining to Soft Feather, Mama Song had to treat her gently.","“Well, to put it simply, an Eighth Stage cultivator has evolved into another species. Moreover, because every Eighth Stage cultivator fused with different nomological laws, every Eighth Stage cultivator was a completely new species. The species are all different, so they can’t give birth to offspring,” Soft Feather explained.","“According to the understanding of ordinary people, it’s like in the process of evolution, some cells evolve into monkeys, some cells evolve into cats, and some cells evolve into fish. Naturally, they can’t give birth to offspring. If there is only one monkey in the world, it will be sterilized,” Soft Feather tried her best to make an analogy.","“Then, is it possible that two different cells coincidentally evolved into a monkey like Song Shuhang?” Mama Song asked expectantly.","“Hello, Mother Monkey,” Song Shuhang said. “I’m your monkey.”","Mama Song slapped her son’s head. Then, her palm hurt.","“It’s too difficult,” Soft Feather said. “Even if we carefully study everything about Senior Song and imitate him according to his trajectory before he advanced to the Eighth Stage Realm, we’ll still be able to find him. When an Eighth Stage comes into contact with laws, the success rate is close to zero.”","“As for Eighth Stage Profound Sages, there are only one or two in a thousand years,” Song Shuhang added.","Mama Song said, “There are only one or two in a thousand years, and you’re already in it?”","“After all, I am the first Sage in a thousand years,” Song Shuhang said.","“Have you ever thought of finding a girlfriend first?” the old mother said bitterly."]},{"number":2909,"title":"Chapter 2909: Don’t They Smell Nice?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2909: Don’t They Smell Nice?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“I leveled up too quickly. I was just about to cultivate our feelings for each other, but I accidentally reached Rank 8,” Song Shuhang replied.","Two months ago, when he was still at the Seventh Stage Realm, Song Shuhang was prepared to listen to the advice of the three-eyed young senior and stay at the Seventh Stage Realm for a while longer. He wanted to carefully study the “illusory reality” function and lay a solid foundation for his future advancement to the Ninth Stage Realm and condensing his path to immortality.","However, even though he had used all his strength to grind his way through the Seventh Stage Realm, he still didn’t last more than a month before he advanced to the Eighth Stage Realm and graduated from the “fake Profound Sage.”","He didn’t even have the time to warm up his feelings...","“The life of a cultivator is either cultivation or seclusion. Sometimes I’m in seclusion, and sometimes she is. After all, only those who can endure loneliness can become big shots among cultivators,” Song Shuhang added.","“Are you serious?” asked Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet.","Ever since I followed Lord White’s orders to accompany you to the ends of the world, I’ve never seen you go into seclusion for more than a month like a real cultivator!","Mama Song was speechless.","She looked at her son, at the beauties hanging on his body and beside him, and suddenly a feeling of disappointment welled up in her heart.","Can’t this monkey look at the rich human resources around him?","There were three beauties hanging on his body: Fairy Creation, the virtuous lamia, and the fairy who was hugging her son’s neck intimately.","There was even a black-skinned Soft Feather hiding in the shadows.","It was said that even the hair on his son’s head was a peerless beauty.","Even the claw on her shoulder sounded like the voice of a fairy. According to Mama Song’s recent understanding, as long as it was a fairy, it was basically a beauty.","Next to him, look at Black Panther’s original body, Miss Soft Feather. Isn’t her leg long?","Also, wasn’t Su Clan’s Sixteen, who had gone to Wenzhou City’s Baijing Street home with Soft Feather, a delicate girl?","Then, he looked at the White Bone Immortal Fairy on the other side. Wasn’t her waist thin?","So many fairies, which one of them didn’t smell good?","Even his son’s senior, Immortal Bai, was a top-notch beauty.","Of course, Immortal Bai didn’t count as a “beauty.” Mama Song simply wanted to pull her over to evaluate her looks. If Mama Song didn’t have Papa Song in her heart, she might not have been able to control herself when facing Immortal Bai.","With so many resources, couldn’t his son become a steel point?","But as she thought about it, Mama Song started to worry.","As an old mother who hated iron for not being able to live up to her expectations, she realized that even if she wanted to become a sensible and kind parent and wanted to give her son an assist, it was not easy.","His mother wanted to help him, but she didn’t know how to help him or which department to send him to.","Moreover... she wondered if the fairies would mind their sterilized monkeys now.","After all, giving birth was a very important part of life. Becoming a mother and father was a very precious life experience. Especially for cultivators with long lifespans, giving birth was a very precious experience.","Now that his monkey was sterilized, she wondered if the fairies would dislike him.","The more elements she imagined, the colder Mama Song’s heart became.","Why don’t Papa Song and I work harder and give birth to a male monkey after we give birth to our daughter?","Mama Song felt that her body was getting younger and younger... It shouldn’t be a problem to have another one.","Song Shuhang looked at his mother, who was suddenly distracted, with a puzzled expression.","Why did she get distracted as she chatted?","Were they all infected by Senior White?","Song Shuhang quietly observed Senior White from the corner of his eye.","“Why are you looking at me? Oh, are you leaving?” Senior White suddenly raised his head and asked sharply. Senior White’s talent allowed him to capture all gazes that were directed at him, regardless of whether they were kind or malicious.","“It’s almost time to go. After we arrive in Wenzhou City, we still have to decorate the house for the seniors in the group to use during the new year,” Song Shuhang nodded and replied.","“Alright, I’ll open the door,” Senior White nodded.","On the other side, Mama Song’s heart skipped a beat when she heard the word “New Year” and she recovered from her daze.","She turned her head and exchanged glances with Papa Song.","‘The New Year is a good opportunity... Take advantage of the New Year to pay attention to your son and see if there are any resources that can help him. Also, see if there are any fairies who don’t mind your son being sterilized.’ Mama Song winked at Papa Song and hinted.","Papa Song and Mama Song were already telepathic. When Mama Song raised her eyebrows, he knew what she meant.","He nodded slightly at Mama Song. This New Year was an opportunity.","At that time, he would carefully observe the details of Song Shuhang’s actions and analyze who he could send to assist him!","The husband and wife who were worried about their son nodded tacitly.","The husband sings and the wife follows.","Song Shuhang also keenly looked at his parents... As a Tribulation Transcender with Three Separations, he could acutely sense that his parents were plotting against him.","This was the ability of someone who had truly entered the threshold of the “Big Boss.” Within a certain range, as long as someone had the idea of plotting against him, the big shots would be keenly aware of it.","Some of the top big shots would even sense it at the first moment when someone mentioned their saint name in the myriad worlds. It was terrifying!","Song Shuhang, who was a weak Immortal, could be considered a big shot at the entry-level in terms of realm.","[I have to pay attention to my parents’ little tricks later and see what they’re up to,] Song Shuhang thought to himself.","Next to him, Senior White stretched out his hand and gently knocked on the void, opening the spatial gate leading to Wenzhou City’s Baijing Street.","“When we pass through the Dimension Portal, we will feel a little weightless. Dad, hold on tight to me,” Song Shuhang said to his parents.","The group pulled their luggage and entered the Dimension Portal.","“Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, please wait!” At this moment, a gentle and heavy male voice sounded behind him.","Song Shuhang turned his head and saw Senior Daoist who had once given him the fragment of the “largest toilet in the Heavenly City.” Right now, this toilet was still continuously sending immortal-level golden kola fertilizer to the spirit plants in Song Shuhang’s Inner World.","Senior Daozi was no longer dressed in a decadent manner. Dressed in a scholarly outfit, he was handsome and had the dignity of an elder brother. He was both a teacher and an elder brother—there was no mistake about it. It was a style that Song Shuhang couldn’t envy.","“Senior Daozi, you’re here too,” Song Shuhang greeted him with a smile.","“The New Year is coming. You don’t plan to spend the New Year in the scholarly faction, so I wish you a happy New Year in advance.” After Daozi went up, he first took out a red packet and handed it to Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song.","When Song Shuhang received the red packet with both hands, he deeply felt the warmth of the scholarly faction!","This wasn’t just a red packet, it was warmth! Even if it wasn’t a large box of spirit stones, the weight of their friendship was heavy!","Seeing the excited Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, Daozi was also somewhat puzzled. How could a small red packet make Tyrannical Song so happy?","This was the first time he had seen the effect of using a person in a formal dress so well."]},{"number":2910,"title":"Chapter 2910: Aren’t you a Profound Sage that only appears once or twice in a thousand years?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2910: Aren’t you a Profound Sage that only appears once or twice in a thousand years?","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","It was mainly because of Tyrannical Song’s expression that he seemed to be very eager to receive this red packet.","“If I had known earlier, would I have put in more New Year’s gifts? To make Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song even happier?” Dao Zi thought to himself.","“Thank you, Senior Daozi.” Song Shuhang sighed with emotion. This red packet was probably the only red packet he would get this year, aside from Senior White’s.","“Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, let’s call each other equals. You’ve done a great favor to the scholarly faction, and you’re now in the realm of the Tribulation Transcender with Three Separations, so we can be considered equals,” Daozi smiled.","“Senior Brother Daozi, did you also return to the scholarly faction to celebrate the new year?” Song Shuhang readily accepted his advice. The thirteen Tribulation Transcenders of the scholarly faction that he had come into contact with in the later stages of his life weren’t willing to become friends with him as ‘seniors.’","“No,” Daozi shook his head. “I came back this time because I wanted to borrow the ancient Heavenly City fragment from the scholarly faction.”","“Senior Brother Daozi, are you in cahoots with the Great Northern Emperor and Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven?” Song Shuhang asked. After all, before coming to the scholarly faction, the Great Northern Emperor had just borrowed the fragment of the Heavenly City from him.","“Eh? Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song has already met Fellow Daoist Northside?” Daozi asked, stunned.","“Yes. Senior Beifang just met me and borrowed the fragment of the ancient Heavenly City and the Inner World from me.” Song Shuhang replied. Then, he patted Scarlet Heaven Sword at his waist, and said, “Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword and Senior Beifang also came to find me.”","Daozi was speechless.","Then wouldn’t my red packet be a free gift?","I was just thinking of borrowing the ancient Heavenly City fragment from you.","No, no, how could he think that way?","With Tyrannical Song’s great kindness to the scholarly faction, what was wrong with giving him a red packet during the new year to make him happy? This was something every scholarly disciple should do.","A mere red packet was enough to make Tyrannical Song happy. It was worth it.","Later, he would contact his junior brothers and wait for the new year to come. He would go to Tyrannical Song’s house and give them his blessings, a few couplets, and a red packet.","Thinking of this, Daozi secretly nodded.","“Senior Brother Daozi, is there something you need?” Song Shuhang asked after putting away the red packet. At this moment, he couldn’t wait to open the red packet to take a look. However, it was too rude to open the red packet in front of others, so he could only endure it.","“It’s nothing. I just saw that Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song was leaving, so I sent you a red packet to wish you well,” Daozi smiled faintly.","“Senior Brother Daozi, happy new year to you too,” Song Shuhang said.","This was the style of the leading senior disciple of the scholarly faction!","With this red packet, Senior Brother Daozi’s business would be Tyrannical Song’s business in the future.","If Senior Brother Daozi was in trouble, he, Song Shuhang, would provide support from all directions!","“By the way, Fellow Daoist Beifang, apart from borrowing the fragment of the Heavenly City, why do you want to borrow your Inner World?” Daozi asked in confusion.","Song Shuhang explained, “It’s like this. Senior Beifang wanted to borrow a fragment of the Heavenly City from me, but the fragment of the Heavenly City in my Inner World has already completely fused, and I can’t move it out... Therefore, if you want to perform any ritual, you need to move the fragment of the ancient Heavenly City into my Inner World. At that time, I will open up a portion of the Inner World for your ritual.”","When Daozi heard this, he nodded and said, “I see. In that case... Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, why don’t you come with me, and we’ll move all the fragments of the scholarly faction’s Heavenly City into your Inner World today?”","Song Shuhang pondered for a moment, and then nodded. “In that case, I’ll leave the good corpse behind and cooperate with Senior Brother Daozi.”","If it was the fragment of the Heavenly City that the Great Northern Emperor and the others had brought over and entered the Inner World now, the Inner World might lick away the Heavenly Emperor’s Great Dao of Immortality.","However, there was no need to worry about the scholarly faction’s ‘fragment of the Heavenly City,’ because the Heavenly Emperor’s path to immortality contained in the ‘fragment of the Heavenly City,’ had long been stolen by the Inner World!","Anyway, there was nothing he could lick. It didn’t matter if he moved to the Inner World a day earlier or later.","“Good,” Senior Brother Daozi said with a smile.","Song Shuhang stretched out his hand, and from the three flowers above his head, the good corpse Tyrant put his hands together and stepped out.","“Fellow Daoist, please help Senior Brother Daozi transfer the fragment of the Heavenly City to the Inner World,” Song Shuhang said to the good corpse.","Good Corpse Ba Shan: “It’s nothing. Don’t worry, I’ll take care of it.”","Fairy @#%×:","During the New Year, she had wanted to cooperate with the Good Corpse to perform a gun battle technique... Now that Ba Shan was staying in the scholarly faction, he didn’t know if he would be able to rush back for the new year.","After leaving the good corpse in the scholarly faction, Song Shuhang waved goodbye to Senior Brother Daozi.","Senior White once again stretched out his hand and elegantly knocked on the spatial door. No matter which door he knocked on, he looked exceptionally handsome. As his realm increased, Senior White needed to use more energy to control his charm.","Song Shuhang supported his parents, and the group stepped into the spatial gate that Senior White had opened. After crossing thousands of mountains and rivers, they directly entered their home on Wenzhou City’s Baijing Street from the scholarly faction.","Behind him.","After the main body was far away, the good corpse Ba Shan put his hands together and said to Daozi, “Senior Brother Daozi, when do we move?”","“How about now?” Daozi replied.","“Alright. Right, Senior Brother Daozi, please stand properly.” The Good Corpse Ba Shan smiled slightly. At the same time, he circulated the Supreme Merit Heart Sutra, the Dual System Virtue Technique.","Under Daozi’s puzzled gaze, the good corpse stretched out its palm and gently pressed it on Daozi’s body.","A virtue rune was left on Daozi’s body.","Daozi was confused.","“This is my gift to Senior Brother.” “This is a ‘merit rune’ used for blessings,” explained the good corpse Ba Shan. “It contains my own merit luck.” Although I don’t know what plan Senior Brother Daozi has... However, with this talisman, your plan will go a little smoother.”","The power of virtue contained the blessings of heaven and earth and could bless peace and success.","“Thank you,” Daozi replied.","For someone of his realm, the blessing effect of the ‘virtue rune’ was so weak that it was almost negligible. However, this was Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song’s kind intentions, and it was also a kind of blessing. Daozi gladly accepted it.","Tyrannical Song was a person with great luck. With his blessings, their 8.5-point Heavenly Dao plan would probably go more smoothly.","Wenzhou City’s Baijing Street, Song Shuhang’s hometown.","Looking at the dusty old house, Mama Song rolled up her sleeves. “It looks like we need to do some cleaning.”","“Leave it to me.” On the side, Senior White revealed a charming smile.","He snapped his fingers and activated the Dust Cleansing Spell.","The dust in the entire house was swept away, and finally condensed into a small ball of dust at the tip of Senior White’s finger.","Senior White skillfully stretched out his hand and threw the gray ball into the flower bed.","His actions made Mama Song’s eyes light up, and she almost became a fan of Senior White.","“Cultivation is so good.” It was simply too convenient. Mama Song turned her head and looked at Song Shuhang. “Shuhang, by the way, why haven’t I seen you use this magical technique to help me clean up before?”","“To be honest, Mom, I don’t know this spell,” Song Shuhang said frankly.","“Aren’t you a Profound Sage that only appears once or twice in a thousand years?” Mama Song asked.","“Even though I’m already a Tribulation Transcender, I still don’t know this technique,” Song Shuhang said sadly.","“Learn from Immortal White and learn some useful spells,” Mama Song instructed.","After marriage, he would use this spell.","“By the way, is this spell very difficult to learn?” Papa Song asked curiously.","As soon as he finished speaking, all the members present gently raised their fingers and condensed the Dust Cleansing Spell.","Obviously, this spell was a basic one.","Papa Song turned to look at his son. His son was already at the Eighth Stage, but he didn’t even know how to use the Dust Cleansing Spell. Wasn’t that a little embarrassing?"]},{"number":2911,"title":"Chapter 2911: In Debt","paragraphs":["Chapter 2911: In Debt","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Song Shuhang felt that the way his father looked at him constantly hinted at a drop in his “mental status.”","“Dad, even though I don’t know the [Cleansing Dust Curse], I can use the spatial gate! It’s the same spatial gateway that Senior White used just now, the one that allowed us to travel from the scholarly faction to Wenzhou City in one go.” Song Shuhang felt the need to maintain his position in his parents’ hearts, so he brought up his most impressive spatial ability.","If he didn’t protect his status, his role as the eldest son would lose all significance in his parents’ hearts after his sister was born.","“Can the Dimension Portal remove dust?” Papa Song asked a very down-to-earth question.","Song Shuhang was silent for a moment. Dad, is this all you want? The Dimension Portal is such a powerful ability, and you’re comparing it to removing dust?","“Oh,” Papa Song replied.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“Although the Dimension Portal can’t remove dust, it can solve the problem of garbage!” Song Shuhang said, “At the very least, with the spatial gate, I don’t have to worry about garbage classification. I don’t have to worry about what kind of garbage I want to throw away, and I don’t have to be asked ‘what kind of garbage are you’ every day. I can directly open a space door on an uninhabited planet in the universe or a world that can completely burn trash into energy and throw the trash in.”","“Eh? Now that you mention it, it’s really interesting.” Papa Song nodded. Actually, when Song Shuhang said he knew how to open a spatial gate, Papa Song was very shocked!","He did not expect his son, who did not even know the Dust-Cleansing Spell, to have mastered the ability of the Dimension Portal, which often appeared in sci-fi movies.","The reason he replied with an “oh” was firstly because he was a little too shocked in his heart, so shocked that he didn’t know what to say. Secondly, he wanted to maintain his status as an old father. He couldn’t show an “you’re amazing” expression like a junior.","However, when Song Shuhang mentioned the various ways to use the spatial gate, Papa Song finally couldn’t take it anymore.","In the past few months, they had been tormented by the ‘garbage sorting.’","“However, if we throw trash into the universe, it won’t pollute the universe, right?” Papa Song casually asked again. He wasn’t really worried about anything; he was just casually asking to keep the conversation going.","“No, there are many magical worlds in the myriad worlds... In some worlds, no matter what was thrown in, it would be decomposed and turned into pure energy. Even if it’s trash, it’s the same.” Song Shuhang explained.","“This is wonderful,” Papa Song said.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet and Scarlet Heaven Sword were speechless.","Zither Master Fengyi’s claws and Pavilion Master Chu’s fur were stunned.","The space ability of a Tribulation Transcender was used to throw trash? You guys are really creative geniuses.","At the side, after Mama Song put down her luggage, she asked, “Shuhang, how many people will come during the New Year?”","When she was in the scholarly faction, Song Shuhang had mentioned to her that the members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group would be coming to Wenzhou City to organize a New Year’s event.","However, Mama Song didn’t know how many members there were in the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","“There should be about fifty people who can come, and a few seniors might bring their juniors or relatives. Therefore, there might be seventy to eighty people,” Song Shuhang replied.","For example, Great Master Profound Principle would probably bring Guoguo over. Guoguo had been very diligent in her cultivation recently, and she was thinking of when she could come and play with Song Shuhang again.","Fairy Lychee might also bring Shi and Zhu, who were also acquaintances.","In addition, Zhou Li was going to bring Fairy Jade Zither over, so Senior Medicine Master would definitely bring Riverly Purple Mist...","Counting them up, the number of people was only a little more.","“Seventy to eighty people?” Mama Song asked. “Then our house is too small... Why don’t we find a place nearby and rent a big place?”","“No need, no need. I have a way to deal with it. Mom, just tidy up the room. I’ll open up my small world later and connect it to our house. It can completely accommodate us,” Song Shuhang said.","“Your little world?” Mama Song asked.","“Yes, it’s similar to the world of the golden lotus of the scholarly faction, but it’s much smaller,” Song Shuhang explained.","Mama Song nodded thoughtfully. God knows how her monkey managed to get so many things in a year or so. There was even a private small world.","“Are there any children coming over? Should we prepare some New Year’s bags?” Papa Song asked.","Song Shuhang shook his head and said, “Forget about the New Year’s bag... Cultivators generally don’t need ordinary money. If you want to make a New Year’s gift bag, you can only use spirit stones.”","“Then we’ll pay spirit stones?” Papa Song asked. After all, they had lived in the scholarly world for a period of time, so they knew about spirit stones.","“No spirit stones,” Song Shuhang raised his head and looked at the sky.","The box of spirit stones that Island Master Golden Trigram had given him as a greeting gift had been used to preserve the World Fusion Card before he could warm it up. As long as he had enough spirit stones, the World Fusion Card could be preserved after each use. However, the cost of using it was a little high.","Song Shuhang’s pockets were cleaner than his face.","The ‘cultivation chat charging function’ that he had painstakingly fiddled with had yet to officially start making profits... Moreover, when he distributed his wealth last time, he had even given out a VIP function worth a few trillion spirit stones to the myriad worlds. It would be too difficult to rely on the ‘cultivation chat’ function to collect fees in the short term.","“Aren’t spirit stones the most basic thing in the cultivation world? I heard that when cultivating, you can’t do without spirit stones. Without spirit stones, how are you going to cultivate? Didn’t you save some?” Papa Song was puzzled.","After staying in the scholarly faction for a few days, Papa Song had gained some basic knowledge about the cultivation world, such as medicinal pills and spirit stones. Every cultivator couldn’t leave them when they were in seclusion.","It was common to see scholarly disciples using spirit stones to absorb spirit energy.","He heard that his monkey’s cultivation realm was quite high. How could he cultivate without spirit stones? Breathing air?","“I didn’t save any spirit stones, not a single one... Therefore, when I don’t have any spirit stones, I can only borrow some,” Song Shuhang said.","“How much do you owe?” Papa Song said worriedly.","He was the type of person who would feel uneasy when he owed others money. After owing others money, he would be eager to return the money as soon as he had money. He would feel uneasy if he owed it for a long time.","Therefore, when he heard that Song Shuhang owed someone spirit stones, he was a little worried.","“Senior White, how many spirit stones do I owe you now?” Song Shuhang turned his head and asked.","At this time, Senior White was squatting beside the coffee table, playing with the mechanical girl on the coffee table and trying to feed her snacks.","After hearing Song Shuhang’s question, he seriously thought about it and replied, “Yes, a lot.”","“Dad, I owe you a lot, a lot,” Song Shuhang turned around and said.","Papa Song was speechless.","How much was a lot?","With his son’s salary, would he be able to repay the debt?"]},{"number":2912,"title":"Chapter 2912: Ball Song Coldly Sneers","paragraphs":["Chapter 2912: Ball Song Coldly Sneers","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","If Song Shuhang owed ordinary money, Papa Song would have gritted his teeth and, taking advantage of his rejuvenated body, worked for a few more years to help his son pay off his debts.","But his son owed spirit stones, and Papa Song was powerless—after all, he had no idea how to earn spirit stones.","Where could he work to earn spirit stones? He was anxious!","Senior White carefully broke open a piece of biscuit-like snack and handed a small piece to the mechanical girl, Little Ling Xiao. Then, he looked at the anxious Papa Song and comforted him, “Don’t worry. I don’t charge interest. Shuhang can pay me back slowly.”","After Senior White comforted him, Papa Song became even more worried. He didn’t even want the interest and only wanted to recover the principal? Wasn’t this just acknowledging that it was very difficult to get back the money he had borrowed and simply wanting to break even?","Song Shuhang saw that his father was still anxious, so he could only comfort him in detail. “Dad, don’t think too much about it. It’s not what you think. Senior White simply doesn’t want any interest, and it could be considered a small benefit for the younger generation. Besides, I’m going to earn spirit stones in the future. I have a big project in my hands. If I manage it well, I might even become the richest man in the cultivation world in the future. There’s still a chance to pay off the debt.”","Papa Song was speechless.","You can’t even afford half a spirit stone, and you’re talking to me about becoming the richest man in the cultivation world? Where did your confidence come from?","“Yes, the cultivation chat client is indeed a good project.” Senior White sat cross-legged on the floor and stretched out his hand to gently touch the mechanical girl. Because Little Ling Xiao hadn’t completely transformed yet, her lower body was in the shape of an eggshell. Senior White stretched out his hand and gently pushed her, making her body start to shake like a roly-poly doll. No matter how hard she shook, she wouldn’t fall down.","Little Ling Xiao swayed in circles, letting out a string of joyful laughter. Children were like this. As long as someone teased them, they would be happy.","After hearing Senior White’s words, Papa Song slightly nodded and let out a sigh of relief. It seemed that his son had really found a good project to make money.","This was the weight of words.","Because Song Shuhang was a son, Papa Song and the others had a fixed impression of him since he was young. Therefore, no matter how good Song Shuhang’s words sounded, Papa Song didn’t dare to believe them.","However, Senior White was different. As long as he casually said something, Papa Song would believe most of it. Then, with the help of Bai’s special charm, this belief would be firmly established.","At the side of the coffee table, Senior White was a little tired of playing with Ling Xiao.","After pondering for a moment, he stretched out his finger and performed the [Cleansing Dust Mantra]’s dao seal in front of Little Ling Xiao, as well as demonstrating the [Cleansing Dust Mantra]’s runes.","At the same time, he said to Song Shuhang, “Right, Shuhang. Northern River’s Loose Cultivator asked me in a private chat just now, ‘How many disciples have you taken in? How many children? He can prepare the red packet.’”","“Are reserve disciples considered disciples?” Song Shuhang asked. He suddenly thought of Joseph.","Joseph was a very persistent guy. After he decided that Song Shuhang was his wet father, he not only bought a house near Jiangnan University Town but also bought a house next door to Song Shuhang’s hometown in Wenzhou City.","Although he was still a preparatory disciple, Song Shuhang had left him a disciple position in his heart after the incident with Evil Wang.","“It can be counted... This time, you and Fellow Daoist Yellow Mountain will work together to give the members of the group treasures that can condense and strengthen the weapon spirit. The fellow daoists won’t mind if you give them more red packets,” Senior White replied.","“Then I’ll call Joseph along,” Song Shuhang said.","After saying that, he stretched out his hand and drew a line in the void, opening his Inner World.","[My son’s spatial ability?] Papa Song went up and took a glance—was trash supposed to be thrown into this space tunnel?","Eh? Something’s not right!","Inside this spatial passageway was a fairyland. Birds were singing, and flowers were fragrant. There was a clean and comfortable aura that assaulted one’s senses.","Was such a fairyland used to throw trash?","Just as he was thinking, several figures flew out of this space.","“Master, is there anything you need?” This was his eldest disciple, the monster bird Little Cai.","Little Cai had taken the treasure that Song Shuhang had brought from the Black Dragon World, which was called ‘forming a human form in advance.’ Although she hadn’t reached the Fifth Stage Realm yet, she could already transform into a human.","Usually, she preferred the state of Cai Que. This state was more suitable for her to practice dual-blade techniques.","However, today was special, so she transformed into the appearance of a multicolored girl—the same girl that she had looked like when she met the monster hunter uncle.","Then, a girl in a long black dress and black stockings stepped out of the spatial passageway. The girl was slender and tall. Other than being a little flat, there was almost no fault with her figure.","“Chu Chu greets Master.” Chu Chu bowed politely. She was a disciple of a cultivation family, so she paid more attention to etiquette.","At the same time, she bowed to Senior White, Song Shuhang’s pendant, Immortal Fairy White Bones, and the other seniors.","Although she was the second disciple, Chu Chu was more suitable to hold up the front of Song Shuhang’s faction than Little Cai.","Song Shuhang smiled and nodded at the two disciples. It would be appropriate to hand over the task of welcoming the seniors of the Nine Provinces Number One Group to Chu Chu.","‘Another two little fairies.’ Mama Song looked at Little Cai and Chu Chu with great attention. She and Papa Song were prepared to help Song Shuhang during the new year, so she had to be careful of any fairy.","Regrettably, these two fairies were Song Shuhang’s disciples, and in this day and age, teacher-student relationships were under a lot of pressure.","“Also, the tree monster Miruru, whom you borrowed from the Dream Realm to become a part of the World Tree Project, is also a disciple that I’m going to take in. She will inherit my daoist name, ‘Priest Mu.’ There’s also a preparatory disciple, Joseph. I’m thinking of giving him the Daoist name of Baijing Street’s Sabersman,” Song Shuhang said.","As he spoke, he extended his hand into his Inner World. He placed his hands on his ribs and carried out the silver-haired girl, Li Yinzhu, who had fallen asleep again.","“As for daughters, Yinzhu and Little Ling Xiao are both my daughters in a sense,” Song Shuhang said.","Senior White nodded and said, “Alright, I’ll inform Fellow Daoist Northern River.”","“How can you carry a child like this?” At this time, Mama Song came out of the room and saw Song Shuhang holding Li Yinzhu by her ribs. Therefore, she took the soft Li Yinzhu from his hands and said, “Right, should we show Apocalypse War during the new year?” A few months ago, your father wanted to play your movie in the living room during the new year so that all the relatives could see it.”","“If I play that movie, I might be beaten to death after it ends,” Song Shuhang said.","Pa ~ At this time, Little Ling Xiao, who was sitting on Senior White’s coffee table, suddenly snapped her fingers.","Then, the magic halo of the Dust Cleansing Spell condensed from her fingers and spread to every room, enveloping the entire house.","Senior White cleaned the dust in the house, while Little Ling Xiao cleaned the outside of the house.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Papa Song couldn’t help but glance at his son.","Song Shuhang was stunned for a moment.","“As expected of my daughter! This talent in spells is deeply inherited from me,” Song Shuhang nodded.","“Kekeke ~” Little Ling Xiao let out a string of chicken-like laughter.","On the other side, in the main world, the solar system.","Ball Song hid alone in the void of the solar system, carefully observing the state of the sun.","As it lurked, it glanced at the blue Earth.","“It’s going to be the new year... This year, I want to celebrate the new year with my main body.” Ball Song made up his mind.","Then, it locked onto the position of the sun.","After investigating the Stellar Destruction Virus for so long, it finally caught the tail of the person who spread the virus behind the scenes!","This person was preparing to release the virus into the sun.","“How can I let you ruin my chance to celebrate the new year with my main body?” Ball Song said mercilessly."]},{"number":2913,"title":"Chapter 2913: Experienced Ball","paragraphs":["Chapter 2913: Experienced Ball","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“It’s the perfect time to capture this guy. On New Year’s Day, I’ll pack him up and present him to the main body as a New Year’s gift,” Ball Song thought to himself.","Recently, the ‘Stellar Destruction Virus’ had been giving the main body a headache. So, if he could catch the mastermind behind the spread of the Stellar Destruction Virus, it would be a significant achievement.","Moreover, this would give him an excuse to return and reunite with the main body.","Thinking of this, Ball Song wished he could immediately take action and capture the person behind the virus’s spread, then bring him to see the main body.","Every time he parted ways with the main body, his inner impulse to “find the main body” would begin to accumulate. This impulse would grow stronger over time.","Each time he located the main body’s position and found him, this accumulated impulse would transform into a sense of accomplishment. It was like finding an opponent in a game of hide-and-seek, making Ball Song happy.","“However, I need to be careful now,” Ball Song said calmly.","He wanted to wait for the mastermind to officially enter the sun before activating the ‘space lockdown’ method he had secretly set up nearby, making it impossible for the mastermind to escape even if he had wings. Then, he would capture him in one move!","He wanted to capture him alive and bring him back. Of course, if he couldn’t control him, he couldn’t do anything about it. In any case, he believed that with the main body’s extraordinary methods, even if he brought back a corpse, the main body would be able to extract a lot of key information.","“Calm down, calm down. Just a little more,” Ball Song thought to himself.","At the same time, the urge to find the main body was accumulating within him.","However, he had to endure it now.","The greater the desire to find the main body was suppressed, the stronger the sense of accomplishment would be when he found him.","Ball Song had completely concealed his aura, so no one could detect him.","At the same time, at a very suitable moment, Ball Song secretly disturbed the heavenly secrets near the sun’s star, making it impossible for people to use ‘divination techniques,’ ‘crisis intuition,’ and ‘omen sense’ to predict the development of events in this area!","The experts of the present world had a strong sense of danger. If the heavenly secrets weren’t disturbed, the mastermind might sense it and become vigilant.","Ball Song was very experienced in this area.","This was an instinct engraved in his bones!","Although he had no detailed memories, he felt that he had often fought with a powerful existence in the past. Both sides had won and lost.","This memory had become Ball Song’s instinct. It allowed him to calculate the enemy in secret with ease and experience.","In particular, his method of disturbing the heavenly secrets was very gentle, as if he were stirring water... Ball Song was confident that even if the main body’s incarnation of the ruler of the Netherworld weren’t paying attention, he wouldn’t notice that the heavenly secrets had been disturbed!","In the modern world, Wenzhou City.","After summoning his disciples and daughter, Song Shuhang sighed with emotion, and said, “Unfortunately, time is a little tight. Otherwise, I could have gone to the Black Dragon World and set up the trial passageway... There’s also a preparatory disciple, Chi Tong.”","Chi Tong was a bit special. As long as his realm hadn’t reached the target, Song Shuhang wouldn’t take him out of the Black Dragon World.","“Cleansing Mantra!” Just as Song Shuhang was sighing with emotion, another cloth-purifying magical technique was thrown at him.","Song Shuhang turned his head and saw Little Ling Xiao giggling at him.","The little fellow’s talent in magic was amazing.","Senior White seemed to be interested. He sat on the floor beside the coffee table and began to teach Little Ling Xiao basic magical techniques one after another. Teaching Little Ling Xiao was much more convenient than teaching Song Shuhang. At the very least, he didn’t have to simplify magical techniques into runes.","Moreover, Little Ling Xiao learned very quickly.","From the Dust Cleansing Curse to the current Clothes Cleansing Curse, Senior White began to teach basic lightning techniques, and Thrice Reckless invented the Charging Technique.","Senior White only needed to briefly explain the principle, demonstrate it once, and then analyze the dao seal and the tricks of circulating spiritual energy. Little Ling Xiao would be able to grasp the spell after silently calculating a few chapters.","For example, now...","“Pa, zi, zi ~” The little fellow stretched out her hand and drew a line of lightning on her fingertip.","Then, she reached out and tapped on Papa Song’s phone, charging it up.","If this went on, before Song Shuhang could become the Master of All Spells, the little fellow might be able to sit on the throne of the Master of All Spells.","“Aww, my little cutie, you’re really amazing,” Papa Song praised happily. This was the privilege of a granddaughter. No matter what her granddaughter did, even if it was just climbing a few steps, she would be praised by the whole family, not to mention a practical spell like the battery charging technique.","“Congratulations, Shuhang. Although you’re still a long way from becoming the Master of All Spells, you’re one step closer to becoming the Master of All Spells’ father,” Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword said happily.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","He stretched out his hand and pressed it on Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword’s body, and with a swipe of his right hand, he released 100 flashes of the Shut Up·Saber Nurturing Technique.","“Then let’s learn some more difficult spells. Hmm, let’s learn the Heavenly Master’s Lightning Technique: Five-Blow-Thunderstruck. Shuhang, open up your Inner World. Five-Blow-Thunderstruck is a little too loud, and it’s not easy to demonstrate it in the main world. Let’s go to your Inner World to practice,” Senior White said.","Five-Blow-Thunderstruck was a lightning technique that Big Boss Tyrannical Song had relied on his realm to strengthen to the level of ‘Five Thunders’. It was a lightning technique that was very memorable.","“Alright ~” Song Shuhang said.","It was finally his chance to show off.","The huge Inner World was one of the few projects that Song Shuhang could take out.","“Where should I set up the Inner World?” Senior White asked.","Song Shuhang pointed at his own room and said, “Let’s set it at the entrance of my room.”","After saying this, Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and opened the exit of the Inner World once again. This time, he set up a stable temporary passage, and the entrance overlapped with his own.","Papa Song curiously leaned over and took a look.","“Eh? Isn’t this the junkyard you mentioned before?” Papa Song said.","Song Shuhangwas confused.","Papa Song quickly realized that he had misunderstood.","As he spoke, he moved closer and looked into the Inner World curiously.","Coincidentally, when Papa Song leaned over, he saw a tall woman holding a kitchen knife and appearing aggressively.","Papa Song subconsciously stepped aside.","“Tyrannical Song, are the ingredients ready?” Immortal Fairy Bie Xue called out.","For Sage White’s sake, she was willing to help the Nine Provinces Number One Group prepare the New Year’s feast. However, Tyrannical Song hadn’t provided her with enough ingredients for the annual banquet.","“What ingredients do you want?” Song Shuhang asked.","Immortal Fairy Bie Xue pondered for a moment and said, “How about a dragon beast feast? Slaughter a dragon beast during the New Year?”","“Dragon beast? Kill the dragon? Isn’t that too cruel?” Song Shuhang asked.","Just as he said ‘kill the dragon’... Suddenly, a spatial rift opened up in the void, and a white dragon head emerged from it.","The White Dragon was speechless."]},{"number":2914,"title":"Chapter 2914: I Have a Wish","paragraphs":["Chapter 2914: I Have a Wish","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“Big Sister White Dragon, does your timing really have to be so coincidental?”","For a moment, he wondered if White Dragon had been peeping at him all along, just waiting for the right moment to appear.","The situation was extremely awkward.","Song Shuhang looked at White Dragon, and White Dragon stared back at him.","Immortal Fairy Bie Xue didn’t dare to say anything.","“Hey, Big Sister White Dragon, is your seclusion over?” Song Shuhang revealed a textbook smile to break the silence.","White Dragon rolled her eyes and turned into a pure white dragon. “I’m a White Dragon that’s as dead as can be. I don’t need to do things like seclusion. Sixteen is the one in seclusion on the mysterious island, not me.”","“Then has Sixteen finished her seclusion?” Song Shuhang took the opportunity to ask the key question. Previously, he had used the ‘cultivation chat’ function to privately chat with White Dragon, but White Dragon didn’t answer him.","“Probably.”","Song Shuhang was startled.","An uncertain answer?","“Right, Shuhang, do you want to become a dragon?” White Dragon suddenly asked.","“Huh?”","“Dragon!” Little Ling Xiao waved his arms excitedly. “Become a dragon!”","She had the ability to transform. In the future, as long as she had a better grasp of her own body, she could change her mechanical mode at will. Turning into a mechanical dragon would not be a problem.","“As a descendant of the dragon, are you interested in becoming a dragon?” White Dragon asked again.","“I might have been interested when I was young,” Song Shuhang replied seriously. “But now, I’ve grown up.”","I’m already a mature Tyrannical Song.","Papa Song was speechless.","Because, for a moment, he had a strong interest in becoming a dragon. To be honest, Papa Song wanted to become a dragon.","However, his son’s answer cut off his thoughts. He had already grown up, so why would he be interested in becoming a dragon? If he said that he was interested in becoming a dragon, did that mean he was not as mature as his son?","“I feel that you should consider turning into a dragon. I have a perfect method for humans to turn into dragons... well, at least the theory is very mature. You’re now a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender. If you don’t want to remain human and become a dragon, it’ll be easier for you to do so.” White Dragon’s body emerged from space and wrapped around Song Shuhang’s neck like a scarf.","Because White Dragon’s aura was too strong, Zither Master Feng Yi’s claws on her shoulder were pushed to the side, and she didn’t dare to say anything.","“After becoming a dragon, you can cut yourself as you wish. Dragon liver, dragon heart, dragon skeleton... You can cut them out and turn them into ingredients for the New Year’s banquet. Isn’t it great?” White Dragon tightened her scarf and whispered in Song Shuhang’s ear in a charming voice, “Also, dragon liver can be sold for spirit stones. It’s very popular in the cultivation world.”","After hearing White Dragon’s devilish enticement, Song Shuhang was almost tempted.","He had Cheng Lin’s Self-Healing Technique, the Primary Instruction of the Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique, and all kinds of powerful self-healing methods, just like how he had taken out 66 hearts to refine weapons previously. As long as he was willing, he could even fork out a few hundred dragon livers. If there was a buyer willing to pay spirit stones, he could even spend his entire life until the buyer went bankrupt!","“However, I refuse this method of earning money.” Song Shuhang’s heart was firm, and he wasn’t tempted at all. “No matter what falls from my body, the Giant Turtle of Disaster will come and collect it.”","“You’re not Fairy Skylark,” White Dragon said.","“It was different in the past,” Song Shuhang said. “But it’s almost the same now.”","White Dragon was speechless.","In other words, it hasn’t been long since Sixteen and I left you, and you’ve become even more troublesome?","Your ability to continuously add +1 points to your hand is really enviable.","After a long while, White Dragon sighed.","“Hahaha.” Song Shuhang didn’t know how to respond, so he could only smile politely.","“If you could advance like a normal cultivator...” White Dragon looked up at the sky. “Forget it. It’s already impossible.”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“Are you guys busy now?” White Dragon asked as she glanced at Senior White.","Senior White nodded. “I’m a little busy. I have to make arrangements for the New Year. Shuhang will also have to stay behind to help.”","“Can you lend us his head for a while? It’ll only take a while,” White Dragon asked.","Senior White replied, “Sure.”","After getting Senior White’s approval, White Dragon tightened the scarf again.","“Stop, stop! Sister White Dragon, I’m going to die! I’m going to die!” Song Shuhang patted White Dragon and called out.","White Dragon said, “Shuhang... lend me your good head.”","Song Shuhang:","“The body will stay behind to assist Fellow Daoist White. The head will follow me first,” White Dragon said.","Song Shuhang said, “Wait a moment. You’ll scare my dad and the others. Why don’t I ask Fellow Daoist Evil Corpse to go with you?”","“No need, just follow the head,” White Dragon said.","Song Shuhang had no choice but to call out to Papa Song. “Dad, I have to leave my head for a while. Don’t worry about me.”","Papa Song was confused.","Then, under Papa Song’s horrified gaze, Song Shuhang’s head and body separated, and White Dragon carried him into the void and disappeared.","Papa Song was speechless.","F*ck, my son’s head flew away just like that?","“Won’t he die?” Papa Song looked at the severed head. No blood spurted out.","“Don’t worry, Uncle Song,” Soft Feather comforted him. “Senior Song’s flying head technique is really good.”","“Can cultivators do this?” Papa Song still felt that the scene was terrifying.","“Not everyone can do it. It’s even rarer to see someone like Senior Song who can ‘act separately,’” Soft Feather said.","“Shuhang’s body, let’s continue setting up the Inner World. Yinzhu, Chu Chu, and Little Cai, come over and follow me,” Senior White said happily.","He was prepared to let Yinzhu and the others watch from the side while he was teaching Little Ling Xiao some magical techniques. They wanted to see how talented Song Shuhang’s disciples were.","Song Shuhang’s body stretched out his hand and made an ‘OK’ gesture, bringing everyone into the Inner World.","Papa Song was at the back of the group.","As he walked, Papa Song subconsciously reached into his pocket. Looking at his headless son, he wanted to chew a few pills to calm himself down.","No matter what kind of pill it was, he just wanted to chew two.","On the other side, the mysterious island, the White Dragon Tomb.","White Dragon brought Song Shuhang’s head back to the tomb.","Next to the dragon tomb, Su Clan’s Sixteen was still meditating with her eyes closed.","However, when White Dragon returned, Su Clan’s Sixteen, who was cultivating, opened her eyes as if she had sensed Song Shuhang’s aura.","She looked at the head that was Song Shuhang and was slightly stunned.","“There’s only one head left?”","Then, she stretched out her arm.","White Dragon gently tossed Song Shuhang’s head to Sixteen.","“You’re awake, Sixteen,” Song Shuhang greeted with a smile.","“Her seclusion has ended,” Su Clan’s Sixteen corrected him as she hugged Song Shuhang’s head.","“Hahahaha.” Song Shuhang laughed awkwardly. After all, he was the only one who needed to ‘wake up’ to end his closed-door training. “Did your training go well?”","“It has been progressing step by step,” Su Clan’s Sixteen said. “However, Shuhang, you’re already a Tribulation Transcender with three corpses. It’s too fast.”","It was so fast that she didn’t have time to do many things, and Song Shuhang had already finished.","“Shuhang, I have a wish,” Su Clan’s Sixteen said.","Su Clan’s Sixteen once had a wish... before entering the final trial of the Spirit River Su Clan, she had a wish."]},{"number":2915,"title":"Chapter 2915: Therefore, We Can’t Wait Any Longer","paragraphs":["Chapter 2915: Therefore, We Can’t Wait Any Longer","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Su Clan’s Sixteen lifted Song Shuhang’s head with both hands and said, “Shuhang, do you want to guess what Sixteen’s wish was?”","“Wish?” Song Shuhang looked at her and pondered.","The White Dragon was swimming around randomly in the void. No matter how sweet their conversation was, the scene in front of me was still extremely terrifying.","Even though she was the one who brought Song Shuhang’s head back, she couldn’t help but complain.","“Have you guessed it?” Su Clan’s Sixteen asked.","“Marry me?” Song Shuhang said somewhat shyly.","It wasn’t that he was narcissistic. This was the answer Su Clan’s Sixteen had personally hinted to him.","At that time, Song Shuhang hadn’t reached the Profound Sage Realm and was still a newbie. Then, one day, Su Clan’s Sixteen’s aura suddenly exploded, and she insisted on discussing with him about ‘future, Dao-companion,’ and other profound questions.","At that time, Song Shuhang’s mentality wasn’t as mature as it was now, and his experience wasn’t as rich as it was now.","Song Shuhang still remembered that Sixteen had asked him if he would consider the option of getting married in the future. The main reason was that Su Clan’s Sixteen was too domineering at that moment, and he would never forget it.","He suspected that if Su Clan’s Sixteen had been a little stronger back then, he might have cowered and agreed to marry into the Spirit River Su Clan.","“Pfft,” the White Dragon couldn’t help but laugh when she heard this answer. No matter what, Tyrannical Song is an existence that can stop babies from crying in the universe. Your answer... Was he possessed?","Pavilion Master Chu, who was standing on top of Song Shuhang’s head, was speechless. Pavilion Master Chu felt a little embarrassed, and she was considering whether she should retract her hair back into her Inner World.","“Why do you still remember this?” Su Clan’s Sixteen said somewhat unnaturally. However, she didn’t wait for Song Shuhang’s reply. She continued, “Before Sixteen entered the final trial of the Spirit River Su Clan, she had a wish. She wanted to live to see you again.”","It was a wish that was both simple and very complicated. At that time, Su Clan’s Sixteen’s heavenly tribulation had not only injured her body but also her soul, which was very troublesome.","“Now, Sixteen’s wish has been fulfilled.” Su Clan’s Sixteen said as she raised Song Shuhang’s head high. At the same time, the ‘glass heart’ in her chest stepped on the accelerator and began to beat faster.","She seemed a little nervous. Pavilion Master Chu was dumbfounded. “That’s the upgraded version of Sixteen’s original wish,” Su Clan’s Sixteen said.","Song Shuhang was silent for a moment. At this time, he noticed that Su Clan’s Sixteen had been calling herself ‘Sixteen’ while introducing her ‘wish.’ Although it was a little cute, Song Shuhang felt that something was wrong when she repeatedly called herself ‘Sixteen’ at this time.","He looked at the White Dragon from the corner of his eye. Then, he noticed that the White Dragon seemed to be frowning as well, thinking about something.","The dragon tomb quieted down, leaving only the sound of Liu Li’s heartbeat.","Su Clan’s Sixteen seemed to be nervous. Song Shuhang was also very nervous. Several guesses appeared in his mind. More than half of these guesses were worrying.","Azurite’s heartbeat was still steadily accelerating. After feeling that the ‘glass heart’ was about to reach its limit, Song Shuhang finally prepared himself to withstand the impact.","Then, he braced himself and asked, “Sixteen Two?”","This was the reason why Song Shuhang was so nervous. During the process of Su Clan’s Sixteen’s final trial by fire of the Spirit River Su Clan, more than a hundred different ‘Little Sixteen’ were collected. Was Su Clan’s Sixteen still the same person from the beginning? Could it be that he had already quietly become Su Clan’s Sixteen Two?","Song Shuhang had similar concerns in the past. At that time, he had secretly used the ‘secret appraisal technique’ on Sixteen and asked the White Dragon for confirmation. Back then, the answer pointed to ‘Sixteen is still Sixteen.’ Even though she had transformed into a dragon, her essence had never changed.","But now, Song Shuhang could no longer be sure of the answer he had given earlier. This was because Su Clan’s Sixteen’s every word and action was strange. If he thought about it carefully...Actually, from the moment Sixteen came out of seclusion, some changes had occurred.","At the time, Song Shuhang thought that Sixteen’s personality had changed after experiencing the ups and downs of life and death. But now, thinking about it carefully, it was extremely terrifying.","Song Shuhang looked at Su Clan’s Sixteen’s lips, waiting for her to answer. He had already prepared himself for the worst. However, if the person in front of him was Sixteen Two, would he be able to face her calmly?","Even the White Dragon was staring at Sixteen. It seemed that even she did not notice the abnormality in this aspect? Or perhaps, when the White Dragon was possessing Sixteen’s body, she had been in contact with Sixteen Two?","Below, Su Clan’s Sixteen shook her head. Song Shuhang heaved a sigh of relief.","“Is that Three?” Pavilion Master Chu asked in a daze. Song Shuhang had just released half of his breath, but it was now stuck in his chest, unable to go up or down.","In the Inner World, Song Shuhang’s heartbeat, which had been slightly calm, immediately sped up. The drum-like heartbeats made Immortal Fairy White Bones, Zither Master Fengyi, and the other fairies curious.","What exactly had Song Shuhang’s brain experienced in the White Dragon’s place? Why did his heartbeat sound like he was playing the “General’s Order”?","“Are you playing an exciting game?” Senior White pondered for a moment and said, “Later, we’ll ask Shuhang what he’s playing. If it’s fun, we can play it too.”","“Senior White, good idea.” Soft Feather agreed. Since Senior Song’s heart was beating so fast, it must be a very interesting game, right?","“It’s not three. It’s not what you think.” Su Clan’s Sixteen said, “The trial went smoothly. Sixteen’s existence has never been replaced.”","Song Shuhang heaved a sigh of relief. From his point of view, he still hoped that Sixteen would be able to successfully pass the trial without any problems. He hoped that there wouldn’t be any two or three.","People were always selfish, and Song Shuhang couldn’t be selfless and equal in everything.","“Then, Sixteen, what’s your current state?” Pavilion Master Chu asked in a daze. As a bystander, she could see everything clearly.","Su Clan’s Sixteen replied, “Yes, in terms of condition... I’m probably Su Clan’s 16.1.”","Song Shuhang was confused.","The White Dragon was speechless.","“This is the price to pay for the Heavenly River Trial. Or rather, it’s a part of the trial.” Su Clan’s Sixteen explained.","“The closest state should be the ‘simulated personality.’ This was the price of the trial and also a guarantee to complete the final step of the trial. He would use the second personality that he had simulated to replace his main body as the hub that would receive all of Little Sixteen’s information. At the same time, it also prevents the main personality from being split into hundreds of consciousnesses after the trial is completed.”","“Then, what about Sixteen’s main personality?” Song Shuhang asked.","“It’s always been there, but it’s still operating in the background. For example, right now, the main personality is also operating...However, to avoid any accidents, we still need to maintain this state for a period of time.” Su Clan’s Sixteen said, “Originally, we thought that we had enough time to slowly accompany you and cultivate your comprehension. It was like water flowing into a river.”","It would be best if he could hold on until Su Clan’s Sixteen’s main personality returned to the stage.","However, Song Shuhang’s leveling speed was too fast. It was so fast that Su Clan’s Sixteen couldn’t keep changing her rhythm in time. Not long after, Song Shuhang was sterilized.","“So, we can’t wait any longer, Ghost Fairy,” Su Clan’s Sixteen said to the person behind Song Shuhang.","A pair of arms stretched out from behind Song Shuhang. The ghost spirit fairy hugged his neck and floated in the air."]},{"number":2916,"title":"Chapter 2916: The Girl Holding a Floating Head Balloon, Heading Towards a Space Full of Coffins","paragraphs":["Chapter 2916: The Girl Holding a Floating Head Balloon, Heading Towards a Space Full of Coffins","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","If it weren’t for the fact that Song Shuhang’s “Flying Head Technique” still had part of his neck left, the ghost fairy spirit would have covered his mouth and hung behind his head when she appeared.","Flying Head Technique, Dragging Knife Version.","Pavilion Master Chu, who was in a daze, also looked curiously at the ghost fairy spirit. She didn’t know why Su Clan’s Sixteen had summoned the ghost fairy spirit at this time.","Originally, Pavilion Master Chu had decided to quietly return to the Inner World. After all, no matter how you looked at it, the following scene was one of Song Shuhang and Su Clan’s Sixteen’s relationship.","From ancient times, Fairy Chu Weiwei, who had never been able to cultivate her feelings, hated to see such emotional drama the most—it was very hurtful!","The current her did not wish all lovers in the world to become siblings. It was all because she was broad-minded.","However, when the ghost fairy spirit appeared, Fairy Chu Weiwei decided to leave her hair behind. She had to look after Song Shuhang’s ghost fairy spirit... She couldn’t let her cause trouble, but she also couldn’t let Song Shuhang bully her.","“Ghost Fairy Spirit.” Su Clan’s Sixteen first let go of Song Shuhang’s head and then stretched out her delicate hand to meet the ghost fairy spirit.","Under the confused gazes of Song Shuhang and Pavilion Master Chu, the ghost fairy spirit stretched out her transparent arm and grabbed Su Clan’s Sixteen’s palm.","She clenched her slender fingers and interlocked them.","In the next moment, the ghost fairy spirit left Song Shuhang’s neck and gently swam to Su Clan’s Sixteen’s side, merging into her body.","Some time ago, the ghost fairy spirit had made a temporary contract with Su Clan’s Sixteen, and she had stayed in Su Clan’s Sixteen’s body for a while. It seemed that they had made some arrangements during their stay.","The two fairies interlocked their fingers, leaving Song Shuhang’s head floating in the air.","In just a short moment, he lost the embrace of Su Clan’s Sixteen and the ghost fairy.","A strange sense of loneliness welled up in his heart.","“This way, the conflict between us will no longer be a problem,” Su Clan’s Sixteen said.","Her words sounded like she was speaking in two different voices. The left voice belonged to Su Clan’s Sixteen, while the right voice belonged to the ghost fairy.","Sixteen stretched out her hand and gently stroked her chest. The “glass heart” that was beating in her chest was the favorite residence of the ghost fairy.","She and the ghost fairy were currently in a cooperative relationship.","If the ghost fairy continued to be in sync with Song Shuhang, she would one day completely become Song Shuhang.","Because of her special nature, she could still maintain her independent personality. However, her thoughts, speech, actions, hobbies, and interests were all synchronized with Song Shuhang’s.","The ghost spirit and its host had such a special relationship... Eventually, they would gradually become one.","“Then, Shuhang, it’s your turn,” Su Clan’s Sixteen said to Song Shuhang’s head. At the same time, she stretched out her hand again and pointed it at Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang was slightly stunned. “I’m going to enter your body like the ghost fairy?”","Su Clan’s Sixteen’s small face was slightly flushed.","Slap? Pavilion Master Chu slapped Song Shuhang’s head.","“But I don’t have the ability to become a ghost fairy.” Song Shuhang gathered his hands and started fighting against Pavilion Master Chu’s hair. He was now at the “Three Separations Tribulation Transcender” realm, and even if he didn’t use any external force, he could at least hold on for a few rounds against Pavilion Master Chu’s hair.","“I have the same function as the ghost fairy,” Su Clan’s Sixteen said softly.","“Eh?”","Sixteen could also possess him?","Thinking about it, it was pretty good.","“However, we will try this function again in the future.” Su Clan’s Sixteen’s palm was facing Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang gently flicked his hair and condensed another braided palm, which locked onto Su Clan’s Sixteen’s palm.","“Sister White Dragon, I need your help,” Su Clan’s Sixteen called out.","“I understand.” The White Dragon’s body swam in the air, drawing a circle with her body.","A space was opened.","It was the special world that contained over a hundred Little Sixteen’s crystal coffins.","“Come, follow me, Shuhang.” Su Clan’s Sixteen grabbed Song Shuhang’s braided hand and walked toward that space.","The White Dragon returned to her neck and turned into a scarf made of true dragon skin.","Pavilion Master Chu looked at this scene from the perspective of a bystander. She felt like a cute little girl holding a balloon with Song Shuhang’s head in her hand and happily walking towards a space filled with coffins.","‘It’s indeed a horror movie.’ Pavilion Master Chu thought to herself.","If this scene was filmed, there would be no need for post-production. All they needed to do was match it with eerie music, and the cold effect would come.","‘As expected, the ‘love scene’ that I was thinking about before did not exist.’ Pavilion Master Chu thought to herself.","It was impossible for Song Shuhang to have a normal emotional scene.","The style was too twisted.","Just as she was deep in thought, Song Shuhang and Su Clan’s Sixteen entered the world of the crystal coffin together.","“What is Sixteen doing?” Song Shuhang asked in puzzlement.","Pavilion Master Chu’s mind was filled with the plot of a horror movie, and she subconsciously came up with a terrifying guess. “Could it be that Song Shuhang is also going to be placed in the crystal coffin and buried in this space?” she asked.","“Good idea,” the White Dragon said.","“I won’t do such a thing,” Su Clan’s Sixteen held Song Shuhang’s braid, took a deep breath, and then took out her treasured saber.","An umbrella-shaped life-bound treasured saber appeared. Sixteen grabbed the handle of the umbrella with her other hand and gently pulled it out, revealing a straight blade.","She activated her saber intent, and a unique saber intent that was a combination of the painting path and the saber path appeared.","A domain-like scroll unfolded under her feet, enveloping Song Shuhang, her, the White Dragon, and Pavilion Master Chu.","Song Shuhang felt a layer of intense light appear in front of his eyes.","It was as if he wanted to sleep in after staying up late, but the glaring sunlight shone through the window that he had forgotten to draw the curtains and shone directly on his eyes. When he opened his eyes, he saw the glaring sunlight...","Even his titanium alloy dog eyes couldn’t withstand this kind of damage.","At the same time, Song Shuhang felt that his “body” had become complete. Originally, he only had one head, but under this dazzling light, he had obtained his entire body.","However, Pavilion Master Chu’s hair had disappeared.","‘This feeling... a dream?’ Song Shuhang’s heart skipped a beat.","He had entered the dream so many times that he was very clear about the feeling of entering the dream. That special state that was like reality and also like a dream was very unique.","And now, he was in a similar state.","“Song Shuhang, is it that guy surnamed Song again?” At that moment, a gentle and sensual female voice sounded in Song Shuhang’s ears.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“The girls of the Spirit River Su Clan are always entangled with the guy surnamed Song.” The woman continued.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","My surname is Song, but I’m very kind.","Fairy, don’t mistake me for someone else!"]},{"number":2917,"title":"Chapter 2917: Suddenly, It Felt Hard to Continue Talking To You","paragraphs":["Chapter 2917: Suddenly, It Felt Hard to Continue Talking To You","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Humans are strange and contradictory beings. Sometimes, they can learn from past mistakes and try their best to avoid the same pitfalls. But sometimes, they repeatedly fall into the same trap, just in different ways.","Song Shuhang had been deceived many times, so he had learned to be cautious. Those who had been beaten many times eventually learned how to take a beating...","Thus, when he sensed that the tone of this “gentle and emotional voice” wasn’t quite right, Song Shuhang decided to save himself. He couldn’t let society beat him up for nothing.","After all, humans are intelligent creatures that can summarize past experiences.","“Well, first of all, I’m not Slow-Witted Song. Look carefully before you hit Song Shuhang,” Song Shuhang said.","“Slow-Witted Song? Who is that? Why would I hit him?” the gentle and emotional woman asked in puzzlement.","Song Shuhang was confused.","Sister Fairy, the lines on the stage don’t match!","However, it was great that they didn’t match!","This meant that Lu Zhuofeng had returned to You Yi Village!","The gentle and emotional woman asked again, “Could it be the other guy surnamed Song who had an entanglement with a girl from the Spirit River Su Clan? Moreover, did you do something wrong?”","“No, no, no,” Song Shuhang hurriedly replied. After realizing that it wasn’t Slow-Witted Song’s fault, Song Shuhang felt a little touched.","It was finally the fault of the other Senior Song. How great.","“Besides, if she wanted to hit Slow-Witted Song, why would she hit you? What have you done to the girls of my Spirit River Su Clan?” the gentle and emotional voice asked.","“No, Fairy, don’t misunderstand. I’ve been scammed a few times, which is why I’ve developed such a conditioned reflex.” Song Shuhang waved his hand and explained, “I met a few senior fairies before. Because of various special reasons, I was tricked several times. It’s really difficult to describe the bitterness and suffering in a few words.”","“However, it’s fine as long as Senior has nothing to do with Slow-Witted Song. Additionally, Senior, you can’t judge a person based on their surname. There are so many people with the surname Song in the world. Among so many people with the surname Song, there will always be one or two who cause trouble. But we can’t let everyone with the surname Song take the blame just because of one or two people, right?” Song Shuhang said.","“You sure know how to talk, just like Fellow Daoist Song,” the gentle and emotional voice laughed.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Fairy, stop fooling around. Don’t try to trick me into thinking that I’m the “Fellow Daoist Song” you know. If you continue to trick me like this, even if I’m fine, it’ll become a problem.","Once a person has a “thought” in their mind, they will involuntarily lean toward that “thought.” It’s like when people suspect someone is a thief, they will feel that everything he does is like a thief. Even if the person only goes to the temple, they will feel that there is something wrong with his posture.","“What you’re worried about is really interesting. Hmm, your face is also interesting. Looking at your face, I can vaguely guess what you’re thinking. It’s amazing,” the gentle and emotional voice said again.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Hmm, even without using the “Expert Appraisal Technique,” he could confirm that this fairy must be a top-notch big shot... It was very likely that she was a hidden big shot of the Spirit River Su Clan.","Because now, those who could use the Face Reading Spell on him were all top big shots! At the very least, she was a top-notch Tribulation Transcender who had stepped into the embryonic form of her path to immortality.","However, it was good that they knew about this. Wouldn’t it be awkward if they said it directly?","“No, I feel that if I look at your face, we can communicate. This way, we won’t be tired,” the gentle and emotional female voice continued, “Don’t think too much. The situation between me and Fellow Daoist Song back then is not what you think. The entanglement between him and I came from our different understanding of the ‘Dao.’ In this regard, we had intense arguments and even fought a few times, but it was not related to feelings.”","Song Shuhang heaved a sigh of relief.","“Also, I said that the girls of our Spirit River Su Clan are prone to getting entangled with the Song family. This is also supported by data. According to my observations, at least half of the junior girls of our Spirit River Su Clan have had various relationships with that fellow surnamed Song,” the gentle and emotional voice said.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Is Fellow Daoist Song really that well-developed? Then why haven’t I met anyone with the surname Song?","However, logic told him not to continue on this topic. After all, he was also surnamed Song. What if he tricked her while chatting?","“The conflict between Fellow Daoist Song and me was mainly about the possibility of sharing the path to immortality with my ‘friends’ and ‘clans,’” perhaps it was because of the “face-reading technique,” that gentle and sensual woman’s voice quietly changed the topic.","Song Shuhang touched his face and tried his best to put on a serious and expressionless face. “Sharing the path to immortality?” he asked. “Is this possible?”","“Do you know about the ancient Heavenly City?” the gentle and emotional voice asked.","“I know,” Song Shuhang nodded.","Moreover, I’m very familiar with the ancient Heavenly City. Not long ago, the Heavenly Emperor was hacked to death by me... Even though she was the one who wanted to die.","When the current Heavenly Emperor left, she called me “Senior Song.”","When talking about the ancient Heavenly City, Song Shuhang couldn’t help but feel touched, and his tense expression relaxed for a moment. Therefore, this big shot fairy of the Su Clan had read part of the information.","“I suddenly feel like I can’t continue chatting with you,” the gentle and emotional woman replied.","I mentioned the ancient Heavenly City to you, but you just killed the Heavenly Emperor?","“Could the ancient Heavenly City be related to sharing the path of immortality?” Song Shuhang asked.","“Yes, there is a certain relationship. The Heavenly Emperor’s Heavenly Court Great Dao was very special. It was all-encompassing and vast enough to accommodate all things in the world. To be honest, this path to immortality had exceeded the limits of an Immortal... It’s like standing on a higher point of view to interpret the path to immortality and then comprehend the ‘path to immortality,’” the gentle and sensual voice seemed to hold the path of the celestial heavens in high esteem.","“Moreover, cultivators who are talented enough but are not strong enough to achieve immortality by themselves will have the opportunity to use the Dao of the Heavenly Court to condense the Dao of immortality after joining the Heavenly Court. Although this path to immortality would be entrusted to the Heavenly Emperor’s ‘Dao of the Heavenly City,’ this is also true longevity,” the gentle and emotional voice said.","“Zither Master Feng Yi,” Song Shuhang nodded.","Zither Master Feng Yi was actually in such a state. She had attained immortality after joining the ancient Heavenly City, and her path to immortality was limited to the path of the Heavenly City. Therefore, after the destruction of the Heavenly Court, she needed to collect a large number of fragments of the Heavenly Court to stabilize her immortality realm.","As this senior fairy of the Spirit River Su Clan explained, Song Shuhang’s understanding of the “path of the Heavenly City” increased. A file containing the “path of the Heavenly City” appeared in his mind, and he began to uncompress it.","This was the portion of the Dao of the Heavenly Courts left behind in the Heavenly Emperor’s Essence Soul after he killed it, plus the portion of the Dao of the Heavenly Courts that he had obtained when he suddenly entered the dream and invaded the Heavenly Emperor’s inheritance of the Heavenly Emperor’s throne to Island Master Golden Trigram.","Of course, the current “Dao of the Heavenly City” was already Island Master Golden Trigram’s path to immortality. Even if Song Shuhang completely understood this part of the “Dao of the Heavenly City,” he wouldn’t be able to attain immortality through this method.","However, he could learn a lot from the ancient Heavenly City’s path to immortality.","Perhaps in the future, it would come in handy."]},{"number":2918,"title":"Chapter 2918: Over a Hundred Different Experiences Await You!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2918: Over a Hundred Different Experiences Await You!","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Previously, Song Shuhang couldn’t understand the ‘path to immortality’ of the Heavenly Emperor. Most of the knowledge could only be stored in the depths of his memory like a compressed file.","While speaking with this big shot fairy of the Spirit River Su Clan, Song Shuhang felt as if he had gained a lot of insight.","In addition, Song Shuhang had already vaguely guessed some information. “So, Fairy Su Clan, did you refer to the ancient Heavenly City’s path to immortality?”","This Spirit River Su Clan’s big shot fairy was probably the ancestor of the Spirit River Su Clan?","Moreover, Su Clan’s Sixteen’s ‘Spirit River Su Clan’s Final Trial’ should be related to this Fairy Su. It might even be related to her path to immortality.","“You guessed right,” the gentle and emotional voice replied. “But my path to immortality is ultimately inferior to the path of the Heavenly City. What I can do is very limited. Even the number of clansmen I can protect is limited. The effect is not as good as the ancient Heavenly City.”","“Is this the reason why the Spirit River Su Clan has a ‘digital dao name inheritance’?” Song Shuhang asked.","This was because Su Clan’s Sixteen wasn’t called ‘Sixteen’ in the beginning. After obtaining the daoist name ‘Su Clan’s Sixteen,’ she gave up her own name and inherited the daoist name ‘Sixteen.’","During the process of inheriting the name ‘Su Clan’s Sixteen,’ the Spirit River Su Clan would also have a ritual.","From the looks of it, this should be the process of obtaining the protection of the Su Clan’s big shot fairy.","“Next, you will enter the space that Sixteen has opened up and begin the final segment of the trial. Su Clan’s Sixteen will need your help in this segment... Go ahead. There is no need to worry about the time in the outside world. The flow of time in this trial space is different from the outside world. It is estimated that after you come out, at most a day will pass in the main world,” the gentle and emotional voice reminded him.","“A day or so? That’s good!” Song Shuhang nodded.","He roughly estimated that he would be able to catch up with New Year’s Eve when he came out.","“Good luck...” The voice of the Su Clan’s big shot fairy slowly said.","“Fairy, wait a moment. Since your path to immortality is somewhat similar to the ancient Heavenly City, it proves that your path to immortality is feasible. Then, what is Fellow Daoist Song’s opinion? He even fought with you a few times because of his different views,” Song Shuhang asked curiously.","“In fact, his views are not entirely wrong. Finally, my path to immortality also partially used his argument... The hundreds of ‘Little Sixteen’ that you saw were works that adopted his argument and combined it with my path to immortality,” Su Clan’s big shot Fairy’s voice was so low that it was almost inaudible. “He has proposed many ideas, including the theory of allowing many people to repeatedly vindicate the same path of immortality and the theory of allowing many individuals to step onto the same path of immortality at the same time. Even if his realm did not increase and he only had the characteristics of immortality, it was fine. I have to admit that many of his ideas are very creative.”","Song Shuhang fell into deep thought.","Multiple individuals using the same path to immortality?","Were the brains of geniuses all so special? This person’s thoughts were already somewhat similar to Tiandao Bai’s.","Song Shuhang wanted to ask a few more questions, but the white light that blinded his eyes had already disappeared.","Next was the end of Su Clan’s Sixteen’s trial. It was also a chance for Song Shuhang to experience the ‘path to immortality’ of that big shot fairy maiden of the Su Clan.","‘According to my previous experience of entering a dream, could it be that I’m going to enter a dreamland related to Su Clan’s Sixteen?’ Song Shuhang guessed in his heart.","Just as he was thinking, the light in front of him dimmed.","Logically speaking, for an existence at his realm, the dim light would not affect the visual effect. Even if he dug out his eyeballs, he had many ways to ‘see’ everything around him.","However, at this moment, his vision was affected by the light, and he could not see the things around him clearly.","Could it be... Becoming Su Clan’s Sixteen? Was it because the target of the dream had changed into Sixteen’s state?","Just as Song Shuhang was in deep thought, a figure turned around.","It was Sixteen.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","At the same time, he finally saw his surroundings clearly.","He was in a coffin.","He and Su Clan’s Sixteen.","But it was not a crystal coffin.","At this time, Song Shuhang finally experienced Pavilion Master Chu’s feelings before she went into a daze. She had thought that this was a romantic plot, but what she saw was the beginning of a horror movie.","“Yo, Sixteen.” Song Shuhang greeted him with a smile.","Next to him, Su Clan’s Sixteen curled up into a ball. After she turned around, she didn’t make a sound.","Song Shuhang stared at her, and she stared back at Song Shuhang.","‘It’s time to show off my flirting skills.’ Song Shuhang took a deep breath and prepared himself.","Then, he affectionately looked at Su Clan’s Sixteen, and their eyes met.","However, Su Clan’s Sixteen was expressionless, and there wasn’t even a hint of emotion in her eyes.","She was as cold as an emotionless killer!","Song Shuhang’s mood, which he had been preparing for, turned cold.","“Um, Sixteen?” Song Shuhang said.","On the opposite side, Su Clan’s Sixteen didn’t move at all. She still didn’t have any emotions.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Their eyes met.","He did not blink.","Then, a day passed.","One day in the trial space.","Song Shuhang sighed and closed his eyelids, which he wasn’t used to. Even he felt a little uncomfortable if he didn’t blink for an entire day.","However, Su Clan’s Sixteen didn’t even bat an eyelid, and her emotionless eyes stared at him for the entire day.","After sighing, Song Shuhang opened his eyes.","Then, he realized that the scene had changed.","He and Su Clan’s Sixteen were sitting side by side under an incomparably huge tree.","The originally emotionless Su Clan’s Sixteen had a completely different appearance this time.","If the previous Sixteen was like an emotionless killer, then the current Sixteen was like... A kind elder.","“Sixteen?” Song Shuhang said.","“Yes, Shuhang, I’m here.” Su Clan’s Sixteen stretched out her hand and patted Song Shuhang’s head as if she was treating a child. Then, she handed the unknown snack in her hand to Song Shuhang and said dotingly, “Do you want some?”","“Thank you.” Song Shuhang said.","At the same time, the experienced him immediately sensed something... These couldn’t all be Little Sixteen, right?","During Su Clan’s Sixteen’s trial by fire, she had collected over a hundred ‘Little Sixteens.’","Could it be that he was going to face all 100 of Little Sixteen?","And what was the relationship between these hundred ‘Little Sixteen’s’ and that fairy maiden of the Su Clan?","‘Moreover, where did these ‘Little Sixteen’ come from? They had different personalities, and even... Seemed to have their own lives?’","After pondering for a moment, Song Shuhang stretched out his right hand and quietly approached Sixteen, who had the personality of an elder.","Try appraising it?"]},{"number":2919,"title":"Chapter 2919: Because We Can’t Beat Him","paragraphs":["Chapter 2919: Because We Can’t Beat Him","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This time, the content of the appraisal involved the path to immortality of the Su Clan’s fairy.","The price to appraise the path to immortality was definitely not small. However, Song Shuhang’s main body was also at the realm of a weak Immortal, like the ‘Three Separations Tribulation Transcender.’ Additionally, he had a special body, so he didn’t have to worry about exploding while appraising the path to immortality.","As long as his body didn’t explode and he only felt dry pain, it didn’t matter.","After pondering for a moment, Song Shuhang’s palm quietly pressed on the arm of ‘Little Sixteen’ who was beside him.","An icy cold sensation.","This ‘Little Sixteen’ was slightly stunned. Then, she grabbed Song Shuhang’s hand and held it together.","‘Su Clan’s Sixteen’s ‘Heavenly River Incarnation’: This was a special projection avatar that she had projected into the myriad worlds during the ceremony to become ‘Su Clan’s Sixteen’ with the help of the immortal path of the Heavenly River Su Clan’s Fairy. The process of constructing the Heavenly River Incarnation was based on the Ten Million Incarnations Technique.’","A slight pain surged into his heart when he inserted the needle. The appraisal fee was paid by the physical body in the Inner World.","He actually couldn’t identify the name of the Immortal Fairy of the Su Clan. This was because the Immortal Fairy of the Su Clan was deliberately hiding it.","With Song Shuhang’s current realm, if he insisted on appraising it and was willing to pay the price, he should be able to obtain some information. However, there was no need for that. After all, he was the ancestor of Su Clan’s Sixteen, so he had to give him face.","In addition, what Song Shuhang didn’t expect was that Su Clan’s Sixteen’s clones didn’t appear when she entered the Spirit River Su Clan’s Final Trial. Instead, during the ceremony where she became ‘Su Clan’s Sixteen,’ the seeds of these incarnations were sent to the myriad worlds and evolved into different lives.","As for the Ten Million Incarnations Technique at the end of the appraisal letter, Song Shuhang had never heard of it before. However, he could vaguely guess the content of the magical technique just by looking at the name.","If he could really evolve the spell of ‘Ten Million Incarnations,’ it would definitely not be the type with powerful combat strength like his clones.","In the world of self-cultivators, it was extremely difficult to create a powerful clone. Song Shuhang’s magical clone and steel clone were both unexpected results. Only the three incarnations created by ‘Three Separations’ were the true powerful combat clones!","Even a secret technique of the level of Three Separations could only create three powerful clones. Therefore, it could be inferred that the clones of the Ten Million Avatar Technique should be like the water clones of the Nine Provinces Number One Group, possessing only some ordinary functions.","This kind of incarnation could be used to do some chores, or by sending them into the myriad worlds and having a life, and then taking back their incarnations after their lives were complete, it could enhance one’s own experience and temper oneself.","However, Sixteen’s ‘Little Sixteen’s Heavenly River Incarnation’ was a little different. They all had pretty good combat strength, and Su Clan’s Sixteen had to go through a lot of trouble to subdue them one by one during the trial.","“This should be the effect of the Su Clan blocking the immortal fairy’s path to immortality,” Song Shuhang speculated.","It wasn’t easy for a cultivator to create a powerful clone, but if there was a big shot helping a newbie create a newbie’s clone, and this big shot was silently providing energy, it could be operated.","“Is the appraisal over?” At this time, Little Sixteen, who looked both like an elder and a big sister, suddenly asked.","Song Shuhang’s sneaky movements slightly froze. He had actually been discovered?","Moreover, she knew about his secret appraisal technique?","“Yes, we all know. After the Heavenly River Trial opens, our information will be shared. Before the trial begins, we are independent individuals, but after that, we are a whole,” Big Sister Little Sixteen replied with a smile.","Song Shuhang was so embarrassed that his palms were sweating.","“Are you nervous?” Big Sister Little Sixteen asked.","“A little,” Song Shuhang replied.","“Don’t be nervous. My personality is considered better among all the Little Sixteen. Many of the ‘Little Sixteen’ you’ll be facing next have strange personalities, so you’ll be even more nervous,” Big Sister Little Sixteen consoled.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“I’ve actually wanted to see you for a long time. A man who can make my main body remember you even in the ‘memory blurring stage’,” Big Sister Little Sixteen said.","“Blurred memories?” Song Shuhang was stunned.","“Eh? You don’t know? After the Heavenly River Trial opened, the memories of his main body’s life became blurry... In other words, if she fails the trial, we will replace her without any hesitation and take over everything she has, becoming the new Sixteen. It’s not that easy to pass the trial and come back to life. The process is very cruel,” Big Sister Little Sixteen said fiercely.","“That’s right.” Song Shuhang sighed after hearing this. “Every time I come back from the dead, it’s incomparably cruel.”","Even though he had died so many times, he still had enough respect for death.","Big Sister Little Sixteen was speechless.","Why are you suddenly so emotional?","My rhythm has been disrupted by you.","“Actually, at the end of the trial, after we discovered your existence, we thought of targeting you first.”","Song Shuhang was a special existence that rekindled Su Clan’s Sixteen’s will to live. If he could kill him, Su Clan’s Sixteen would definitely be unable to recover.","“Why didn’t you do that after that?” Song Shuhang asked curiously.","“Because I can’t beat him. I was subdued earlier,” Big Sister Little Sixteen said. “That’s why I’ve been in spectator mode since a long time ago. In the information Little Sixteen shared at the end of the trial, there was indeed a strategy against you, but I didn’t expect you to advance so quickly.”","The strategy was still being decided, but in the end, you advanced so quickly. What was there to target?","Song Shuhang laughed in embarrassment.","“Alright, sit with me for a while more and it’ll be over. There are still over a hundred Little Sixteen waiting to see you,” Big Sister Little Sixteen said.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","In spring, I planted Sixteen, and in winter, I harvested more than a hundred Little Sixteen?","After the trial ends, will you all return to Sixteen?” Song Shuhang raised his head and looked at the leaves, asking.","“Normally speaking, all the Little Sixteen will completely fuse. However, Su Clan’s Sixteen made another choice.” The big sister Little Sixteen also looked up at the leaf and said, “She chose to be herself.”","Song Shuhang said, “This seems to be Sixteen’s personality.”","“So, this is the last time we meet here. You have to treat the next hundred or so Little Sixteen well and satisfy their willful requests,” said the big sister, Little Sixteen.","“Will it disappear?” Song Shuhang was stunned.","“Yes, I’m going to disappear from here. Close your eyes,” Big Sister Little Sixteen said slowly.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Was this the ‘close your eyes’ routine in movies?"]},{"number":2920,"title":"Chapter 2920: Time Flies, It’s Time to Comprehend the Path to Immortality","paragraphs":["Chapter 2920: Time Flies, It’s Time to Comprehend the Path to Immortality","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Was it like in the movies where the female lead makes the male lead close his eyes, then does something sneaky?","Since he knew it was a trick...","Just as Song Shuhang was deep in thought, the big sister, Little Sixteen, placed her hand over his eyes.","Song Shuhang’s vision went dark.","Then, he felt as if he had undergone spatial transformation and was in the next scene.","‘As expected... The plot in movies only happens in movies, just as I thought.’ Song Shuhang mused.","As he pondered, an arrogant laugh echoed in his ears. “Ahahaha! I’ve finally been waiting for you, Song Shuhang.”","Song Shuhang turned his head and saw a familiar ‘Little Sixteen.’","Her petite frame was clad in heavy armor, even her head covered by a full-body helmet—this was the first ‘Little Sixteen’ Song Shuhang had encountered in the main world.","She was the one who first discovered Song Shuhang’s existence and uploaded information about him to the Little Sixteen Sharing Network.","It was through meeting her that Song Shuhang learned about Su Clan’s Sixteen’s ‘Spirit River Su Clan Trial.’","“Yo, it’s you,” Song Shuhang said. “Why, do you want to fight?”","“Am I crazy? Why would I want to fight you?” Arrogant Little Sixteen replied.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","If you don’t want to fight, then why are you so arrogant?","I thought you were going to beat me up.","“I just want to see how you’re going to get past me,” Arrogant Little Sixteen said. “If you don’t satisfy me, you won’t be able to get past this stage. Then, you’ll have to stay here forever!”","“Do you really want to accompany me for the rest of my life?” Song Shuhang asked curiously.","Arrogant Little Sixteen was confused.","“By the way, will you disappear from this place after I meet the next Little Sixteen?” Song Shuhang suddenly asked.","Arrogant Little Sixteen replied, “Yes.”","Song Shuhang pinched his chin. “What happens after I disappear?”","“I’ve never disappeared from this space before. How would I know what happens after I disappear?” Arrogant Little Sixteen replied.","Song Shuhang pondered for a moment and said, “Then, what would happen if we followed the normal procedure?”","“If we fuse according to the normal procedure, each of us will become a part of Su Clan’s Sixteen. Moreover, we all carry information about the path to immortality. After we completely fuse, Sixteen will benefit from it, and it will be very beneficial for us to comprehend the path to immortality in the future,” Little Sixteen replied.","“But in fact, the Su Clan’s trial is already an abnormal fusion process. After all, the purpose of the trial is to let Su Clan’s Sixteen be reborn. It’s equivalent to starting the fusion process in advance,” Little Sixteen explained.","The real normal process would be to wait for all the ‘Heavenly River Incarnations’ to complete their lives before returning to their main bodies one by one. Generally, the complete reincarnation of the Heavenly River Incarnation would take about a thousand years.","By then, the geniuses of the Su Clan’s numbered series would have almost reached the Eighth or Ninth Stage Realm. After accepting their perfected ‘Heavenly River Incarnation,’ they would gain assistance and break through the bottleneck to advance to a higher realm.","After that, if the Su Clan’s disciple with the numbered dao name couldn’t step on the path to immortality at the Ninth Stage, they could still enter the realm of a weak Immortal, like Song Shuhang, who had just killed the Tribulation Transcender with three corpses.","After reaching this realm, they could rely on their connection with the Su Clan’s ancestor’s path of immortality to greatly extend their lifespan, possibly even achieving immortality.","In the cultivation world, as long as one lives long enough, anything is possible! Living long enough, it’s not a dream to become the son-in-law or daughter-in-law of one’s disciples or grand-disciples after hundreds of generations!","As long as one lives long enough, anything can happen.","This is also why the Spirit River Su Clan has very high requirements for the inheritor of the ‘Numbered Dao Name.’ They need to have at least a thousand years of cultivation to the peak of the Eighth Stage or even the Ninth Stage.","Of course, the above is only theoretical aptitude. However, from this, one can see the importance of having a good ancestor in the cultivation world.","Song Shuhang pinched his chin and fell into deep thought.","“Hey, say something. If you don’t say anything, how can I be satisfied?” Arrogant Little Sixteen said.","Song Shuhang said, “Chatting is very tiring. You have to pay for it.”","“Why don’t you just die?” Arrogant Little Sixteen said.","Song Shuhang replied, “I don’t want to die anymore after dying too many times.”","Arrogant Little Sixteen was speechless.","If it wasn’t for the fact that she couldn’t beat him, she would have already carried her saber and attacked him with her irritable temper.","“Right, let’s give each other a high five?” Song Shuhang suddenly stretched out his hand and said to Little Sixteen.","Sixteen was confused.","“Didn’t you want to be satisfied? High five!” Song Shuhang said.","Little Sixteen: “In the end, you still want to compete with your internal energy? I’m afraid of you?”","She waved her hand and slapped Song Shuhang’s palm, and spiritual energy erupted from her body.","Boom","The spiritual energy that erupted from her disappeared the moment it touched Song Shuhang’s palm, like a clay ox entering the sea... The difference was too great.","Taking advantage of this moment, Song Shuhang secretly left a [Godly Weapon Brand] on her body.","This was the mark of Song Shuhang’s spatial coordinates.","Before he comprehended the spatial ability, Song Shuhang relied on it and his Inner World to teleport.","“What did you do to me?” Arrogant Little Sixteen said warily.","“Right, I still have to do something.” Song Shuhang was enlightened.","And then...","He didn’t hesitate to cast the evil art Cheap Love.","“You’re cheating!” Arrogant Little Sixteen said.","“Cultivators like me don’t look at the process, only the result,” Song Shuhang said in a deep voice. “As long as you can attain immortality, the process is not important!”","Arrogant Little Sixteen was speechless.","In the main world, a day later.","In the White Dragon Tomb on the mysterious island.","Song Shuhang opened his bright eyes.","At the same time, the divine third eye on his forehead opened, and a beam of light shot out from it, connecting Su Clan’s Sixteen and their mental energy.","In the past, Song Shuhang had always used this method to forcefully transmit trash information to his enemies.","But this time, he was using this function to play support for Su Clan’s Sixteen.","Song Shuhang had a lot of experience in receiving information that caused the brain to crash, so he could help Su Clan’s Sixteen at this time.","In Su Clan’s Sixteen’s consciousness.","Su Clan’s 16.1 Virtual Machine personality was currently receiving the huge amount of information that Little Sixteen had sent back.","Su Clan’s Sixteen’s main body chose not to fuse with all of the ‘Little Sixteens,’ and instead wanted to preserve them. After all, to her, all of the Little Sixteens had complete lives. It would be a pity if she forcefully fused them.","If it was any other Spirit River Su Clan member, they would not have had a choice. If he didn’t fuse with it, the Ultimate Trial wouldn’t be able to achieve the effect of reincarnation.","However, Su Clan’s Sixteen was different. The ‘skeletal dragon’s withered vine’ that Song Shuhang had given her back then also came with a ‘Big Sister White Dragon’s gift bag.’","With the help of the White Dragon, Su Clan’s Sixteen’s condition had been greatly adjusted.","At this moment, Su Clan’s 16.1 was adjusting all of Little Sixteen’s information.","In Sixteen’s space of consciousness, the scene was very chaotic.","At this time, Song Shuhang’s consciousness quietly connected to Sixteen’s space of consciousness, and his figure appeared in the sky above it.","All of the Sixteen’s consciousness saw Song Shuhang.","The chaotic scene suddenly became silent.","The sudden silence made the situation awkward.","“Hey ” Song Shuhang shyly waved his hand and said, “I’m here to take a look at the last segment of the trial. Perhaps it will be helpful for me to comprehend my own path to immortality.”","He, Tyrannical Song, had killed a Tribulation Transcender with three corpses, and his combat strength was weaker than that of an Immortal. Now, it was time for him to comprehend his own path to immortality."]},{"number":2921,"title":"Chapter 2921: My Path to Immortality-The Great Path of Death!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2921: My Path to Immortality-The Great Path of Death!","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Why are you here? Do you think this place is your backyard?” Arrogant Little Sixteen was the first to jump out.","She was completely wrapped in metal armor, and she headbutted Song Shuhang with her helmet. When she attacked, two sharp, electric drill horns protruded from her helmet, making the assault quite vicious!","Additionally, it was clear that she was in good spirits, jumping around energetically.","Seeing that Little Sixteen and the others were so lively, Song Shuhang heaved a sigh of relief. At the very least, this indicated that his mission was going well.","“Take this!” Little Sixteen shouted.","“Stop fooling around.” At the same time, Song Shuhang reached out and gently patted the tip of the electric drill on the helmet. Amidst the explosive light effects, he forcefully pushed the rotating drill back!","The older-looking Little Sixteen below him was speechless.","How many defense points did he have to add to his palm to be able to press down on the sharp electric drill and force it back?","Song Shuhang lightly pressed down, sending the arrogant Little Sixteen back to her original position. Then he said, “I’ll stay here until your trial’s final ceremony is over, then I’ll leave.”","Earlier, he had heard Su Clan’s 16.1 virtual machine personality mention that the final ritual of the “Heavenly River Su Clan Trial” might impact Su Clan’s Sixteen’s main personality. This was why Su Clan’s 16.1 personality acted as a barrier and buffer, to prevent Sixteen’s main body from being attacked by the personalities of over a hundred Little Sixteens during the ritual, causing her personality to split.","Worried about her, Song Shuhang entered Su Clan’s Sixteen’s consciousness space through the connection function of his divine third eye.","He was no longer the same person who had once carried Su Clan’s Sixteen while being chased all over the street by Immortal Farming Sect’s Second Stage Uncle Zheng De and grabbed like a chicken by Fourth Stage Anzhi Demon.","Even if a hundred thousand Zheng De uncles came, Song Shuhang could just lie still and rely on his own defense to clear the area.","As for Demon Monarch Anzhi, he had already been turned to ashes by Song Shuhang.","If something happened to Su Clan’s Sixteen during the end of the Heavenly River Trial, Song Shuhang would find a way to solve it immediately. This wasn’t because he was confident in himself, but because he had great faith in the big bosses who had his back.","The long list of big shots supporting him made Song Shuhang’s mind very calm.","If there was a problem that even Senior White, Senior White Two, Goudan Dad, and Senior Three-Eyed couldn’t solve, then it must be a Heavenly Dao-level issue!","“Xiao Hang, you can watch from above. I’ll definitely lead everyone to complete the last step of the ritual!” Cute Little Sixteen, who had a sharp canine smile, said.","As she spoke, an unblinking, uncomprehending Little Sixteen gently pushed away the cute, canine-toothed Little Sixteen and strode toward Su Clan’s 16.1.","The end ceremony of the Heavenly River Trial was much simpler than Song Shuhang had imagined. There were no complicated procedures involved. The Little Sixteens just needed to step forward and lightly high-five Su Clan’s 16.1.","After the two palms came into contact, a portion of the things from the Little Sixteens would be copied and fused into Su Clan’s 16.1.","Song Shuhang paid close attention to the parts that the Little Sixteens left behind. This included their cultivation insights, life experiences, and some information related to the path to immortality.","After the high-five, the Little Sixteens didn’t disappear. Instead, they stood beside Su Clan’s 16.1 and didn’t move.","Song Shuhang silently recorded this scene from above.","Although he couldn’t see anything special about this process, his intuition told him that it would be beneficial for him to remember it.","Moreover, he felt that when the Little Sixteens and Su Clan’s 16.1 were copying data and information, it vaguely corresponded to the “cultivation chat” function.","“After the recording is done, send a copy to ‘Miss Long Luo’ to help analyze it. Perhaps it’ll be useful in upgrading the ‘cultivation chat’ function and the client,” Song Shuhang thought to himself.","He was very interested in the ‘cultivation chat’ client that would make him a millionaire in the cultivation world in the future. He never forgot to collect the elements needed to upgrade the client.","However, it seemed that he couldn’t comprehend any information related to the path to immortality from this scene. Song Shuhang continued to record, but he didn’t have any new inspirations like “enlightenment” or “comprehending the Dao” in his mind.","Without inspiration, it meant that he couldn’t capture any information about his path to immortality.","The path to immortality was originally the result of inspiration plus one’s own strength.","This process indeed required the support of inspiration.","A few minutes later.","Over a hundred Little Sixteens and Su Clan’s 16.1 completed the exchange of information.","Su Clan’s 16.1 clasped her hands together, and the information fed back by the hundreds of Little Sixteens fused into a ball that rolled in her palm... It looked like it was about to launch a shock wave.","Song Shuhang’s three eyes focused on the information ball in Su Clan’s Sixteen’s palm.","In this information sphere, the information fed back by the hundreds of Little Sixteens was arranged in order, turning into stars in the galaxy, rolling in a “celestial river” inside the sphere.","This was the projection of the immortal path of the Su Clan’s shielded fairy... The celestial river was her Dao, and the stars in the celestial river were the people she protected. She was like a carrier, carrying the clansmen who were connected to her by blood.","“The Milky Way protects our clansmen. Our clansmen can be reborn from the dead. I seem to have some inspiration!” Song Shuhang’s heart skipped a beat.","This clear projection of the “Stellar Longevity Great Dao” was clearly something that the Su Clan’s shielded fairy had specially shown him to observe and use as a reference for him to accumulate experience in creating the “Dao of Longevity.”","Song Shuhang had a thought that was becoming clearer and clearer.","On his body, the aura of the path to immortality became thicker and thicker, and it gradually evolved into the embryonic form of the path to immortality.","Song Shuhang was currently a Tribulation Transcender who had killed three corpses.","He had not deliberately thought about his path to immortality, nor had he taken the initiative to condense it.","However, he had already condensed the framework of the path to immortality!","His brain hadn’t figured out the path to immortality yet, but his body had already laid the foundation for it!","“I have some clues,” Song Shuhang said.","The “path to immortality” of Immortals was related to the experiences of cultivators.","What he had experienced in life, what he was good at, what he had done, and what techniques he had comprehended related to immortality would all become the foundation of his path to immortality!","Song Shuhang began to recall his magnificent cultivation experience, crossing borders to fight against his lifelong enemy, and facing the heavenly tribulation... If he accidentally died, then he would fight against the gods and Dao Artifacts...Then, he went on to fight all kinds of big shots and the ruler of the Netherworld...He had accidentally died again, and he had even fought against the Heavenly Dao Molt in the end. This was a complicated and magnificent experience that could not be written in seven million words!","“In my entire life, the most abundant experiences I’ve had are fighting big shots, dying, and giving lectures.”","“If I turn my life into a galaxy, then the big shots, death, and speech will be the brightest stars.”","“But my speech is actually exaggerated.”","So, could my path to immortality be to fight the big shots and die?","Was he trying to find a way out of the nine deaths of a big shot?"]},{"number":2922,"title":"Chapter 2922: Super Rule Level, Like a Bottomless Abyss, Beyond Human Capability","paragraphs":["Chapter 2922: Super Rule Level, Like a Bottomless Abyss, Beyond Human Capability","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Sometimes, as long as a person had a clear goal, they would become focused and full of vitality.","Song Shuhang felt that his future path to immortality should be based on these two points.","Taking a chance at survival in a narrow escape sounded like a very cool way to live forever.","However... How was he going to achieve immortality?","The path to immortality was not to randomly come up with a concept and then rely on this concept to obtain immortality. Immortality was not that easy!","If he wanted to attain immortality, he had to at least have a feasible method of immortality and not something empty.","For example, Cheng Lin’s Dao of Reincarnation. Through this reincarnation technique, she could continuously conceive herself and give birth. With each reincarnation, she would become even stronger.","Another example was the Great Dao of a genius Immortal from the Mo family. His Dao was to change his body into a puppet structure, and with his puppet technology that was already close to the Dao, he proved his Dao and achieved immortality.","There was also Pavilion Master Chu. Her Dao of Life, Death, Withering, and Flourishing was extremely special. After she had proven her Dao and attained immortality, she had always been in between life, death, and withering. Once she had proven her Dao, she had become one of the best among Immortals. However, this state was still not her 100% perfect path to immortality. If her path was perfect, it would actually be Chu Two completely devouring her, giving birth to a new life from the withering, and her strength would increase by a step!","As for the Scholarly Sage’s path to immortality, it was the ‘Confucian Dao’ that he had created. But how could he explain the Scholarly Sage’s ‘Confucian Dao’? How did the Sage obtain immortality through the scholarly path? No one in the myriad worlds had seen through it. In any case, as long as he knew that the Scholarly Sage’s ‘Longevity Confucian Way’ was impressive, he would be done with it.","As for the Heavenly Emperor’s Dao of the Ancient Heavenly City, which was on the same level as the Scholarly Sage, it was also different.","Her Dao of the Heavenly Court was actually a Great Dao that the Heavenly Dao fat ball had created for the Heavenly Emperor from the perspective and height of the Immortal Heavenly Dao. This Great Dao of Longevity was actually directly connected to ‘undying’ and was used to make up for the lack of ‘Heavenly Dao Fat Ball’s’ undying.’","The other Immortals stood in the position of Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender, looking up and creating their own ‘path to immortality.’","The Celestial Thearch was looking down from the undying and deducing a Great Dao of Immortality.","Their horizons and heights were all different, so this ‘Dao of the Heavenly Courts’ was naturally very impressive.","Therefore, if he wanted to create a Great Dao of immortality similar to the Heavenly Emperor’s Dao of the Heavenly Courts, he had to raise his horizons to the infinite, to the perspective of the Immortal Heavenly Dao. Only then could he complete it.","However, the Celestial Thearch’s situation was too special.","After all, the prerequisite to vindicate the Heavenly Dao was the Great Dao of Longevity. Becoming the Wielder of the Will meant that you already had the ‘way to immortality.’ What was the point of deducing the way to immortality?","From the primordial era until now, only one Heavenly Dao fat ball had appeared.","“But how do I operate ‘survival in death’?” Song Shuhang frowned and pondered.","Could it be that he had to rely on resurrection?","After thinking for a long time, the most effective method he could think of to survive in death was to resurrect!","Is my path to immortality really going to move in the direction of the path of resurrection?","“That’s not right. If there really is a path to immortality in the myriad worlds that is the path of resurrection, it definitely doesn’t belong to me...It belongs to Fairy Skylark.” Song Shuhang was very self-aware.","In terms of resurrection, even if he died like the wind, he couldn’t compare to Fairy Skylark!","Fairy Skylark was the true throne of the Resurrection World, the unshakable ruler of the Resurrection World.","Compared to her resurrection, Song Shuhang was just a little brother.","“If I can’t walk the path of resurrection, how can I break the path of immortality? Where is the opportunity?” Song Shuhang pondered over his current state.","He began to ponder over his body.","This was a huge advantage for him!","This was an advantage he had over ordinary Tribulation Transcenders who were searching for their own path to immortality. His body had already instinctively begun to condense the framework of the path to immortality!","However, because he had not found the ‘turning point’, his path to immortality was temporarily unable to condense into a prototype.","But at least it proved that he already had the seed of the path to immortality in his body, and it had even begun to germinate!","Therefore, he only needed to study himself and see through himself. Sooner or later, he would be able to dig out the path to immortality!","Compared to the countless concepts of immortality, studying his own body was too easy.","Although the human body contained endless subtleties...But to put it bluntly, it was still the size of a person.","Even if he cut himself into pieces and studied them, Song Shuhang would still be able to dig out information about his path to immortality!","Song Shuhang didn’t feel any pressure at all when it came to slicing himself up and studying him for the sake of attaining immortality.","Moreover, he could turn himself into smoke. Not only could he study the pieces piece by piece, but he could also study the strands by streams!","Down below, over a hundred ‘Little Sixteens’ raised their heads and looked at Song Shuhang, who was floating above their heads.","Although it was only a consciousness, the aura of the path to immortality on Song Shuhang’s body began to become active. Gradually, Song Shuhang’s entire body was wrapped in the aura, and his face became blurry.","Under normal circumstances, if a cultivator below the Eighth Stage looked directly at this aura of the path to immortality, they would feel uncomfortable.","However, Su Clan’s Sixteen was now clearly classified as a member of the ‘special population.’","She had the White Dragon protecting her, and the ‘Su Clan’s Heavenly River Trial’ also involved some information about the Su Clan’s immortal fairies. Little Sixteen and the others were truly related to the path of immortality.","This was the reason why they were able to look directly at Song Shuhang’s aura of immortality.","In addition, Song Shuhang deliberately controlled the aura of the path to immortality and made it blurry, so that it wouldn’t cause any harm to Su Clan’s Sixteen and Little Sixteen.","“Shuhang, are you going to level up again?” Even the arrogant Little Sixteen couldn’t act arrogantly at this time. The sharp tip of the drill had been smashed askew, and Song Shuhang looked like he was about to level up again, causing her aura to be lacking.","“I just had some inspiration. I’m still far from leveling up.” Song Shuhang smiled and replied,” I’m studying myself to see if I can find any clues. Other than resurrection, I’m also trying to see if there’s any other method of immortality that belongs to me.”","At this moment, Su Clan’s 16.1 stretched out her hand and closed it. The ‘information ball’ in her hand was compressed and fused into her body.","Then, with her as the center, a network of light spread out, connecting all the Little Sixteen.","Every Little Sixteen occupied a node of the ‘network’ and was connected to Su Clan’s 16.1 body.","“Eh?” Song Shuhang’s mind moved.","The ‘inspiration’ in his heart touched again.","The aura of the path of immortality on his body became denser!","Obtaining a sliver of life from nine deaths could become Song Shuhang’s path to immortality, but there was an even more profound path to immortality hidden in Song Shuhang’s body.","The path to immortality was like a bottomless abyss.","With Song Shuhang’s knowledge, it was impossible for him to complete it!","It was a special Great Dao that surpassed the capabilities of Tribulation Transcenders and even Immortals."]},{"number":2923,"title":"Chapter 2923: Come, customer","paragraphs":["Chapter 2923: Come, customer","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Song Shuhang felt that even if he used Song Youyou’s authority as the ruler of the Netherworld, it wouldn’t be enough to make up for the second path to immortality hidden within his body.","This path to immortality was like a bottomless hole, involving too much content.","Moreover, he understood why he had begun to condense the aura of the path to immortality before figuring out the theory behind it.","It was because he was already practicing part of the “method of immortality” at this moment. His innate ability, the “cultivation chat” function, was one of the links in the “method of immortality” as a server.","However, the “cultivation chat” function was not the entire path to immortality. He still needed to fill in more content and theories to perfect this path.","Song Shuhang felt that there were still many “parts” in his body related to this method of immortality.","Senior White Two had drawn nine dragon patterns on his golden core, the star path map on the fat whale golden core, the Sage Seal, the law of origin characters, the law of flowers, the power of karma, the network of virtue, and so on.","Moreover, the most crucial point was—how was he going to achieve immortality?","If he didn’t figure this out, he wouldn’t be able to condense the aura of immortality into the embryonic form of the Dao of Longevity.","If this bottomless path of immortality was expanded, it would vaguely have some similarities with the Heavenly Emperor’s path of the ancient Heavenly City.","‘If I want to complete this path to immortality, do I have to stand at a height that surpasses the Immortals or even the rulers of the Netherworld and look down to reverse the path to immortality?’ Song Shuhang gently rubbed the space between his eyebrows.","Surpassing Immortals and rulers of the Netherworld... In other words, he had to stand from the perspective of the Heavenly Dao and look at this problem from that angle.","‘If I can perfect this path to immortality from the perspective of the Heavenly Dao, do I still need the method of immortality?’","Unless...","The next person to vindicate the Dao was either Senior White or one of the big shots he knew. This way, after the seniors proved their immortality, they could help him deduce the path to immortality from the perspective of the Heavenly Dao.","And he would just lie down like a salted fish, not thinking about anything, waiting for the Heavenly Dao to cheat him and perfect the method of immortality.","“That’s great,” Song Shuhang thought to himself.","However, he couldn’t just wait for Senior White or the pendants on his body to become immortal.","Salted Fish also had dreams and needed to turn over occasionally.","Furthermore, there was also the plan of two different individuals vindicating the Dao at the same time left behind by Tiandao Bai.","It would be great if he could enter the dream of the Heavenly Dao Fat Ball again. He could enter the dream of the Heavenly Dao Fat Ball creating the Heavenly Emperor and deducing the Dao of the Heavenly Court. He might be able to find some inspiration from the deduction process.","“If it really doesn’t work, we can put this Bottomless Pit path to immortality aside for now. First, he had to figure out the path of immortality that would allow him to live forever. Then, he would wait for the opportunity to perfect the Bottomless Pit’s path of growth.","Just like the previous Heavenly Emperor Da Da Zi, on the surface, she still had the ‘Dao of the Ancient Heavenly City’ after possessing Soft Feather’s ghost spirit, but deep down, she was already using the ‘Dao of Time.’","Once she passed on the Dao of the Ancient Heavenly City to Island Lord Golden Trigram, she would immediately be able to use the Dao of Time to achieve immortality.","Song Shuhang could also learn how to use the dada dada. Later, he would use Song Youyou’s authority as the ruler of the Netherworld and see if he could figure out the opportunity to obtain a life and death method and step onto the great path in this area. When the time was right, he would pass on this Dao of Nine Deaths to others or abandon it... He could even upgrade the version of the Nine Ways of Death and seamlessly connect it to the Bottomless Pit of Immortality.","Song Shuhang deduced in his mind, ‘It seems feasible.’","After confirming the answer in his heart, the ‘Immortal aura’ around him began to retract.","At the same time, the hundred or so Little Sixteens below shifted their eyes away.","Su Clan’s Sixteen version 16.1 stretched out her hand and gently pushed the space in the sky. The space of Song Shuhang’s consciousness began to close, and he was pushed out of Su Clan’s Sixteen’s space.","In the Dragon Tomb.","Song Shuhang opened his eyes.","When he opened his eyes, he saw the White Dragon staring at him.","“Scared!” Song Shuhang was startled by the dragon’s shining eyes. “What are you doing, Sister White Dragon?”","“Have you figured out the path to immortality?” the White Dragon asked.","Just now, there was mist rising from Song Shuhang’s head, and the smell of a ghost film was very strong... However, an expert at the White Dragon’s level could tell with a glance that the fog was caused by the aura of Song Shuhang’s path to immortality.","Not only did he advance quickly, but he also had to condense the path to immortality in such a hurry?","“No, I don’t have a complete clue about the method of immortality.” Song Shuhang waved his hand.","The White Dragon asked, “Then what’s with the longevity aura on your body?”","“It was me who overtook the car. Although I haven’t completely understood the path to immortality, my body is already executing part of it.” Song Shuhang replied.","The White Dragon was speechless.","What a good curve to overtake.","If you say that... If it wasn’t for the fact that the Tribulation Transcenders of the myriad worlds couldn’t beat him, they would have already come to him and hammered him into a pulp with their little fists.","“Is Sixteen alright?” the White Dragon asked.","Song Shuhang closed the divine third eye on his forehead and nodded.","While they were talking, Su Clan’s Sixteen opened her eyes.","“Has the trial ceremony ended?” the White Dragon asked.","“Not yet. I estimate that Sixteen still needs to sleep for about three hours to digest the harvest of the ritual.” Su Clan’s Sixteen spoke in the voice of a ghost fairy.","She was the one who temporarily took over Sixteen’s body and acted on her behalf.","“When she wakes up, she will probably enter the state of transcending the tribulation... Shuhang, you’d better get ready.” The ghost spirit fairy controlled Su Clan’s Sixteen and gestured.","“Advancement? Has Sixteen completed her Golden Core composition?” Song Shuhang was stunned.","He had also experienced the Golden Core stage before. At that time, he drew seven Golden Core compositions in one go, almost driving him crazy.","The Golden Core composition, especially the finishing touch, was like a soybean milk machine.","“Yes, Sixteen’s Golden Core composition has been perfected. She has a hundred Little Sixteens to help her draw this Golden Core composition. All she needs to do is wait for her main body to wake up from her deep slumber and make the final stroke.” the ghost fairy answered.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","A hundred Little Sixteens could actually help him draw the Golden Core composition!","Back then, when I was in the Sixth Stage, if there were a hundred little Shuhangs in my body...","Song Shuhang imagined this scene. If there were a hundred little Shuhangs in the space of his consciousness...","Well...","Forget it.","Mother Yellow Mountain was already very tired, so he didn’t want to add to his burden!","“You’re here?” All of a sudden, Mother Yellow Mountain seemed to have telepathy and sent a message through the cultivation chat.","Song Shuhang almost thought that Senior Yellow Mountain was monitoring him.","Perhaps Venerable Yellow Mountain had set up some sensitive words, and as long as he thought of the words ‘Mother Yellow Mountain,’ Senior Yellow Mountain would be able to sense it?","“We’re almost at your door,” Mother Yellow Mountain continued.","Song Shuhang said, “Here you go, dear customer!”"]},{"number":2924,"title":"Chapter 2924: Tenfold Joy","paragraphs":["Chapter 2924: Tenfold Joy","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Senior Yellow Mountain has arrived; can the other seniors from the ‘Nine Provinces Number One Group’ be far behind?","Song Shuhang closed his eyes, allowing his consciousness to seep into the ‘Core World’ as he checked the date on his phone.","January 24, 2020, 6:00 PM. New Year’s Eve.","For the people of China, this is the last day of the old year, a day when the new year is just around the corner. For most ordinary people, this day holds significant meaning.","“After today, I’ll be another year older,” Song Shuhang said with a touch of gravity.","“Remember this as Tyrant Song’s first year of celibacy,” a voice whispered in his ear. It was from Pavilion Master Chu.","Song Shuhang sighed.","Pavilion Master Chu wasn’t always like this, but after being cooped up in the ‘Core World’ for so long, she’s developed a habit of getting under people’s skin.","Poking at people’s hearts is a bad habit. If you poke too hard, you’ll lose their hearts entirely.","“Wish me a happy New Year, Senior Chu,” Song Shuhang said.","Pavilion Master Chu blew some bubbles and replied, “Don’t look at me. My entire Crystal Palace is blown to bits, and the rest has been handed over to Chu Two. If you want a red envelope from me, you’ll have to go beat her up for it.”","Song Shuhang sighed again, “I’m afraid she’ll twist my head off.”","Even though he’d already used a Skylark’s head to pay off a debt, Chu Two’s title in the ‘Cultivation Chat Group’ was still [Owed a Head].","This meant that Pavilion Master Chu Two still had her eye on Song Shuhang’s head.","Hearing this, Pavilion Master Chu suddenly became interested. “I’ll send her a message right now to remind her to wish you a happy New Year and to make sure she brings a red envelope.”","Song Shuhang was startled.","When Song Shuhang’s consciousness returned from the Core World, he realized his vision was spinning wildly.","What’s going on?","Song Shuhang was baffled.","Then he discovered that, like a ball, he was being spun around by Su Clan’s Sixteen with just one finger.","“What are you doing?” Song Shuhang asked, half-amused and half-annoyed.","“You zoned out all of a sudden, and no matter how I called you, there was no response. I got mad,” she replied.","“Stop messing around. It was Senior Yellow Mountain contacting us, saying he’s almost at our place. I was replying to him and checking the time,” Song Shuhang explained.","“Oh.” Only then did she stop spinning Song Shuhang’s head.","“Let’s go. Time to welcome Senior Yellow Mountain. White Dragon Sister, can Sixteen leave the Dragon Tomb now?” Song Shuhang asked.","White Dragon Sister nodded, her gaze lingering thoughtfully on her Dragon Tomb.","“I’ll open the space gate,” Song Shuhang said, and with a solid headbutt into the void, he opened a spatial gate.","Ghost Fairy and Su Clan’s Sixteen, holding his head, stepped through the gate, heading to White Whale Road in Wenzhou City.","After them, White Dragon Sister reached out her claw, picking up her ‘crystal coffin,’ revealing a wealth of treasure beneath it that glowed with a rainbow of colors.","White Dragon Sister sifted through the treasure and picked out two ‘Ancient Heavenly Court Money Notes,’ placing them into two red envelopes.","The Ancient Heavenly Court money notes had long since lost their value with the fall of the Ancient Heavenly Court, making them non-redeemable for spirit stones.","However, they still held significant sentimental value.","Moreover, the ‘Ancient Heavenly Court Money Notes’ could be crafted into lucky charms. As the universal currency of the Ancient Heavenly Court, they carried the court’s fortune.","This fortune, when made into a charm, could bring good luck to its bearer.","Being able to get two silver notes out of a true dragon’s claw was something Su Clan’s Sixteen and Song Shuhang could take pride in!","With the two red envelopes in tow, White Dragon Sister gracefully slipped into the spatial tunnel, following Su Clan’s Sixteen.","When Song Shuhang’s head rejoined his body, he transformed from Wooden Power Muscles back into a complete Song Shuhang.","“Senior White, Senior Yellow Mountain... has said that he’ll be here soon,” Song Shuhang called out.","Black-Skinned Feather Soft Child appeared and said, “Senior Song, Senior White and my main body have gone to capture the mythical beast for the New Year’s feast. I just contacted them, and my main body said they’ll be back soon.”","“We’ve almost finished setting up the Core World,” said Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet.","Li Yinzhu added, “We’ve also tidied up Ah Song’s house.”","“Thank you, everyone. Now, let’s go to the entrance and welcome our seniors,” Song Shuhang said as he picked up Li Yinzhu in one arm and his mechanical egg daughter, Xiao Lingxiao, in the other.","Chu Chu and Xiao Cai followed closely behind him.","“When the seniors from the ‘Nine Provinces Number One Group’ arrive, I’ll introduce you all. The sweeter you greet them, the bigger their red envelopes will be,” Song Shuhang advised.","Since he wouldn’t be getting any red envelopes from the seniors in the ‘Nine Provinces Number One Group’ this year, he was determined to maximize the benefits for his disciples and daughters.","[We’ve arrived!] At that moment, Senior Yellow Mountain’s voice echoed.","Song Shuhang hurried to the front door and opened it.","Today, Senior Yellow Mountain looked as dashing and stylish as ever. Since he was visiting Song Shuhang’s house for the New Year, he was dressed casually in modern attire.","“This is Group Leader Senior Yellow Mountain, one of the seniors I respect most in the group,” Song Shuhang introduced.","“Happy New Year, Senior Yellow Mountain. I am Master’s second disciple, Chu Chu, and this is my senior sister, Xiao Cai,” Chu Chu greeted with a bow, Xiao Cai following suit.","“Happy New Year, Chu Chu,” Senior Yellow Mountain nodded. His family’s pet dog had a strange fixation on Chu Chu, and to this day, he still didn’t know why.","“These are New Year’s gifts. In the coming year, I hope you’ll work hard in your cultivation,” Senior Yellow Mountain said, handing over two sets of magical items to Chu Chu and Xiao Cai.","The items were complete sets of flying magic tools called ‘Wind and Fire Wheels,’ the same kind Doudou used when he first appeared. Even if a cultivator hadn’t reached the fourth-grade realm, they could maintain the ‘Wind and Fire Wheels’ by filling them with spirit stones, allowing them to experience the joy of flight in advance—perfect for Chu Chu and Xiao Cai.","After that, Senior Yellow Mountain prepared treasures for Li Yinzhu and Xiao Lingxiao as well... a warm-looking fox fur cloak and a key to an ‘Immortal Boat.’","The cloak was for Li Yinzhu, while the Immortal Boat was a custom-made, child-sized toy for Xiao Lingxiao.","“You have a few more disciples, don’t you?” Senior Yellow Mountain asked.","“One is still on her way, and the other, Miruru, has to stay in the Dream World,” Song Shuhang replied.","“Alright, I’ll give them their gifts later. Oh, and here’s your red envelope,” Senior Yellow Mountain said, pulling out a thick red envelope from his pocket and handing it to Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang’s eyes lit up, “Senior Yellow Mountain prepared a red envelope for me?”","—Senior Yellow Mountain is the best!","“Go ahead, open it. I put some thought into this gift and researched customs,” Senior Yellow Mountain said with a slight smile.","“Can I?” Song Shuhang carefully opened the thick red envelope.","Inside...","He found a stack of about ten thousand RMB.","The bright red bills were a pleasant sight.","This was something that everyone in China loved, and very few didn’t appreciate it.","Song Shuhang was confused.","“Happy New Year, Shuhang,” Senior Yellow Mountain said with a light pat on Song Shuhang’s shoulder. “This is your New Year’s money. Congratulations, after today, you’ll be a year older. I specifically looked into it; ordinary people usually give several hundred to a thousand in New Year’s money. I’m giving you ten thousand, ten times the joy. Don’t be too happy.”","Song Shuhang held the tenfold joy in his hands, his feelings mixed.","“Oh, and Sixteen, this one’s for you too,” Senior Yellow Mountain said, pulling out another red envelope. “Here are fifteen hundred fifth-grade spirit stones. Happy New Year.”","“Thank you, Senior Yellow Mountain,” Ghost Fairy and Su Clan’s Sixteen said sweetly."]},{"number":2925,"title":"Chapter 2925: Fulfilling a Promise Made Long Ago","paragraphs":["Chapter 2925: Fulfilling a Promise Made Long Ago","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Hey, Little Sixteen finally learned how to smile sweetly. That’s progress,” Senior Yellow Mountain praised. “Keep it up.”","In the past, Su Clan’s A Sixteen was strong-willed and polite, but Senior Huangshan had never seen her smile this sweetly before.","A Sixteen had grown up. Watching the younger members of the group mature, Senior Huangshan felt a deep sense of satisfaction.","After offering his encouragement, Senior Huangshan placed his hands behind his back and swaggered into the house.","Song Shuhang looked at the “Ten Times the Happiness” in his hand and sighed.","Senior Yellow Mountain definitely did that on purpose.","Even a gift of ten thousand first-grade spirit stones would have been better. What can you do with ten thousand RMB?","As his strength and realm increased, Song Shuhang’s need for RMB had drastically decreased. He still had leftover money from the first small boss he defeated. After all, he didn’t have many opportunities to spend it.","Still, even if it was just an RMB red envelope, it was a gift—one that other seniors in the “Nine Provinces Number One Group” might not have even considered preparing for him.","“Any gift is better than no gift,” Chu Pavilion Master’s strand of hair remarked.","“Yeah, I think so too,” Song Shuhang agreed, tucking away the thick envelope. “Later, I’ll take everyone to the mall. If you see something you like, don’t hesitate to pick it out. Don’t be shy. Earth’s malls actually have a lot of interesting little gadgets.”","Now that he had more companions, he was thinking about getting them all cell phones and modifying them a bit.","If he got the chance, he also planned to develop a “Cultivation Chat” app with a mobile interface to enhance functionality.","Moreover, it had been a long time since he and Su Clan’s A Sixteen went shopping together...","Even during the New Year, Song Shuhang still had a lot of things he wanted to do.","As he was lost in thought, another senior descended from the sky on a sword.","The light from the flight technique landed at Song Shuhang’s door, and the illusion formation concealing the person dissipated, revealing Miss Jiang Ziyan, who was clinging to the arm of the Alchemist.","The two of them were inseparable, exuding an air of sweet romance.","“Long time no see, Shuhang,” said the Alchemist. His long hair was tied back into a neat ponytail, though the dark circles under his eyes seemed darker than before... which was odd, considering he hadn’t been making as many pills lately and had cut back on all-night sessions.","It seemed that Miss Jiang Ziyan was quite eager to have a child.","Of course, no one was worried about the Alchemist’s health; he was one of the top three medical experts in the “Nine Provinces Number One Group.” He knew how to take care of himself better than anyone.","“Long time no see, Senior Alchemist. We’ve hardly met since you and Miss Ziyan got married,” Song Shuhang said, walking up to them.","The Alchemist smiled warmly. “Well, we’ve been on our honeymoon. Maybe I’ll make a copy of our travel itinerary for you, so you can learn a thing or two.”","“I’m good, thanks,” Song Shuhang said.","Beside him, Chu Chu stepped forward at the right moment, leading Little Cai in a respectful greeting.","Li Yinzhu and Little Lingxiao also greeted them sweetly.","The Alchemist beamed as he handed each of the four young girls a small box. Inside were some auxiliary cultivation pills he had recently developed, with side effects minimized to the greatest extent.","Then, he produced two more small boxes and handed them to Song Shuhang.","“These are for me? Did you prepare New Year’s gifts for me too, Senior Alchemist?” Song Shuhang’s eyes lit up—there was no way these boxes contained RMB; he could smell the medicinal aroma.","He hadn’t expected anyone other than Senior Yellow Mountain to prepare New Year’s gifts for him!","Could it be that other seniors in the “Nine Provinces Number One Group” had also secretly prepared New Year’s gifts for him?","Maybe they all said they wouldn’t give him anything but had actually planned to surprise him?","Just as Song Shuhang was getting excited, Jiang Ziyan cut in. “Don’t get your hopes up. These are gifts from the Alchemist for your parents.”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“They’re longevity pills for ordinary people. Your parents should find them useful,” the Alchemist explained. These were a new type of pill he had developed for his own parents this year, and he had prepared two extra for Song Shuhang.","“Thank you, Senior Alchemist,” Song Shuhang said, putting away the gifts. Though they weren’t for him, he appreciated the Alchemist’s thoughtfulness.","This gift was exactly what his parents needed.","“A Sixteen, here’s something for you too. Since you activated your true dragon bloodline, I have a few ‘Dragon’s Breath Pills’ that might help,” the Alchemist said, handing Su Clan’s A Sixteen her own gift.","“Thank you, Senior Alchemist!” Su Clan’s A Sixteen, in her ghost spirit mode, giggled.","After the Alchemist handed out all the gifts, Jiang Ziyan pulled out a card and handed it to Song Shuhang. “Shuhang, this is my New Year’s gift to you.”","“Huh? For me?” Song Shuhang’s heart skipped a beat. “What is it, Miss Ziyan?”","“It’s a VIP card for the Alchemist’s Super Deluxe King Bed Suite. With this card, you can book the Alchemist’s VIP suite at any time,” Jiang Ziyan said with a straight face.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“Just kidding. With your current strength, you’re more likely to send others to the Alchemist’s VIP suite after rubbing them into the ground. Who could send you there? Besides, your chances of getting severely injured are slim—you usually end up dying straight away,” Jiang Ziyan teased with a smile.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Jiang Ziyan’s mischievous personality hadn’t mellowed one bit since getting married.","“This is actually a data storage card. It contains several ways to earn ‘ordinary people’s money’ that the Alchemist uses in the modern world. He once promised to help you make money, but never had the chance... Now, during the New Year, he’s finally handing over these channels to you. If you ever need money, you can earn some with these,” Jiang Ziyan said, her lips curling into a trademark sly grin.","Song Shuhang was startled.","The Alchemist had indeed promised to help him make money a long time ago.","It seemed that the senior was a man of his word, fulfilling his promise no matter how much time had passed!","However... this was another New Year’s gift related to RMB.","Did the seniors plan this together?","As Song Shuhang pondered, a spatial gate opened in front of him.","The portal shimmered lightly before the Northern Emperor stepped out of the void.","“Happy New Year, Fellow Daoist Tyrant Song,” the Northern Emperor greeted with a smile.","At that moment, the Emperor held a “red envelope” in his hand, thick enough to hold about twenty thousand yuan.","‘Is the Emperor going to give me an RMB red envelope too?’","The Northern Emperor was speechless.","Why did Fellow Daoist Tyrant Song look so puzzled after being wished a Happy New Year?","On Song Shuhang’s shoulder, Feng Yi’s strand of hair curiously asked, “Are you here to deliver a New Year’s gift too, Fellow Daoist of the North?”","“No, I’m here for something else.” The Northern Emperor handed the “red envelope” to Song Shuhang. “This is the contract we negotiated with the new Heavenly Emperor, Jin Gua. Jin Gua agreed to temporarily lend us the fragments of the Heavenly Court and transfer them to Fellow Daoist Tyrant Song’s Inner World. This is the letter and contract from Jin Gua.”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Why did the letter need to be in a red envelope?","After accepting the red letter, Song Shuhang couldn’t help but ask, “Senior, how did you convince Senior Jin Gua?”","The fragments of the Heavenly Court were like roots to Senior Jin Gua; how could he be willing to lend them out?","“We agreed to transfer the complete ‘Heavenly Emperor’s authority’ to Jin Gua after the ceremony. With that, he was willing to lend us the Heavenly Court fragments for a while,” the Northern Emperor said, transmitting the message directly to Song Shuhang."]},{"number":2926,"title":"Chapter 2926: Countdown","paragraphs":["Chapter 2926: Countdown","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Song Shuhang was confused.","Complete Heavenly Emperor privileges?","Didn’t Dada pass the Heavenly Emperor’s privileges on to Senior Golden Trigram? Could it be that the Heavenly Emperor privileges Dada inherited were still incomplete?","“The Heavenly Emperor’s privileges were once divided... some of those privileges ended up in our hands,” the Northern Emperor continued to speak telepathically.","This was actually possible?","Song Shuhang: “That’s impressive!”","The Northern Emperor’s unknown organization had pulled off a move so slick that it made Song Shuhang’s scalp tingle, as if his hair was about to be shown off and fall out, leaving him bald.","“By the way, Senior Northern, when do you plan to hold the ceremony?” Song Shuhang asked.","It was almost New Year’s for him.","“We’ll hold the ceremony next year,” the Northern Emperor said with a gentle smile. His warm, melting-ice demeanor would have been a sure-fire hit in TV dramas, winning over millions of female fans.","“It’s already next year after today,” Senior Akasword couldn’t help but point out.","The Northern Senior nodded, “Exactly, we’ll wait until you finish celebrating the New Year before holding the ceremony. New year, new beginning.”","“Thoughtful of you, Senior,” Song Shuhang said as he opened the letter inside the red envelope.","The content of Senior Golden Trigram’s letter was simple: he agreed to temporarily lend out the “ancient Heavenly Court fragment,” but requested that Song Shuhang be extra cautious during the ceremony to ensure the fragment wasn’t damaged.","As long as the fragment remained intact, he promised to send Song Shuhang another box of spirit stones afterward.","“Senior Island Master sure is generous,” Song Shuhang said as he closed the letter.","Under the guidance of the previous Heavenly Emperor Dada, Island Master Golden Trigram had hit Song Shuhang’s weak spot squarely—if the spirit stones were in place, there was no need to worry about anything.","Even if something unexpected happened, considering the spirit stones, Tyrant Song would step in to help.","But actually, even if Island Master hadn’t mentioned the spirit stones, Song Shuhang would have made sure to protect his Heavenly Court fragment... After all, he still remembered the favor from when the Island Master had gifted him the “Bunny Bag of One-Inch Shrinking.”","No matter how poor he got, he would never forget a favor.","A man of principles, even in poverty.","Aside from the letter, there was also a contract, an agreement signed between Island Master Golden Trigram and the Northern Emperor’s group.","Song Shuhang skimmed through the contract, focusing on the signature at the end... Cheng Lin Immortal.","“Is Cheng Lin the representative?” Song Shuhang asked, puzzled.","Northern Emperor: “Cheng Lin?”","“I mean, why is this contract being given to me?” Song Shuhang smoothly transitioned to the next topic as he put the contract away.","“The contract is in three parts, and since your core world is your territory, one part of the contract is entrusted to you for safekeeping,” the Northern Emperor explained.","Song Shuhang: “Got it.”","He carefully stored both the letter and the contract in his “bead bracelet artifact.”","“By the way, Senior Northern... are you staying for the New Year celebration?” Song Shuhang asked.","The Northern Emperor shook his head, “I need to help transfer Golden Trigram’s Heavenly Court fragment.”","“Then I won’t keep you, Senior,” Song Shuhang said, taking out the red envelope used as a letter case, and pulling out 1,000 yuan from the “ten times happiness” lucky money packet given by Senior Yellow Mountain, stuffing it into the red envelope before handing it to the Northern Emperor.","Northern Emperor was confused.","“Happy New Year, Senior,” Song Shuhang wished him.","“Is this a custom?” The Northern Emperor accepted the red envelope with a slight smile, then turned and opened a space gate, leaving with Song Shuhang’s New Year’s blessing.","The Emperor had no intention of giving a return gift.","After the Northern Emperor left, one by one, the members of the “Nine Provinces Number One Group” started arriving from all over the world.","Everyone had coordinated in the group chat beforehand, so their arrivals in Wenzhou City were closely timed.","Young Master Miefeng appeared at the door with a charming smile, “Shuhang~ I heard Senior Yellow Mountain gave you a big red envelope?”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“If Senior Yellow Mountain gave you a red envelope, we naturally have to follow the group leader’s lead. Here, here, this is my red envelope for you—6,666 yuan, all in paper bills. It might not match Senior Yellow Mountain’s tenfold happiness, but my 6,666 yuan is still auspicious. Don’t be shy with us!” Young Master Miefeng cheerfully pulled out a thick red envelope, with a mix of 1-yuan, 5-yuan, and 10-yuan bills.","After pulling out the envelope, Young Master Miefeng enthusiastically shoved it into Song Shuhang’s pocket, “Don’t be shy with us, we’re all friends. Being shy with us would be too formal. Quickly open your pocket so I can put the 6,666 yuan envelope inside!”","Song Shuhang was caught between laughter and tears.","After successfully stuffing the 6,666 yuan envelope into Song Shuhang’s pocket, Young Master Miefeng then handed out the New Year gifts he had carefully prepared for Song Shuhang’s disciples and daughters.","Just as Young Master Miefeng finished distributing the gifts, Thrice Saber Reckless came into the house carrying a large cloth bag, “Shuhang little friend, I’m here!”","Song Shuhang glanced at Senior Three Waves and the large cloth bag he was carrying, his mouth twitching, “Senior Three Waves, didn’t you say I’m not your little friend Shuhang, but your Senior Song?”","“Ay, what Senior Song, it’s New Year’s, so let’s forget formalities. As a senior of the ‘Nine Provinces Number One Group,’ I’ve prepared a surprise for you this New Year. Look, I’ve gathered 8,888 coins, such an auspicious number.” Thrice Saber Reckless cheerfully approached, insisting on giving the coins to Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang:","Looks like I’ll have to study some lightning-based techniques soon, to see if I can put these 8,888 coins to good use.","“Alright, enough joking around,” Thrice Saber Reckless said as he handed over the coins, then reached into his pocket to pull out a red envelope and handed it to Song Shuhang, “This is the real New Year’s gift I prepared for you consider it a return gift for lending me the ‘Confucian Classic’ the other day.”","“What’s this?” Song Shuhang asked, half-believing, as he looked at Senior Three Waves.","“A treasure map, said to contain a massive amount of spirit stones, once left behind by a powerful evil sect from the heavens and worlds,” Thrice Saber Reckless replied earnestly. “This was a powerful evil sect that established a nation, gathering a massive amount of spirit stones with the power of the entire sect and nation. But one day, this evil sect provoked a formidable enemy, and overnight, their sect was destroyed, with members scattering. But their massive wealth was left behind, becoming a treasure.”","“The fleeing sect members didn’t try to reclaim the treasure?” Song Shuhang asked, puzzled.","“That, I don’t know,” Thrice Saber Reckless replied, raising an eyebrow.","Song Shuhang put away the treasure map, “Thank you, Senior Three Waves.”","“No need to be so formal,” Thrice Saber Reckless said, waving his hand as he walked toward Cloud Sparrow.","After a moment’s thought, Song Shuhang extended his finger, and the evil corpse, Tyrant Evil, materialized.","He handed the treasure map to the evil corpse, “Friend, could you check out the location indicated on this treasure map?”","“Leave it to me,” the evil corpse said, taking the map and vanishing into the void.","Song Shuhang glanced at his watch.","The New Year’s countdown was down to its final 60 minutes, and the members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group were almost all here. Senior White and Feather Soft Child were also on their way back and would arrive shortly.","Solar System, Moon Base.","“Only one hour left until the New Year,” Ball Shuhang, in human form, held a metal box in his right hand, calculating the time in his mind.","Time to make an appearance!","In a moment, it would bring its spoils to the scene and give its main body a surprise."]},{"number":2927,"title":"Chapter 2927: When Foes Cross Paths","paragraphs":["Chapter 2927: When Foes Cross Paths","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In the Core World, Song Shuhang had specifically set aside a scenic area near a lake for the members of the “Nine Provinces Number One Group” to celebrate the New Year. This area, originally designated for developing “lake-view villas” in the Core World, was prime real estate.","The stage, the banquet venue for Fairy Snow White’s New Year feast, had already been set up.","The Iron Avatar and the Self-Corpse Overlord were responsible for accompanying the seniors of the “Nine Provinces Number One Group,” while the “Core Assistant” ensured that every guest in the Core World felt at home, with meticulous care provided to everyone.","For this event, aside from a few restricted areas, Song Shuhang opened up the rest of the Core World to the seniors.","The restricted areas weren’t locked down out of concern that the seniors would leak the secrets of the Core World; it was simply a matter of convenience. For example, the area around the central “Living Spring” wasn’t open because the main body of Pavilion Master Chu was soaking in the spring, blowing bubbles—not exactly something that should be on public display. There was also a secret, sealed-off area containing a large number of corpses, which wasn’t suitable for the members of the “Nine Provinces Number One Group” to encounter. Then there were the more dangerous areas, like the “Death Forest,” filled with traps, which Song Shuhang had also sealed off.","At the moment, however, the members of the “Nine Provinces Number One Group” weren’t in the “New Year Celebration Area.” They were touring the nearby Ancient Heavenly Court ruins under the guidance of the Iron Avatar.","To accommodate the “special ceremony” that the Northern Emperor was organizing, Song Shuhang had temporarily gathered all the “Ancient Heavenly Court fragments” in one place.","Aside from the “Cafeteria 111 Heavenly Court fragment,” which had been designated as the venue for Fairy Snow White’s New Year feast, the rest of the Heavenly Court fragments had been assembled.","After the event, Song Shuhang could use the “Core Assistant’s” saved “Core World Planning Map” to move the “Ancient Heavenly Court fragments” back to their original planned locations, so it wasn’t a big deal.","Song Shuhang had collected quite a few “Ancient Heavenly Court fragments” over time. Among the Four Emperors of the Heavenly Court, Song Shuhang had two complete relics: the Northern Emperor’s Winter Palace and the Southern Emperor’s “Southern Autumn Temple,” which had developed a sentient artifact spirit.","Song Shuhang also had several fragments of the Eastern Emperor’s “Spring Pavilion” and even a plaza from the Western Emperor’s “Summer Palace.”","Additionally, there were the Merit Palace of the Merit Snake Beauty and the Gravity Hall that Su Clan’s Sixteen had entrusted to him.","And now, thanks to the cooperation of his Kind Corpse “Ba Shan” and the Taoist Heir, who had been transferring a large number of Heavenly Court fragments from the Confucian Sect, Song Shuhang’s Core World had become a sizable “Ancient Heavenly Court Ruins” site.","Anyone who practiced cultivation would be fascinated by the once-dominant power of the Ancient Heavenly Court. Even the seniors of the “Nine Provinces Number One Group” rarely had the opportunity to see so many Heavenly Court fragments in one place.","Outside the Core World, in Wenzhou City at Song Shuhang’s old home,","“Teacher, when is Senior White arriving? Fairy Snow is getting impatient,” Chu Chu called out.","Senior White had teamed up with Soft Feather to hunt down the “Year Beast” for the New Year feast, and now there were only about fifty minutes left until the New Year.","“I’ll contact him,” Song Shuhang said as he used the “Cultivator Chat” function to call Senior White.","On the other end, Senior White answered the call and said, “Shuhang, Soft Feather and I are taking a quick detour, but we’ll be back soon. Just tell Fairy Snow to wait ten minutes.”","“A detour? Did you find something interesting, Senior White?” Song Shuhang asked curiously.","Senior White never missed an opportunity to find treasures, and if he was taking a detour, it had to be either a valuable find or something particularly fun that had caught his attention.","“Since the New Year is almost here, even if I found something fun, I’d bring you all along. This time, it’s serious business,” Senior White replied with a smile. “I suddenly remembered the ‘Jade Pool Heavenly Court fragment’ we took from the ‘Limitless Demon Sect.’ I’m heading there now to bring it back.”","“Oh, right, the Jade Pool! I almost forgot about it too,” Song Shuhang said.","The Heavenly Court fragment of the Jade Pool, along with the Divine Lantern of Mount Lu Demon Sovereign, had been snatched from the Limitless Demon Sect.","Now, the Mount Lu Demon Sovereign was in Song Shuhang’s “Domination Realm,” overseeing the enslaved disciples of the Limitless Demon Sect—who were bound by a contract to work for Song Shuhang for free for ten years.","Originally, these disciples were to work in Song Shuhang’s Core World, but he had temporarily transferred them to the Domination Realm for the New Year feast preparations.","After all, it was all Song Shuhang’s territory. Once their ten-year contract ended, he could consider moving the entire Limitless Demon Sect into the Domination Realm as the sole resident sect. By then, they could work for Song Shuhang for compensation instead of for free.","In fact, the disciples of the Limitless Demon Sect in the Domination Realm were already so awed by Domination Song’s methods that they were left speechless.","Not only did he possess an incomparably vast personal world, but Domination Song also had an entire “multiverse!”","How... How did our young master, Sea King, manage to offend such a being?","The Sea King has led us astray!","But... maybe this is a blessing in disguise?","Domination Song’s “multiverse” world seemed to lack people. Perhaps this was an opportunity for the Limitless Demon Sect?","After finishing his conversation with Senior White, Song Shuhang turned to Chu Chu and said, “Chu Chu, go tell Fairy Snow that Senior White and the others will be back in at most ten minutes. The seniors in the group should be arriving soon... You go help Fairy Snow with the preparations. Xiao Cai, you help too.”","Xiao Cai wasn’t much help with cooking, but her knife skills could come in handy.","“Alright, Teacher,” Chu Chu nodded.","She was now pursuing the path of the Immortal Chef, so assisting Fairy Snow White was a form of cultivation for her.","“By the way, has Joseph shown up yet?” Song Shuhang asked, puzzled.","He had messaged Joseph a few days ago, intending to formally establish their master-disciple relationship during this New Year celebration.","Given Joseph’s personality, he should have already arrived by now.","But with the New Year fast approaching, Joseph was still nowhere to be seen.","“Maybe give him a call?” The Ghost Fairy, controlling Su Clan’s Sixteen’s body, hovered behind Song Shuhang, wrapping her arms around his neck.","“I’ll try,” Song Shuhang said as he pulled out his phone and selected Joseph’s name.","But as soon as the phone rang twice, the line went dead.","Song Shuhang was confused.","Joseph would never deliberately turn off his phone... Could it have been stolen?","With a slight shift of his mind, Song Shuhang channeled a bit of his primordial spirit, and in the next instant, his “Tribulation Immortal-level” divine sense enveloped the entirety of China.","His divine sense spread out silently, unnoticed by cultivators below his level.","In a mere moment, Song Shuhang pinpointed Joseph’s location.","Sure enough, Joseph was in trouble. At that moment, he was bound tightly and hanging from the ceiling of a cave, spinning slowly.","Opposite him, a crude puppet was crushing a cellphone.","“Your master’s call, but don’t think he can save you,” the crude puppet sneered. “No matter who your master is, they can’t save you.”","“Yeah! I can ask my master for help!” Joseph suddenly exclaimed.","The crude puppet was confused."]},{"number":2928,"title":"Chapter 2928: Why Don’t You Ask Who My Master Is?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2928: Why Don’t You Ask Who My Master Is?","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Since Joseph had been captured, the thought of asking his master for help hadn’t crossed his mind.","For one, he was too nervous. And two, this was his first time experiencing something straight out of a martial arts novel—being captured by the villain and interrogated for treasure. In the midst of the adrenaline rush, he lacked the experience to know what to do.","After being captured, he briefly considered calling the police. But his phone, smartwatch, and any other communication devices were quickly confiscated by his captors. Clearly, these people weren’t the kind of isolated martial artists from novels, completely ignorant of modern technology.","Actually, if Joseph had mentioned his master, “Song Shuhang,” earlier, or if he had called out for his master, Song Shuhang would have sensed it immediately and located him. Given Song Shuhang’s current level, he could definitely do that. After all, Song Shuhang was now a “Tri-Sage Immortal,” and his spiritual senses were more than sharp enough to detect such things.","Unfortunately, Joseph was too tense to think of that before.","It wasn’t until the rough-looking puppet before him let out a sneering laugh that he suddenly remembered—maybe he could just shout for his master, Song Shuhang!","His master, Song Shuhang, was far more powerful than any “martial arts master” in those novels. Thinking back to the “evil obsession incident,” Joseph realized that his master was more like one of the celestial beings from Chinese legends than a mere martial artist.","Though he wasn’t sure why such a celestial being would still be a student at Southeast University, perhaps his master was one of those legendary beings who enjoyed wandering the mortal world?","So maybe, if he shouted for his master, it would work! If his master was indeed a celestial being, he might be able to hear him!","“You’re still thinking of asking for help? Do you have some hidden spell for that?” The rough puppet immediately pressed its hand to the ground, activating several array patterns that rose up in a barrier, blocking any magical rescue signals.","Better safe than sorry!","Even though this Western man had lousy skills and was no longer young, his master was probably some half-baked Western holy light cultivator.","But the rough puppet was cautious by nature, so it still raised a barrier, cutting off any unexpected rescues.","Within this barrier, no matter what kind of help Joseph tried to call for, there was no way for any signal to get out!","As the barrier activated, the rough puppet bared its sharp steel teeth, staring at Joseph—go ahead, try your rescue spell!","When you realize your spell can’t break through the barrier, that’s when you’ll lose all hope!","Under the puppet’s cold gaze, Joseph opened his mouth and yelled, “Master! Help! Help me! Save me!”","There was no hidden rescue spell, no “signal-breaking rune,” or anything like that.","Joseph’s idea of calling for help was just to shout.","The rough puppet was speechless.","I can’t believe I actually fell for this foreigner’s nonsense, actually believing this low-level guy might have some high-level rescue spell or rune to save his life!","But after all that, he’s just yelling at the top of his lungs.","It felt like my intelligence had been dragged down to his level, only to be rubbed in the dirt by his abundant experience in stupidity.","At that moment, the rough puppet felt an overwhelming urge to bash this Western middle-aged man to pieces.","“Shut up!” the rough puppet shouted in anger. “Do you really think shouting is going to get anyone to hear you? Your master can’t hear your screams; he’s not coming to save you! Damn it... because of your ridiculous shouting rescue plan, I wasted a barrier setup. I can’t believe I was dumb enough to think you actually had a magical rescue method. If you keep yelling, I’ll stab you in the kidney.”","Joseph remained silent.","Barrier? Magical methods?","It sounded like this creature wasn’t just an ordinary martial arts master either, but more like his master—a celestial being, perhaps even a monster from legends.","So, does that mean my master still has a chance to save me?","Joseph felt a twinge of anxiety.","“Stop thinking about your master. Whoever he is, he can’t save you now. Tell me, where did you hide my key stone disk?” the rough puppet snarled through clenched teeth.","Joseph hesitated.","*Why don’t you ask him? Why doesn’t he ask you who your master is?* Suddenly, a soft yet familiar voice echoed in Joseph’s ear.","Though the voice was youthful, it carried the weight of years and had the tone of a wise elder.","Joseph’s eyes lit up.","It was his master!","Last time, when facing the “monster in the fog,” his master’s voice had also appeared like this!","His master had heard his cries for help!","Suddenly, Joseph felt a surge of confidence.","“Hmph!” Joseph cast a haughty look down at the rough puppet—though he was still spinning while suspended from the ceiling.","“Since you’re so sure my master can’t save me, why don’t you ask who my master is?” Joseph raised his head proudly, though the action made it hard for him to breathe. But right now, he needed to exude an air of confidence!","The rough puppet said nothing.","It didn’t want to play into Joseph’s game. After all, it had already been dragged into his foolish rhythm once, getting its intelligence rubbed in the dirt.","But even if the rough puppet didn’t want to respond, Joseph wasn’t going to stop.","“My master’s name is Song Shuhang! He’s from the Jiangnan University’s Mechanical Engineering Department!” Joseph loudly proclaimed his master’s name.","Since his master had prompted him to say it, Joseph figured the puppet must recognize the name.","In Joseph’s mind, his master was akin to a legendary martial artist. Just by mentioning his name, the entire martial arts world would give him respect.","“Song Shuhang?” The rough puppet’s reaction was far more intense than Joseph had imagined!","The puppet’s entire body trembled, and it even took a few involuntary steps backward.","Judging by the way it shook in fear, it was clear that his master wasn’t just a “famous martial artist.” No, it was more like his master was the leader of the martial arts world, whose name alone struck terror in those who heard it.","“Ba... Ba Song.” The rough puppet’s voice quivered.","Once, it thought the title “Millennium’s First Sage” was a joke.","Once, it believed that Ba Song was just a little newbie at the fourth realm.","Once, it had even stabbed Ba Song in the kidney and planned to do it again.","Once, it had cursed Ba Song.","Once, it had teamed up with the Beast Cultivation Realm’s Gorilla General to deal with Ba Song.","Once, it had even worked with the Sea King to plot against Ba Song.","But all of that was in the past.","It never imagined that the Ba Song it thought was a joke would now be dominating all the immortals across the realms, and even be a top candidate for the next Heavenly Dao.","The rough puppet trembled for a full thirty seconds.","Then, it steeled itself and transformed its right hand into a sharp blade. “How could someone with your pathetic skills be his disciple? Besides... even if you are, with this barrier, he might not be able to sense this place.”","The rough puppet’s killing intent surged as it slowly stepped toward Joseph.","Suspended in the air, Joseph shivered as a cold fear spread through his body.","Each step the rough puppet took felt like it was stomping on Joseph’s heart, causing it to race faster and faster.","One step, two steps...","As the puppet took its third step, a finger materialized out of thin air, gently tapping the rough puppet’s forehead.","That single tap didn’t just target the rough puppet but traced it back to its source.","“Ba... Ba Song...” the rough puppet stammered, its voice catching as if a mechanical glitch had taken over."]},{"number":2929,"title":"Chapter 2929: These Tricks Are What I, Tyrannical Song, Have Already Mastered","paragraphs":["Chapter 2929: These Tricks Are What I, Tyrannical Song, Have Already Mastered","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The crude puppet never expected that its “source” could be so easily traced by Tyrannical Song!","These puppet avatars and their source had a very special relationship. Even if a single puppet were completely annihilated, it wouldn’t harm the source. Tracing the source through just one puppet was nearly impossible.","But with just a simple tap of Tyrannical Song’s finger, the source was captured!","When the source made contact with that finger, it was already too late to sever its connection with the crude puppet.","When Tyrannical Song’s finger touched the puppet’s forehead, it instantly bypassed hundreds of fake decoy points and broke through dozens of virtual sources to lock onto the real one!","The source of the crude puppet didn’t even have time to react... The events that unfolded were too fast for its consciousness to keep up.","The power gap between it and Dominating Song was of a different dimension entirely.","“Master! Master, you’re amazing!” Joseph, hanging from the ceiling, shouted.","At this moment, he was filled with the joy and thrill of surviving a life-threatening situation, combined with the shock of witnessing his master’s true power.","Divine techniques!","This time, Master had clearly displayed divine techniques—piercing through space with a single finger to subdue a formidable enemy.","Unlike the last incident with the evil illusion, this time Joseph clearly saw his master’s methods!","He originally thought that the master he stubbornly followed was a “martial arts expert” straight out of a wuxia series, but now he could confirm his master was actually a divine being. This revelation brought him joy tenfold... no, a hundredfold.","If his Chinese vocabulary weren’t so limited, he’d be praising his master in a hundred different ways!","Crack! The sound of space shattering echoed.","In the void, the finger resting on the crude puppet’s forehead remained in its original position. From the cracked space, Dominating Song stepped out!","As soon as he appeared, an immensely powerful aura that made people tremble radiated out.","This was the standard entrance of a big shot!","The soul within the crude puppet couldn’t withstand the pressure and was on the verge of collapse.","However, Joseph, hanging from the ceiling, was unaffected by this oppressive aura—clearly, the pressure from Song Shuhang’s entrance was deliberately directed away from him.","At that moment, he looked at his master and said, “Huh? Master, are you T-1000 from Terminator?”","The master below did indeed resemble Song Shuhang in every way—same facial features and all. But right now, his master’s body was emitting a metallic sheen, with the metal seeming to flow like liquid.","He looked exactly like the liquid metal robot assassin from *Terminator*.","‘Uh...’ In Joseph’s ears, Master Song Shuhang’s gentle yet awkward voice rang out.","Joseph was confused.","His master’s voice sounded not only awkward but also somewhat strained and uncomfortable?","Could it be... do divine beings also get constipated?","Aren’t the legendary fairies supposed to never need a bathroom?","Could it be that divine beings and fairies are different?","Below.","The liquid metal Song Shuhang’s fingertip remained on the crude puppet’s forehead as he spoke: “*Smirks* A trash like you dares to target my disciple?”","The words were filled with an air of dominance.","Joseph, upon hearing his master’s words, felt a warm sensation in his heart—a happiness that came from being acknowledged.","This time, did his master finally recognize him as his disciple?","The crude puppet stared at “Dominating Song” before it, feeling an overwhelming fear... It was as if it had entered hell, the most brutal part of hell, filled with despair.","“*Smirks* You think your method of hiding your ‘primordial spirit source’ is clever?”","“Your way of hiding the ‘source’ might fool others, and maybe you could slip away. But I am Dominating Song!”","“Every trick you’ve got is meaningless in my eyes!”","The liquid metal Song Shuhang spoke slowly.","He didn’t immediately end the source of this crude puppet—instead, he used it to locate all the other puppet avatars.","If he was going to strike, he’d make sure to wipe them all out in one go!","Leave no loose ends!","“Your so-called ‘puppet avatars’ are, to put it plainly, modified independent beings. Each of these puppets has a relatively complete consciousness and soul. You used some method to brainwash these independent puppets, turning them into extensions of yourself. Or perhaps, without their knowledge, you modified them so that they still believe they’re living their own lives... But in reality, they’ve become nothing more than your puppets.”","“In this way, neither the method to obliterate both body and soul nor the ordinary technique to sever the source would have any effect on your true source. This is because the puppets that are destroyed aren’t true avatars; they’re just puppets under your control.”","“But your trick is no secret to me. This method you’re using? I, Tyrannical Song, have already mastered these.”","‘No, I haven’t’! Somewhere in the void, Song Shuhang silently defended himself: ‘I haven’t been cruel enough to turn people into puppets...’","“Once I understood your methods, finding your true source was all too easy. *Smirks*” The liquid metal Song Shuhang said.","The next moment, his finger pressed deeper into the crude puppet’s forehead, piercing it and leaving a hole.","“Die!” The liquid metal Song Shuhang slowly withdrew his finger and blew on it.","Boom!","The crude puppet’s skull emitted a sound of explosion, and the puppet collapsed.","At the same time, across the heavens and realms, in nearly a hundred different world planes, close to a thousand puppets suddenly collapsed, with their skulls exploding.","Among them, some puppets were even unknown to others as puppets!","They had lived their own lives, with identities within small sects of the cultivation world.","They were like Mr. Shelan, who broke into the Chu family’s home with sea urchin warriors, trying to steal the “sword manual.” They thought they were still alive, believing only parts of their bodies had been modified and turned into puppets.","They had their own schemes, their own ambitions... their own goals and desires.","But in reality, they had long become nothing more than puppets in the hands of the “puppet source.”","These thousands of puppets were all destroyed, their heads blown to bits.","Simultaneously, the hidden “puppet source” in the shadows also disintegrated in despair.","Beside it, in a hidden cave, were countless puppet parts, cultivation techniques, pills, and treasures... but no spirit stones.","Recently, this puppet source had been keeping a low profile, afraid of being caught by Dominating Song, so its stash of spirit stones, accumulated over years, had been drained.","The liquid metal Song Shuhang gathered all these items.","After eliminating the puppet source, Ball Shuhang felt an overwhelming sense of satisfaction—playing hide and seek with the main body and then taking down an enemy afterward doubled the sense of achievement!"]},{"number":2930,"title":"Chapter 2930: Ball Shuhang’s New Year’s Gift","paragraphs":["Chapter 2930: Ball Shuhang’s New Year’s Gift","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Indeed, after Joseph shouted “Help!” loudly, Ball Shuhang seized the opportunity and made a flashy entrance before the original body could!","Ball Shuhang had been pondering whether there was a more ingenious way to make an entrance, something that would catch the original body off guard.","For two days, it had been lingering in the solar system, using a combination of “divination methods + instinct” to track the original body’s location.","When Joseph cried out for help, Ball Shuhang knew its moment had arrived!","Without hesitation, it acted, interrupting the original body’s chance to show off—taking the path of the original body and leaving it with no way forward; stealing the spotlight so the original body couldn’t shine.","The feeling was simply indescribable.","Ball Shuhang’s instincts told it that after finally finding some satisfaction at the expense of the original body, slaying a few more things would amplify that satisfaction exponentially.","This crude puppet’s core just happened to fall into Ball Shuhang’s hands, becoming the perfect score to boost its joy.","After dealing with the core of this “crude puppet,” Ball Shuhang didn’t forget to collect the spoils of war, using spatial means to snatch everything the puppet was holding.","After all, the original body had so many workers in its core world now that anything thrown in could be transformed into something useful.","As a competent clone, Ball Shuhang was always looking out for the original body, meticulously planning.","And with the New Year countdown already underway, if it didn’t make its appearance now, it wouldn’t have time to give the original body a New Year’s gift.","Having completed everything, Ball Shuhang’s form bounced into a “liquid metal sphere,” hopping a few times on the ground before quietly waiting for the original body to arrive.","“Teacher, why did you turn into a ball?” Joseph asked, puzzled, staring at Ball Shuhang on the ground.","“Joseph, be quiet.” Song Shuhang’s voice echoed in Joseph’s ears.","Moments later, a spatial door was pushed open in the void, and Song Shuhang’s original body dragged Su Clan’s Sixteen, holding Li Yinzhu and Xiao Lingxiao in his arms, along with a bunch of other items hanging from him, and stepped into the cave abode.","“Master!” Joseph was filled with admiration, bowing deeply after seeing Song Shuhang use such a space-crossing technique.","He knew he was already getting on in years, and learning his master’s true skills was nearly impossible so he didn’t aim too high. His expectations were modest; even learning just a little would be enough to last him a lifetime. He was old now, so if he could cultivate at even one percent... no, one-thousandth, or even one-ten-thousandth of his master’s speed, he would be satisfied!","“Original body!” Ball Shuhang bounced twice: [Happy smile].","“You did well,” Song Shuhang nodded in praise—honestly, even if he had personally intervened, he might not have been able to do it as perfectly as Ball Shuhang did.","Song Shuhang had “causal methods” and the “Primordial Spirit Disintegration Sutra” passed down by Senior White; he could sever the core of the crude puppet if he acted personally. But he certainly couldn’t do it as cleanly as Ball Shuhang had, erasing all traces and preventing any chance of resurrection.","However, despite how perfectly everything had been set up for him to make an entrance, Ball Shuhang had swooped in and stolen the moment. Song Shuhang’s feelings were now incredibly complicated.","Ball Shuhang glanced at the original body and, upon seeing the constipated look on its face, felt a vague sense of “happiness” welling up inside.","Doing this made it happy... The satisfaction was second only to the moment it had reunited with the original body after traversing countless mountains and rivers.","This additional joy was something Ball Shuhang found addicting.","After savoring the extra joy, Ball Shuhang’s eyes drifted toward the mechanical girl, Xiao Lingxiao, in Song Shuhang’s arms.","Xiao Lingxiao was also staring at Ball Shuhang.","The two shared countless connections, so even though this was their first real meeting, they felt an inexplicable resonance.","“This is Xiao Lingxiao, my daughter,” Song Shuhang explained.","“Our daughter? No wonder, there’s a special sense of closeness,” Ball Shuhang nodded—this feeling of a connection that seemed like a blood bond was unmistakable; she was indeed the original body’s daughter!","Song Shuhang: “!!!”","What do you mean *our* daughter? That’s going to cause misunderstandings!","Hearing these words, Su Clan’s Sixteen, who was hanging onto Song Shuhang’s neck, froze, tightening her grip both Sixteen and the spirit ghost felt a sudden sense of crisis.","“Master~ I’m feeling dizzy~” Fortunately, Joseph, who was hanging there, let out a pitiful cry, breaking the awkward tension.","Song Shuhang turned and gently tapped Joseph.","The long-unused treasured blade “Ba Cu” broke through the air, lightly slicing the rope holding Joseph, and then caught him.","“Sword riding... no, blade riding?” Joseph, supported by the blade’s light, was ecstatic.","It was reminiscent of when the then-newbie Song Shuhang had first experienced “sword flying” and was filled with excitement.","Every man dreams of flying, conquering the skies is every boy’s desire.","Even though Joseph was well into middle age, his heart remained young—he was interested in the martial arts fantasies of walking on rooftops and even more so in the legendary “sword flying.”","The treasured blade Ba Cu supported him and gently placed him back on the ground.","Once on the ground, Joseph gazed at the treasured blade Ba Cu with infatuation, unable to resist reaching out to touch it—this was his master’s treasured blade, and he touched it!","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Had Joseph caught Su Clan’s habit of wanting to touch everything?","Maybe it was time to consider passing the treasured blade Ba Cu down to Joseph?","Ba Cu was an excellent blade, one that had accompanied Song Shuhang through most of his cultivation journey. After going through so many events, the treasured blade Ba Cu was now even better than a five-grade treasured blade.","Although Joseph practiced the “Holy Light Sword Technique,” that sword technique had been entirely modified from a “blade technique” template. With Ba Cu in his hand, Joseph could fully utilize the sword technique—Song Shuhang had experienced this firsthand.","“Joseph, why did that puppet try to capture you?” At this moment, Chu Pavilion Master’s strand of hair on Song Shuhang’s head curiously asked.","From the way the events unfolded earlier, it seemed like the puppet didn’t even know Joseph was Song Shuhang’s disciple, so why did it go after him?","What did Joseph have that was worth the puppet’s trouble?","“He was asking for a ‘key stone disk’ from me... but I haven’t received any key,” Joseph mused, rubbing his chin.","“Have you recently found anything unusual or crafted something special, even if it doesn’t resemble a key?” Chu Pavilion Master’s strand of hair suggested.","Joseph furrowed his brows, searching his memory.","On the other side,","After the original body put its disciple down, Ball Shuhang reluctantly tore its gaze from “Xiao Lingxiao.”","Because of the feeling of familiarity, it really wanted to hug Xiao Lingxiao, to touch her, to connect with her.","But this was their first meeting; being too enthusiastic might scare the child.","Ball Shuhang forced itself to suppress the urge.","Then, it opened its body, spitting out a box: “Original body, Happy New Year~ This is the New Year’s gift I prepared for you!”","A New Year’s gift?","At that moment, Song Shuhang was deeply touched!","Ball Shuhang was truly the model of all clones!"]},{"number":2931,"title":"Chapter 2931: Indeed, You Are Its True Form!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2931: Indeed, You Are Its True Form!","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“If only it were my clone instead of Fat Ball Big Boss’s clone!” Song Shuhang couldn’t help but let this thought cross his mind as he received the New Year’s gift box.","Fat Ball was incredibly capable!","As an enemy, it was undoubtedly one of the most troublesome adversaries. But as an ally, it was one of the most reliable partners.","And it was different from the “Core World Assistant” and “Ms. Long Luo,” who were more management-oriented helpers, focused on internal affairs. Fat Ball was the type of assistant that specialized in expanding operations, focusing on external matters.","With the Core World Assistant, Ms. Long Luo, and Fat Ball, both internal and external affairs were covered. Having even one of these assistants would stabilize everything; having both was nothing short of wonderful.","“Aren’t you going to open it, Main Body?” Seeing that its Main Body had accepted the New Year’s gift it had carefully prepared, Ball Shuhang was in a very good mood.","Song Shuhang held the gift box. “Can I open it now?”","It felt a bit awkward to open a gift right in front of someone.","“Of course! I put a lot of thought into this gift just for you, so why wouldn’t you open it? Besides, I’m really looking forward to surprising you!” Ball Shuhang said, bouncing on the ground.","Song Shuhang placed the box on the ground and grabbed the handle. “Alright, I’m opening it.”","“Happy New Year, Main Body! Wishing you prosperity in the new year!” Ball Shuhang exclaimed.","Song Shuhang took a deep breath and gently opened the New Year’s gift box.","To be cautious, he prepared to use his spatial abilities. If anything seemed off, he could immediately transfer the box to a specific location within the Core World.","There was a Heavenly Dao Sealing Pillar originally used to seal the Confucian Saint’s Classics ready and waiting there. If something unexpected happened, the pillar could seal whatever was in the box right away.","Although Ball Shuhang had lost its memory, it was once the ruler of the Nine Serenities. Its idea of a “gift” might be very different from that of ordinary people.","When it mentioned a surprise gift, it might be something extremely dangerous. One had to be on guard.","Click the box opened, revealing a small sealing pillar.","“Huh?” Song Shuhang was surprised.","The gift came with a sealing pillar?","Moreover, this sealing technique was the improved version of the one Fat Ball had used to ambush Senior White Two, capable of sealing even a ruler of the Nine Serenities.","Was this gift something that even Fat Ball found threatening?","Inside the small seal was a severed head, along with a cloud of violent, virus-ridden mist.","At the core of this mist was a tiny particle that resembled a piece of iron... The moment Song Shuhang’s gaze fell upon it, his eyes started to ache slightly.","Simultaneously, his Immortal Fat Whale Golden Core in his natal dantian was stimulated, and the usually motionless whale suddenly had the urge to leap over the Dragon Gate.","“Is this the Star Destruction Virus source?” Song Shuhang guessed aloud.","The violent mist looked even purer than the “Star Destruction Virus” that he and Senior White had detonated in the Dream Realm’s illusory sun.","Moreover, it triggered a resonance with the immortal attribute of his Fat Whale Golden Core.","So, this might be the Star Destruction Virus Source with true immortal properties mentioned in the shadow left by the Immortal Karma Daoist—something even the authority of the Heavenly Dao couldn’t erase!","Based on the pain in his eyes—staring at this tiny iron particle hurt far less than when he looked at the Immortal Daoist’s immortal body in his dream.","This iron particle virus source seemed to be on the same level as Skylark’s “Immortal Bone” or his “Immortal Fat Whale Golden Core”possessing immortal qualities but differing from the Heavenly Dao’s version of immortality.","“You guessed right, Main Body. This is indeed the virus source.” Ball Shuhang looked at its Main Body with a bit of admiration.","It wasn’t surprised that its Main Body could stare at the core of the Star Destruction Virus Source for so long without being affected!","Despite its small size, this iron particle carried an immortal attribute, emitting immortal information. A normal cultivator’s consciousness would be devoured just by staring at it; even an Eternal Being would be unable to resist its allure and would be drawn into it.","Even Fat Ball had to quickly look away after a couple of glances to avoid being affected.","But its Main Body stared at the particle without flinching, completely unaffected.","“My Main Body is just that strong!”","“I didn’t expect you to actually find the Star Destruction Virus Source. Well done!” Song Shuhang praised him.","This New Year’s gift was truly unexpected.","“Hehe” Ball Shuhang rolled around on the ground—receiving praise from its Main Body gave it a feeling of being acknowledged for its strength. It was like it had managed to make its Main Body completely concede in a certain area, and the feeling was incredible!","Song Shuhang turned the sealing pillar around and asked, “Whose head is this?”","Aside from the Star Destruction Virus Source, the sealing pillar also contained a head.","The head looked like a red skeleton, with skin tightly wrapped around the bones, complete with horns like those of a demon from Western mythology—a stereotypical villain face.","If one looked closely, there seemed to be some kind of war paint on the red skeleton’s face, though it had been wiped off—likely during the fight.","“This guy was the one who tried to release the Star Destruction Virus,” Fat Ball replied with a grin. “I found him secretly lurking in the solar system, trying to release the virus into the Sun to ruin your New Year. So, I quietly set up a sealing formation and took him down without a sound. I wanted to keep his body intact, but he wasn’t weak, so I had to blow up his body and bring back only his head.”","Song Shuhang was stunned.","This guy was planning to release the virus into the Sun?","If not for Ball Shuhang’s timely intervention, the entire solar system might have been doomed.","“Even though I only brought back the head, I’m sure you’ll be able to extract enough information from his brain,” Fat Ball said.","Song Shuhang did have Senior White’s personally taught “Memory CDEF Disk Extraction Method,” but he wasn’t sure if it would work on this head.","Memory extraction techniques usually involved overpowering a weaker opponent... and generally only worked on those at a lower level than oneself.","Moreover, this head looked like it had been killed by Fat Ball. He wasn’t sure if Senior White’s memory extraction method could be used on a corpse.","Just as Song Shuhang was pondering, the demonic skull inside the sealing pillar suddenly opened its eyes.","Its pupils glowed with a piercing red light.","“So, you’re its true form? No doubt, you must be the Heavenly Dao’s contingency plan. You have the same origin energy as it does! I never imagined this generation’s Heavenly Dao would leave such a contingency behind.” The demonic skull spoke in an ancient language.","Song Shuhang glanced down at the mechanical girl in his hand."]},{"number":2932,"title":"Chapter 2932: The New Year Event on the Cultivation Chat Client","paragraphs":["Chapter 2932: The New Year Event on the Cultivation Chat Client","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Song Shuhang’s current proficiency in the ancient language is at a “basic understanding” level. Unless he activates the law related to “language and script,” he finds most ancient language conversations difficult to comprehend.","The red devil skull spoke at length, but the only words Song Shuhang could immediately understand and react to were keywords like “body,” “backup plan,” and “Heavenly Dao.”","For the remaining words, he had to run them through his mind and carefully consider the overall meaning of the sentence.","However, when he registered the term “Heavenly Dao’s backup plan,” he instinctively looked towards Little Lingxiao.","The mechanical girl shook her head, indicating that she didn’t recognize this red devil skull.","“Still alive, huh?” Ball Shuhang hopped over, eyeing the head inside the sealing pillar, ready to strengthen the seal at any moment.","Song Shuhang and Ball Shuhang shared a tacit understanding, placing the “sealing pillar” on the ground—ready for Ball Shuhang to reinforce the seal should anything unexpected occur.","“Why are you stopping us when you’re no longer the Heavenly Dao? As someone who once attained immortality, you should understand that to transcend further, you must break the shackles of the universe. We should be working together, not tripping each other up like this,” the red devil skull continued in the ancient language.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","This time, the conversation was filled with specialized terms, most of which Song Shuhang couldn’t grasp.","But he couldn’t ask Fat Ball to translate for him—that would make Fat Ball suspicious and question his “real” identity.","At the moment, Song Shuhang didn’t want to complicate his relationship with Fat Ball, especially during the New Year.","So, he quietly activated the law related to “language and script” within his body. Once the law was in place, he could at least understand what he was hearing.","However, since the previous sentence in ancient language was too complex, and he hadn’t activated the law at that time, he missed its meaning and had to let it go.","Song Shuhang maintained a stern expression, staring at the red skull without giving it the chance to use any “face-reading” techniques.","Seeing that Song Shuhang remained silent, the red skull simply stared back at him.","After a moment, it seemed to sense some sort of “mark.”","“You’ve killed our ‘Void Sun Guardians’?” the red devil skull questioned, locking its gaze on Song Shuhang.","Apparently, those who had killed a “Void Sun” would carry some kind of mark that the red devil skull could detect.","Song Shuhang remained expressionless.","Not only had he killed a Void Sun, but he had taken out two of them.","One in the Dream Realm.","And another small Void Sun that had infiltrated the Heavenly Dao’s little black room, observing as Song Shuhang and Senior White dealt with the “Stellar Destruction Virus.” Song Shuhang discovered it and obliterated it with a “pay-to-win strike.”","When Song Shuhang still didn’t respond, the red devil skull sneered, “Not talking, huh? It seems we have no room for cooperation. Don’t blame us for being rude... Killing the ‘Void Sun Guardians’ and ‘Stellar Enders,’ even if you’re the Heavenly Dao’s backup plan, we won’t fear you. Mark my words, this debt will be settled!”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","It’s not that I don’t want to talk—if you can, try speaking in modern language! Someday, if I ever attain the status of “immortal Heavenly Dao,” I’ll make sure to promote Mandarin across the entire universe, making it a universal language.","Also, Song Shuhang couldn’t help but wonder if this red skull had some connection to the “Sea Urchin Warrior.” Or maybe... had it also undergone ninety years of compulsory education as a Sea Urchin Warrior? Even its lines were so polished!","Moreover... the “Void Sun Guardians” clearly refer to the Void Suns, so does “Stellar Enders” refer to this red devil skull itself? Could it be that, like the Void Suns, there are many of these entities across the universe?","“Shuhang, Soft Feather and I are back! I’ve also brought back the ‘Jade Pool.’ Where are you?”At this moment, Senior White’s message came through the “Cultivation Chat” function.","Song Shuhang checked the time; Senior White and Soft Feather had only been gone for 9 minutes, just within the 10-minute window.","“I’m on my way back. Please wait a moment, Senior White. I might need your help here with something—possibly reading some memories.”Song Shuhang replied.","It would be difficult for him to read the memories of the red devil skull himself.","But if it were Senior White, he might be able to dig out even the childhood memories of this red devil skull.","“I’ll wait.”Senior White responded.","“Let’s go, we’re heading back to Wenzhou,” Song Shuhang said aloud.","He glanced at Ball Shuhang and ultimately decided to bring it along—after all, this year’s “New Year’s feast” would be held in the Core World.","The Core World was connected to Senior White Two’s Evil Lotus World, so even if Ball Shuhang suddenly regained its memory, Senior White Two was just next door and could jump in to help.","“I’ll open the door.” Ball Shuhang leapt into the air, colliding with the void to open a space gate.","The treasured saber Broken Tyrant nudged the still-pondering Joseph, sending him through the space gate.","Li Yinzhu, rubbing her eyes, hugged Little Lingxiao and followed behind Broken Tyrant.","Song Shuhang bent down, placing his hand on the sealing pillar, and lifted it up.","As he did so, the red devil skull inside the pillar gritted its teeth and let out an angry roar before self-destructing.","It was a final act of defiance.","The entire skull exploded into a cloud of blood mist, assaulting the sealing pillar.","“I was ready for this!” Ball Shuhang’s body extended a hand, pressing down on the sealing pillar to reinforce the seal.","The explosion of the red skull failed to break the “sealing pillar.”","Instead, the virus-laden fog within the sealing pillar was neutralized by the exploding blood mist.","The virus’s violent aura dissipated, leaving only the iron-like core of the virus mother within the sealing pillar.","“Huh?” Song Shuhang lifted the sealing pillar, examining it closely.","It seemed that the red skull’s explosion could partially neutralize the “Stellar Destruction Virus”?","Everything has a counterbalance. The red skull, responsible for planting the virus fog, seemed to have detoxifying properties.","“We should make a note of this... It might come in handy. If possible, we should try to capture more of these red skulls to study the chemical reactions between them and the virus,” Song Shuhang suggested.","“Leave it to me! [Proud smile]” Ball Shuhang replied.","“If possible, I’d really like to launch a ‘New Year Event’ on the ‘Cultivation Chat’ client, mobilizing all the idle experts to hunt down and capture these ‘red skulls’... Too bad there’s no reward enticing enough for those big shots,” Song Shuhang mused.","Pavilion Master Chu’s hair strand:","These things seem like high-tier bosses, and you’re thinking of turning them into a New Year event?","“Let’s leave it for now.” Song Shuhang placed the sealing pillar back into its box.","Then, he shook his hand a bit—the explosion of the red skull had quite a bit of power, enough to make his palm tingle and even redden slightly."]},{"number":2933,"title":"Chapter 2933: Killing Two Birds with One Stone, Pushing Boundaries!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2933: Killing Two Birds with One Stone, Pushing Boundaries!","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","After putting the sealed pillar containing the “Immortal Small Iron Particle” back into the box, Song Shuhang gestured for the Ball Shuhang to shrink down and perch on the other side of his shoulder.","Receiving the signal, the Ball Shuhang leaped into the air, its form melting and spreading out—by the time it landed on Song Shuhang, it had transformed into a flowing trench coat made of liquid metal.","Song Shuhang was taken aback and lightly swayed in the newly donned Ball Shuhang coat. It was simply too cool!","The flowing effect of the coat seemed like it had special effects, making his figure appear more slender, with a design that emphasized the length of his body. The liquid metal sleeves could also be extended at will, perfectly complementing his “Sleeve Within the Universe” spell.","On top of that, this coat had the strength of a “Nine Serenities Ruler” level body, making it the very “robe” Song Shuhang had always dreamed of.","“If only this Ball Shuhang was truly my avatar,” Song Shuhang thought to himself again.","Twitch, twitch Phoenix Sword Master’s claw, originally standing on Song Shuhang’s shoulder, was now planted on the “Ball Shuhang Coat,” trembling at a steady rate of 25 hertz.","After shaking for a moment, she couldn’t take it anymore and chose to fly to the top of Song Shuhang’s head, landing behind Senior Chu’s cowlick.","“Ahh, much better here,” Phoenix Sword Master said with a sigh of relief.","Senior Chu’s cowlick:","Just moments ago, Song Shuhang, with his cool new coat, had his charm score boosted by +10, but thanks to the claw on his head, it suddenly dropped by -11.","To top it off, there was the “Spiritual Ghost Fairy Edition Su Clan’s Sixteen” cloak floating around his neck, distorting the overall vibe of his look.","However, Song Shuhang didn’t pay much attention to these minor details.","After picking up the “Ball Shuhang New Year’s Gift Box,” he stepped through the space gate.","Back at Song Shuhang’s old home in Wenzhou City.","Senior White and Soft Feather were waiting on the other side of the space gate for Song Shuhang’s arrival.","Soft Feather was joyfully playing with Little Lingxiao, while the shrunken Li Yinzhu lay napping on Senior White’s shoulder.","Joseph, having just passed through the space gate, was still recovering. Due to his weaker cultivation, the spatial transfer left him feeling dizzy and nauseous.","“Huh? Senior Song looks pretty dashing today,” Soft Feather remarked as she happily approached, handing him a small red box. “Happy New Year, Senior Song!”","Her gaze was locked on the “Ball Shuhang Coat” that Song Shuhang was wearing, examining it with curiosity.","“For me?” Song Shuhang blinked, somewhat surprised.","Soft Feather had always called him “Senior Song,” and over time, Song Shuhang had indeed become a senior figure to her.","So, Song Shuhang had never expected to receive a New Year’s gift from Soft Feather this year!","“Mhm! When Senior White and I were on our way back from bringing back the ‘Jade Pool,’ we happened to find a treasure chest along the way. Inside, there were several pieces of equipment, one of which seemed perfect for Senior Song!” Soft Feather said, putting her hands behind her back and laughing cheerfully. “Open it and see.”","The Spiritual Ghost Fairy, controlling Su Clan’s Sixteen, leaned over curiously to take a look.","Song Shuhang took the box and opened it.","Inside was a jade hairpin, nothing too fancy, maybe around the fourth tier in quality.","But these kinds of items were more for decoration rather than combat.","“Senior Song, sometimes you maintain long hair, so I thought this jade hairpin would suit you!” Soft Feather explained.","“Thank you, Soft Feather. Happy New Year to you, too.” Song Shuhang happily accepted the gift. This was, in a true sense, the most normal “New Year’s gift” he had received.","He couldn’t help but take a picture of the gift Soft Feather had given him and post it on his social media, tagging each of his seniors from the Nine Provinces Number One Group. His hint was anything but subtle—look, even Soft Feather gave me a New Year’s gift; seniors of the Nine Provinces Number One Group, take note!","After posting, Song Shuhang put away the hairpin and looked at Soft Feather with a smile—should he prepare a return gift?","Soft Feather was different from the other seniors in the group... she wasn’t a senior herself.","Later, when they celebrated the New Year, he and Senior Huangshan had prepared a group gift for the members: a substance that would enhance the spirits of the artifacts.","But that was a group red envelope, which had a different meaning.","“The Seal of the Wealth Dispersing Throne~” The Spiritual Ghost Fairy, in the form of Su Clan’s Sixteen, whispered in Song Shuhang’s ear, reminding him.","“Huh? Ah! We missed out on at least a billion! Senior White, we lost out on at least a billion!” Song Shuhang suddenly exclaimed.","Soft Feather and Senior White were equally confused.","“The Wealth Dispersing Throne’s betting ceremony, we messed up the sequence!” Song Shuhang lamented, “Back when I advanced to Tribulation Immortal after slashing my three corpses, I shouldn’t have rushed to face the heavenly tribulation immediately. Instead, I should have gone straight to find Senior Three-Eyed Youth for a round of betting!”","The Tribulation Immortal realm was the last chance for him to make a wager with Senior Three-Eyed Youth.","After winning a round of wealth, he could have transferred the “Wealth Dispersing Throne Mark” to Senior White, letting him go for another round with Senior Three-Eyed Youth...","Then, after Senior White’s gamble, he could have advanced to Tribulation Immortal... another round of betting.","“In this way, with a triple combo, we could have emptied Senior Three-Eyed Youth’s pockets,” Song Shuhang explained.","“Sounds interesting,” Senior White said.","“I think it’s fun, too,” Soft Feather agreed.","“Are you the devil?” The Nine Serenities Ruler, Senior Three-Eyed Youth, read Song Shuhang’s words through the “Wealth Dispersing Throne Mark” and felt as though he were a fake ruler of the Nine Serenities.","But at the same time, he was comforted by the thought that there was a successor—Song Shuhang, after all, was half a “Nine Serenities Ruler” himself and was truly dedicated to the role.","“Unfortunately, Senior White has already advanced to Tribulation Immortal,” Song Shuhang remarked.","Senior White, holding Li Yinzhu, said, “No worries~ For me, the process of the betting ceremony is the fun part. Later, if we have time, I’ll join you to visit that senior and finish your last round of bets.”","“Awesome, and I happen to have something I want, which I hope I can get from Senior Three-Eyed Youth,” an idea popped into Song Shuhang’s head.","The prizes for the “Cultivation Chat Group’s New Year’s Event—Capture the ‘Red Demon Skull’ or ‘Virtual Sun Guardian’!”","He needed treasures that would catch the interest of Longevity Seekers or those shaping the path to longevity through the Tribulation Immortal stage—and in sufficient quantities.","Senior Three-Eyed Youth might just have such treasures.","If his plan worked, he could complete his “wealth dispersal” agreement with Senior Three-Eyed Youth under the guise of the New Year’s event.","Two birds with one stone!","And after winning from Senior Three-Eyed Youth, he could transfer the “Wealth Dispersing Throne Mark” to the next contestant.","He turned to look at Soft Feather as he thought.","Soft Feather was one of the luckiest participants—during the “Tractor Pulling Competition,” she encountered way more “speed boosts” and “return to start traps” than anyone else.","If she inherited the Wealth Dispersing Throne, she’d definitely be able to score even more goodies from Senior Three-Eyed Youth."]},{"number":2934,"title":"Chapter 2934: Do you want to be happier?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2934: Do you want to be happier?","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Moreover, Yu Rouzi’s advancement was just as rapid as Su Clan’s Sixteen, who had the assistance of Senior White Dragon and Fairy Susu.","Advancing quickly meant shorter intervals between her challenges with the “Three-Eyed Senior,” yielding high rewards.","And unlike penniless Song Shuhang, Yu Rouzi was the sole heir to the “Lingdie Island.” From the start, she could offer substantial stakes for her bets with the Three-Eyed Senior.","A good choice indeed.","“Yu Rouzi, after the New Year’s feast, I’ve got a gift for you too,” Song Shuhang said, revealing the “Scattering Wealth King’s Mark” on his hand. “Once the feast is over, I’ll team up with Senior White to conclude my final bet with the Three-Eyed Senior. After that, I’ll hand this mark over to you!”","“Thank you, Senior Song!” Yu Rouzi responded happily.","After putting away the gift for Yu Rouzi, Song Shuhang turned to look at Senior White—finally, the highlight of his New Year’s celebration had arrived!","He looked at Senior White expectantly.","Senior White looked confused.","Song Shuhang was shocked.","Did Senior White forget to prepare a New Year’s gift for me?","After being handed a stack of RMB by the generous Yellow Mountain Senior, Senior White was Song Shuhang’s last hope for comfort within the “Nine Provinces Number One Group.”","“Oh, right.” Senior White, holding Baby Sound Bamboo in his arms, reached into his pocket and pulled out a thin red envelope, handing it to Song Shuhang. “Happy New Year, Shuhang.”","A thin, paper envelope.","But since it was a New Year’s gift from Senior White, it was bound to be something extraordinary.","Song Shuhang believed that no matter how thin the envelope was, it had to be special.","“Can I open it now?” Song Shuhang asked cautiously.","“Go ahead,” Senior White nodded.","Carefully, Song Shuhang slid open the envelope—experience taught him to be gentle, as tearing it too quickly might damage the contents.","After opening it, Song Shuhang pulled out the paper inside.","[A New Year’s Gift for Shuhang: 100,000 Ninth-Level Spirit Stones.]","[Amount deducted from the owed balance.]","[Signed: Ah Bai]","[Date: January 24, 2020]","It was a handwritten note from Senior White, with beautiful calligraphy that matched his appearance.","More importantly, this piece of paper was worth a fortune!","Tears of joy welled up in Song Shuhang’s eyes.","Senior White was always so generous—even for something as small as New Year’s, he gifted 100,000 Ninth-Level Spirit Stones!","This was the most valuable New Year’s gift he had received.","“Are you happy?” Senior White asked.","“Very happy!” Song Shuhang replied, touched—how could he not be? He would carefully store this note in the deepest part of his Core World, treating it like a family heirloom. He couldn’t let anything happen to it—after all, it represented 100,000 Ninth-Level Spirit Stones!","“As long as you’re happy.” Senior White nodded in satisfaction.","Palace Master Chu’s single hair strand peeked at the note and almost choked with laughter—Senior White’s New Year’s gift was entirely unexpected.","“100,000 Ninth-Level Spirit Stones? He owes that much?” Phoenix Saber Master exclaimed in surprise. And it seemed like 100,000 Ninth-Level Spirit Stones were only part of the debt that Tyrant Song owed Senior White.","Senior Red Sky Sword: “Shuhang owes a lot—I’ve lost track of how much exactly.”","Song Shuhang quickly cast “Knife-Nurturing Technique” twenty times on Senior Red Sky Sword to stop it from making any more painful remarks.","“Come on, let’s go see Fairy Snowflake. I’ll hand over the captured Year Beast to her.” Senior White, still holding Baby Sound Bamboo, started toward the Core World.","After taking a few steps, Senior White suddenly squinted, turning back to Song Shuhang. “Want to be even happier?”","“I do,” Song Shuhang answered honestly.","“Then, these two things are for you.” Senior White extended his hand, revealing two small, orb-enclosed miniature fairylands.","This was a technique similar to the “Palm-Sized Buddha Realm.”","The first fairyland was the “Jade Pool Fairyland” that Senior White and Yu Rouzi had brought back.","The other was a small fragment, containing only a “storage palace” and a lake fairyland. It also bore the aura of the Ancient Heavenly Court—a fragment of the Heavenly Court.","This was the second gift Senior White had prepared for Song Shuhang.","“On our way back after retrieving the ‘Jade Pool Fairyland,’ Yu Rouzi and I discovered this Heavenly Court fragment... Yes, Yu Rouzi’s treasure chest from earlier was placed right beside this fragment,” Senior White explained.","Yu Rouzi added, “This Heavenly Court fragment was originally guarded by several Fourth-Level puppets and was well hidden. Since it belonged to someone, we didn’t plan on taking it. But just as we were about to leave, all the puppets exploded, their heads blowing off—it was pretty intense... The fragment became ownerless, so we brought it back.”","“Puppets? Exploding?” Song Shuhang was stunned.","And considering the timing of Senior White and Yu Rouzi’s return, coupled with his own experiences...","Could it be a coincidence?","“What a coincidence?” Palace Master Chu’s single hair strand commented.","“We were just about to rescue Joseph when Song Shuhang’s clone managed to destroy a puppeteer who had previously caused trouble for Song Shuhang—that guy was well-hidden and probably lucky enough to inherit some puppeteering legacy. He had puppet clones stationed in several locations across the heavens and the world. Afterward, Song Shuhang’s clone severed the puppeteer’s root, causing all his puppet clones to explode,” Stone Tablet Senior elaborated.","Yu Rouzi blinked. “So, it’s the same guy?”","She glanced at Senior White—he truly lived up to his reputation as a walking good-luck charm. Senior White’s luck was just inevitable.","“But this small fragment is locked,” Senior White said, picking out the fragment and handing it to Song Shuhang. “To open it, you’ll need a matching key. If you try to force it open, it will trigger the ‘defense mechanism,’ causing the entire fragment to explode and destroy all the treasures inside.”","Upon closer inspection, the Heavenly Court fragment, shrunk down by the “Palm-Sized Buddha Realm” technique, had a circular imprint at the entrance... it needed a specific key to unlock it.","Additionally, Song Shuhang vaguely sensed the presence of the Heavenly Emperor within the palace—could this be related to her, a part of her Heavenly Emperor’s Palace?","“A key?” Palace Master Chu’s single hair strand immediately pointed towards Joseph.","If she remembered correctly, the rough puppet that had captured Joseph earlier had been interrogating him about a “key disk.”","Song Shuhang also turned to his potential disciple.","Under the influence of Senior White’s luck, all the prerequisites seemed to be falling into place!","“Joseph, come take a look at this,” Song Shuhang called.","Joseph jogged over.","“Look at the small circular hole in front of the palace. Does it seem familiar? Do you recall anything that could fit perfectly inside?” Song Shuhang asked.","“Master, I’ve never played with models,” Joseph replied. He was a proper man!","Song Shuhang was speechless.","This is a “Palm-Sized Buddha Realm,” not a model!"]},{"number":2935,"title":"Chapter 2935: Dadazi, Are You Trying to Stir Things Up?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2935: Dadazi, Are You Trying to Stir Things Up?","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Joseph’s expression made it all too clear—he seemed to think that people who play with models aren’t serious.","If both master and disciple could read faces like this, how could he, Tyrannical Song, keep any secrets in the future?","Maybe he should make wearing a mask part of the sect’s tradition. Anyone who joins Song’s sect would wear a half-mask as a sign of identity.","However, after imagining the scene, Song Shuhang shook his head. An entire sect wearing masks would look way too outlandish.","With a sigh, he explained to Joseph, “This isn’t just a small model. It’s actually a real miniature palace, shrunk down by Senior White using the ‘Palm-Sized Buddha Kingdom’ technique.”","Joseph asked, “Can you use this technique, Master?”","“Nope,” Song Shuhang replied without hesitation.","Joseph immediately praised, “A technique even my Master can’t use—it’s incredible!”","Song Shuhang was confused.","Just because I can’t use a technique doesn’t mean it’s automatically amazing.","“Master, could you enlarge this model so we can see it better?” Joseph asked—truthfully, he couldn’t make out the details of the door after it was shrunk by the Palm-Sized Buddha Kingdom technique, let alone the holes on it.","After all, he was just a beginner who had barely gathered a wisp of ‘Holy Light’ and hadn’t even opened his Eye Acupuncture Point.","“Let’s move to the Core World,” Song Shuhang suggested.","The fragments of the Heavenly Court and the Jade Pool would have to be sent to the Core World sooner or later, so they might as well be sent now, where they could be restored.","Core World.","Song Shuhang, Senior White, Feather Soft, and Joseph entered the Core World.","“Senior White, please release the Palm-Sized Buddha Kingdom technique,” Song Shuhang requested.","Senior White gestured, and the two ‘ancient Heavenly Court fragments’ floated into the air.","The ‘Core Little Assistant’ appeared, catching the two fragments and placing them in the peripheral area of the Core World. The ancient Heavenly Court fragments could forcibly expand the Core World’s territory, so the thoughtful Little Assistant wasn’t going to miss this opportunity.","Once the fragments were placed at the perimeter, Senior White reversed the effects of the Palm-Sized Buddha Kingdom technique.","The enormous Jade Pool expanded back to its original size, stretching the Core World’s boundaries.","The smaller ‘palace fragment’ also slightly increased the Core World’s territory.","Song Shuhang and Joseph landed in front of the ‘palace fragment’s’ door.","“This is spectacular,” Joseph remarked, looking up at the nearly twenty-meter-high door.","That tiny model could transform into such a gigantic palace—could it be that this Senior White was an even more powerful immortal than his Master?","“Look at that round hole in the disk, and try to remember it well,” Song Shuhang instructed.","“Yes, Master,” Joseph responded.","He stood before the enormous palace door, deep in thought.","A few moments later...","Pavilion Master Chu’s hair strand asked, “Have you remembered anything?”","“Master, I was thinking... If we learned this Palm-Sized Buddha Kingdom technique, couldn’t we just make model houses and then enlarge them? We’d be rich!” Joseph said excitedly.","Song Shuhang was startled.","You stared at it all this time, and that’s all you came up with?","Do you want me to smack you right now?","“Master, I’ve never handled a stone disk key this large before! And look at this disk; it’s at least a meter deep, with a diameter of two meters. Even if it was placed next to me, there’s no way I could move such a huge stone,” Joseph explained.","“That’s true,” the Stone Tablet agreed.","Joseph was just a regular guy who had gathered a wisp of ‘Holy Light.’ He wasn’t gifted with superhuman strength.","“But he was captured by that puppet, and it’s still interrogating him,” the handsome windbreaker-clad version of Fat Ball commented. “That puppet wouldn’t just grab someone at random, so there must be some clue.”","Senior Akasaguru added, “Could someone have disguised themselves as Joseph and then taken the stone disk key?”","“Senior Copper Trigram?” Feather Soft blurted out.","After all, Senior Copper Trigram had a shady past—he’d once disguised himself as a member of the ‘Nine Provinces Number One Group’ and spread misfortune, blaming it on the group members.","Even though Joseph wasn’t a member of the ‘Nine Provinces Number One Group,’ he was Song Shuhang’s disciple, so he might have made it onto Senior Copper Trigram’s ‘black disguise list.’","“Let’s not jump to conclusions. If it comes to that, I’ll just spill some blood,” Song Shuhang said, rolling up his sleeves.","They say that shedding a little blood every month is good for your health.","“Wait, Master!” Suddenly, Joseph’s eyes lit up. He pointed at the disk and said, “I’ve never seen such a large stone disk before, but I have seen that strange crown symbol in the middle!”","It was a symbol of a flat crown and a throne, similar to the Merit Flat Crown that Song Shuhang had given to the Merit Snake Beauty.","“Where did you see it?” Song Shuhang asked.","“When I was heading to the New Year’s Eve feast you hosted, I stopped at a highway rest area and found a car key with that crown and scepter symbol. I was curious about what kind of car it belonged to, so I remember it clearly,” Joseph replied.","“A car key? And then?” Song Shuhang prompted.","“Since I found it at a highway rest area, I was worried the owner might have trouble finding it, so I handed it over to the staff on duty,” Joseph explained. “If that key is the one we’re talking about, then I’ve been wronged. I got beaten up for nothing! If they’d just mentioned a car key, I would’ve remembered right away. How was I supposed to know they meant a stone disk key?”","Song Shuhang:","“Which rest area was it?” Senior White asked.","“Zhujie,” Joseph answered.","“I’ll go take a look. Be right back,” Senior White said.","With that, Senior White’s figure vanished into thin air.","“Master, that Senior was really good-looking—way more handsome than you,” Joseph whispered, sidling up to Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Are you begging for a beating?","When I officially take you on as a disciple, I’ll make sure your training is full of... ‘challenges.’","“No, no, wait—I mean, you aren’t as good-looking as that Senior. No, that’s not right—I mean that Senior is more good-looking than you. No, I mean...” Joseph stammered, getting more flustered with each word.","Song Shuhang gently patted Joseph on the shoulder. “Your body tempering liquid for next month is canceled.”","“Senior Song, what do you think might be inside this palace?” Feather Soft asked from the side.","“Probably... a celestial boat? The Heavenly Emperor’s celestial boat?” Song Shuhang guessed.","After all, it was a car key.","As they were speaking, Senior White returned, emerging from thin air.","He held the key with the ‘crown and scepter’ emblem.","And, no kidding, it really did look just like a car key.","And to open the door, you didn’t even have to insert this car key into the stone disk.","Senior White pressed a button on the key.","Rumble","The palace door slowly opened.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Are you kidding me?","If it was a remote-controlled door, why did you bother carving a hole in the stone disk? Were you just trying to stir things up?","As the door creaked open, a golden throne was revealed to everyone inside.","The Heavenly Emperor’s Throne!"]},{"number":2936,"title":"Chapter 2936: I, Tyrannical Song, May Be Lacking in Power, But I Have a Group of Almighty Seniors","paragraphs":["Chapter 2936: I, Tyrannical Song, May Be Lacking in Power, But I Have a Group of Almighty Seniors","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","To be precise, this should be the backup Heavenly Emperor Throne.","It was the “Heavenly Emperor Throne Two” model.","The main seat should be in the exclusive palace of the Heavenly Emperor. Every time Song Shuhang used the virtuous lamia to project the image of the ancient Heavenly City for defense, he would see the most imposing palace at the center of the Heavenly City.","“I thought it was the Celestial Thearch’s personal immortal boat. I didn’t expect it to be a throne,” Song Shuhang said with some regret. Ever since he experienced Senior White Two’s “Myriad Worlds Piercing Immortal Shuttle,” Song Shuhang had also wished to own a top-notch immortal shuttle.","It was one thing whether he could afford it or not, but it was also very pleasing to the eye to keep it at home.","Moreover, he already had a throne.","The Thorn Crown + Endurance Throne combination, the Life-saving Survival Set.","It was much more practical than the “Heavenly Emperor Throne Two,” which was only good-looking.","At this time, Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword smiled and said, “Actually, this might not be a throne. It might be”","“Fellow Daoist Scarlet Heaven Sword, be careful with your words. Tiandi Zi will still be resurrected,” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet hurriedly reminded him.","“Don’t continue on this topic. Shuhang is still young, and he doesn’t want to die,” Pavilion Master Chu said, still in a daze.","Song Shuhang was confused.","“Seniors, what are you talking about? Why is it suddenly related to my death?”","As they were talking, the lotus projection of the Inner World impatiently extended over and shamelessly licked the Heavenly Emperor Throne Two.","“Stop! Wait a moment,” Song Shuhang stopped the Inner World from licking the “Heavenly Emperor’s path to immortality.”","In a while, the Island Master would transfer his portion of the ancient Heavenly City fragment over. Song Shuhang had promised to take good care of his fragment of the Heavenly City.","Therefore, before that, he had to train his Inner World to temporarily control its licking behavior.","After receiving Song Shuhang’s order, the lotus projection could only reluctantly retreat, turning back three times with every step it took.","“Core Assistant, move the neighboring Jade Lake Immortal Realm to the fragment of the ancient Heavenly City as well. It will provide assistance to the Great Northern Emperor and the others in their operation later. As for the Heavenly Emperor’s Throne Palace, keep it for now. It’s just a small fragment anyway,” Song Shuhang said. “It’s not appropriate to expose something like the Heavenly Emperor’s throne to the members of the ancient Heavenly City.”","“I already saw it,” Zither Master Fengyi said.","“I already saw it,” the virtuous lamia’s voice came from Song Shuhang’s stomach. She repeated Zither Master Fengyi’s words.","“I saw it too. If I saw it, it means Sixteen saw it. If Sixteen saw it, it means Big Sister White Dragon saw it,” Sixteen Cape said.","“I saw it, which means my Lord saw it too,” Senior Turtle appeared beside him at some point and reminded him.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“If you all saw it, then why would I hide it?”","“Then let’s close this palace for now.” Senior White stretched out his hand and pressed on the key.","Then, the palace door slowly closed.","Senior White casually threw the key to Song Shuhang.","“Eh? Was it made of spirit stones? No wonder it was called the stone key. There’s nothing wrong with the spirit stone.” When Song Shuhang took the key, he could tell what material it was made of just by touching it.","Moreover, this was at least a spirit stone of the Ninth Stage.","After thinking for a moment, Song Shuhang instructed, “Little Assistant Core, record this key... The next time I spend money on it, be careful not to spend too much.”","“Recording complete” the Core Assistant replied.","Song Shuhang gently caressed this key made of a spirit stone of the Ninth Stage. This was probably the only spirit stone item he could preserve at the moment.","Senior White looked at the time and said, “Let’s go. We don’t have much time left. Let’s go find Fairy Bie Xue!”","“The countdown for the New Year is the fireworks event. Senior White and I are going to do the countdown~ I have to go back,” Soft Feather raised her hand and said happily.","In the past, she spent the New Year on Spirit Butterfly Island. Moreover, it wasn’t held every year. After all, the New Year was not a holiday that cultivators cared much about. Sometimes, Venerable Spirit Butterfly would miss it if he stayed in seclusion for too long.","This was the first time Soft Feather had spent the New Year with so many people in the Nine Provinces Number One Group. Therefore, she was especially happy and excited.","Inner World, Lakeview Villa Planning Area","Immortal Fairy Bie Xue was busy at the location of the Heavenly City fragment in Cafeteria No. 111. Chu Chu and Little Cai were helping her. In addition, the Puppet Fairy was also assisting Immortal Fairy Bie Xue.","On the side, the members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group who were visiting the fragment of the Heavenly City had also returned one by one, waiting for the final New Year’s ceremony.","Senior Yellow Mountain had also arranged a program.","After the countdown ended, the New Year banquet would begin, and the program would also start.","At this moment, on the lawn by the lake, several young figures were playing and running.","Abbot Profound Principle had brought Little Guoguo, Fairy Lychee had brought Loli Shi and Loli Zhu, True Monarch Tyrant Flood Dragon had brought a little princess, who was Yu Jiaojiao’s younger sister, Cave Lord Snow Wolf had brought two little wolves, and Doudou, who was clearly already at the Fifth Stage Realm, could still play with the little wolves.","Shi and Zhu’s laughter, the little wolf’s cries, Yu Jiaojiao’s little sister’s babbling, and Little Guoguo’s miserable cries all rang out.","Cave Lord Snow Wolf transformed into his true form and laid on the edge of the lawn, dozing off as he watched these devilish children.","Abbot Profound Principle sat next to Cave Lord Snow Wolf and clasped his hands together. Since he cultivated Silent Meditation and wouldn’t speak under normal circumstances, he might as well look after the children with Cave Lord Snow Wolf.","At the lakeside, Fairy Lychee, Fairy Sixth Cultivator of True Virtue, and Fairy Firefly were sitting on the shore, gently swaying their feet in the lake. They were talking about something in soft voices, and from time to time, a burst of pleasant laughter could be heard.","At the edge of the forest, Medicine Master and Riverly Purple Mist were sitting under a tree. They were holding a large newspaper in their hands, blocking everyone’s line of sight. They were trying to cover something up. It was unknown if Andeli was doing something that required the Holy Knight’s Holy Light to shine.","In the past, Senior Medicine Master would always exchange alchemy techniques with Senior Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue, Senior Yellow Mountain, Senior White, and the others. However, recently, he only talked about whether the dog food was good or not and gave up his main business.","Behind them, the originally bare tree could no longer bear it anymore. Beautiful plum blossoms bloomed, setting off Medicine Master and Riverly Purple Mist.","On the temporary stage, Senior Yellow Mountain and Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue were working together to set up a huge calendar. At the last second of the New Year, they had to tear off the last page of the calendar and open a new chapter for the year.","On the side of the stage, the scholarly faction’s Venerable Eternal Fire was writing a couplet with his brush, while the scholarly faction’s Mister Jade Zither was grinding ink for the Venerable. Heaven Hiding Hook Zhou Li was also serving Senior Eternal Fire as if he were his father-in-law, handing over the couplet paper to him. After all, if he wanted to marry Fairy Yuqin, he had to build a good relationship with Senior Eternal Fire.","Dharma King Creation, Fairy Dongfang Six, and Palace Master Seven Lives Talisman were adjusting the electronic equipment, making the final preparations for the stage of the upcoming New Year’s Banquet.","True Monarch White Crane and Young Master Phoenix Slayer, who were in their fairy forms, were setting up the table. True Monarch White Crane was full of energy, but Young Master Phoenix Slayer was a little lazy. Winter had arrived, and he especially wanted to curl up next to the heater and roast his cat fur. He didn’t want to move.","Not far away, Seven was slashing at Thrice Reckless.","Thrice Reckless jumped up and down. Su Clan’s Seven’s face was ferocious, and he looked like an evil ghost that had just stepped out of hell. He had the aura of someone who wanted to chop Thrice Reckless into pieces for the new year.","Mama Song and Papa Song didn’t know the truth and thought this was a rehearsal for the New Year’s program. They sat together with the other members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group and acted as spectators. From time to time, they would cheer and applaud loudly.","Only the reliable Senior Northern River quietly spread out a bed and took out a healing pill.","“What a harmonious scene.” As soon as Song Shuhang entered, he saw Seven chopping Thrice Reckless, and his heart warmed up. Everyone was happy.","After seeing Song Shuhang, Senior White, Soft Feather, and the others, Immortal Fairy Bie Xue waved her hand and said, “Over here, Fellow Daoist White!”","Senior White and Soft Feather walked over, preparing to hand over the secret surprise for the New Year’s banquet the “year beast.”","Song Shuhang wanted to follow them, but Zhu ran over and tugged at his windbreaker.","“Senior Brother Song, Senior Brother Song!” Zhu called out.","“What’s the matter?” Song Shuhang asked as he picked her up.","“Where’s the snow? Isn’t it supposed to snow during the New Year?” Loli Zhu asked.","If there was no snow during the New Year, could it still be called the New Year?","“Snow?” Song Shuhang sighed. “It’s snowing all over the country, but I’m the only one in Wenzhou who doesn’t see any snow.”","Since he was young, he had only seen snow a few times in Wenzhou.","Fortunately, he was a cultivator now.","“Fairy Dongfang Snow, let’s make Wenzhou’s first snow of 2020!” Song Shuhang loudly called for help.","He, Tyrannical Song, had killed a Tribulation Transcender with three corpses. Yet, he had so many seniors one of them would surely be able to make it snow.","“Even though my Daoist name has the word ‘Xue’ in it, I don’t know how to make it snow. I’m not of the ice attribute,” Fairy Dongfang Snow replied. “Your name is Song Shuhang, but do you know how to write books?”","“I know how to read,” Song Shuhang replied earnestly.","“Actually, my master is an ice and snow type,” Senior Turtle reminded him.","Song Shuhang’s eyes lit up.","The Great Northern Emperor was not only an ice element cultivator but also a big shot who had stepped onto the path of immortality with the ice element.","So, he used the Cultivation Chat System to contact the Great Northern Emperor.","“I’m not available right now,” the senior from the north said. “I’m the Great Emperor Chang Sheng. Do you think I’d make it snow for you just like that? What about my dignity?”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","You’re the Great Emperor Chang Sheng, yet you’ve done things like peeping at screens. Why can’t you make it snow?","“In that case, what should I do to make Senior Beifang lose face?” Song Shuhang asked directly.","His life experience had taught him that as long as the price was right, anyone could set aside their dignity.","Especially the Almighty Merchant if the spirit stones were in place, he’d sell his face repeatedly.","“It’s not happening,” the Great Northern Emperor replied.","He was the one who valued face the most among the four great emperors of the celestial heavens.","“Yes, Senior Northside, did you happen to see the newly acquired ‘Heavenly Emperor Throne Two’ through Senior Turtle?” Song Shuhang asked, already knowing the answer.","The Great Northern Emperor was speechless.","“Anyway, since you’ve already seen it, I can lend the throne to you,” Song Shuhang smiled and said. “Let’s have Wenzhou City’s first snow of 2020!”"]},{"number":2937,"title":"Chapter 2937: If You’re Unhappy, Come Bite Me!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2937: If You’re Unhappy, Come Bite Me!","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","So, just a few minutes later...","Heavy snow began to fall over Wenzhou City, the kind of snow that many young residents of Wenzhou had never seen in their lifetimes. It was the legendary kind of snow perfect for making snowballs, having snowball fights, building snowmen, and rolling around in the snow—enough to make most of Wenzhou’s residents transform into ecstatic huskies, frolicking in the snowy wonderland!","The snowfall blanketed every corner of Wenzhou City, and under the meticulous control of the Northern Emperor, it precisely settled on the lakeside lawn of Song Shuhang’s Core World. At that moment, there was a gateway connecting the Core World to the real world, allowing the Northern Emperor’s power to pass through.","The snow quickly accumulated, covering the grassy area around the lake with a thick layer. And the snowfall didn’t show any sign of letting up? it just kept coming down like money wasn’t an issue!","Under the influence of the Northern Emperor’s magic, the temperature in the area dropped dramatically, causing the lake to freeze over with a thick layer of ice.","“Snow Wolf, it’s too much, that’s enough,” called out Sixteen, Lychee Fairy, and Liu Ying, who had been playfully dipping their bare feet in the lake water.","The ice was forming so quickly that the three fairies found their feet trapped in it, unable to move—though, with their cultivation levels, they weren’t exactly bothered by the cold.","“It wasn’t me, I swear! Don’t accuse me falsely!” grumbled Snow Wolf Cave Lord, who was himself buried under a thick pile of snow.","Next to him was Master Tong Xuan, half-buried in the snow with his head, shoulders, and part of his body completely covered.","The little ones who had begged Song Shuhang for snow were now completely buried under it, with only their little heads sticking out, shivering from the cold.","They looked like they were learning to swim, slowly moving through the snow... Occasionally, they had to pop out like a whale breaching the surface, gasping for fresh air.","“It was a senior I invited who brought this snow, but he’s too proud to admit it,” Song Shuhang explained. “Even though he was tempted by my treasure to create this snow, his actions clearly show he’s holding a grudge against me.”","The snow was coming down so heavily—there was no way the Northern Emperor wasn’t doing it on purpose.","Such pride.","“Ah Song, heads up!” Suddenly, Li Yinzhu’s voice rang out— the little one who had been dozing off on Senior White’s lap earlier was now wide awake and full of energy.","Song Shuhang turned his head just in time to see a massive, two-meter-wide snowball flying straight at him.","Hold on! This isn’t playing snowball fights anymore!","With his current level as a Tribulation Transcender, Song Shuhang could easily dodge the snowball... but seeing the eager look on Li Yinzhu’s face, he could only smile and let the snowball hit him squarely in the face.","It didn’t hurt at all.","Boom!","The massive snowball smashed into Song Shuhang and shattered into pieces.","Thunk! Something hard seemed to hit Song Shuhang’s head with a dull thud.","He reached out and grabbed a small metallic figure that had been hidden inside the snowball—a mechanical girl...","The little ones had completely underestimated just how tough Tyrant Song’s skull was. The mechanical girl’s eyes were now flickering like strobe lights, and her internal circuits were close to short-circuiting.","As soon as Song Shuhang released his grip, the mechanical girl rolled into his arms, wobbling back and forth like a roly-poly toy.","“I told you sneaking up on Shuhang wouldn’t work. We’d only end up hurting ourselves. We should have hidden something nastier inside the snowball instead,” said Doudou from the snow.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Only someone as childish as Doudou could come up with such an idea.","But provoking me was your biggest mistake this year, Doudou. Don’t start crying later!","“Chuchu!” Song Shuhang suddenly called out.","Chuchu looked up in his direction, confused. “Master?”","“Since you joined me as my disciple, I haven’t had the chance to give you a Daoist title. I’ve had seven titles in the past, and while ‘Virtuous Gentleman Saber’ was passed down to Little Cai, today I’m giving you a new title—’Seeker Scholar.’ When you decided to follow me, it was to ‘seek the Dao,’ to find an opportunity for enlightenment. This title suits you well. From today, you shall be known as Seeker Fairy. Witness this, everyone,” Song Shuhang announced solemnly.","Chuchu was caught completely off guard by her master’s sudden decision to give her a title.","But to her, it was like receiving the best New Year’s gift ever.","A Daoist title held special significance for a cultivator.","And when it was a meaningful title, it symbolized that the disciple’s fate was tied to their master’s.","“Thank you, Master, for bestowing this title upon me,” Chuchu said, bowing deeply.","As she bowed, she felt an immense wave of fortune and virtue settle upon her.","Tyrant Song, known for his boundless merit, was a figure whose virtue was unmatched across the heavens. Being his disciple, receiving a title from him meant being blessed with great fortune.","Chuchu felt a lightness in her body, and even her cultivation and Daoist heart seemed to improve!","This was the benefit of having a powerful master—being accepted as a disciple, receiving a title, and eventually graduating brought significant advantages.","“Focus on your cultivation. If you have any questions, you can use the ‘Cultivation Chat’ to ask the seniors in the ‘Nine Provinces Number One Group,’” Song Shuhang said earnestly.","Then he looked at Doudou. “Doudou, look—there’s one less Chuchu now!”","Doudou was bewildered. “Huh?”","“From today onwards, she’s Seeker Fairy!” Song Shuhang declared proudly.","As of today, the world has one less Chuchu and one more Seeker Fairy.","“You’re such a child! Woof!” Doudou barked angrily.","Song Shuhang chuckled. “I’m her master. I have the right to do this. If you’re upset, come bite me!”","Repent, Doudou.","“If you’re still upset, I’ll post an announcement on the ‘Cultivation Chat’ to recruit a hundred cultivators named ‘Chuchu’ from across the realms to become my disciples. Then, one by one, I’ll give them all new titles... and just like that, the realms will have a hundred fewer Chuchus,” Song Shuhang said mischievously.","“Woof!” Doudou growled, charging at Song Shuhang.","“Doudou, don’t fall for his taunt! If you bite him, you’ll only hurt yourself!” Poet Loli quickly grabbed Doudou and warned him.","Song Shuhang laughed heartily. “Hahaha!”","*Thwack*—a tuft of hair from Pavilion Master Chu’s clone swatted his head. “How old are you? Stop acting like a kid. You’re a Tribulation Transcender—why are you arguing with children?”","“But Senior Chu, I’m just a few minutes away from turning nineteen,” Song Shuhang said.","*Thwack, thwack, thwack* Pavilion Master Chu’s tuft of hair kept smacking him.","“I’ll give you nineteen! I’ll give you nineteen!”","“It’s starting, it’s starting! Time to count down!” Yurouzi called out.","She and Senior White stepped onto the stage together.","The old year was about to end...","“Time flies,” Song Shuhang mused as he looked at Senior White and Yurouzi, recalling their first encounter and how he’d helped Senior White after he came out of seclusion.","A new year was about to begin!"]},{"number":2938,"title":"Chapter 2938: The Most Unforgettable Fireworks of That Winter","paragraphs":["Chapter 2938: The Most Unforgettable Fireworks of That Winter","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Are the fireworks ready?” asked Dog Head Tower Master, also known as Guo Da the Broken Sun Halberd.","Seven Lives Talisman Mansion Master replied, “Nowadays, fireworks are banned for environmental reasons.”","“But in Shuhang’s core world, it should be fine, right?” said Young Master Extinguishing Phoenix lazily.","Venerable Yellow Mountain sighed, “My bad. It’s been so long since I celebrated New Year’s like an ordinary person that I forgot to buy any fireworks or firecrackers. There’s still time to get some—who’s willing to make a trip?”","“I’ll go. I’ll be back in no time,” a voice replied.","“Great, as long as someone goes,” Yellow Mountain acknowledged.","Then... about two minutes later.","Young Master Extinguishing Phoenix suddenly added, “By the way, what about the fireworks? Wouldn’t it feel a bit lonely without them?”","Venerable Yellow Mountain hesitated. “Uh, I thought I asked someone to get them.”","“If there’s not enough time, I can imitate the sound of fireworks myself. I promise it’ll sound just like the real thing,” volunteered the Law King of Creation. “But don’t worry, I won’t sing.”","“Well... okay,” Yellow Mountain pondered. As long as the Law King doesn’t sing and just uses his vocal imitation skills, it should be fine. Plus, Shuhang has that Confucian Celestial Maiden with him, right? Her heavenly voice might even neutralize the Law King’s singing if it comes to that.","“The couplets are ready, start putting them up!” Venerable Everlasting Fire, with a flourish of his pen, nodded in satisfaction—this time, his calligraphy had surpassed expectations, with each character appearing as if it could leap off the page.","Zhou Li, the Sky-Hiding Hook, immediately led the way, sticking the couplets on the entrance to Song Shuhang’s home and several structures by the lake in the core world.","Daoist Stone Tablet explained, “Just these couplets alone from Senior Everlasting Fire can protect the house, warding off evil with their righteous energy.”","“They’re worth a lot of spirit stones,” added Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword with a chuckle.","Hearing this, Song Shuhang’s heart skipped a beat—he decided that after the New Year, he’d carefully collect every single one of those couplets.","Nearby, Fairy Dongfang Jingxue asked, “Senior Yellow Mountain, have you arranged for a dragon dance and lion dance? New Year’s wouldn’t be complete without those.”","“I’ve got it covered! Doudou!” Venerable Yellow Mountain called out.","Doudou responded, “What’s up?”","“Transform into your original form,” ordered Venerable Yellow Mountain.","“Okay,” Doudou obediently reverted to his original form.","“Freeze~” Venerable Yellow Mountain cast a freezing spell on Doudou with a wave of his finger.","Doudou was stunned.","“Alright, we’ve got our ‘lion’ for the dance. Little Guoguo, Shi, Zhu, and Xiaoyinzhu, you’re in charge of dancing with Doudou,” Venerable Yellow Mountain announced solemnly.","In his canine form, Doudou bore an uncanny resemblance to the traditional lion used in Chinese New Year’s lion dances.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“What about the dragon?” asked Northern River’s Loose Practitioner.","True Monarch Tyrant Flood Dragon silently pulled out his phone and opened the ‘Nine Provinces Number One Group,’ contemplating whether he should leave this group while he had the chance.","After all, among those present, he was the one most likely to be associated with a ‘dragon.’ Since Doudou had already become a lion dance prop, he feared he might be next.","“Don’t worry, Fellow Daoist Flood Dragon, I already arranged for the props yesterday... I contacted a lion dance and dragon dance team,” Venerable Yellow Mountain reassured.","Then he clapped his hands.","A familiar team of lions and tigers entered.","It was the same true dragon and true lion team that had appeared at Doudou’s wedding.","Back then, this lion and dragon team had lost a bet and had to serve as dance props.","But after that, they’d become famous.","Recently, they’d been getting hired for high prices to perform at various celebrations and weddings in the cultivation world, turning their misfortune into profit.","Venerable Yellow Mountain had also paid a hefty sum to hire them.","“Since you hired a professional team, why involve me?” Doudou protested.","Venerable Yellow Mountain smiled warmly. “It’s my blessing to you, Doudou. After this New Year, you’ll be leaving Yellow Mountain Manor to move into your own cave. Let this dragon and lion dance be your opening ceremony.”","Doudou was left speechless. Has Yellow Mountain gone off his meds again?","As the lion and dragon dance team took the stage, they began beating drums and gongs to liven up the atmosphere.","The four little ones grabbed hold of Doudou and joined the lion dance, filling the air with joyful laughter.","The mood reached a fever pitch.","“Nineteen!” Soft Feather called out loudly.","She raised her right hand and, with a flourish, shed her outer coat, revealing a form-fitting red qipao underneath.","With her striking figure and long legs, Soft Feather looked stunning in the traditional dress, a stark contrast to her usual youthful style.","The members of the ‘Nine Provinces Number One Group’ were taken aback by the transformation—it was like seeing a cute girl-next-door suddenly don a glamorous outfit. The difference was shocking.","At the same time, a giant clock appeared behind Soft Feather, with the second hand ticking steadily.","“Eighteen!” White Senior followed her lead, announcing the next number.","Everyone’s gaze shifted to White Senior—if Soft Feather had changed into a qipao, what about him?","White Senior calmly unbuttoned his coat and tossed it aside, revealing a red traditional Chinese robe underneath, his black hair flowing as if caught by an invisible wind.","Next to him, Soft Feather’s hair fluttered along with her movements, and instead of being overshadowed by White Senior’s presence, her aura harmonized with his.","It was clear that White Senior and Soft Feather had rehearsed this.","Holy Butterfly Sage felt a sudden wave of nostalgia, a sense of ‘my child has grown up.’","Without realizing it, his daughter had indeed matured.","She looked like her mother and had inherited his tall frame—a perfect combination of strengths.","“Seventeen!” Some of the group members began counting along with Soft Feather and White Senior, synchronizing with the clock’s second hand.","Even Song’s Mom and Dad joined in, blending into the festive atmosphere.","—Honestly, in recent years, New Year’s had always been joyful, but something had felt off, as if the happiness was just a little too forced.","Every year, the mind would tell the body, “It’s New Year’s, time to get excited.”","But deep inside, something was missing—the pure, simple joy of past New Year’s celebrations.","However, at this moment, mingling with the members of the ‘Nine Provinces Number One Group,’ Song’s parents felt like they were kids again. The atmosphere was pure and delightful, just like the old days.","“Ten!” When the countdown reached ten, everyone shouted with all their might.","It was as if they were releasing everything within them through their voices.","“Nine!”","“Three, two...”","“One!” Everyone in the core world shouted in unison as the final second ticked down.","White Senior and Soft Feather reached out and tore off the last page of the old calendar.","The old year was officially over.","The new year began at their fingertips.","Out with the old, in with the new.","*Cough.* The Law King of Creation cleared his throat, ready to perform his imitation—finally, it was his moment to shine!","*Boom!*","But before he could start, an earth-shattering explosion of fireworks resounded.","The noise was like rolling thunder, shaking the skies, echoing for miles, and exuding an overwhelming presence.","Just before the explosion, a blood-red beam of light shot up, piercing the core world’s sky.","Even the falling snow was swept away, leaving a clear space.","As the blood-red beam reached the clouds, it burst apart, turning into red raindrops that began to fall.","As they descended, the blood-red energy drops were continuously purified by the core world.","In an instant, they transformed into pure energy.","The Law King of Creation was dumbfounded. “???”","Who interrupted my performance?","Who stole my spotlight?","“Shuhang!”","“Senior Song!”","“Song Shuhang!”","“A’Song!”","Voices called out simultaneously.","That winter, the most unforgettable fireworks exploded in the core world.","The Tyrant’s brand.","It was the most luxurious fireworks display in all the heavens and realms—bar none!","This moment was destined to be recorded in the annals of the ‘Nine Provinces Number One Group’ as a major event.","The event would be titled: *Tyrant Song’s First New Year’s Blast, the First Death of Lunar 2020.*","In the void, the purified light rain turned into sparkling ruby-colored droplets, shimmering brightly.","These ruby-like energy droplets fell on everyone present.","Nourishing silently.","Everyone who was touched by the red rain felt as though they had taken a powerful elixir, their spiritual power strengthening and their mental fortitude increasing!","After all, this was the inheritance of a ‘Three Corpses Tribulation Immortal’ after self-detonation.","Everyone and everything present, including the spiritual plants in the core world, were nourished.","Venerable Yellow Mountain and the others looked at the scene in awe, while Fairy Dongfang Jingxue suddenly started crying. “A’Song, A’Song, don’t do anything rash!”","Venerable Yellow Mountain was speechless.","Fortunately, the red rain was harmless—everyone was able to take it in.","“What an intense tribulation,” Northern River’s Loose Practitioner commented.","Then everyone’s gazes turned to Song Shuhang.","After self-detonating, Senior Song was in the process of being ‘reborn.’","The Book of Eternity shone with a crimson light, slowly stitching his body back together.","His new body... seemed a bit taller and more slender, like a young man who had just hit a growth spurt.","He was also much more handsome he was literally radiating light.","Senior White and Soft Feather quickly rushed over.","They weren’t sure whether Song Shuhang was conscious, but they knew they had to act fast.","They wrapped Song Shuhang’s new body in a blanket.","After all, self-detonation stripped him of all his clothes.","Song Shuhang was reborn with a ‘bang,’ bringing a perfect end to the New Year’s countdown."]},{"number":2939,"title":"Chapter 2939: Heh Heh Heh, Gotcha!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2939: Heh Heh Heh, Gotcha!","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The Disaster Turtle Sister, who had been assigned to secretly monitor Song Shuhang, suddenly felt a strong premonition when Song Shuhang experienced his first explosion of the New Year!","There was an inexplicable bond between her and Song Shuhang, which led her to become Bà Sòng’s designated sentinel under the arrangement of Turtle Papa. If Bà Sòng were to die, she would sense it immediately.","However, a moment later, she sighed in relief—because Bà Sòng had honored their agreement. This time, when he died, nothing remained, not even a trace.","Even the energy from his body explosion had been purified, turning into a ‘fortunate encounter’ for all the spectators.","This meant that the Disaster Turtles wouldn’t need to travel far and wide to retrieve Bà Sòng’s remains.","The Disaster Turtle Sister nodded approvingly. “A good death—this is how he should die.”","Happy New Year, Dead Bà Sòng~","Inside the Core World.","Some of the more observant seniors in the “Nine Provinces Number One Group” remained calm.","It wasn’t that they had become accustomed to Song Shuhang’s ‘deaths’ and were now indifferent to them; rather, they noticed that the Core World was still functioning normally.","The Core World, in some aspects, could represent Song Shuhang’s current state.","If Song Shuhang had truly perished, with both his body and soul obliterated, the Core World they were currently in would inevitably collapse. The rules of the Core World, which operated in sync with Song Shuhang, would also vanish.","But now, the Core World was running smoothly... it was even purifying the energy of the ‘blood-red raindrops’ falling from the sky, ensuring that the ‘Bà Sòng legacy energy’ could be absorbed more efficiently by everyone.","Aside from the Core World, the “Cultivator Chat System” that relied on Bà Sòng’s existence was also running steadily, unaffected by Song Shuhang’s first explosion of the New Year.","So, these careful seniors could confirm that Song Shuhang was definitely safe and sound.","Though they didn’t know why he had exploded again, they were sure that Song Shuhang had entered the normal ‘resurrection process.’ Before long, he would be bouncing around again, full of life.","“But... isn’t Song Shuhang a Tribulation-Transcending Immortal now? Why would he suddenly explode like that?” The seniors in the Nine Provinces Number One Group exchanged thoughts via the “Cultivator Chat System.”","Who in the world could secretly assassinate Song Shuhang so quietly that he didn’t even notice?","“I don’t think it was an assassination. If someone could silently kill Song Shuhang, they would’ve already dominated the heavens and the earth, achieving Dao of Heaven,” Seven Cultivation Holy Sovereign replied.","“Senior White, any ideas?” Yellow Mountain asked while chewing on a pill.","“None.” Senior White shook his head.","Then, he extended his arm, glancing at his wrist. “Shuhang is fine. Although his Primordial Spirit Projection was affected for a moment, it has already recovered. He’s now in the resurrection phase.”","Hidden within Senior White’s arm was Song Shuhang’s Primordial Spirit Projection.","A moment ago, Senior White’s own Primordial Spirit Projection had disintegrated alongside Song Shuhang’s sudden explosion.","“Senior White, the New Year’s Gala will proceed as usual. Please host the event... I’ll be back soon.” Song Shuhang’s voice suddenly came from Senior White’s arm.","Hearing Shuhang’s voice, the members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group finally breathed a sigh of relief.","Though they had made educated guesses, they only fully relaxed after confirming that Song Shuhang was safe.","“Leave it to me. Fairy Snow Maiden, bring out the Year Beast.” Senior White called out.","Boom, boom, boom","As he spoke, another wave of ‘fireworks’ shot into the sky.","This time, they were actual fireworks.","Unbeknownst to everyone, someone had set off a row of fireworks and firecrackers by the lakeside and quietly ignited them.","The fireworks that shot up were dazzlingly beautiful, whether viewed from below or from the side.","“So pretty,” Soft Feather said as she gazed upward.","The fireworks continued to rise, their brilliance lingering.","After a long while...","The fireworks display ended.","The lights then focused on Fairy Snow Maiden.","She brought out a fierce beast with long antennae and sharp fangs.","The Year Beast, Xi!","No one had expected that Senior White would actually find and capture such a ferocious creature—originally, even Fairy Snow Maiden had only intended to catch a common, non-sentient Flood Dragon or something similar to serve as the Year Beast.","The Xi was a brutal beast without intelligence, driven purely by a desire to destroy everything. Because of its nature, it had long been hunted by cultivators, making it exceedingly rare in the current cultivation world.","What made it even more remarkable was that the Year Beast was delicious, with a particularly rich flavor.","Eating it would not only fill one’s stomach but also increase one’s cultivation.","Subduing demons and monsters to benefit the world, gaining power, and enjoying a tasty meal—it’s no wonder the Year Beast had nearly been hunted to extinction.","To survive, the Year Beast would need to be bred, but raising them had proven to be incredibly difficult. To date, there hadn’t been a successful large-scale breeding plan for Year Beasts...","At this moment, the Year Beast Xi had already been slain by Fairy Snow Maiden with a single stab to the throat in the instant everyone shouted ‘one’ and Song Shuhang exploded, the Fairy had struck, sending the beast into the afterlife.","“This Xi is a mutated variant,” Fairy Snow Maiden explained. “After I prepare it, anyone who consumes its flesh should sit down immediately to absorb the energy. Its blood and flesh offer a one-time ‘Blood Rebirth’ effect. This will work for cultivators at the seventh rank and below.”","A one-time ‘Blood Rebirth’ effect is nearly equivalent to a weak version of a ‘resurrection.’","After saying this, Fairy Snow Maiden pulled the blade from the beast’s throat.","A spray of pure energy in the form of blood mist gushed out...","The Year Beast Sacrifice began!","The Creation Law King started to play a tune in coordination.","Meanwhile, at the spot where Song Shuhang had exploded, the windbreaker that Song Fatball had transformed into was now draped over the shoulders of the dizzy Mechanical Maiden.","Su Clan’s Sixteen gently lifted the Mechanical Maiden.","Pavilion Master Chu’s ahoge moved over to Sixteen’s head.","Scarlet Heaven Sword, Nine Repair Phoenix Saber, Stone Tablet Fellow Daoist, and Phoenix Ruler Claw, among other attachments, also temporarily shifted to Spirit Ghost Fairy A’16.","In Song Shuhang’s absence, the Spirit Ghost Fairy essentially became Song Shuhang.","Su Clan’s Sixteen gazed off into the distance, her eyes fixed on the “Heavenly Emperor’s Palace.”","Within the depths of the palace, atop the Heavenly Emperor’s throne marked as “TWO,” a figure began to take shape.","It was none other than the recently exploded Bà Sòng.","At this moment, Song Shuhang hadn’t fully resurrected yet—he lingered between life and death, much like Schr?dinger’s squirrel.","Inside his body, at the location of his Life Force Dantian, a rune on the forehead of the Immortal Whale Golden Core began to fade, leaving only an empty shell.","This was similar to Immortal Bone Revivals like Skylark’s.","However, Song Shuhang’s Immortal Whale Golden Core revival had a cooldown period. Once exhausted, it needed time for the color in the rune to replenish.","Song Shuhang silently sat on the throne.","He raised his palm, looking at the now-vanished red dot in his hand. “Heh heh heh, gotcha.”","“Senior Song, my mysterious island’s Heavenly Court fragment is coming!” The voice of the Island Master echoed in his mind.","“The ritual can now begin.” The Northern Emperor’s voice chimed in at the same time."]},{"number":2940,"title":"Chapter 2940: Conversation as Deep as the Ocean","paragraphs":["Chapter 2940: Conversation as Deep as the Ocean","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Senior Island Master, you can move in whenever you’re ready. I’ve already granted you access,” Song Shuhang, who was currently hovering between life and death on the throne, said aloud.","“Got it. I’m on my way,” the Island Master replied.","Given the Golden Trigram Island Master’s current cultivation level, moving all the fragments of the Heavenly Court from the mysterious island wouldn’t be an issue at all.","After that, Song Shuhang responded to the Northern Emperor: “Senior Northern Emperor, I’ve consolidated all the fragments of the Heavenly Court into one area and separated that area from the rest of the core world. You can conduct the ceremony without any worries. However, due to some personal reasons, the Heavenly Emperor’s Throne Two will be transferred to you a bit later.”","“I understand. My Turtle has already informed me that you’ve exploded again and are currently resurrecting at the ‘Heavenly Emperor’s Palace,’” the Northern Emperor replied. “We also need to wait for Golden Trigram to move the ‘Heavenly Court fragments’ over before starting the ceremony. This buffer time should be enough for your physical body to revive.”","“That’s good to hear,” Song Shuhang replied. News sure travels fast—no sooner had he exploded than the Northern Emperor got wind of it.","“By the way, how did you explode this time?” the Northern Emperor asked, taking advantage of the brief lull before the ceremony out of curiosity.","Song Shuhang wasn’t the inexperienced “fake Profound Sage” he had been a few months ago. Now, as a genuine Tribulation Immortal who had severed three corpses, he was someone even the most powerful beings across the heavens and earth would respect as a “big shot.”","Even someone like the Northern Emperor, a top-tier immortal, couldn’t simply cause Song Shuhang to explode without any warning.","“If I told you I did it to spread some New Year’s cheer, would you believe me, Senior?” Song Shuhang responded.","The Northern Emperor paused for a moment before replying, “If it were someone else, I wouldn’t believe it. But coming from you... yeah, I actually would. It sounds like something you’d do. I’ll be sure to share this with the others.”","Song Shuhang:","Your confidence in me is too heavy, Senior Northern Emperor. I can’t bear it.","“See you in a bit,” the Northern Emperor concluded, not giving Song Shuhang a chance to explain further, and ended the call.","Back on the Heavenly Emperor’s Throne Two, Song Shuhang, still suspended between life and death, resembled a misty cloud curled up on the throne.","He tapped the armrest of the throne lightly with his fingers.","Of course, the reason he exploded wasn’t just because he wanted to.","Even though he had died countless times in the past year, he wasn’t like Yunyi Ziqi from the Profound Girl Sect, who enjoyed courting death. He wasn’t a fan of dying. If he could avoid it, he would much rather stay alive... after all, resurrection artifacts are expensive.","That said, there was a reason for this “New Year’s First Explosion” of Song Shuhang’s.","The catalyst for the explosion was related to that “Stellar Destruction Virus.”","The Stellar Destruction Virus was the fuse, while the “Stellar Doomsday Demon Skull” that Fat Ball had sealed and sent him at the end of last year served as the spark that ignited it.","During this period, Song Shuhang had intentionally suppressed his Spirit Ghost Fairy, the Merit Snake Beauty, the Nine-Repair Phoenix Sabre, and other “attachments” instead of snuffing out the spark and fuse. He had quietly cooperated instead.","Then... at the moment his body exploded, the “Cultivation Chat System” managed to lock onto an ID in the background.","To be honest, even Song Shuhang himself hadn’t expected this “follow-the-thread” tactic to be so successful.","So successful, it was like Senior White had taken over his body!","He had been prepared to use the “Law of Cause and Effect,” along with the help of the Confucian Sage’s Eye, Senior White Two, the Three-Eyed Senior, Dog Egg Dad, Song Youyou, and Lady Long Luo, to forcibly track down the existence behind the “Stellar Doomsday Demon Skull” and the “Virtual Sun Guardian.”","But before he could even make his move, the “Cultivation Chat System” quietly locked onto a user ID.","Yes... the terrifying entity behind the Virtual Sun Guardian and the Stellar Doomsday Demon had actually registered an account on the “Cultivation Chat System” and even downloaded a “client.”","And at the exact moment of Song Shuhang’s explosion, that terrifying entity launched a powerful attack on the “Cultivation Chat System,” trying to seize it for itself!","This was a true powerhouse!","Far more domineering and powerful than any of the big shots Song Shuhang had faced before!","Even the likes of Demon Emperor Hezhi couldn’t figure out how to deal with the “Cultivation Chat System” and had been toying with the idea of deleting Song Shuhang as a friend for days without success.","But this hidden powerhouse had already figured out a way to attack the “Cultivation Chat System” and was even implementing it.","Unfortunately... the entity’s attempt failed as soon as it began.","The “Cultivation Chat System” was far more unique than anticipated!","So unique, it was impossible to take over!","The system was an extension of Song Shuhang’s very existence, tied to his “Path of Immortality,” making it one of a kind.","As long as Song Shuhang existed, so would the “Cultivation Chat System.” If Song Shuhang perished, so would the system.","Moreover, behind the “Cultivation Chat System” stood Lady Long Luo, who served as the ultimate shield. Without breaking through Lady Long Luo’s defenses, the entity couldn’t even touch the system, let alone influence it.","To seize the “Cultivation Chat System,” one would first have to seize its root—Song Shuhang.","Only by capturing Song Shuhang could they claim the “Cultivation Chat System.”","After failing, the terrifying entity swiftly erased all traces of its actions... then deleted its account!","Using a method Song Shuhang was quite familiar with the “Heavenly Dao Black Room” technique of erasing all roots.","The erasure was confined to the “Cultivation Chat System.”","This impressive and flawless operation even made Lady Long Luo’s scalp tingle.","After erasing all traces, the entity disappeared without a trace.","It was as if nothing had ever happened.","Flawless. No evidence left behind.","However...","There are always things in this world that defy expectations.","When the resurrection ability of the “Immortal Fat Whale Golden Core” kicked in and Song Shuhang was reborn on the “Heavenly Emperor’s Throne Two,” the missing data in the “Cultivation Chat System” was also restored.","The only data ever missing in the “Cultivation Chat System” was the account of that terrifying entity behind the scenes.","So... after the entity deleted its account and left, a gray ID quietly resurrected in Song Shuhang’s “Cultivation Chat System.”","“Heh heh heh,” Song Shuhang chuckled.","The resurrected gray ID was now in “offline” status but still tightly connected to the terrifying entity behind the scenes.","“But now’s not the time,” Song Shuhang murmured softly.","Rushing to confront that terrifying entity now would only alert it.","Song Shuhang shifted his focus away from that gray ID, avoiding it so that the entity wouldn’t sense anything and become suspicious."]},{"number":2941,"title":"Chapter 2941: The Reestablishment of the Heavenly Court!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2941: The Reestablishment of the Heavenly Court!","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The top-tier powerhouses across all realms had an uncanny ability to hear even the faintest whispers—Song Shuhang had experienced this firsthand many times.","For instance, if he were to badmouth Father Goudan or mention Goudan in a negative light, the retribution from Father Goudan would soon follow. And then there was Senior White Two...","The same went for the Devil Emperor. Even when gravely injured, if Song Shuhang so much as muttered something bad about him behind his back, the Devil Emperor would sense it, perform a quick divination, and immediately track Song Shuhang down!","The supreme beings of all realms were just that powerful! So, if you wanted to plot against them, the first step was to find a way to block their celestial senses.","Of course, these beings didn’t just pick up on everything indiscriminately.","Certain conditions had to be met for them to sense anything at all. Factors like the level of threat, the closeness of the relationship, whether there was a conspiracy at play, whether it posed any danger to them, or if there were any information-blocking techniques involved—these all served as prerequisites. After a complex set of calculations, the supreme beings would then pick up on the situation.","They were busy, after all. They couldn’t be receiving alerts all day, like “ding-dong~ ding-dong~.”","Song Shuhang and the likes of Father Goudan, Goudan, Senior White Two, and Three-Eyed Senior had close connections, so just thinking about them would trigger their senses.","As for the Devil Emperor, since Song Shuhang was considered a “source of danger,” the moment he mentioned the Devil Emperor, the latter would instantly become agitated.","So...","Song Shuhang averted his gaze, pretending the restored gray ID didn’t exist and deliberately avoided focusing on it.","Otherwise, just having the thought of calculating against it, coupled with his current “threat level,” would trigger the opponent’s senses. They would then take a series of defensive measures, creating unnecessary trouble.","Currently, the “restored” gray ID’s connection to the supreme being was one-way, like it was sealed. There was no need to worry about the opponent using this ID to log back in and cause trouble.","As long as Song Shuhang didn’t intentionally activate this ID, it would remain as if it didn’t exist.","“I need to wait... at least until my Causality Saber can rub shoulders with a few more powerhouses,” Song Shuhang thought to himself.","One day, when I collect a complete set of ‘Divine Cards’ for my Causality Saber, nothing will be able to stand in my way—be it gods, Buddhas, demons, or anything else!","After a moment of quiet, passionate contemplation, Song Shuhang’s mood finally calmed down.","In the hazy mist, he shifted his position to the right, moving a couple of seats over to lean against the right armrest.","“It’s huge,” Song Shuhang remarked.","Like the dragon throne from ancient China, the Heavenly Emperor’s throne of the ancient Heavenly Court was particularly spacious. Sitting on one side of the armrest, one couldn’t even touch the other side.","But bigger isn’t always better... For example, now that Song Shuhang wanted to change his sitting position, he had to scoot over several seats, which was tiring.","“The Heavenly Emperor must have had terrible lower back problems,” Song Shuhang commented.","After saying this, he intentionally fell silent for a long while.","But the sound he expected—a voice with a ‘da’ ending—never came.","“Not even a reaction to a comment about a herniated disc? Or is it that she really hasn’t revived yet?” Song Shuhang mused, leaning against the right armrest.","Normally, when the ‘Immortal Whale Golden Core’ resurrection ability was activated, he should have revived on the spot. Where he fell, he should have risen again!","However, instead of reviving on the spot, he reappeared a long distance away, sitting on the ‘Heavenly Emperor’s Throne Two’ in the Heavenly Emperor’s palace!","This strange occurrence made Song Shuhang suspicious.","Could it be that the Heavenly Emperor was manipulating things behind the scenes?","Has she already revived?","Or is she using my ‘revival’ to secretly set up a scheme?","To be honest, the Heavenly Emperor had helped Song Shuhang a lot in the later stages.","She had been deliberately trying to befriend Song Shuhang.","Given her methods and experience, winning someone’s favor was easy for her—after all, she once gathered a large group of diverse and powerful cultivators around her, establishing the ancient Heavenly Court with herself at the center!","Her charisma was undeniable!","Over time, as Song Shuhang interacted with her, he found himself harboring less and less resentment toward her. This was a testament to her exceptional social skills.","Now, Song Shuhang only retained a baseline level of wariness toward her.","This cautious stance would remain unless there was a dramatic change in their relationship.","“Not coming out? Given the time, you should have already revived by now, right?” Song Shuhang, realizing he couldn’t provoke her, decided to cut to the chase.","His voice echoed through the ‘Heavenly Emperor’s Palace.’","But the Heavenly Emperor still didn’t respond.","Song Shuhang then opened the ‘Cultivation Chat’ system to check on the Heavenly Emperor’s status.","[Fox Friend] Heavenly Emperor? Dadadazi (Status: Deader than dead).","“So, dealing with you ‘deader than dead’ folks is really frustrating. Can’t everyone just be a bit more straightforward? Like me! People should trust each other more!” Song Shuhang sighed.","Just as he finished speaking, his own profile popped up in the ‘Cultivation Chat’ system.","[Server? Goudan? Group Leader] Song Shuhang (Status: Deader than dead).","Song Shuhang was speechless.","He was speechless.","He looked up at the sky.","Who would’ve thought... I’m also ‘deader than dead’ now.","But my soul is still intact, right? If my soul isn’t dead, how can I be ‘deader than dead’?","Could it be that my soul, which has been divided into 15+1 pieces, is also considered in a ‘dismembered’ state?","While Song Shuhang was deep in thought...","A rumbling sound came from the Heavenly Court fragment area within the core world—a sign that something massive had just landed. It was the sound of the Golden Trigram Island Lord moving his ‘Heavenly Court fragments’ over.","This time, the core assistant didn’t take the opportunity to forcefully expand the core world’s territory using the ‘Heavenly Court fragments’... after all, the Golden Trigram Island Lord’s ‘Heavenly Court fragments’ were only on loan. Once he was done, they’d be returned.","Rumble rumble~","With the Golden Trigram Island Lord’s ‘Heavenly Court fragments’ in place, the Heavenly Court fragment area within the core world began to resonate.","This resonance traveled across the ‘core world,’ reached the present world, and extended to most of the heavens and realms near the present world, including Earth!","This resonance signaled that the ‘ancient Heavenly Court fragments’ had reached a critical mass, and the basic framework of the ancient Heavenly Court had been rebuilt—announcing the rebirth of the ancient Heavenly Court that had fallen in ancient times!","This resonance had an effect similar to that of a ‘Saintly Sermon.’","In more than half of the heavens and realms, cultivators all looked up at the sky in the same direction.","In their sight, a magnificent palace’s phantom image appeared, floating above the clouds.","The Heavenly Court!","The invincible Heavenly Court had returned!"]},{"number":2942,"title":"Chapter 2942: Heavens, who attracted the Heavenly Tribulation?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2942: Heavens, who attracted the Heavenly Tribulation?","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The ancient Heavenly City was similar. Cultivators of the Fifth Stage Realm and above could see the “Heavenly City” above the clouds as long as they raised their heads.","In ancient times, the Heavenly Court suppressed the myriad worlds and was unquestionably the strongest force in the myriad worlds.","To the cultivators of that era, the only difference between the Heavenly Emperor and the Scholarly Sage was that the Heavenly Dao still existed in the era when the Heavenly Emperor lived. The Heavenly Emperor had never had the chance to defeat the significant figures of the myriad worlds.","“It’s really the Heavenly Court?” Some of the old antiques opened their eyes and saw the illusory celestial heavens. Upon hearing the sounds of the celestial heavens’ “Great Dao of Longevity,” they felt as if they had returned to ancient times.","At the same time, some of the remnants of the ancient Heavenly City in the myriad worlds burst into tears upon seeing the familiar Heavenly City in the void.","During the era of the ancient Heavenly City, many members had already regarded it as their home and felt a deep attachment to it.","Even the ‘Ancestral Golden Dragon,’ White Dragon, while deliberately distancing herself from the Heavenly City, still had a profound connection to the ancient Heavenly City.","The reestablishment of the Heavenly Court was a momentous event that shocked the myriad worlds and, naturally, the group of big shots.","In the chat system’s “Tyrannical Song Research Group”:","“It’s really the Heavenly City!” Saint Scythe Heavenly King, who was once a member of the ancient Heavenly City, said. “It’s definitely the Heavenly City!”","The Primordial Demoness was puzzled. Wasn’t the Heavenly Emperor killed by Tyrannical Song?","They had seen with their own eyes that the moment Tyrannical Song’s clone opened the door, the Heavenly Emperor was killed by Tyrannical Song, with his body and soul destroyed and his soul scattered!","The Sage of Beast Tamer asked, “Who rebuilt the Heavenly Court?”","The Celestial Thearch was dead. So, who re-established the ancient Heavenly City?","“I have a bold guess,” Supremacy Golden Meow said in a deep voice. Although this person’s title was ‘Supremacy,’ he was in fact already a Tribulation Transcender who had stepped into the embryonic form of his path to immortality.","“Tell me your guess and see if it’s the same as mine.”","“Tyrannical Song,” King Non-Phase continued. “I blindly guessed it was Tyrannical Song.”","“That’s my guess too,” the Clown Emperor said. “The Heavenly Emperor was killed by Tyrannical Song. It’s very likely that Tyrannical Song obtained some information from the Heavenly Emperor and might have even plundered the Dao of the Heavenly Emperor. Then he collected the fragments of the Heavenly Court and rebuilt it?”","If Tyrannical Song re-established the Heavenly Court, I’m afraid we won’t have the fate of the Heavenly Dao in this life, the Primordial Witch sighed.","The Clown Emperor thought for a moment and decided, “So... should we do something?”","Tyrannical Song was already in a crushing situation!","If he re-established the Heavenly Court, everyone in that group could only lie on the ground and let Tyrannical Song run over them.","Black and White Dragon Lady Fairy He Cheng: “Fellow Daoists, please calm down. I have internal news that the reestablishment of the Heavenly Court this time wasn’t led by Tyrannical Song. The re-establishment of the Heavenly Court this time is led by someone else; this is a good thing for us! We need an existence that can rival Tyrannical Song!”","She did not want anyone to come and disrupt the ceremony at this critical moment!","He hadn’t expected to find this Tyrannical Song Research Exchange Group useful here.","“Is Fellow Daoist Black and White Dragon Lady’s information reliable?” the Clown Emperor asked.","Although Black and White Dragon Lady was the group leader, it was a serious matter. He had to ask. It would be best if he could have evidence to prove it.","At that moment, the reliable senior in the group, ‘My Family Has a Twin Eggs,’ suddenly appeared and said, “I just did a divination and found some shocking news. Tyrannical Song just died!”","“What is it? Tyrannical Song is dead?” King Non-Phase was stunned.","There was actually someone in the universe who could defeat Tyrannical Song?","“You can also start your own divination and calculate a game in detail,” Goudan Family said. “Tyrannical Song definitely wouldn’t be destroyed like this. He definitely has his own resurrection method. However, since Tyrannical Song has died once and is still in the resurrection stage, the person presiding over the reestablishment of the Heavenly Court shouldn’t be Tyrannical Song.”","The Goudan family had a very high popularity in the group.","What he said made sense.","The members of the group were all top-notch existences, and they immediately began to calculate Tyrannical Song’s condition according to their own methods.","A moment later...","The Sage of Beast Tamer asked, “He actually died once?”","“In other words, in this world, there is still someone who can contend with Tyrannical Song? Moreover, he might even have an advantage?” The Primordial Witch’s heart skipped a beat.","King Non-Phase said, “I feel that it’s more likely that both sides will suffer! Otherwise, the existence that forced Tyrannical Song to enter the resurrection stage would have already stood up and spread the news to the myriad worlds.”","“If the two of us fight, we will have a chance. Let’s wait and see!” the Clown Emperor said after a moment of silence.","In the Inner World.","The fragments of the Heavenly City were arranged according to the original layout of the Heavenly City.","“Fellow Daoist Golden Trigram, I’ll have to trouble you for the next part,” the Daozi holding the Confucian Canon called out.","“No,” Island Master Golden Trigram shook his head. “It’s just a deal. There’s no need to talk about grievances.”","After saying that, he retreated and took the initiative to enter a space opened by Daozi and the others.","After Island Master Golden Trigram entered this space, his existence and origin seemed to have been erased from the myriad worlds... At that moment, no one in the myriad worlds remembered his existence.","In the void, a handsome man who was hiding in a spatial gap and quietly observing the process of the Heavenly City’s reconstruction was suddenly stunned.","“Who am I here to see?” The man pinched his chin.","A moment later.","“Oh right, I’m going to find my good disciple.” After laughing heartily, the handsome man entered the void and disappeared in the direction of the mysterious island.","The Great Northern Emperor glanced in the direction where the man had disappeared.","“He’s the most terrifying genius of the Heavenly Court, Silver Trigram. He was wearing a disguise mask, so I didn’t recognize him immediately,” a golden figure stepped into the main world and the Inner World. He smiled and said, “He’s not easy to deal with, but fortunately...” We don’t have any ill intentions towards Gold Trigram, and Copper Trigram is Song Shuhang’s senior. Therefore, there won’t be any conflict between us and Silver Trigram. Don’t worry.”","The Great Northern Emperor nodded.","“But isn’t that little fellow called ‘Copper Trigram’ celebrating the New Year in the Inner World?” the Great Master of the Titanium Temple asked curiously. “Why did Silver Trigram run to the mysterious island?”","“It might be... Are you lost?” the Great Northern Emperor pondered.","“Don’t worry about Silver Trigram. Let’s start the ritual. I don’t have much time to stay in the main world,” the golden figure elongated and turned into the golden appearance of Fairy Cheng Lin.","Then, huge statues rose from the fragment area of the ancient Heavenly City and guarded the rebuilt Heavenly City.","On the palms of the statues stood many big shots.","They were the other members of the Heavenly Dao Alliance!","“I’m ready,” Daozi nodded. He slowly opened the Scholarly Classic and activated the ‘innate ability’ left behind by the Scholarly Sage.","“Remember, leave behind your path to immortality and a part of your existence... This is the proof of your resurrection,” the golden Fairy Cheng Lin warned.","Daozi nodded and activated the Confucian Classic.","In the next moment, an invisible force wrapped around Daozi’s body and bit off a part of his ‘existence.’ Daozi was fortunate enough to become the second person in the universe to taste the pain of this innate spell after the fat ball.","A part of his existence and the path to immortality had been bitten off!","Master’s strength made Daozi feel proud... and pained.","The pain was indescribable.","For a moment, he seemed to be able to understand why the ‘Heavenly Dao Fat Ball’ hated the scholarly faction so much... This pain was simply engraved in his bones. He could not forget it even if he wanted to.","Cold sweat poured out of Daozi’s forehead like rain, dripping onto the fragment of the Heavenly City below.","His path to immortality, a part of his existence, had been bitten off by the ‘Code of Confucianism,’ and then stored inside it.","The Daozi’s realm and aura fell rapidly.","He was about to fall from the Immortal Realm back to the Tribulation Transcender Realm.","“Come out!” The golden Cheng Lin approached the Daozi and shouted.","A ghost spirit was attracted by Daozi’s body and stepped out.","This was Daozi’s ghost spirit, and it had already been nurtured to maturity. It looked exactly the same as Daozi’s ghost spirit. This ghost spirit","had been found recently, and after signing a contract with Daozi, he had used the methods of an Immortal to rapidly ripen it.","This ghost spirit was also part of the plan.","After the Daozi ghost spirit appeared, it silently stood in front of the golden Cheng Lin, unmoving.","“The position of the Heavenly Emperor, inheritance!” The golden Cheng Lin tapped the Daozi ghost spirit with her finger, transferring her Heavenly Dao Seat into the Daozi ghost spirit.","This was also the reason why she wanted Daozi to cut off his path to immortality first.","Next, Daozi was going to inherit the ‘Dao of the Heavenly Emperor,’ the seat of the Heavenly Emperor.","The reason why Gold Trigram had entered the space similar to the Wielder’s small black room was to temporarily block the source of the attack.","In this way, the Daozi who inherited the position of the Heavenly Dao would become the only Heavenly Emperor in the myriad worlds and meet the standards of the ceremony later.","A few breaths later...","“Success!” The golden Cheng Lin took a step back weakly.","At the same time, a golden space opened behind her.","In the golden space stood a large number of heavenly soldiers and generals, as well as a few statues of Immortals who had yet to be freed, and an ice-cold Great Northern Emperor.","The Great Northern Emperor in the golden space was the Great Northern Emperor, but not the Great Northern Emperor.","He was the Great Northern Emperor’s mark that had once been left in the ancient Heavenly City. He had used Cheng Lin’s secret technique to transform... In fact, this was the ‘replacement’ for the 8.5 Wielder of the Will’s plan.","“Thank you, fellow Daoist, for taking the tribulation for me,” the resurrected Great Northern Emperor bowed to the ‘Great Northern Emperor’ in the golden space.","The Great Northern Emperor, who was in the golden space, faintly smiled.","“The final step, Fellow Daoist Scarlet Heaven, please bring the little friend who is about to face the heavenly tribulation here,” the golden Cheng Lin said.","The 8.5 The Heavenly Axiom Plan was an opportunity for the members of the Heavenly Axiom Must Step Down Alliance to complete their redemption!","He was no exception... The 8.5 The Heavenly Dao Plan was his last chance to fulfill his promise and free his companion, whom he could entrust his life to, from the Dao of the Heavenly Court!","This was the final salvation.","It was also because of Song Shuhang and Senior White... Pathfinder!","“Wait a moment. I’ll be right there,” Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven nodded. They had already prepared a little fellow Daoist who was about to transcend the tribulation. This was also part of the ceremony.","This little fellow Daoist was found by Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven, and there was some karma between him and Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven.","This ceremony was dangerous for the little fellow Daoist, but it was also a great opportunity.","If he grasped it, his future would be limitless.","As long as a cultivator was confident in himself, he would not reject such an opportunity.","Just as Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven stood up and was about to bring that little fellow Daoist over, suddenly... In the Inner World next door, thunder rumbled!","“Heavenly Tribulation? Heavens, who is it?” The golden Cheng Lin widened her eyes.","Who was the one who caused the heavenly tribulation?","Could it be such a coincidence?"]},{"number":2943,"title":"Chapter 2943: Fragrant as Can Be!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2943: Fragrant as Can Be!","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","At that moment, Song Shuhang’s Inner World had two places connected to the main world. Without deliberate shielding, the power of the heavenly tribulation could be transmitted directly through these passages.","“Tyrannical Song?” the master of the Titanium Temple asked.","Recently, no matter what happened in the universe, everyone seemed to unconsciously think of Tyrannical Song.","Is someone transcending the tribulation again? Is it Tyrannical Song?","Is someone giving a lecture again? Is it Tyrannical Song?","Is someone dying again? Is it Tyrannical Song?","Is someone causing trouble again? Is it Tyrannical Song?","“It shouldn’t be him. Tyrannical Song has already reached the Tribulation Transcender Realm, where he defeated three Immortals,” Daozi analyzed.","In other words, theoretically, Tyrannical Song should no longer be subject to transcending the tribulation. Of course, if Tyrannical Song had some tricks up his sleeve, it would be a different story.","The eight-armed ancient otherworldly demon asked, “I still don’t understand how Tyrannical Song managed to transcend the Ninth Stage thousand-day heavenly tribulation.”","A thousand-day heavenly tribulation indeed requires a thousand days to handle. How did Tyrannical Song manage to cripple the Ninth Stage tribulation and maintain a rhythm of one grade per month?","“There are many factors. From what I know, he has the Heavenly Lightning Graduation Law and Sector Lord Imprint,” Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven said, looking up at the sky. “By the way, do I still need to go pick someone up?”","Not far away, the heavenly tribulation in the Inner World had already taken shape.","It seemed that this member of the Nine Provinces Number One Group wanted to transcend his tribulation in the Inner World directly.","If that’s the case... if another little daoist is brought in to transcend the tribulation, the two heavenly tribulations would merge, making the situation uncontrollable.","The Great Northern Emperor looked up at the sky and said with a heavy heart, “We should have informed Tyrannical Song in advance about the part where someone would transcend the tribulation during the ceremony.”","“Who would have thought of this? It’s too late to say anything now,” the master of the Titanium Temple said. “Who can contact Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song? Let’s see if we can safely transfer the daoists undergoing their tribulations.”","...","...","In the Celestial Thearch Palace.","“It’s Sixteen.” Song Shuhang, still not revived, used his Inner World to observe the New Year celebrations of the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","His resurrection this time was indeed a bit unusual.","The revival process was transferred to the Heavenly Emperor Throne Two... and the resurrection channeling time had become much longer.","In the past, this amount of time would have been enough for Song Shuhang to complete his resurrection, take a bath, and have a meal.","But now, in a state of being “dead beyond death,” he sat on the Celestial Thearch’s throne, shifting from left to right and back again, unable to complete the resurrection channeling.","He almost turned into a bean.","“Could it be because I’m now in the Tribulation Transcender Realm that the channeling time has been extended?”","After sighing, Song Shuhang turned his gaze to Su Clan’s Sixteen.","After Sixteen concluded the “Spirit River Su Clan’s Trial Ceremony” and reached a balanced state with the hundred or so Little Sixteens, her main body’s consciousness fell into a brief slumber, with the ghost fairy assisting her movements.","Now, with her main body’s consciousness awakened, she had entered the “preparing to transcend the tribulation” state.","Additionally, after Song Shuhang’s “New Year’s first self-destruction,” the pure blood-red energy that fell nourished her. The spiritual energy in Su Clan’s Sixteen, which was already at a critical point, exploded instantly.","Before she could move, the heavenly tribulation had already begun to condense.","“Sixteen... Do you need me to seal the space and delay your tribulation?” Song Shuhang contacted the Nine Provinces Number Two Group through the Cultivation Chat System.","At this time, the seniors in the group were mostly in the second group. By posting here, everyone could see it, so the seniors wouldn’t worry about Sixteen’s tribulation. At the same time, they could discuss how to handle it.","Moreover, the Inner World had evolved through several iterations and was no longer “so timid.”","Now, the Inner World no longer gives face to the heavenly tribulation. As long as the passage between the main world and the Inner World is forcibly closed and isolated, even the heavenly tribulation would be turned away, left outside.","“Shuhang, help me move to a suitable location... I’m preparing to transcend the tribulation,” Su Clan’s Sixteen replied.","Su Clan’s Seven asked, “Are you confident?”","Every time Su Clan’s Sixteen was about to transcend her tribulation, Seven would be quite worried. After all, Sixteen had encountered an accident during her Fourth Stage heavenly tribulation.","Moreover, this time Su Clan’s Sixteen had advanced too quickly—last year, when she met Song Shuhang, she had only transcended the Fourth Stage heavenly tribulation. Now, she was about to transcend the Sixth Stage heavenly tribulation. Seven was concerned that her foundation might be unstable.","“Don’t worry, I’m very confident about transcending the Sixth Stage heavenly tribulation. Moreover, I have already made preparations to deal with this tribulation,” Su Clan’s Sixteen replied.","She and the White Dragon had already set up a “portable” tribulation-transcending formation. Now, they just needed to find a suitable place to transcend the tribulation, take out the formation from their cosmos bag, and set up spirit stones to use it.","Additionally, her advancement this time was actually smooth sailing, with no hidden danger of foundation instability. Although it had only been a bit more than half a year in the main world, she had spent a much longer time in the Spirit River Su Clan’s trial space.","Later, with the White Dragon’s help, she entered a secret realm and spent even more time refining there.","In other words, she had actually stagnated at the Fifth Stage Realm for quite a while.","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator asked, “Have you completed the Golden Core composition?”","“Yes, I can finalize it at any time,” Su Clan’s Sixteen replied.","Palace Master Seven Lives Talisman said, “You little fellows really don’t give us old fellows a chance to relax.”","Since Song Shuhang joined the Nine Provinces Number One Group, its members had been stimulated once a month on average, and their cultivation speed had increased several levels compared to previous years.","Now, even Soft Feather and Su Clan’s Sixteen had caught up with the group members, and were about to overtake them.","The seniors felt bitter.","“Don’t worry, Seven Lives Mansion. Even if the sky falls, there’s still someone tall to hold it up... After Sixteen advances successfully, the one with the greatest pressure in the group should be Su Clan’s Seven,” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber seized the opportunity and said. “According to Su Clan’s ranking, Seven’s number is more than twice as big as Sixteen’s. But now, True Monarch Seven is about to be caught up by ‘True Monarch A·Ming Tian·Sixteen.’ Think about it, how much pressure is Seven under? Hahaha ~”","“Thrice Reckless, stop talking!” Northern River’s Loose Cultivator reminded.","However, as soon as Northern River’s Loose Cultivator finished speaking, Thrice Reckless Mad Saber was already in Dharma King Creation’s bear hug, unable to escape.","“This time, I want the Book Immortal Invitation,” Dharma King Creation said with an honest smile.","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber: “???”","What is the Book Immortal Invitation?","“Deal,” Su Clan’s Seven’s hearty laughter rang out, accompanied by the sound of exploding saber qi.","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber... had met his end.","In the Nine Provinces Number Two Group.","Song Shuhang said, “Sixteen, get ready... I’ll transfer you out.”","“Hi, can I make a suggestion?” At that moment, Fairy Couldn’t Be Deadly Cheng Goudan posted, “Little Fairy Sixteen of the Su family, would you like to come to the Heavenly City fragment area to transcend the tribulation? It smells so good!”"]},{"number":2944,"title":"Chapter 2944: 8.5-Ren Tiandao Plan, Start ~","paragraphs":["Chapter 2944: 8.5-Ren Tiandao Plan, Start ~","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chapter 2942: Heaven’s Plan 8.5, Let’s Roll~","In the ‘Cultivator Chat System,’ inside the Nine Provinces Second Group, apart from the original ‘Nine Provinces First Group’ members, Song Shuhang had also invited several influential seniors to join, to keep the group balanced. These seniors were all incredibly wealthy—if they were in a good mood and decided to share some wealth, everyone could benefit.","Among these big shots was naturally Fairy Cheng Lin—back when the ‘Cultivator Chat System’ was still in its early stages, both Fairy Cheng Lin and Senior White were even more adept at using its features than Song Shuhang.","At this moment, after seeing Fairy Cheng Lin’s message, Su Clan’s Sixteen was slightly stunned.","However, before she could respond, Song Shuhang quickly intervened: “No way, it’s too dangerous, I don’t agree!”","Fairy Cheng Lin, Northern Emperor, Daoist Scarlet Heaven—they were planning to mess with some kind of ritual involving the ‘ancient Heavenly Court fragments.’ Although Song Shuhang wasn’t sure exactly what they were up to, he knew for sure that when such top-level seniors gathered to mess with something, it was bound to make headlines.","Honestly, if they didn’t make some top-tier news across the heavens and realms, it would be a waste of such a star-studded lineup!","And big news usually equates to big trouble.","So, it was better if Su Clan’s Sixteen didn’t get involved in her tribulation. When it comes to overcoming tribulations, keeping it simple and straightforward is the safest bet.","Song Shuhang himself had suffered enough from ‘group tribulations’ and ‘mutant tribulations.’","Before he advanced to the Eighth Stage, when the tribulation bigwigs were still formidable, each of his tribulations had been a life-and-death struggle... As someone who’s been through it, he naturally hoped that Su Clan’s Sixteen and the members of the ‘Nine Provinces First Group’ could have smoother tribulations, without any unnecessary complications.","Calm and steady wins the race, peace and tranquility are a blessing.","“Song Dog Egg, I wasn’t even asking you, why are you so quick to respond? You’re acting like we’re an inconvenience to you... To be honest, if it were you facing a tribulation, we’d actually be the ones not wanting you involved. We’d refuse to let you participate.” Fairy Cheng Lin responded.","Ba Song and tribulations are a match made in hell—every time his tribulation was loud and dramatic, Fairy Cheng Lin had a real distaste for Song Dog Egg’s tribulations.","Song Shuhang: “...”","“So, what do you think, Su Clan’s Little Fairy?” Fairy Cheng Lin asked.","Su Clan’s Sixteen politely declined: “If Song Shuhang says it’s too dangerous, then I’d better not participate, but thank you for your kind offer, Fairy Cheng Lin.”","But Fairy Cheng Lin wasn’t discouraged, and she continued: “I’ve already told you, my offer is fantastic. Little Su Clan’s Fairy, let’s talk privately.”","“I don’t have much time left.” Su Clan’s Sixteen replied. The tribulation clouds above her head were already beginning to gather...","Fairy Cheng Lin privately messaged: “My path to immortality—The Path of Nurturing New Life.”","Su Clan’s Sixteen: “!!!”","“Let me put it this way, my path to immortality is the pinnacle of the ‘Way of Life’ and a blessing for ‘sterile cultivators.’” Fairy Cheng Lin continued: “So, what do you think? (o ゚▽ ゚)o☆”","Su Clan’s Sixteen: “Can it be used anytime?”","“You get three chances. If you need it, just contact me. As long as I’m not busy, I’ll be there whenever you call.” Fairy Cheng Lin replied.","Su Clan’s Sixteen: “In that case... I accept!”","“Don’t worry, I guarantee you won’t be in any life-threatening danger. During the process, your ‘Sixth to Seventh Stage Tribulation’ might get stronger, drawing additional risks. But those risks pale in comparison to the huge opportunities you’ll gain.” Fairy Cheng Lin assured.","Afterward, she switched back to the ‘Nine Provinces Second Group’: “@[Server Owner ? Cheng Dog Egg ? Group Leader] Song Shuhang, Su Clan’s Little Fairy has agreed.”","Song Shuhang: “Sixteen?”","“Yes, I’ve decided.” Su Clan’s Sixteen replied: “Don’t worry, I won’t be in life-threatening danger. And if things get too risky, we can always cut off the ‘Sixth to Seventh Stage Tribulation,’ right?”","“Let’s get going—we can’t delay any longer.” Fairy Cheng Lin urged.","Above them, Su Clan’s Sixteen’s tribulation was rumbling, as if urging her.","“Don’t resist, I’ll take you through a space transfer,” Fairy Cheng Lin called out.","In the next moment, Su Clan’s Sixteen’s figure vanished from her original spot, transferred to the ‘Heavenly Court Fragments’ area.","Leaning on the armrest of the Heavenly Emperor’s throne, Song Shuhang eventually didn’t stop them.","“This is the core world... If it doesn’t work out, I’ll just forcefully disperse the tribulation and seal it as ingredients.” Song Shuhang nodded.","With Su Clan’s Sixteen being pulled away for the tribulation, the attention of the ‘Nine Provinces First Group’ members shifted towards her.","At the same time, the New Year’s feast had reached the stage where Fairy Snow was serving the dishes.","The group members sat in their seats, waiting for the food while keeping an eye on the situation in the ‘Heavenly Court Fragments’ area.","“Is this one of the New Year’s programs?” Holy King Creation asked.","Venerable Yellow Mountain sighed, “I’d prefer it if the New Year didn’t have such explosive events.”","...","...","In the Heavenly Court Fragments area.","On the hands of several giant statues, Golden Fairy Cheng Lin, Northern Emperor, Daoist Scarlet Heaven, Master of the Vajra Temple, and the Eight-Armed Ancient Demon from Beyond the Heavens took their positions.","Daozi stood in the very center of the ‘Heavenly Court Fragments’—originally the location of the ‘Heavenly Emperor’s Palace.’","The Heavenly Emperor’s Palace was no longer there, leaving an empty space.","Rumble~","In the void, Su Clan’s Sixteen’s ‘Sixth to Seventh Stage Tribulation’ was also transferred over, rumbling in the sky above the ‘Heavenly Court Fragments’ area.","The Stone Monument Fellow Daoist, Scarlet Heaven Sword, Nine Repair Phoenix Saber, Chu Pavilion Lord’s Dumb Hair, Song Fatball’s Windbreaker, Little Lingxiao, and Phoenix Dance Instrument Master’s Claw all temporarily moved aside to avoid being caught up in Sixteen’s tribulation.","“Don’t worry, focus on overcoming your tribulation, we’ll handle the rest,” Northern Emperor assured Su Clan’s Sixteen. “The power of the tribulation will temporarily increase due to our interference, but don’t worry, the enhanced part will be redirected away.”","As he spoke, Northern Emperor’s ‘presence’ began to thin—half of his body integrated with the statue beneath him.","That statue had an effect similar to the ‘Small Black Room of the Way of the Heavenly Dao.’","Not just Northern Emperor, the other participants did the same, merging parts of their bodies with the statues, reducing their presence to the bare minimum.","The first wave of the Sixth to Seventh Stage Tribulation, a ‘prelude tribulation,’ crashed down—what was supposed to be a tribulation of early Fifth Stage power was greatly amplified under the influence of Northern Emperor and the others.","But after a certain point, as Northern Emperor and the others’ ‘roots of existence’ were suddenly obscured, the tribulation’s programming seemed to glitch, entering a partial loop.","(Tribulation Big Shot being toyed with.JPG)","“The tribulation big shot has lost all dignity,” the Stone Monument Fellow Daoist remarked.","Chu Pavilion Lord’s Dumb Hair: “It lost all dignity the moment it was added to the menu.”","Boom~","The toyed-with tribulation partially struck Su Clan’s Sixteen, while most of it was guided towards the ‘Ancient Heavenly Court Fragments’ area, converging on Daozi.","Under the effect of the tribulation, the power of Daozi, the Way of the Heavenly Emperor, and the Heavenly Court Fragments resonated at high frequency!","The transformation of the 8.5 Heavenly Dao Plan had begun.","“Ba Song~ is the Heavenly Emperor’s throne ready?” Northern Emperor asked.","Though not essential to the plan, the Heavenly Emperor’s throne could speed up the progress of the 8.5 Heavenly Dao Plan.","“Just a moment, Senior, I’m almost done here,” Song Shuhang replied.","At this point, his body had finally completed the ‘resurrection loading bar.’","The ‘deader-than-dead’ status in the chat system was beginning to fade away..."]},{"number":2945,"title":"Chapter 2945: Someone Ascends to Immortality!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2945: Someone Ascends to Immortality!","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The long “loading screen” for resurrection finally ended.","Song Shuhang’s body, shrouded in mist, began to solidify, starting from the skeleton and gradually reforming. At last, he was spared from rolling around in boredom on the “Heavenly Emperor’s Throne Two.”","“Hurry up and come back to life. Don’t get too absorbed in dying,” the Northern Emperor urged. “We’re waiting on you for the throne.”","After all, he had traded his “dignity” for the opportunity to use the Heavenly Emperor’s Throne, so naturally, he was particularly invested. To him, it wasn’t just a throne; it was his pride!","“Almost there, Northern Senior. Don’t worry!” Song Shuhang replied.","As he spoke, he opened his “Cultivator Chat System” to check his current status.","In the system, his personal status note, “Deader than dead,” began to fade...indicating that he was gradually exiting this “beyond dead” state.","Song Shuhang then scrolled down to the Heavenly Emperor Child’s status.","The Heavenly Emperor Child still showed no signs of resurrection; her status remained unchanged.","“The Heavenly Court has been reestablished, and yet she hasn’t revived. What exactly is she waiting for?”","Could it be that Da Da Zi’s resurrection cycle operates on a “millennial” scale?","Or perhaps, like White Dragon Sister and the Northern Emperor in the past, her revival requires some kind of catalyst, reaching a certain condition?","While he pondered, the left arm of his body was the first to fully regenerate—then, Senior White’s “Primordial Spirit Projection” reappeared in Song Shuhang’s left arm.","“Lucky left arm,” Song Shuhang chuckled.","Under the influence of Senior White’s luck attribute, even during resurrection, his left arm was the first to be completed.","Once his arm was restored, Song Shuhang, still enveloped in resurrection mist, stood up from the Heavenly Emperor’s Throne. He extended his lucky left arm and gently tapped the throne.","With a thought, he used his telekinesis to lift the “Heavenly Emperor’s Throne Two.”","“Go on, head over to Senior Daozi,” Song Shuhang willed, using his core world’s authority to relocate the Heavenly Emperor’s Throne.","...","...","Core World – Heavenly Court Fragment Area.","Daozi was enduring the power of heavenly lightning, synchronizing his being with the Heavenly Emperor’s Dao and the Heavenly Court fragments.","Once this synchronization was complete, and after reversing the “Heavenly Dao Sphere’s Self-Completion Plan,” Daozi and the Heavenly Emperor’s Dao would be fully integrated into the 8.5th Heavenly Dao!","At that moment, a magnificent and regal “Heavenly Emperor’s Throne” appeared in the air behind Daozi.","This throne carried the aura of the Heavenly Emperor Da Da Zi.","“Little Fairy Su, I need to speed up the ritual’s pace! Get ready to withstand the impact,” Daozi called out.","“I’m good,” Su Clan’s Sixteen replied calmly.","At that moment, she stood atop a scroll-like “Tribulation Array Diagram,” infused with her blade intent—a unique blend of “Art Dao and Blade Dao.”","After being guided by White Dragon Sister and tested by the Su Clan’s Immortal Fairy, the tribulation for advancing from Fifth to Sixth Stage was hardly a challenge for Su Clan’s Sixteen.","Now, Su Clan’s Sixteen had just completed the final stroke of her “Golden Core Composition.”","Her Golden Core Composition consisted of 108 images of herself, arranged in a pattern corresponding to the 108 heavenly stars.","These 108 Su Clan’s Sixteen images formed a “dragon” procession, resembling a New Year’s “dragon dance.”","And the last stroke for her Fifth-to-Sixth Stage Golden Core Composition depicted the eyes of this dragon.","This was a true “dotting the eyes” moment.","However, these “dragon eyes” were quite unusual.","Though they were dragon pupils, upon closer inspection, one could discern the aura of “great maternal love” within them.","“Senior, go ahead and speed up. Don’t worry about me,” Su Clan’s Sixteen added.","Truth be told...if it weren’t for Daozi Senior’s ritual effects, Su Clan’s Sixteen might have already stepped in to seal the heavenly lightning, capturing it as ingredients for Song Shuhang’s “Heavenly Tribulation Feast.”","Below, Daozi smiled and nodded.","He could tell that Su Clan’s Sixteen was completely at ease during her tribulation—despite the fact that the heavenly tribulation had been enhanced.","Daozi estimated that the real combat strength of this Su Clan’s little fairy had already surpassed the Fifth Stage, reaching the Sixth Stage. Moreover, she possessed true dragon blood, which could allow her to double her strength in critical moments.","This wave of heavenly tribulation was indeed no threat to her.","Another genius, with potential no less than the 13 Tribulation Immortals of the Confucian Sect.","“Then, once I accelerate the ritual, you should also seize the moment. Aim to expand your Golden Core Spiritual Lake to its maximum upon entering the Sixth Stage,” Daozi advised.","And this was just one of the perks.","The real reward was yet to come. If he successfully became the 8.5th Heavenly Dao, Su Clan’s Sixteen would gain boundless merit.","The power of merit is vital for cultivators, as evident in Tyrant Song!","After the reminder, Daozi took a deep breath.","Then...he slowly sat on the Heavenly Emperor’s Throne!","Daozi’s style was that of a Confucian scholar, which clashed with the grandeur of the throne, but this didn’t hinder the progress of the plan.","Nor did it disrupt the resonance between the “Heavenly Emperor’s Dao” within him and the throne.","With the acquisition of the Heavenly Emperor’s Throne, the “8.5th Heavenly Dao Plan” surged forward as if a race car had suddenly hit the nitrous.","About thirty breaths later...","“It’s triggered!” the Golden Linglong Fairy exclaimed joyfully.","By harnessing the power of the heavenly tribulation, Daozi had fully activated the “Heavenly Emperor’s Dao + Reconstructed Heavenly Court,” finally triggering the backup mechanism left by the former “Heavenly Dao Fat Ball.”","The remnants of the Heavenly Dao began to operate autonomously—until a new Heavenly Dao was appointed, all mechanisms left by Fat Ball remained effective!","This was the crux of the 8.5th Heavenly Dao Plan.","“Everyone, focus all your energy on the formation!” Golden Linglong ordered.","Daoist Chixiao stroked his long beard, channeling all his energy into the statue.","The Eight-Armed Ancient Outer Demon, the Grandmaster of the Vajra Temple, and the Northern Emperor followed suit.","Simultaneously, a portal opened behind the Golden Linglong Fairy.","Several figures of ancient Heavenly Court’s Immortals appeared—these were the friends of the Heavenly Emperor’s Child, whom Song Wood had rescued from her “Dao.”","These liberated Immortals still needed to go through the process of “dying once + reincarnating,” and were currently in a golden space.","Among them was the true body of “Feng Yi Qin Zhu,” who had already died once and was now in a state of resurrection like Song Shuhang.","The power of the ancient Heavenly Court’s Immortals gathered, filling in the gaps in Daozi and the Heavenly Court.","In the void, the “Self-Completion Mechanism” of the Heavenly Dao Fat Ball was finally fully activated.","“It’s time!” Golden Linglong flicked her sleeve.","A series of doppelgangers, crafted using her Immortal Dao + the “Die Once Imprint” of the Heavenly Court’s Immortals, were summoned.","These doppelgangers would take the tribulation on behalf of the Heavenly Court’s Immortals.","As she released these doppelgangers, all the worlds trembled.","All cultivators felt something.","Someone ascended to immortality?","Who could it be?","Is it Tyrant Song?"]},{"number":2946,"title":"Chapter 2946: I’m Still Green, But He’s More Seasoned!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2946: I’m Still Green, But He’s More Seasoned!","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","No matter what the issue is, it’s always safe to assume it’s related to Tyrannical Song.","Don’t ask why. Just know it’s always Tyrannical Song!","Nowadays, in the eyes of cultivators across all worlds, Tyrannical Song indeed has the bearing of someone who can suppress an entire era.","Tyrannical Song’s clone has been challenging top experts in the solar system, particularly on Mars, defeating them one after another without suffering a single loss!","Meanwhile, his true body even managed to slay the “Invincible Heavenly Emperor” from the previous era!","Tyrannical Song has also become the ruler of one of the myriad worlds, a “World Lord,” controlling an entire world.","And that’s not all...","It’s said that Tyrannical Song, as a mere “mortal,” even took control of the Nine Netherworlds, becoming its ruler!","Rumor has it that the previous Heavenly Dao was shattered because of him.","In the past six months, tales of Tyrannical Song have bombarded the minds of cultivators across the myriad worlds, spreading like wildfire.","While an Eighth Stage Profound Sage enjoys the “Everyone Knows You” buff due to the “Profound Sage Speech,” Tyrannical Song’s fame was earned through his fists. And let’s be honest, no one can match him in delivering the Profound Sage Speech either—he’s done it more times than anyone else! There’s simply no comparison.","In the “Cultivator Chat System,” countless cultivators have gathered in groups, discussing fervently.","“Is the one proving the Dao really Tyrannical Song?”","“But... Has Tyrannical Song already subdued all the ‘Immortals’ across the myriad worlds? Isn’t that a prerequisite for proving the Dao and attaining immortality—to suppress an era and become invincible?”","“But who would still challenge Tyrannical Song? It seems like no one, right?”","In the myriad worlds, everyone was speculating.","All eyes were on the skies, eagerly awaiting the revelation of who would prove the Dao and become the new Heavenly Dao.","—This year, cultivators across the myriad worlds have looked up to the skies at least once a month, sometimes several times a month, greatly alleviating spinal problems for low-level cultivators.","While there was much speculation among the general populace, the top-tier experts among the Immortals, the strongest of them all, understood that proving the Dao and becoming the Heavenly Dao wasn’t as easy as everyone imagined... but it wasn’t impossible either.","It’s both difficult and simple—a paradoxical situation.","Subduing the myriad worlds is indeed one condition for proving the Dao and becoming the Heavenly Dao. After all, if someone can truly overpower the myriad worlds, then their position as Heavenly Dao would be secure.","But in reality, not every Heavenly Dao throughout history accomplished the feat of subduing the myriad worlds—some of them didn’t even match the power of the Confucian Saints.","Although most Heavenly Daos had power comparable to the Confucian Saints before proving the Dao, the standards for proving the Dao seemed to differ in every era.","So perhaps it’s not always about “defeating everyone,” but rather fulfilling certain conditions and being recognized as worthy to prove the Dao and attain immortality!","Theoretically, any Immortal who has stepped onto their own path has the potential to prove the Dao and become the Heavenly Dao.","“Could Tyrannical Song have fulfilled some hidden condition?” speculated the top-tier experts.","...","In the Core World.","Golden Tranquil, along with the Ancient Heavenly Court’s Immortals and the Northern Emperor, seized the opportunity to retreat from the “Ancient Heavenly Court” region.","At the same time, Golden Tranquil extended her hand, using a gentle force to pull Su Clan’s Sixteen toward her, bringing her closer to the “Heavenly Court Fragment.”","Sixteen’s tribulation was still ongoing, and she couldn’t stray too far... Now was the time for her to receive the reward of the opportunity she had gained.","“Fellow Daoist Daozi, in the end, we’re entrusting our obsessions and our redemption to you!” Golden Tranquil said weakly.","Expending so many “substitutes” at once had nearly drained her.","“This is my chance at redemption too,” Daozi replied.","This was his only and final chance to save his junior brothers. Now that he had it, he wouldn’t let go.","Whoosh~","In the heavens, the rules of the previous Heavenly Dao began to operate. Like a rigid program, as long as the activation conditions were met, it would be triggered.","A pillar of light imbued with the aura of immortality descended from the sky, enveloping Daozi.","Daozi’s body was wrapped in immortal energy, beginning his transformation.","The undying and unending information flooded into his body, transforming his physical form and soul.","This scene was reflected in the myriad worlds.","Normally, when someone proves the Dao and ascends to Heavenly Dao, they can choose whether or not to reveal their identity, or even whether to broadcast their ascension to the myriad worlds.","But Daozi took a shortcut and wasn’t fully proving the Dao—he was merely becoming an interim 8.5th Heavenly Dao.","He had no control over this process.","So, his image began to be broadcast across the myriad worlds.","In that instant, cultivators across the myriad worlds saw a scholar in Confucian attire, sitting high on a golden throne.","Behind him was a phantom image of the “Ancient Heavenly Court.”","“It’s not Tyrannical Song?”","“Who is this scholar, a member of the Confucian School?”","“It’s Daozi, one of the Thirteen Tribulation Immortals of the Confucian School! But wasn’t he insane?”","“When did Daozi prove the Dao and become an Immortal?”","At that moment, the message boards across the myriad worlds exploded.","“Can he defeat Tyrannical Song?”","“The Thirteen Tribulation Immortals of the Confucian School are indeed powerful, and Daozi is the top disciple of the Confucian Saint... But he’s not the Confucian Saint himself. Why is it him who’s proving the Dao?”","This was completely unexpected.","No one had anticipated that it wouldn’t be Tyrannical Song proving the Dao, but rather Daozi, who had been much less prominent recently.","...","In the neighboring Heavenly Emperor Palace.","Song Shuhang, who was in a half-revived state, looked stunned.","He knew that Golden Tranquil, the Northern Emperor, Daoist Red Cloud, and Daozi—these top experts across the myriad worlds—would definitely create some major news event.","But he never expected the news to be this big, this explosive!","They actually managed to churn out a Heavenly Dao!","“Kneel to the big shots,” Song Shuhang muttered in awe.","After all, an elder is still an elder!","Even though he, Song Shuhang, had pulled off some wild moves, it was nothing compared to creating a “Nine Nether Ruler’s clone.”","Yet these big shots had directly gone and created an “Undying Heavenly Dao”!","This move deserves all the praise!","Song Shuhang quickly contacted the Northern Emperor: “Senior, you’re incredible...”","He was just about to shower the Northern Emperor and the other big shots with praise.","But just as he was about to start, the image of Daozi, projected across the myriad worlds and sitting high on the “Heavenly Emperor Throne,” suddenly changed.","Beside the majestic figure of Daozi, another figure appeared.","This figure hovered behind Daozi, like a ghost clinging to his back.","“Heavenly Emperor’s Child?” Song Shuhang’s first thought was this possibility.","But as soon as the thought crossed his mind, that ghostly figure became more solid.","The ghostly figure manifested, taking the shape of a young man.","The man had a gentle and kind expression, and just by looking at the lower half of his face, he seemed quite handsome.","“Isn’t that me?” Song Shuhang was bewildered.","Why was he appearing like a ghost, clinging to Senior Daozi’s back?","And the cultivators across the myriad worlds were in an uproar once again.","“It’s Tyrannical Song, it’s Tyrannical Song!”","“So Tyrannical Song was here all along. I knew it, how could it not be Tyrannical Song proving the Dao?”","“Even if it wasn’t Tyrannical Song directly, it had to be something related to him!”","“This is the correct way to go about it.”","Don’t ask why. Just know it’s always Tyrannical Song!","“Wait, that’s not me,” Song Shuhang muttered as he closely observed the ghostly figure hovering behind Daozi—he realized that this ghostly version of himself looked older!"]},{"number":2947,"title":"Chapter 2947: The Whisper of the Old Overlord Song","paragraphs":["Chapter 2947: The Whisper of the Old Overlord Song","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Song Shuhang’s reference to “old” doesn’t pertain to any physical differences, but rather to the distinction in aura and temperament.","Take his current self, for instance. Although he doesn’t look physically older compared to last year, the overwhelming challenges and life-altering experiences he’s encountered over the past year have made him seem more weathered and mature.","Even if his appearance hasn’t changed, his aura makes him seem much “older.”","The “Ghost Song Shuhang” behind Daozi shared this characteristic—while he looked very similar to Song Shuhang, his demeanor seemed noticeably more mature.","Even though the “Ghost Song Shuhang” floated behind Daozi like a cloak, his presence still exuded an unmistakable sense of maturity.","A truly mature man looks composed and seasoned no matter what he does.","“Shuhang, what did you do?” The Northern Emperor immediately contacted the still-reviving Song Shuhang, his tone urgent.","This 8.5th Heaven’s Path Plan is critical to him, too. Like Wooden Song, he has a dear friend he wants to save. Therefore, he hopes the 8.5th Heaven’s Path Plan will succeed without a hitch.","Moreover, the throne of the Heavenly Emperor that Daozi is sitting on is something he exchanged for, by sacrificing his pride, for a chance to use it. Now, the anomaly behind Daozi is clearly connected to the Heavenly Emperor’s throne.","If it weren’t for Song Shuhang’s well-known character, the Northern Emperor might have considered filing a complaint with the “Consumer Protection Association” against Overlord Song!","Song Shuhang quickly clarified: “It’s not me, Senior Northern Emperor. I have no idea how that ghost version of me appeared... But look closely; it’s not really me. He looks a bit older than me.”","The Northern Emperor fell silent for a moment before responding: “Even if he appears slightly older than you... can you honestly say he has no connection to you?”","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","The Northern Emperor had hit the nail on the head.","The truth is, even if this “Ghost Song Shuhang” looks older, his face and appearance are unmistakably similar.","If someone were to claim that this “Ghost Song Shuhang” has no connection to the real Song Shuhang—even Song Shuhang himself wouldn’t believe it!","Why else would this ghost take on his likeness if there was no connection?","Song Shuhang conducted a quick self-assessment.","At the moment, he was still in the “reviving” state.","His “Iron Clone” hadn’t fled.","His “Three Corpses Avatar” was still intact.","His “Song Youyou” remained in the Netherworld.","His “Overlord Corpse,” the avatar integrated with the “Heavenly Dao Remnant,” was still in the Evil Lotus World.","“Could it be my secret technique clone? The one that disappeared with Onion Maiden?” A sudden thought struck Song Shuhang.","Onion Maiden, Song Shuhang’s clone, Heart Demon Akasha Sword, and Nine-Repair Phoenix Saber had all vanished into a black hole during the “Heaven’s Path Little Black Room Tunnel Explosion.”","But afterward... the Nine-Repair Phoenix Saber returned to him, fully upgraded to the Eighth Stage. Onion Maiden, Heart Demon Akasha Sword, and his clone, however, never reappeared.","“But, no... My clone wasn’t a ghost.” Song Shuhang frowned.","As he pondered, the Northern Emperor asked again: “Do you have any ideas? Will your “Ghost Song” interfere with Daozi’s path to ascension?”","“Sorry, Senior Northern Emperor, but I’m just as clueless about this “Ghost Song.” I’ve checked all my clones and avatars, and they’re all in normal states. The one problematic clone isn’t even a ghost. As for the ghostly figure behind the Heavenly Emperor’s throne, I have no idea...”","“Wait, the Heavenly Emperor’s throne! What if “Ghost Song” is connected to the Heavenly Emperor’s Child? That throne belongs to her. Could the “Heaven’s Path Ceremony” have triggered her resurrection? And maybe I accidentally became her resurrection’s anchor point? That could explain the emergence of “Ghost Song”!” Song Shuhang speculated as a sudden realization dawned on him.","The Northern Emperor was left speechless.","“Also, could it be related to the Thirteen Tribulation Immortals of Confucianism? My first spirit ghost was borrowed by the Glazed Scholar, one of the Thirteen Tribulation Immortals, who is closely connected to Daozi.” Song Shuhang felt like his brain was suddenly flooded with ideas, each potential connection surfacing in rapid succession.","“Wait, maybe it’s also linked to the “Heavenly Dao Ball”? When it collapsed, one of my necrotic kidneys got sucked in.” Song Shuhang recalled yet another detail.","The Northern Emperor was speechless.","“Or maybe it’s because someone accessed my “Core World”? I’ve mentioned before that the Core World absorbs “Heavenly Court Dao.” Now, the Confucian Heavenly Court fragments and my own Heavenly Court fragments, which are in the Core World, have all had their “Heavenly Court Dao” absorbed... Perhaps that triggered some sort of mutation?” Song Shuhang frowned.","On the other end, after carefully considering everything, the Northern Emperor finally decided: “Let’s cut ties, Overlord Song!”","You’re like a walking “event core”; wherever you stand, chaos follows.","To avoid getting caught up in another major incident, the Northern Emperor felt it was best to sever ties with Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang: “...”","At the same time, in the void, within the “Heavenly Dao Projection,” Daozi remained seated on the Heavenly Emperor’s throne, steady as ever.","He turned his gaze toward the “Ghost Song Shuhang” floating behind him.","With the insight of someone on the brink of becoming the 8.5th Heavenly Dao, one look at the “Ghost Song” revealed much to Daozi.","“Everyone, don’t worry. The Ghost Song Shuhang behind me won’t interfere with our ascension plan.” Daozi’s voice echoed in the minds of the Northern Emperor, Song Shuhang, and the others.","With Daozi’s reassurance, the Northern Emperor, the Eight-Armed Ancient Demon from Beyond the Skies, and the Great Master of the Diamond Temple all breathed a sigh of relief.","In the projection.","The Ghost Song Shuhang transitioned from floating to standing behind Daozi.","Then, he leaned in close to Daozi’s ear, whispering something.","After listening to “Ghost Song’s” words, Daozi’s expression suddenly changed.","His gaze sharpened, sweeping across a corner of the void like a blade.","“I won’t let you ruin my plan. This is my last chance... my teacher’s final request! Anyone who tries to thwart my plan will die!” Daozi declared coldly.","His voice grew even icier, like the mechanical hum of a soulless machine.","Daozi’s obsession was with his fellow disciples.","No one could stand in the way of his last opportunity.","After his sweeping gaze, Daozi flipped his hand.","The Confucian Saint’s “Confucian Canon” was summoned forth.","The next moment, Daozi hefted the hefty “Confucian Canon” and without hesitation, hurled it toward the corner of the void he had locked onto.","The projection of the myriad worlds still maintained the illusion of “Daozi’s ascension.”","Daozi’s strike carried the force of an “about-to-be-immortal” existence—an attack on the cusp of becoming the Heavenly Dao!","With one strike, the void shattered, spiritual energy annihilated... Over a hundred destructive heavenly phenomena engulfed that corner of the void!"]},{"number":2948,"title":"Chapter 2948: The New Year’s Event Hosted by Heaven and the Cultivation Chat System!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2948: The New Year’s Event Hosted by Heaven and the Cultivation Chat System!","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","As the scene of Daozi launching his attack played out, it was broadcasted across all realms, causing a massive stir among cultivators everywhere.","In the void, the image of Daozi striking at a certain point made the cultivators feel as if the attack was coming directly at them. The massive “Confucian Classic” he wielded seemed like the iron fist of knowledge, ready to smash into their faces.","Weaker cultivators, faced with this terrifying sight, collapsed to the ground. Thankfully, it was just a broadcast—had it been real, mere collapse would have been the least of their worries.","However, the stronger cultivators with steadfast wills managed to withstand the pressure, keeping their gaze fixed on the broadcast. For them, enduring this challenge was a great trial, one that could significantly strengthen their Dao Heart.","At the same time, countless questions arose in their minds:","“What did Senior Ba Song whisper to Daozi that made him so suddenly enraged?”","“Who is Daozi attacking? Is there really someone foolish enough to challenge him at this time?”","—","Boom!","Daozi’s attack obliterated a portion of the void.","To the viewers, it seemed impossible that anything could survive such a devastating strike—it was simply too overwhelming. Not even the formidable strength displayed by Senior Ba Song earlier could compare to Daozi’s current might.","Yet, just as the void began to crumble, two figures emerged from the chaos.","Below, Song Shuhang’s eyes narrowed.","His gaze, as sharp as a polished blade, locked onto the two figures. He knew their “names” well.","The Void Sun Guardian and the Stellar Doomsayer.","Among these, the Stellar Doomsayer was composed of many individual entities, while the Void Sun Guardian appeared to be a powerful eternal being, fragmented into countless “Void Suns.” However, these fragments seemed to operate independently; even if one were destroyed, it wouldn’t affect the original body—a truly unique condition.","In the void, both the Stellar Doomsayer and Void Sun Guardian were in a pitiful state. They each had been holding what seemed to be a scroll or book, but Daozi’s sudden strike had reduced them to mere fragments.","The Void Sun Guardian’s book had been reduced to just a binding strip, while the Stellar Doomsayer only had a tattered page left. The cloaks they wore were also incinerated by Daozi’s attack—these cloaks and books had shielded them from complete annihilation.","But now, without those two books, surviving Daozi’s next move seemed futile. Those books were crucial tools for them to interfere with Daozi’s ascension. Without them, how could they possibly stop him?","They had considered fleeing, but before they could even act on the thought, Daozi had already made his move.","With a casual flick of his wrist, Daozi summoned a scroll-like artifact covered in complex test questions. The scroll materialized an endless sea of questions, deep and profound—an ocean of knowledge.","The vast question sea engulfed the Void Sun Guardian and the Stellar Doomsayer, sealing their movements and confining their souls within the unending questions. There was no escape unless they could answer every question in the sea within a short span of time.","This was the nightmare of all scholars! If you didn’t study hard enough, if you didn’t acquire sufficient knowledge, how could you even think of fighting?","The Void Sun Guardian was an extremely powerful eternal being—if it tried, it might actually solve all the questions in the sea given enough time.","But Daozi had no intention of giving them that time.","As the question sea sealed off their retreat, Daozi clenched his fist. Empowered by Heaven’s Will, his fist broke through the limitations of space and relentlessly pummeled the Void Sun Guardian and the Stellar Doomsayer!","Daozi’s fists struck at a speed of millions of punches per second, an onslaught so overwhelming that the exact number of blows landed was impossible to count.","Yet, despite the rapidity of his strikes, Daozi controlled his strength with precision. This wasn’t just an attack—it was a venting of his fury, expressed through countless blows.","Among the top-tier eternal beings witnessing this scene, some found old wounds—long healed—suddenly aching again. They had once been crushed like this by the Confucian Sage, but Daozi, with Heaven’s Will as his aid, was even more ruthless.","At least when the Confucian Sage threw a punch, he had to open a “space gate,” and his fist would come through from the other side.","But Daozi’s fists ignored the boundaries of space entirely. His fists could simultaneously appear anywhere across the realms, even manifesting in multiple places at once.","Each punch he threw carried the full weight of his rage.","If only he weren’t punching so fast, Daozi would have loved to add a verbal taunt with each punch for maximum effect—but even he couldn’t imagine shouting out millions of insults per second.","After a few seconds, Daozi withdrew his fists.","During that short span, he had delivered billions of punches!","With Heaven’s Will empowering him, his strength was perfectly controlled, ensuring every blow landed solely on his targets. Otherwise, the force of those billions of punches would have reduced an entire world to ashes.","The Void Sun Guardian and the Stellar Doomsayer, who had given Song Shuhang so much trouble earlier—causing him to explode once—were now nothing but ash, obliterated by Daozi’s relentless fists.","This end was far more agonizing than a swift death by a single punch.","“Pity... but no matter,” Daozi murmured as he lowered his fists.","The ghostly figure of Song Shuhang leaned in to whisper something in Daozi’s ear, causing his anger to subside slightly. He nodded faintly.","Together with the ghostly Song, Daozi ascended to a certain height before disappearing.","Immediately afterward, a notification rang out in the minds of cultivators across all realms, via their Cultivation Chat System:","[System Alert: As the new year begins, we wish all fellow cultivators across the realms a Happy New Year and good fortune.]","[To celebrate the new year, the Cultivation Chat System, in collaboration with Heaven, will host a ‘New Year’s Event’ across the realms.]","[During the event, any cultivator who can collect the heads of two Void Sun Guardians or Stellar Doomsayers will be eligible to exchange them for a super reward through the Cultivation Chat System.]","[Additionally, anyone who can provide information on the whereabouts of the Void Sun Guardian or Stellar Doomsayer can also exchange their findings for rewards, with the level of rewards varying based on the quantity and quality of the information.]","With Heaven joining forces with the Cultivation Chat System for the New Year’s event, the prestige of the occasion skyrocketed!"]},{"number":2949,"title":"Chapter 2949: Unprecedented!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2949: Unprecedented!","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This is essentially the new Heavenly Dao endorsing the “Cultivation Chat System”!","With the Heavenly Dao personally endorsing it, no product across the myriad realms can boast such a privilege.","As the system’s prestige soared, the power ceiling for “Cultivation Chat System” users quietly began to rise.","Originally, some top-tier big shots across the myriad realms either were in deep seclusion and hadn’t downloaded the “Cultivation Chat System,” or felt that the system seemed too trivial. Even those who had downloaded it didn’t engage with it much, and some outright dismissed its minor features, uninterested in benefits like the “sermons.”","“Ba Song” and his “Cultivation Chat System” weren’t some universally beloved spiritual stones; it wasn’t possible to force everyone across the myriad realms to like it.","In fact, even if it were spiritual stones, there were still some big shots who could smile and say, “I’m not interested in spiritual stones.” So, it’s even less surprising that they would have little interest in the “Cultivation Chat System.”","But now, a new Immortal has proved their Dao!","This is the true headline event across the myriad realms—no event in the coming eras could be more explosive or significant than a big shot proving their Immortality!","So, even those top-tier big shots in deep seclusion were so shocked that they had no choice but to emerge from their closed-door cultivation.","“A new Heavenly Dao proved their Dao? I’ve only been in seclusion for a hundred years!”","“I just started a long-term seclusion! I’ve only been in for ten years, and the world’s changed this much?”","“A few months ago, while in seclusion, I vaguely sensed the collapse of the Heavenly Dao. So, I planned to stay in seclusion for another ten years, adjust to my best state, and then break through... Now, a new Heavenly Dao has already proved their Dao? Did I miss a lot?”","“[Have I only been in seclusion for three years? Could it be that I’ve entered a special state of enlightenment, and a single glance already spans millennia?”","These top-tier long-life cultivators who emerged from deep seclusion were utterly bewildered.","Some had been in seclusion for hundreds or thousands of years, while others had only been in for ten years, three years, or even just a single year.","Especially those who had only been in seclusion for one year—they were completely lost.","So much had happened in just one year.","Thus, even after just a year of seclusion, they had been left behind by the times, unable to keep up with the year’s information.","Upon emerging, they were bombarded with tons of information—sermons by Saints, among other things, all waiting for them to absorb.","But the sermons were secondary... The most important news was the explosive headline of a new Immortal proving their Dao and the collaboration between the new Immortal and something called the “Cultivation Chat System,” which was launching a “New Year Event” for cultivators across the myriad realms.","Due to the Heavenly Dao’s prestige, these top-tier big shots who had just emerged from seclusion couldn’t help but download the “Cultivation Chat System” and register accounts.","If the Heavenly Dao was endorsing something, that meant it was connected to the Heavenly Dao.","For those seeking to glimpse the ultimate secrets of Immortality, perhaps this “Cultivation Chat System” could serve as a path.","Similarly, those top-tier big shots who initially dismissed the “Cultivation Chat System” or downloaded it but didn’t use it much—or hadn’t downloaded it at all—immediately reopened or downloaded the system, clicking into it without hesitation, thanks to the Heavenly Dao’s endorsement.","And in this “New Year Event” hosted by the “Cultivation Chat System” across the myriad realms, the task of collecting two “Solar Guardians’ or Starfall Doom-bringers’ heads” was, in fact, aimed at this segment of top-tier big shots!","Whether it’s two Solar Guardian heads, two Starfall Doom-bringer heads, or one of each, all could be directly exchanged for rewards through the “Cultivation Chat System” with the Heavenly Dao!","The rewards that the Heavenly Dao could offer to these top-tier big shots were already quite clear—Heavenly Dao-level sermons, or perhaps the chance to slightly glimpse “Immortal Information” or “Pseudo-Immortal Information.”","After all, these big shots had already reached their limits in power, sitting at the forefront of the long-life cultivators, just a tier below superpowers like the “Confucian Saints” and the “Heavenly Court’s Emperor.”","With their current levels, it was nearly impossible for them to progress further... Perhaps only by touching the Heavenly Dao and Immortal Information could they advance further.","Meanwhile, the task to “Simply locate the tracks of the Solar Guardians or Starfall Doom-bringers” was targeted at the high-end combat forces of the myriad realms—Ninefold Tribulation Immortals, Eighth Realm Saints, and even some battle-hardened Seventh Realm Masters.","This segment of the high-end combat forces had various means to search for traces of Solar Guardians or Starfall Doom-bringers, but they lacked the power to fight them.","With the release of these two tasks, top-tier big shots and high-end combat forces across the myriad realms were all mobilized.","However, the “8.5th Heavenly Dao,” Daoko, was not yet satisfied. He decided to add another activity to the event—since it was a “New Year Event for Everyone,” ordinary cultivators couldn’t be left out, right?","After all, ordinary cultivators were the true foundation of the myriad realms!","So, using the “Heavenly Dao Authority” that he hadn’t fully mastered, the “Half Heavenly Dao” Daoko captured a specific piece of information.","[——Whoever can locate and capture or slay members of the “Sun Worship Sect” or “Starfall Cult” across the myriad realms can directly exchange them for New Year’s gifts with the Heavenly Dao through the “Cultivation Chat System”! The higher the rank and the greater the number of captured or slain members, the more abundant the gifts.]","[Note: Ten Bronze Gifts can be combined into a Silver Gift, ten Silver Gifts can be combined into a Gold Gift, and ten Gold Gifts can be combined into a Supreme Gift... Opening ten or a hundred Supreme Gifts in a row will yield even richer rewards!]","[Attachment: Comprehensive Information on the Sun Worship Sect and Starfall Cult.]","Clearly... these Sun Worship Sect and Starfall Cult members were related to the Solar Guardians and Starfall Doom-bringers.","The task released by the “8.5th Heavenly Dao” Daoko was a call to mobilize all the cultivators across the myriad realms to deal with their enemies.","Using the collective power of the people across the myriad realms, they would raise a tidal wave of unimaginable proportions!","This New Year Event would be a revelry of unprecedented magnitude, one never seen before and never to be seen again!","Universal celebration!","In the core world, within the Heavenly Emperor’s Palace.","Song Shuhang quietly observed the three tasks released by the “Cultivation Chat System.”","At this moment, he was certain—the “Ghost Song” attached to Senior Daoko’s side was none other than himself!","Launching a “New Year Event” to target the Solar Guardians and Starfall Doom-bringers had been part of his plan all along.","And the later additions of treasure chests, chest combinations, and the ten or hundred consecutive openings... were all reminiscent of the mobile games that once made his liver quiver.","“Is it the future me?” Song Shuhang wondered silently.","He didn’t have the ability to transcend time, like Future Child, and appear in his own past.","But he did have the strange “dream-walking” ability.","Was it the future me who dream-walked into Senior Daoko’s Dao-proving moment?"]},{"number":2950,"title":"Chapter 2950: The Principle Behind Tyrannical Song’s Path to Immortality","paragraphs":["Chapter 2950: The Principle Behind Tyrannical Song’s Path to Immortality","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","If this really is... my future self, visiting the present through a dream while Daozi is in the midst of proving the Dao, then what kind of experiences must my future self have gone through to become so weathered?","Though the face and appearance are the same, the “Ghost Song” attached to Daozi looks at least ten years older than the current me.","What could have happened that made him mature like that?","Aside from death, what else can make a man grow up? Is it marriage, having kids, family responsibilities, the cost of baby formula, mortgage payments, car loans, children’s education costs, financial pressure... or maybe even the thought of a daughter getting married? This thought popped into my mind.","Death, or rather the near-death state, can lead to maturity by forcing one to see things more clearly.","Besides death, a man matures for those reasons I just mentioned.","Of course, there are even more pessimistic and desperate reasons.","For example, heartbreak. Or the loss of a loved one...","However, “Ghost Song” just seems more mature, without any hint of deep sorrow on his face. This suggests he hasn’t experienced anything that tragic.","“Except for getting married and having kids... I don’t have to worry about family burdens, financial pressure, or car and house issues anymore,” I said to myself.","As for housing, I have the Core World. I’m set to become the biggest real estate mogul in the cultivation world—definitely not short on homes!","Financial pressure is there; right now, I’m the biggest pauper in the “Nine Provinces Number One Group.”","But with the “Cultivation Chat System” in place, my future financial stress should ease up.","As for what I owe Senior White, he’s not charging interest, so I can pay it back slowly. Eventually, I’ll be debt-free, so money shouldn’t be too much of a concern either.","And when it comes to my kids’ education, that’s the least of my worries. With the seniors in the “Nine Provinces Number One Group” and all my protective artifacts, my future children and even my little sister, who will be born in half a year, will start their education at the highest level across all heavens and worlds.","So... is it because my daughter got married?","Which daughter?","Li Yinzhu? Xiao Lingxiao? Or is it my future daughter who hasn’t been born yet?","As one of the top figures in the heavens and worlds, a “Three Corpses Severing Tribulation Immortal,” my mind operates at an unimaginable speed.","When a thought forms, it can instantly branch out and evolve into numerous scenarios. Each branch can develop into hundreds of complete storylines.","In terms of word count, each thought could extend to at least three million words.","I even managed to imagine what my daughter might look like in nearly three hundred different ways.","Just as I was getting carried away, imagining multiple scenarios where my daughters get married, the “Cultivation Chat System” sent me a flood of information.","This data was relayed through Daozi, the 8.5th Heavenly Dao, and it’s precious information related to [Death].","I have two clues regarding my “Path to Immortality.”","One is related to “Death,” a prototype I developed after countless encounters with powerful beings, dying, and reviving repeatedly.","The other is tied to the “Cultivation Chat System,” a path so complex that it’s terrifying—completely beyond the reach of any cultivator. I have no way to grasp or deduce this path.","So, I’ve only ever tried to deduce my own “Death Path.”","Initially, I thought my “Death Path” might be something like “Seizing a thread of life in the midst of nine deaths,” a path where one seeks life in the face of death.","Or it could overlap with Senior Skylark’s “Revival Path,” being a variant of the resurrection path.","But now, the data transmitted from Daozi doesn’t match either of these interpretations.","After analyzing the data, combined with the information from my own body, the “Death Path” I possess becomes clearer.","After careful analysis, I frown—this “Death Path” is extreme.","This path to immortality straddles the line between life and death... but it’s different from Pavilion Master Chu’s path of the “Cycle of Life and Death,” where withering and flourishing endlessly alternate.","This “Death Path” requires me to remain in a state where I’m dead but haven’t fully revived.","Neither alive nor dead.","Dead, but not completely.","Revived, but not fully.","“Is this like the ‘dead but can’t die any further’ state of Cheng Gou Dan and Emperor Son?” I pondered.","Cheng Gou Dan is the typical example of someone who’s “truly dead,” a state where his soul and body are annihilated, yet he can still walk, talk, and even provide external support to me.","The Emperor Son’s state is slightly weaker than Cheng Gou Dan’s. Although she’s marked as “dead and can’t die any further,” ever since her “death,” she hasn’t sent me her daily energy drip, nor has she spoken or appeared again.","Following this line of thought, I examined my own body.","Yes!","It’s this special state!","Dead, and on the verge of revival.","But the revival process is being suppressed—the cooldown timer is long, and I can’t fully revive.","Neither dead nor alive.","**But what’s the principle behind this “Death Path” leading to immortality?** I furrowed my brow.","An immortality path needs to make sense; it requires a logical foundation.","Whether it’s the Puppet Path, Cheng Lin’s Reincarnation Path, or Pavilion Master Chu’s “Withering and Flourishing Cycle,” where withering nourishes flourishing, and flourishing eventually withers—they all make sense as paths to eternal existence.","They are theoretically sound paths to immortality.","But what’s the logic behind this “Neither Alive Nor Dead” path?","Is it because this state is so unique, placing me in some “no-man’s land” between life and death, where death can’t claim me, and life can’t restrict me, that I can attain immortality?","“If this is really the principle, then this path to immortality has flaws... just like that genius from the Ink Sect’s Puppet Path—it loses certain characteristics and concepts of ‘life,’” I mused.","I may have lost the ability to reproduce... but I haven’t lost hope, I still have dreams.","If I lose the characteristics of “life” entirely, then I might be facing a hopeless situation, one that even the “Path of Life” can’t save me from.","So, if the principle behind this immortality path is “Neither Alive Nor Dead,” should I really walk this path?","I hesitated.","And why did Daozi send me the data to complete this “Path to Immortality”?","“Cheng Lin and the Heavenly Emperor seem to be deliberately maintaining this state too...”","Clues gathered in my mind.","My computational power as a Three Corpses Severing Tribulation Immortal focused like never before, running at overclocked speeds.","Every memory, every piece of data, every bit of information in my mind was poured into this computation.","“Wait... two different entities proving the Dao together.”","“What if... these two entities, one alive and one dead, could achieve immortality together?”","Does it have to be that both entities are alive to prove the Dao?","If one of them is dead, could there still be a loophole?"]},{"number":2951,"title":"Chapter 2951: Reuniting the Shattered Sphere","paragraphs":["Chapter 2951: Reuniting the Shattered Sphere","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","After pondering the possibility of “exploiting the loophole in the Heavenly Dao,” Song Shuhang contacted Senior White and Senior White Two.","The concept of “two different beings proving the Dao and becoming immortal simultaneously” was a clue left by Heavenly Dao White after his near-transcendence.","Later, Senior White Two left this clue as “homework” for Song Shuhang, asking him to think about how “two different beings could prove the Dao simultaneously.”","Now that Song Shuhang had a lead, he remembered the “homework” and decided it was time to turn it in.","He opened the “Cultivator Chat System,” pulled up Senior White and Senior White Two from his friend list, and created a temporary discussion group.","The system notified him: *[Pet owner (text blurred, crossed out) close friend]White Two and [Admin]White have joined the temporary discussion group!*","“Done with the resurrection?” asked the present-world Senior White.","“What’s up?” inquired Senior White Two.","The new Heavenly Dao proving his Dao was such a significant event that even the dormant Senior White Two had been awakened. Normally, Senior White Two, who experienced intermittent bouts of drowsiness, would sleep for extended periods. But this time, his drowsiness had been forcibly dispelled. Because of his poor sleep, his mental state was a bit unstable.","Song Shuhang replied, “Present-world Senior White, I’m still in the process of resurrecting—just a little longer, and I’ll be done. No need to worry. As for Nine Serenities Senior White, I do have something to report.”","“What kind of ridiculous titles are those?” Senior White Two retorted, clearly displeased.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Driven by a strong survival instinct, Song Shuhang had deliberately chosen to distinguish between the two Senior Whites by adding geographic descriptors, the most ordinary and non-confrontational way to differentiate them!","Currently, as his “Indestructible Whale Gold Core” hadn’t yet restored his resurrection cooldown, Song Shuhang’s survival instincts were terrifyingly strong. There was no way he would dare to call them “White Two” or “White Yoohoo!”","“Titles should indeed be distinct,” said Senior White after a brief thought. “You don’t need to add ‘present-world’ for me, but you can add ‘Nine Serenities’ when referring to Nine Serenities White.”","Senior White Two was speechless.","If it weren’t for his sleep deprivation and poor mental state, he would have immediately argued with the present-world White.","Senior White continued, “Does this sudden Dao-proving by the Confucian Daoist have anything to do with you, Shuhang?”","Song Shuhang nodded, “Yes, it should be related to the ritual held by the Northern Emperor, Daoist Red Scarf, and Cheng Goudan using the ‘Heavenly Court fragments’ within my Core World. However, I don’t know how they managed to elevate Daoist Senior to the position of the Immortal Heavenly Dao.”","After a brief pause, Senior White said, “So, the Confucian Daoist didn’t undergo a regular ‘Dao-proving,’ but instead took some kind of shortcut. White, has there been any activity on the Nine Serenities side?”","Under normal circumstances, once the Dao-proving process was completed, a corresponding “Nine Serenities Ruler” would emerge from the source of the Nine Serenities World!","The Heavenly Dao and the Nine Serenities Ruler share all memories before the Dao-proving. However, the Nine Serenities Ruler’s personality might change in the future due to the influence of the Nine Serenities’ source.","“There’s been some movement, which is why I’m a bit busy,” said Senior White Two.","Song Shuhang was puzzled, “I checked through Song Youyou, but I didn’t sense anything wrong in the Nine Serenities? There’s no movement in the source either.”","“That’s because you’re not me,” Senior White Two replied.","Song Shuhang was confused.","“The movement in the Nine Serenities is something only I can clearly sense. After all, I’ve been entangled with it for so long,” Senior White Two explained without further delay, “It’s Fat Ball... My instincts tell me that Fat Ball might be about to resurrect, reuniting the shattered sphere.”","Song Shuhang was startled. “Fat Ball is going to resurrect?”","He was still traumatized when it came to Fat Ball.","Upon hearing this news, the hair on his arms stood on end.","Moreover... why would Daoist Senior’s Dao-proving lead to Fat Ball’s resurrection?","Did the script get mixed up somewhere?","Shouldn’t there be a Daoist Two Ruler?","“Could Daoist Senior be Fat Ball’s backup plan?”","“No, Daoist Senior is the leader of the Confucian Thirteen Tribulation Immortals—there’s no way he’s Fat Ball’s backup plan.”","“It must be an issue with the Ancient Heavenly Court fragments.”","With his Immortal-level computational power, Song Shuhang quickly pulled out every clue related to the “thread” in his mind.","Ancient Heavenly Court fragments, the Dao of the Heavenly Dao, Fat Ball’s backup plan to complete itself, and the fact that Fairy Cheng Lin, the Northern Emperor, and others used the Heavenly Court fragments to push Daoist Senior into the position of Heavenly Dao. Moreover, the fact that the Nine Serenities didn’t produce a “Daoist Ruler,” but instead, the shattered Fat Ball is now reuniting.","One by one, the clues were pulled out, and Song Shuhang’s mind formed a clear conjecture.","His guess was probably very close to the truth.","“I’ll confirm this with Cheng Goudan later.”","As he thought about this, Song Shuhang replied to Senior White Two, “So, Senior White, are you trying to stop Fat Ball from resurrecting?”","“No,” Senior White Two replied seriously, “I’m looting Fat Ball’s inheritance.”","Song Shuhang was confused.","Senior White Two explained, “Since Fat Ball was thoroughly finished, I knew about its inheritance, but I wasn’t particularly interested in taking it. I thought I’d leave it for your Song Youyou to play a treasure hunt game with when you had the time.”","Song Shuhang was startled.","“But now that Fat Ball might reunite the shattered sphere at any moment, I need to raid its inheritance grounds before it recovers. I’ll leave it a note reminding it that I borrowed all the treasures, with an infinite-year repayment period,” Senior White Two added mischievously.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","At this point, he couldn’t help but touch his chest, which had already started to heal, feeling his heartbeat up close.","Listen, does the sound of his glass heart beating have a hint of heartbreak?","Overlord Song felt like he had lost another billion today.","Fat Ball’s inheritance left in the Nine Serenities, and several of them at that!","If he had raided them all, it might have been enough to pay off his massive debt to Senior White... But now, they all belonged to someone with the last name “White.”","“Oh, right, what did you want to say when you added us? I’m pretty busy right now, so make it quick,” Senior White Two urged.","He was currently sleep-deprived, mentally exhausted, and still had to force his fatigued body to raid Fat Ball’s inheritance and lair—such a tiring task.","“I came to turn in my homework, Senior White,” Song Shuhang replied.","“What homework?” Senior White Two asked, confused.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Senior White Two, you assigned me this homework, and you actually forgot about it?"]},{"number":2952,"title":"Chapter 2952: Why Push So Hard?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2952: Why Push So Hard?","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“This is about the possibility of two different entities achieving the Dao simultaneously,” Song Shuhang replied.","On the other end, Senior White Two remained silent for a while.","“Have you found the answer?” Senior White Two asked, his tone suddenly serious.","Song Shuhang nodded. “I’ve got a bit of a clue. Earlier, after the ‘Daoist Senior’ achieved Dao, he used the Heavenly Dao’s authority to calculate some of the information related to my ‘Path to Immortality.’ This information contains the concepts of ‘dead beyond dead, neither alive nor dead.’”","“What’s the principle behind this Path to Immortality?” Present-World Senior White asked.","“I haven’t figured it out yet,” Song Shuhang replied.","Senior White Two said, “Present-World White, don’t make it hard on Shuhang. The principles behind immortality are too complex. It’s impossible for him to comprehend them fully in such a short time. Besides, even if he doesn’t grasp the ‘principle,’ as long as this is confirmed as a ‘Path to Immortality,’ and has been verified by the Heavenly Dao, then even without understanding the principle, Shuhang can still achieve Dao if he keeps cultivating it.”","The principle isn’t important; what matters is that it’s a Path to Immortality. Just keep pushing forward.","Senior White agreed. “Makes sense.”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Are the two Senior Whites teaming up to mess with me?","Senior White said, “Shuhang, go ahead and share your thoughts.”","“I’ve actually been trying to deduce the principle of this Path to Immortality... During the process, this ‘neither alive nor dead’ Path to Immortality inspired another idea in me!” Song Shuhang explained. “Back then, the clue left by the Heavenly Dao White was ‘two different entities achieving Dao simultaneously,’ but it didn’t mention whether these two entities were dead or alive.”","“So, you’re considering the possibility of one entity being alive and the other dead. The living one achieves Dao normally, while the dead one tags along in a ‘death state’ to become immortal?” Senior White Two followed Song Shuhang’s line of thinking.","Song Shuhang nodded. “Right. If one of the entities is dead, could this loophole in the Heavenly Dao be exploited?”","Neither of the Senior Whites responded immediately. They each began thinking and calculating.","After a while...","“There’s a problem... If it’s dead, how does it achieve immortality?” Senior White asked.","“The concept of immortality in the Heavenly Dao includes the idea of ‘undying and indestructible.’ If you attempt to use ‘death’ to achieve Dao, it might conflict with that concept,” Senior White Two said, rubbing his chin.","“There’s also another issue. How does the ‘alive’ side cooperate with the ‘dead’ side’s Path to Immortality to allow them to achieve Dao together?” Senior White added.","Song Shuhang thought for a long time before asking, “So, is the plan of one alive and one dead not feasible?”","“Not necessarily. Our understanding of ‘Heavenly Dao’ and ‘immortality’ is still limited. Your idea is at least a starting point. There’s a chance it can be further developed,” Senior White Two said.","Senior White chimed in, “Speaking of further development, I just had a thought—I’m quite interested in how the Confucian Daoist achieved ‘immortality.’ Maybe there’s a connection between the two?”","“What’s the theory behind the Confucian Daoist’s immortal achievement?” Senior White Two asked.","“I suspect the Daoist Senior’s achievement of Dao might be related to the ‘Ancient Heavenly Court Fragments’ and the Heavenly Dao Fat Ball’s ‘self-completion plan.’ We can ask a few of the involved parties for more details. Senior White, hold on a second; let me pull someone in,” Song Shuhang said.","After passing the ‘neither alive nor dead’ Path to Immortality data to Song Shuhang, the Daoist Heavenly Dao immediately went off to adjust to some of the ‘Heavenly Dao’s authority.’","Since the 8.5th Heavenly Dao is destined to be temporary, the Daoist Senior must race against time to fulfill everyone’s desires within the limited time available.","He’s working to undo the ‘incomplete resurrection’ side effects for his junior brothers.","He’s lifting the ancestral curse from the ‘Eight-Armed Primordial Demon.’","He’s breaking the shackles on the immortals from the ‘Ancient Heavenly Court’ for Fairy Cheng Lin.","And if time permits, he’d like to do a favor for little friend Tyrant Song, to settle an old debt.","The Daoist is quite busy.","So, Song Shuhang didn’t want to disturb the Daoist Senior.","He opened his ‘Cultivation Chat System’ friend list, lightly tapped Fairy Cheng Lin’s name, and added her to a temporary discussion group.","System Notification: [Blacklist 1: Deader than Dead Fairy] Fairy Goudan has joined the discussion group.","Fairy Cheng Lin: “???”","Song Shuhang: “(????)?? Hi, Fairy Goudan~”","Fairy Cheng Lin: “???”","Fairy Cheng Lin: “Why push so hard? Song Goudan, I don’t care why you pulled me in, but just for calling me that, goodbye—no, forever goodbye!”","“Fairy Cheng Lin, please wait. It’s not me who’s looking for you; Senior White wants to ask you something,” Song Shuhang hurriedly said.","Fairy Cheng Lin glanced at the two Whites in the discussion group. “...”","“Master White, what do you need?” Fairy Cheng Lin asked.","Senior White nodded and asked, “Fairy Cheng Lin, could you share the principle behind the Daoist Senior’s achievement of immortality?”","“The 8.5th Heavenly Dao Plan?” Fairy Cheng Lin asked back.","Senior White Two said, “So, it wasn’t the 9th Heavenly Dao... Interesting.”","“The plan has already succeeded, so sharing some details isn’t a problem,” Fairy Cheng Lin replied.","She then explained the details of the ‘8.5th Heavenly Dao Plan’ to the two Senior Whites.","After hearing the plan’s details, even Senior White Two couldn’t help but praise, “Fairy Cheng Lin, the plan you all devised is truly astonishing.”","The plan was bold yet meticulous.","Most importantly, it succeeded.","As long as it succeeds, no matter how risky or aggressive the plan was, it will be seen as perfect.","“Thank you for the compliment, Maswter White. Now that I’ve explained everything, can I leave the group?” Fairy Cheng Lin asked.","“Fairy Cheng Lin, please hold on. I’d like you to stay in the group. The next topic we’re discussing might require your input,” Senior White requested.","Initially ready to bid Song Goudan a permanent farewell, Fairy Cheng Lin pondered for a moment after Senior White’s request and then nodded. “Alright, I’ll give you this favor.”","“Thank you,” Senior White said with a slight smile before continuing, “Also, would the Daoist Heavenly Dao’s situation count as two different entities achieving immortality?”","The Fat Ball is an independent entity, and the 8.5th Heavenly Dao ‘Daoist’ is also an independent entity.","“That’s right! The 8.5th Heavenly Dao consists of the Daoist Senior plus the Heavenly Dao Ball, making them two distinct entities!” Song Shuhang’s eyes lit up.","“But this isn’t ‘simultaneous achievement.’ What we need are two different entities achieving Dao at the same time,” Senior White Two pointed out.","Senior White nodded. “Yes, but... this is still a direction to explore. By combining the ‘neither alive nor dead’ Path to Immortality that Shuhang mentioned earlier, we might be able to have two ‘neither alive nor dead’ entities complement each other’s flaws. Then, using the 8.5th Heavenly Dao’s method of self-completion, we could achieve the possibility of ‘simultaneous achievement.’”"]},{"number":2953,"title":"Chapter 2953: The Second Eye","paragraphs":["Chapter 2953: The Second Eye","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","A missing Heavenly Dao Fat Ball + “Heavenly Dao Completion Plan” + a Daoist willing to sacrifice himself to complete the Heavenly Dao = two Heavenly Daos existing in the same era.","However, in this situation, while both the “Heavenly Dao Fat Ball” and the “Daoist” are considered the Heavenly Dao of the 8th era, they didn’t achieve enlightenment at the same time...","Moreover, the Daoist’s ability to attain the 8.5th era’s immortality hinges on the “Heavenly Dao Fat Ball” being gone.","If the Heavenly Dao Fat Ball were still alive before the ritual was completed, the Daoist’s sacrifice to complete the Heavenly Dao would only serve to perfect the “Heavenly Dao Fat Ball,” essentially sending a lamb to the slaughter and filling in the Fat Ball’s missing parts to make it a perfect sphere!","What Song Shuhang and Senior White want is for “two different entities to achieve immortality simultaneously,” so they can’t follow the Heavenly Dao Fat Ball and Daoist model.","However, there’s one thing to be borrowed from the Heavenly Dao Fat Ball and Daoist model—the concept that two incomplete entities can achieve enlightenment simultaneously as the Heavenly Dao of the same era!","As long as these two incomplete entities can complement each other—just like the Daoist completing the Heavenly Dao Fat Ball—there’s a chance, with the right manipulation, for them to achieve immortality together.","Senior White’s idea was to use Song Shuhang’s “neither life nor death” Eternal Life Path attribute to see if it could create two complementary entities—one that’s half-dead, the other half-alive?","Senior White described his idea in the temporary discussion group.","...","“So, what Senior White is suggesting is that before attaining ‘immortality,’ we should first damage the two candidates for enlightenment—damage them to the point of losing part of their existence, similar to the Heavenly Dao Fat Ball. The parts they lose should be able to complement each other, like one losing the upper half of their body while the other loses the lower half?” Senior White Two mused.","Senior White nodded, “That’s the idea.”","“But Shuhang’s ‘neither life nor death’ Eternal Life Path might not necessarily create two complementary incomplete entities,” Senior White Two pondered.","Finally, Song Shuhang found an opportunity to speak up: “In that case, we can ask @Cheng Lin Fairy... Cheng Lin Fairy, when the Daoist was completing the Heavenly Dao, was he fully intact? Or was he missing parts?”","“Missing parts,” Cheng Lin Fairy replied.","Song Shuhang pressed further, “What was missing?”","“The Confucian Sage left behind a book called ‘Confucian Classics,’ which had the ability to bite off part of the Heavenly Dao Fat Ball’s existence. The Daoist used the ‘Confucian Classics’ to activate this ability and bit off a part of himself,” Cheng Lin Fairy explained.","Song Shuhang: “...”","The Daoist was ruthless.","Being cruel to oneself is true cruelty.","“Is the Confucian Sage’s ‘Confucian Classics’ still usable?” Senior White Two asked.","Cheng Lin Fairy shook her head, “I’m afraid not. The Sage’s innate ability, which was attached to the ‘Confucian Classics,’ only manifested when the Daoist activated the book... It was an added effect from the Sage, not an inherent skill of the book itself.”","Senior White from the present world sighed in regret, “What a pity. If we could have studied the Confucian Sage’s ability, perhaps Nine Serenities White and I could have replicated it.”","“How about we wait until the Daoist is free, and I’ll retrieve the ‘Confucian Classics’ to see if there’s any trace of the Sage’s power left?” Song Shuhang suggested.","The “Confucian Classics” is officially in the care of Creation Fairy, but it was borrowed by Mad Blade Three Waves and eventually handed over to the Daoist.","As Song Shuhang spoke, a strange “resonance of the Great Dao” echoed through the void of the heavens and all realms.","This was the 8.5th Heavenly Dao, the “Daoist,” after his ascension, becoming familiar with the Heavenly Dao’s laws and beginning his first attempt to harness the power of the Great Dao.","In other words, it was the new Heavenly Dao’s first command to the heavens and all realms, a direct intervention by the Heavenly Dao.","Under the Daoist’s attempt, a “fate-altering” rule descended from the void.","The Confucian Golden Lotus World opened automatically.","The Second Tribulation Immortal, Wen Zi.","The Third Tribulation Immortal, Yan Zi.","The Seventh Tribulation Immortal, the dull Chi Zi.","The Eleventh Tribulation Immortal, Yu Zi.","Four Confucian Tribulation Immortals, plus Yuan Zi, possessed by a strand of the Kun King’s consciousness, stepped out of the Confucian Golden Lotus World simultaneously.","That “fate-altering” power fell upon them.","The “death karma” that lingered over Wen Zi, Yan Zi, Chi Zi, and Yu Zi was directly severed.","The faint aura of death on them vanished, replaced by boundless vitality.","Their previously “incomplete resurrection” was fully completed under the power of the 8.5th Heavenly Dao.","Each of the thirteen Confucian Tribulation Immortals had the potential to attain immortality... Now, with these four Tribulation Immortals fully resurrected, their bodies complete, all they needed was time to eventually take the final step towards becoming Eternal Beings.","The “Yuan Zi” nearby was also enveloped by the fate-altering power.","However, the Heavenly Dao’s power only flashed across his body before disappearing, as if something had changed, yet nothing seemed different.","The Second Tribulation Immortal, Wen Zi, glanced at “Yuan Zi” in confusion... Could it be that Yuan Zi’s consciousness hadn’t fully dissipated? His body wasn’t just an empty shell, but rather waiting for the right moment to regain consciousness?","Aside from the five Confucian Tribulation Immortals who remained, the Daoist’s power spread across the heavens and all realms, scattering six more strands of “fate-altering” power.","Among these six, two had the attribute of “completing an incomplete resurrection array.” The remains and resurrection arrays of these two Tribulation Immortals had always been secretly kept by the Daoist.","The other four had the effect of healing severe injuries—over the years, four heavily wounded Confucian Tribulation Immortals had secretly taken turns guarding the Confucian sect.","However, due to their severe injuries, they spent most of their time in seclusion, healing.","Now, under the Daoist’s power, the injuries of these four Tribulation Immortals were healed.","“Senior Brother.” When the four Tribulation Immortals opened their eyes, they couldn’t help but tear up.","What their master couldn’t accomplish, their senior brother had done!","After taking care of his thirteen junior brothers’ aftereffects in one go, the Daoist slightly frowned—yet there was no trace of his youngest junior brother, the Glazed Scholar.","The Daoist sighed deeply.","He gently closed the “Confucian Classics,” and suddenly, an object emerged from within, lightly landing in his hand.","It was an eye, seemingly ordinary at first glance.","Yet, this eye was one that could make cultivators across the heavens and Nine Serenities tremble—it was feared by all because of Tyrannical Song’s reputation.","“The teacher’s eye.” The Daoist carefully cradled it.","The appearance of the Confucian Sage’s eye was a gesture of comfort for the Daoist, telling him that he had done well.","The Daoist stared blankly at the eye in his hand.","After pondering for a moment, the Daoist suddenly tossed it lightly.","The “Confucian Classics” and the “Sage’s Eye” both vanished into the void, heading in Song Shuhang’s direction."]},{"number":2954,"title":"Chapter 2954: A Scene Only Visible with Two Eyes","paragraphs":["Chapter 2954: A Scene Only Visible with Two Eyes","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The Ritual Code was something the Little Junior Sister unearthed, so it was returned to her for safekeeping.","The second Sage’s Eye was given to Tyrannical Song as a token of gratitude from Daozi on behalf of the Confucianists.","Tyrannical Song had done too much for the Confucians.","Even this 8.5th Heavenly Dao Ceremony was conducted using Tyrannical Song’s core world and fragments of the Heavenly Court—although the Northern Daoist had already negotiated the borrowing terms with Tyrannical Song, the very act of lending itself was a favor.","As the saying goes, “A drop of water shall be returned with a spring.”","Since Tyrannical Song already had one Sage’s Eye, the second eye should also be handed to him.","The teacher would probably agree with this decision.","After all, in all the worlds, only Tyrannical Song could wield the teacher’s eye so well, making the Sage’s Eye famous.","The Sage’s Eye and Tyrannical Song were fated to be together!","—","At the same time, in the core world...","Tyrannical Song’s upper body had already regenerated. He reached out, summoning a garment, and draped it over himself. He also preemptively wrapped a sheet around his body.","Once properly dressed, he summoned all his accessories back to him.","Particularly the Song Fat Ball Windbreaker!","With the Nine Nether Fat Ball Elder about to resurrect, the presence of the Song Fat Ball had become increasingly dangerous—no one could guarantee when it might suddenly connect with the resurrected Fat Ball Elder and regain its memories.","To prevent any accidents, Tyrannical Song recalled the Song Fat Ball Windbreaker and maintained the connection between the core world and the Evil Lotus World. It would be best to send the Song Fat Ball Windbreaker to Senior White Two.","After all, only Senior White Two could securely suppress the Song Fat Ball Windbreaker at this point.","As Tyrannical Song was recalling his accessories, a thick book suddenly broke through the air.","The book hurtled toward him with the sound of wind and thunder, exuding an imposing aura.","“Who dares attack my princess!” Virtuous Snake Beauty darted out, her electronic voice clear and powerful. She wrapped her body protectively around Tyrannical Song, shielding him from the book.","Clang!","The book struck the forehead of Virtuous Snake Beauty, producing a metallic clang.","“It’s the Ritual Code. It seems that Senior Daozi sensed we needed it, so he sent it back. The Heavenly Dao is terrifying; there’s practically no privacy in front of it. Thankfully, Senior Daozi is a gentleman. If it were someone with more sinister inclinations, who knows how much blackmail material they’d gather and store?” Tyrannical Song mused as he bent down to pick up the Ritual Code.","Virtuous Snake Beauty rubbed her forehead.","Then, she looked at Tyrannical Song.","After picking up the Ritual Code, Tyrannical Song casually flipped through it.","Virtuous Snake Beauty was speechless.","I got hit!","My forehead got smashed by the Ritual Code with a loud clang!","Seeing that Tyrannical Song’s attention was entirely focused on the Ritual Code, Virtuous Snake Beauty rolled her eyes and collapsed to the ground, playing dead like a limp snake. “Ah, the wind is blowing.”","After her long-forgotten play-dead routine, Virtuous Snake Beauty lay on the ground, slyly peeking at Tyrannical Song.","And then... she saw a scene that made her scales stand on end!","Tyrannical Song had pulled an eye out from the Ritual Code.","This eye looked very ordinary, indistinguishable from a normal human eye.","However, any practitioner this year who saw this eye would immediately recognize it!","The second Confucian Sage’s Eye!","Virtuous Snake Beauty felt as if she heard a game-like notification sound in her mind: “Ding~ Congratulations, player ‘Tyrannical Song’ has collected the complete green set ‘Confucian Sage’s Eyes’ (Left) (Right).”","“A Sage’s Eye?” Tyrannical Song lifted the eye gently with his mind power.","At the same time, a blood web emerged from the void.","This was a blood web formed by a drop of Confucian Sage’s Blood that had assimilated with Tyrannical Song’s body. The blood web contained some of Tyrannical Song’s precious organs that couldn’t be regenerated with normal resurrection methods.","For example, the Third Divine Eye and the other Confucian Sage’s Eye...","“A pair of Sage’s Eyes.” Tyrannical Song held them with his mind power.","He actually gathered both of them?","So... should he try putting them on? The thought suddenly crossed Tyrannical Song’s mind.","The moment that thought surfaced, Creation Fairy sensed it and appeared.","She gently approached Tyrannical Song from behind, extending her hands to cover his eye sockets.","Painless eye removal!","Creation Fairy deftly plucked out Tyrannical Song’s recently regenerated eyes and kept them safe for future use.","Then, she skillfully inserted the pair of Confucian Sage’s Eyes into Tyrannical Song’s eye sockets.","The Third Divine Eye also lazily returned to its place in the void.","The Sage’s Blood enveloped the other precious organs, guiding them back into position.","Virtuous Snake Beauty lay on the ground, her head tilted as she stopped pretending to be dead. She watched Tyrannical Song with curiosity—she wanted to see what special changes Tyrannical Song would undergo after acquiring a complete set of eyes.","Hot!","Scorching heat!","As the pair of Sage’s Eyes were placed, Tyrannical Song felt his eye sockets heat up crazily.","Even with his high pain tolerance, the burning sensation was intense—an indication that the temperature was extraordinary.","Luckily, Tyrannical Song’s strength had already reached the Slaying Three Corpses Tribulation Immortal level; otherwise, his eye sockets would have been seared like before by the Confucian Sage’s Eyes.","Due to the constant rise in temperature from the Sage’s Eyes, Tyrannical Song’s eye sockets began secreting Tribulation Immortal Tears, which were then evaporated by the Sage’s Eyes, forming a white mist that enveloped the area in front of his eyes.","After a while...","Tyrannical Song finally adjusted to the Confucian Sage’s Eyes.","He slowly opened his eyes.","The Sage’s Eyes moved nimbly within their sockets.","“Is it foggy?” Tyrannical Song asked.","Pavilion Master Chu poetically replied, “Those aren’t fog; they’re your tears.”","“How about we collect them?” Tyrannical Song suggested—Tribulation Immortal Tears turned into mist were valuable materials for artifact crafting.","As they spoke, Tyrannical Song’s eyes began to shift slightly.","The focus of the Sage’s Eyes locked onto the cloud of ‘mist.’","The mist acted like a screen, and through this ‘screen,’ the Sage’s Eyes saw several fleeting images.","There was a fleeting image of Yun Quezi’s silhouette.","There was a scene of someone holding a child, looking lost.","There was an image of a person meticulously sewing a Confucian robe for a disciple.","There was a powerful arm gently writing Confucian characters on white paper.","Finally... the image froze on the Confucian characters.","Tyrannical Song couldn’t recognize the Confucian characters at all, but through the Confucian Sage’s Eyes, he could miraculously understand their meaning. The Sage’s Eyes had an auto-translate feature.","The Confucian characters contained the Sage’s analysis of his own innate ability.","And... its inheritance.","The Confucian Sage had researched and refined a method to turn his innate ability into a spell, to be passed down.","His research was successful, but also a failure.","—It was successful because the ability could indeed be passed down, but it was a failure because the cost was too great to be acceptable.","By consuming a Confucian Sage’s Eye and a Path of Longevity, one could gain the chance to inherit the Sage’s talent.","The success rate wasn’t even 100%...","Moreover, the Sage’s Eyes were different from Tyrannical Song’s eyes.","There were only two of them—no bulk supply!","The Sage wasn’t like Tyrannical Song, who had a habit of plucking out his own eyes.","In other words, at best, these two Sage’s Eyes could only allow two people to inherit the Sage’s talent, and that’s assuming things went perfectly."]},{"number":2955,"title":"Chapter 2955: Fellow Daoist Song’s Redemption","paragraphs":["Chapter 2955: Fellow Daoist Song’s Redemption","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","If luck isn’t on your side, not only could you fail to inherit the Confucian Sage’s “special talent,” but you might also lose the Sage’s eye... and an entire path to immortality!","The price is nothing short of devastating.","It’s a “do or die” situation!","Such a steep cost would stop even the most powerful beings across the myriad worlds in their tracks.","Even those who stand at the pinnacle of countless worlds and have achieved immortality typically just walk their own path to eternity.","Take the “Heavenly Emperor,” for instance. She possessed a “Heavenly Court Path” and a “Time Path” simultaneously—a rarity even in the vastness of all worlds!","But even the Heavenly Emperor didn’t hold both eternal methods at the same time. She passed the “Heavenly Court Path” to Jin Gua before stabilizing her immortality through the “Time Path.”","Without the Heavenly Emperor’s extraordinary methods, attempting to inherit the Confucian Sage’s “special talent” would mean falling from the immortal realm, even if you succeeded, down to the level of a tribulation immortal...","“The cost and the reward aren’t proportional at all,” Song Shuhang commented.","People might gamble with their lives, but no one would enter into a losing deal.","Exchanging a priceless “Confucian Sage’s eye” plus an entire path to immortality for a talent that might not even succeed? In a normal situation, that’s a deal you’d have to be crazy to take!","The Confucian Sage’s eye—how could that not be valuable?","Just one “Confucian Sage’s eye” had made cultivators across the myriad worlds tremble in fear!","And don’t even mention the path to immortality.","Since ancient times, there might not be enough immortals to average even one per world in the myriad worlds.","Who would be willing to burn through an entire path to immortality?","Except for someone like the Heavenly Emperor, who has unique circumstances, who else could afford such a thing?","“What happens with two Confucian Sage’s eyes?” Pavilion Master Chu couldn’t help but ask, curious.","Fengyi Qinmaster added, “So, the eye we just saw was the Confucian Sage’s?”","“Yes.” Song Shuhang nodded, then he described what he saw through the “pair of Confucian Sage’s eyes” and the Sage’s analysis of the “talent.”","Just as Song Shuhang finished his explanation, White Senior Two’s voice rang out, “We need this talent from the Confucian Sage.”","Core World and Evil Lotus World were closely connected at this moment, so even without using a “temporary group,” White Senior Two was keeping tabs on Song Shuhang.","“Indeed, if we could have two people inherit the Confucian Sage’s ‘devouring others’ existence’ talent... then we must obtain this ability,” Senior White agreed.","After all, there’s no other ability more suited to creating two “imperfect yet complementary” special beings than the Confucian Sage’s “devour the existence of others” technique.","If two people with the Confucian Sage’s talent devoured a part of each other before achieving enlightenment, they could theoretically achieve a “complementary enlightenment.”","“But won’t the cost be too great?” Song Shuhang asked.","“If it can result in two distinct beings achieving enlightenment simultaneously, the price is worth it,” White Senior Two responded.","Sometimes, an exchange that seems unbalanced becomes worthwhile under the right conditions.","“Also, the Confucian Sage’s plan is just a draft... we could refine it and reduce the cost,” Senior White added.","The Confucian Sage had only just begun exploring his talent, and he didn’t push it to its limits.","The hardest part is starting. With the Sage’s “starting point,” Senior White Two and Senior White could continue researching and make improvements.","“For example... we might be able to preserve the ‘Confucian Sage’s eyes’ after they’re used up,” White Senior Two said.","“How would we do that?” Song Shuhang’s eyes lit up.","“Don’t forget about your Immortal Whale Golden Core. It’s an incredible object, so don’t just treat it like a ‘rechargeable resurrection device.’” White Senior Two pointed out, “If you can bind the Confucian Sage’s eyes to your Immortal Whale Golden Core, then even if the Sage’s eyes are sacrificed or turned to ashes, the power of the Immortal Whale Golden Core could restore them from nothing.”","The Immortal Whale Golden Core is like an “immortal bone” with a cooldown. If you time it right, the Confucian Sage’s eyes, originally consumable, could become reusable, like a portable power bank.","“So, how do we bind them?” Song Shuhang’s eyes sparkled.","“That’s what we need to research. When the time comes, bring the Sage’s eyes and the Whale Golden Core to me, and I’ll study them thoroughly,” White Senior Two said.","“Similarly, it might be possible to recover some of the cost of using a path to immortality,” Senior White added.","Following the conversation, Song Shuhang tried to keep up with the advanced topic the two Seniors were discussing. He ventured, “Turn the ‘path to immortality’ into a kind of rechargeable battery, so after it’s used up, it can be recharged and reused. Or, make the cost a ‘partial use of the path to immortality,’ then restore it afterward?”","“That’s unlikely... the consumption of a path to immortality is a foundational part of the Confucian Sage’s plan,” Senior White shook his head.","“But before consuming your path to immortality, you could try backing it up—saving the understanding, data, and information related to the path. Then, if you can’t re-cultivate that path, you could at least pass it on to someone else,” White Senior Two chimed in, complementing Senior White’s thought.","It’s still uncertain whether a path to immortality consumed during the inheritance process could be cultivated again. If not, passing it on to someone close could at least minimize the loss.","One path to immortality per immortal.","If you step down from that path, someone else could step up to inherit it.","Song Shuhang’s eyes lit up. “Like that unwalked path to immortality stored in the merit network? Brilliant.”","He had two potential paths to immortality.","One was the “Non-Life, Non-Death” path.","The other was connected to the “Cultivation Chat” system.","The “Non-Life, Non-Death” path could be sacrificed.","However, the path connected to the “Cultivation Chat” system was too grand—it could only be completed from a perspective that surpasses immortality.","Song Shuhang didn’t have the confidence to master that path to immortality.","...","...","Meanwhile, the 8.5th Heavenly Dao’s “Daozi,” after resolving the lingering issues of the Confucian disciples, took a brief rest.","Then, he began to address “Song Woodenhead’s” obsession, bringing them salvation.","“To those fellow Daoists bound to the ancient Heavenly Court, as promised, I will grant you freedom on behalf of Song Daoist,” Daozi said, drawing a circle of light in the air.","Behind him, several “substitute avatars” emerged and stepped into the circle of light."]},{"number":2956,"title":"Chapter 2956: I’m Coming Out!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2956: I’m Coming Out!","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","As each tribulation substitute appeared, they bowed respectfully in the direction of the Daozi.","These substitutes were created by binding the marks of immortals trapped in the “Heavenly Emperor’s Path of the Heavenly Court” and combining them with Song Woodenhead’s ghost hand techniques.","Now, Daozi was fulfilling his agreement with Song Woodenhead. These tribulation substitutes, representing their true selves, were expressing their gratitude to Daozi.","While bowing, the substitutes shifted their gaze behind Daozi, where a more mature version of Song Shuhang floated calmly, seated cross-legged in a meditative posture.","The tribulation substitutes nodded respectfully to the mature version of Song Shuhang before leaping into the glowing circle one by one.","In Song Shuhang’s Core World...","The Northern Emperor’s form trembled slightly, as if he had just lost something.","He was one of the few members of the Heavenly Court who had managed to escape death through his own backup plans. After his resurrection, the Northern Emperor was no longer bound by the “Path of the Heavenly Court.”","However, there remained a mark of him within the ancient Path of the Heavenly Court—this was why, when Song Woodenhead had appeared to rescue Pavilion Master Chu, there had been a “Northern Emperor” present in his golden spatial world. The “Northern Emperor” in Woodenhead’s space was a tribulation substitute formed from the mark left by the Northern Emperor.","This was also the reason why Puppet Fairy had refused to acknowledge the revived Northern Emperor as the original. She couldn’t sense the familiar aura she once recognized. In her puppet state, her way of identifying things was different from that of living beings.","But now, as the tribulation substitute jumped into the glowing circle and disappeared entirely, the Northern Emperor lost a trace of his icy aura, gaining a faint warmth instead.","His realm seemed to have been subtly liberated, increasing ever so slightly.","Apart from the Northern Emperor, several other ancient Heavenly Court immortals also experienced a change in their aura, achieving true freedom.","Back in the Core World...","Golden Cheng Lin covered her forehead with her hands, shielding her eyes.","At this moment, she didn’t want her companions to see her tearful, elated expression.","Memories of the days spent with her fellow Daoists, playing and fooling around in the ancient Heavenly Court, flooded her mind.","Now, all those companions were finally free from the restraints of the “Path of the Ancient Heavenly Court.” In the near future, they would all return from their sealed states.","“If you want to cry, just cry out loud,” Daoist Chixiao said with a smile. “After all, it’s Cheng Lin’s reputation on the line.”","Golden Cheng Lin was speechless.","Daoist Chixiao made a very good point, but now that he mentioned it, even though she really wanted to cry, Golden Cheng Lin found herself unable to shed a single tear.","She removed her hands from her eyes and laughed. “Daoist, the 8.5th Heavenly Dao Ceremony is complete... Next, according to the contract, I need to take Jin Gua’s ‘Mysterious Island Heavenly Court Fragment’ back to his island and hand over the ‘Emperor Seal.’ I’ll be back soon... In the meantime, I’ll leave the management of things in your capable hands.”","The Emperor Seal was merely a symbol of the Heavenly Emperor during the Ancient Heavenly Court and didn’t have any real power.","However, as per the contract, after Golden Cheng Lin handed over the Emperor Seal to Jin Gua, once everything was settled, the 8.5th Heavenly Dao “Daozi” would bestow the complete “Path of the Heavenly Emperor” upon Jin Gua, making him the one and only officially recognized second-generation Heavenly Emperor.","“Leave it to me,” Daoist Chixiao nodded.","“Well then, everyone, I’ll be back soon.” Golden Cheng Lin extended her hand, and the fragments of the Heavenly Court belonging to the “Mysterious Island” within Song Shuhang’s Core World floated up.","Additionally, a portion of the Heavenly Court fragments originally collected by the “Heavenly Dao Must Step Down Alliance” was also included as part of the payment to Jin Gua—the remaining Heavenly Court fragments would serve as Song Shuhang’s compensation.","This time, under Song Shuhang’s careful restraint, the Heavenly Court fragments from the “Mysterious Island” did not have their embedded “Path of the Heavenly Court” absorbed by the Core World.","After all, this was something Song Shuhang had promised Jin Gua, the Island Master!","However... the “Path of the Heavenly Court” within the Heavenly Court fragments collected by the “Heavenly Dao Must Step Down Alliance” was mostly licked clean by the Core World after the ceremony.","Golden Cheng Lin, carrying numerous Heavenly Court fragments, vanished into the void.","This journey to the Mysterious Island was not just to return the Heavenly Court fragments, but also to visit the Dragon Tomb on the island and see the “Golden Dragon Ancestor’s” resting place.","Now that Golden Cheng Lin’s obsession had been resolved, the 8.5th Heavenly Dao plan had succeeded, and the restraints on the ancient Heavenly Court immortals had been broken, everything was on track.","So, while there was still some time, she intended to visit the Dragon Tomb and meet the Golden Dragon Ancestor... and remind her that staying cooped up in the tomb for too long wasn’t good for her health.","...","Back in the Core World...","“Did Senior Daozi issue a second directive? What’s the instruction this time?” Song Shuhang asked.","The first directive was to relieve the Confucian school of the aftereffects of their incomplete resurrection, but what about this one?","In the temporary discussion group...","Fairy Cheng Lin replied, “It’s to release the restraints on the ancient Heavenly Court members.”","“Are all the ancient Heavenly Court members’ restraints being lifted? Wouldn’t Senior Jin Gua end up as the bachelor emperor?” Song Shuhang asked.","Wouldn’t this be a heavy burden for Senior Jin Gua, who had only just taken on the position of Heavenly Emperor?","“No worries. The ‘Path of the Heavenly Court’ for the second-generation Heavenly Emperor Jin Gua is different from the original... There’s no hidden danger, and it won’t be swallowed up as part of the ‘Heavenly Dao Completion Plan.’ So, in the future, he can gradually reintegrate the Heavenly Court members,” Fairy Cheng Lin explained.","A Heavenly Court with no hidden dangers, combined with the grand momentum of the “Heavenly Court Reestablishment” right before Daozi ascended to the 8.5th Heavenly Dao, had essentially served as an advertisement for Jin Gua.","In the future, there would be a wave of “returning to the Heavenly Court” from survivors scattered across the myriad worlds.","The second-generation Heavenly Emperor Jin Gua would be the ultimate beneficiary.","“Island Master Jin Gua is the second-generation Heavenly Emperor?” Song Shuhang asked, suddenly confused.","He remembered that Senior Copper Trigram had mentioned seeing two Heavenly Emperor tombs—one old and one new—on the Mysterious Island.","Even though they were just cenotaphs.","So why was Island Master Jin Gua still considered the second-generation Heavenly Emperor?","“Was Heavenly Emperor Dadazi the first generation?” Song Shuhang asked.","[Ding~ Your ‘good-for-nothing friend’ the Heavenly Emperor has remotely sent you one drop of energy, with a note: Senior Song, you called for me~]","See! This is the terrifying power of a top-tier big shot.","As long as you say her name, she’ll sense it after running a series of data screening formulas.","Hold on.","[You revived?] Song Shuhang asked.","[Ah, after waiting so long... it’s time to revive. Senior Song, lift up your shirt~] the Heavenly Emperor transmitted her voice.","Song Shuhang: “???”","[I’m coming out,] the Heavenly Emperor replied.","Song Shuhang: “!!!”"]},{"number":2957,"title":"Chapter 2957: Trouble? Bring Me Along!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2957: Trouble? Bring Me Along!","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“So it’s you, Sun Wukong Son of Heaven!”","“Then that makes me Song Iron Fan Shuhang, right?”","“Should I say something to coordinate with you?” Song Shuhang asked.","Celestial Thearch was speechless.","On this day, the Celestial Thearch realized that there are limits to human understanding. Even someone like her could be stumped by some of Song Shuhang’s lines, unable to grasp the underlying meaning and continue the conversation.","“How am I supposed to respond to that?” the Celestial Thearch asked.","Song Shuhang thought for a moment, then said, “Maybe it’s better if you don’t respond... If you force it, it’s going to get really awkward for me.”","“I’ll look into what that means later,” the Celestial Thearch said. “I’ve got plenty of free time now that I’ve been resurrected.”","“Alright,” Song Shuhang replied.","Then he began to lift his shirt in cooperation.","But halfway through, he suddenly remembered something: “Celestial Thearch, why are you resurrecting inside my body?”","As expected, there must have been a reason she insisted that he annihilate her completely. Had she planted a spore in him the moment she died by his hand?","“Wanna guess?” the Celestial Thearch retorted.","Song Shuhang, dead serious, said, “Over the past year, I’ve grown to hate it when people ask me to guess things I have no clue about, so I can’t figure them out; and second, I hate it when people try to read my face for answers when I ask them ‘Wanna guess?’”","The Celestial Thearch laughed, “I’m the opposite... I love seeing the look of utter confusion on someone’s face when I ask them to guess.”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","As they were talking, a “lotus projection” formed on his body.","“It’s this thing?” Song Shuhang was startled.","He remembered this lotus projection. It was from when his Core World had recklessly tried to swallow the Celestial Thearch and lick her “Heavenly Court Dao,” resulting in this massive lotus projection. But it backfired. The Celestial Thearch had severed the giant lotus projection... And in the end, the projection became compensation for Song Shuhang’s Core World secretly licking the Celestial Thearch’s “Heavenly Court Fragment Dao.”","If not for the Celestial Thearch pulling it out now, Shuhang might have completely forgotten about it.","“So, you’ve been hiding in this lotus projection all along? Hiding in my body?”","“No, I’ve been hiding on Little Blackie the whole time~” the Celestial Thearch’s voice replied.","Black Soft Feather: “!!!”","You were hiding on me all this time? When did that happen? How did I not notice at all? Also... I’m not ‘Little Blackie!’","“Butter Song Baihua Huang... Guai Li Six Bean Phoenix.” Little Blackie pondered for a while, unsure what to say, so she just announced her full name.","“If I had hidden directly in you, with your connection to the lotus projection, you would have sensed it right away. But hiding on Little Blackie was easy. With my relationship with her, plus the ‘enlightenment’ and aura concealment I left with you before I died, it was almost impossible for you to notice me~” the Celestial Thearch continued.","Little Blackie: “...”","I just said my name, and you’re ignoring it. That’s rude.","Next to them, Song Shuhang thought for a moment, then mimicked the tone of the Virtuous Lamia, speaking seriously, “Lies obscure the truth and lead the outcome astray!”","Even if the lotus projection was on Black Soft Feather, there was no way he wouldn’t have sensed it. So... the Celestial Thearch wasn’t telling the truth. Or maybe she was mixing in some half-truths. Most likely, he got hit by something when he slashed her to death, or maybe when he floated to the ‘Celestial Thearch’s Throne Two’ during his resurrection.","“Heaven is jealous of geniuses, and they die young,” the Celestial Thearch replied.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","I can’t mess with her, I really can’t.","As they spoke, the lotus projection bloomed.","The lotus bud unfurled, and a tall figure stepped out from within.","The resurrected “Celestial Thearch” still retained Feather Rouzi’s basic appearance—perfectly proportioned long legs, silky smooth long hair. However, her expression seemed more mature compared to Feather Rouzi’s.","“This resurrection state is just right,” the resurrected Celestial Thearch said with a satisfied stretch.","The stretching motion highlighted Feather Rouzi’s stunning figure in every detail!","Creation Fairy raised her hands to cover Song Shuhang’s eyes, blocking his view. After all, these were her master’s eyes. Who knew what powerful functions they might have? What if Song Shuhang got excited and activated one of those powerful functions?","But Song Shuhang didn’t mind.","In fact, at his level of power, seeing things wasn’t limited to using the “eyes” as an organ. Besides, apart from the pair of Confucian Saint’s Eyes, he also had a third godly eye.","After the Celestial Thearch’s resurrection was complete, Song Shuhang reached up and gently poked the Fengyi Qin Lord’s claw on his head.","The Fengyi Qin Lord’s claw responded, “What? You almost poked my eye.”","There was a single eye on her claw.","“Look, it’s a fresh Celestial Thearch, alive and kicking,” Song Shuhang said.","The Fengyi Qin Lord’s claw fell silent.","“I told your main body before, I’m really familiar with the Celestial Thearch, so your main body shouldn’t be messing with the whole ‘resurrecting the Celestial Thearch’ thing. But she wouldn’t believe me,” Song Shuhang said.","The Fengyi Qin Lord’s claw fell silent again.","“But I was once killed by Senior Song~” the Celestial Thearch stepped on air, bent down, and with a tug, pulled the massive “lotus projection” off of Song Shuhang, casually tossing it into her spatial storage.","Even if it was used up, it was still hers, so she had to keep it.","“Should I congratulate you on your perfect resurrection?” Song Shuhang asked, as he checked the Celestial Thearch’s status in his “Cultivation Chat System” again.","Her status had already switched from “dead as can be” to “perfectly reborn.”","Perfect meant she had completely broken free from the “Heavenly Court Dao.”","“If you congratulate me, I still won’t have a red envelope to give you,” the Celestial Thearch replied.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","So shallow, do I look like I care about a red envelope?","“Now that I’m resurrected, I’ve got a bit of business to take care of,” the Celestial Thearch said.","“Causing trouble? Count me in!” Song Shuhang asked—not because he really wanted to join, but to find out what the Celestial Thearch was planning, to get some intel.","“Sure,” the Celestial Thearch smiled. “I’m going to chop down Cheng Lin, wanna come?”","Song Shuhang: “!!!”","“Right now, isn’t Senior Song Cheng Lin?” Black Soft Feather asked. “So you’re gonna chop down Senior Song?”","“Ah, I almost forgot about that,” the Celestial Thearch chuckled.","Then she formed her fingers into a sword and pointed it at Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang: “You’re serious?”","“Of course~ Time Dao: Sword of Years—Clouds Parting, Rivers Flowing,” the Celestial Thearch said as she thrust her finger sword at Song Shuhang."]},{"number":2958,"title":"Chapter 2958: A Signal Beyond the Heavens","paragraphs":["Chapter 2958: A Signal Beyond the Heavens","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","At that moment, the Celestial Thearch and Song Shuhang were only about a meter apart—a distance so insignificant to those of their caliber that it was practically nonexistent.","Moreover, the Celestial Thearch had been resurrected in perfect form. At such a close range, if she were to make a move, thrusting her sword, no one across the myriad realms could evade it!","Just as the Celestial Thearch prepared to strike...","The Phoenix Master hastily explained, “It’s coming—this is the Celestial Thearch’s ultimate move—’Senile Dementia Sword!’ Anyone struck by this blade is doomed to wither into senility over the endless passage of time!”","Song Shuhang: “!!!”","See, this is why names are so important.","The same move, the same power, the same effect, but change the name, and the gravitas changes by an entire plane of existence.","‘Senile Dementia Sword’ compared to the Celestial Thearch’s announced ‘Sword of Time—Fleeting Clouds, Flowing Water for Ten Years’—both have the same nature, but the difference in prestige is staggering.","If my “Basic Fist Techniques, Part II” were renamed to “Meteor Fist—Shattering the Moon and Splitting the Mountain Peaks, Meteor Sweeping the Dawn Sky,” its prestige would probably shoot through the roof as well!","Even when facing the Celestial Thearch’s sword, Song Shuhang’s mind, enhanced by his “Slaying Three Corpses Tribulation Immortal” level, was still able to flash through these unrelated thoughts.","Of course, he hadn’t given up on resisting. His body instinctively tried to dodge as the Celestial Thearch struck.","But the one-meter range was too small, fully within the domain of the Celestial Thearch’s “Time Dao.”","The Celestial Thearch’s finger finally touched Song Shuhang!","Time and the force of years were violently propelled.","Under the influence of this strike, Song Shuhang’s body stiffened, unable to move.","In his pupils, countless streams of information rapidly processed—that was the Confucian Sage’s Eye, receiving information and converting it, feeding it back to Song Shuhang.","A few breaths later.","“Hahh~” The Celestial Thearch exhaled softly, withdrawing her finger.","“What did you do to Shuhang?” Pavilion Master Chu’s hair strand asked.","Pavilion Master Chu didn’t seem intent on attacking the Celestial Thearch. Given her level, she could naturally tell that the Celestial Thearch’s strike hadn’t harmed Song Shuhang.","“First, I poked Senior Song, who’s currently in Cheng Lin’s form, to collect some interest~ And, of course, to practice my technique for when I slice through the real Cheng Lin later. I’ll be more proficient by then.” The Celestial Thearch replied.","Pavilion Master Chu’s hair strand: “...”","“And also, I used that strike to end Senior Song’s long-standing ‘enlightenment’ state and give him part of the answer.” The Celestial Thearch continued.","Since Song Shuhang had cut her down once before, he’d been affected by the Celestial Thearch’s earlier primordial spirit’s “obliteration,” leaving him in a prolonged state of “enlightenment plus Dao comprehension.”","However, the problem with “enlightenment” is that if it lasts too long, it can lose its soul, the critical “flash of insight” during the moment of realization.","Thus, the Celestial Thearch took this opportunity to provide Song Shuhang with part of the correct answer, allowing him to exit the soulless state of enlightenment.","“What information did you give to Shuhang?” the Scarlet Heaven Sword asked.","It could feel the “Path of Longevity” aura on Song Shuhang becoming more complete. Was the Celestial Thearch giving Song Shuhang information that would complete his “Path of Longevity”?","“The ancient Heavenly Court, aside from a few constraints, has some similarities with Senior Song’s ‘Repair Chat System.’ The information I gave him was the complete details of that portion, along with my personal insights.” The Celestial Thearch replied.","The Stele Spirit spoke up, “Are you sure you have no ulterior motives towards Shuhang?”","“If I say I have no ulterior motives towards Senior Song, would you believe me?” the Celestial Thearch responded.","The Phoenix Master immediately chimed in, “I believe you!”","In modern terms, the Phoenix Master was practically a die-hard fan of the Celestial Thearch.","“Thank you for your trust, Phoenix Immortal.” The Celestial Thearch smiled and added, “But I don’t even believe myself~”","Phoenix Master’s claws trembled: “!!!”","“Well, I’m off. I’ll be back in a few days.” The Celestial Thearch thought for a moment, reached out to Song Shuhang, and snatched away his blanket, which hadn’t yet been used, draping it over herself.","After wrapping the blanket around herself, she dispelled the illusion on her body.","“Where are you going?” the Scarlet Heaven Sword asked, puzzled.","The Celestial Thearch: “Like I said, I’m going to cut Cheng Lin.”","“Uh-huh. Do you even know where Cheng Lin is?” the Scarlet Heaven Sword questioned.","The Celestial Thearch: “Don’t worry... I have a lead.”","With that, the Celestial Thearch kicked her long legs into the void, opened a spatial gate, and disappeared.","The Scarlet Heaven Sword: “...”","After some thought, it contacted Daoist Scarlet Heaven.","Scarlet Heaven: “???”","What kind of weird nickname is ‘Ashao’?","The Scarlet Heaven Sword explained, [I noticed that Fairy Sound Bamboo calls Shuhang ‘Ashu’ so affectionately, so I figured I’d change things up. But if I called you ‘Achi,’ it’d sound like an insult. So, I went with ‘Ashao.’]","Scarlet Heaven: “...”","[Anyway, on a serious note, Ashao, the Celestial Thearch is going to cut Cheng Lin. You might want to warn Cheng Lin to be careful.] The Scarlet Heaven Sword advised.","Daoist Scarlet Heaven thought for a moment and said, “Why don’t you just tell the Celestial Thearch that Cheng Lin has gone to the mysterious island?”","The Scarlet Heaven Sword: [???]","Isn’t that selling out your teammate?","“The truth is, Cheng Lin has also been looking for the Celestial Thearch. If the Celestial Thearch wants to cut Cheng Lin, it’ll fulfill both of their wishes. Isn’t that perfect?” Daoist Scarlet Heaven replied.","The Scarlet Heaven Sword: [That actually makes a lot of sense.]","But by now, the Celestial Thearch was already gone.","...","...","Meanwhile, in the temporary chat group Song Shuhang was part of.","“Fairy Cheng Lin, do you think you can handle the Celestial Thearch?” Senior White casually asked.","He knew Fairy Cheng Lin had been keeping tabs on Song Shuhang’s situation, so she was undoubtedly aware of the Celestial Thearch’s resurrection.","“Not really, but it doesn’t matter, Senior White... I’ve already died more than once.” Fairy Cheng Lin replied, “Besides, the Celestial Thearch looking for Fairy Cheng Lin has nothing to do with me, Cheng Goudan. Who’s Cheng Lin anyway? Never heard of her.”","“Good to hear.” Senior White responded calmly.","Members of the “Nine Provinces Number One Group” had a knack for maintaining composure during the wildest of conversations.","“By the way, Song Shuhang, how are you holding up?” Fairy Cheng Lin asked.","After taking a strike from the Celestial Thearch, his physical body was frozen in place, unable to move. It was unclear if his consciousness was still communicative.","[System Alert: Tyrannical Song has crashed... Please try again later.]","“You’ve crashed again? Not to be harsh, but you really need to upgrade your hardware to keep up with the times.” Fairy Cheng Lin remarked.","But at that moment, Song Shuhang was unable to respond.","Under the influence of the Celestial Thearch’s “Sword of Time—Fleeting Clouds, Flowing Water for Ten Years,” he realized that his signal seemed to be syncing with another signal from the void.","The reason they were syncing was because both signals originated from the same source.","One was Song Shuhang’s own signal, while the other... transcended the myriad realms, existing high above the heavens."]},{"number":2959,"title":"Chapter 2959: Comprehension: Quasi Heavenly Dao Smashing Books","paragraphs":["Chapter 2959: Comprehension: Quasi Heavenly Dao Smashing Books","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The Emperor’s sword was meant to make whoever was struck by it experience the ravages of time all at once, effectively accelerating the aging process to the point where they’d show symptoms of dementia.","After being hit by that sword, Song Shuhang’s consciousness began to drift.","At that moment, his spiritual awareness split into two.","One part synchronized with the Sage’s Eye, which received data from the Heavenly Emperor, refining and relaying it back to Song Shuhang.","The other part, influenced by the power of time, floated higher and higher, like he was intoxicated.","Song Shuhang felt like his mind was clear, but he couldn’t control his drifting spiritual awareness.","After floating for a few seconds, the power of time, influenced by the “Age Sword,” served as a bridge that connected Song Shuhang’s consciousness with that of another “Song Shuhang” from a different frequency.","——It was the “Old Tyrant Song” attached to Daozi’s back!","Seconds later.","Song Shuhang entered a familiar “dreaming” state.","But this time, it was different from the past.","This time, the “dreaming” was actually a “dream within a dream.”","And the subject of this “dream within a dream” was none other than Daozi.","The entry point into this dream was when Daozi ascended to become the 8.5th Heavenly Dao!","—","—","Within the dream.","Daozi floated at the connection point between the Core World and the real world.","Below was the “Ancient Heavenly Court Fragment,” fused with the Core World, and the “Heavenly Emperor’s Dao” was attached to Daozi.","Song Shuhang’s vision synchronized with Daozi as he ascended to become a Heavenly Dao.","As soon as they synchronized in the dream, Song Shuhang vaguely sensed Daozi’s subconscious resistance — true experts possess the ability to perceive through time and space, and they could sense Song Shuhang’s “dreaming” state.","Daozi, who was in the process of ascending to the 8.5th Heavenly Dao, was indeed a true expert among experts. Naturally, he could sense Song Shuhang’s presence.","However, that resistance was only momentary. Then, Daozi began to cooperate, even going so far as to open his state of mind to Song Shuhang.","Clearly, Daozi had recognized Song Shuhang’s identity.","Song Shuhang had strong ties to the Confucian Sage, Yunquezi, the thirteen Confucian Tribulation Immortals, the Fairy of Creation, the Golden Lotus World, and Venerable Henghuo — though despite these connections, he was destined never to become a part of the Confucian sect.","After recognizing Song Shuhang’s identity, Daozi, under the circumstances, naturally opened the door for him.","This shows how important connections are in cultivation.","With strong enough connections, even the Heavenly Dao could endorse you, share their glory and experiences, and maybe even help you ascend.","Within the dream.","Song Shuhang’s “vision” was synchronized with Daozi’s as he sat on the Emperor’s Throne, slowly ascending while overlooking the myriad worlds.","The view of the Heavenly Dao encompassed all worlds in an instant.","Among them, Song Shuhang recognized Earth, then the Beast Realm, the Dream World, the realm of the creditor “Shadow Lord,” and finally, his “Tyrant World.”","After scanning these, Song Shuhang — or rather, Daozi’s — gaze landed on Su Clan’s Sixteen.","Previously, Su Clan’s Sixteen had lowered her own tribulation to assist Daozi’s plan to ascend as the 8.5th Heavenly Dao, lending him a hand.","So, naturally, after Daozi’s ascension, he had to repay this favor.","As an ascending Heavenly Dao, all Daozi needed to do was glance at Su Clan’s Sixteen, and the thought of gratitude would cause the laws of the myriad worlds to respond.","A surge of power, akin to what one would receive after giving a “Saintly Lecture,” fell upon Su Clan’s Sixteen, enhancing her luck and merit.","The merit from an ordinary Saintly Lecture wasn’t particularly strong. Every time Song Shuhang lectured, the merit he gained was several times that of a regular Saintly Lecture.","However, the merit Su Clan’s Sixteen received was just the beginning. Once Daozi fully ascended, that merit would increase several times over.","Helping the Heavenly Dao ascend is equivalent to achieving “功德无量” (boundless merit), and the merit that comes from this is immeasurable.","Moreover, the merit itself isn’t the most important part.","The most important part is the “Heavenly Dao’s gratitude” contained within the merit — essentially, it’s a powerful buff.","From now on, every time Su Clan’s Sixteen faces a tribulation, the Heavenly Tribulation will acknowledge this buff and give her a pass.","After seeing this, Song Shuhang felt a sense of relief deep in his heart.","With this, Su Clan’s Sixteen would no longer need to worry about future tribulations. Even after Daozi steps down as the 8.5th Heavenly Dao, this buff will remain in effect.","Unless the next Heavenly Dao bears a grudge against Daozi and deliberately cancels this “Heavenly Dao’s buff.”","After settling Su Clan’s Sixteen’s karma, Daozi continued to ascend from the throne.","During this time... the attached Song Shuhang vaguely heard a voice in his ear.","This seemed to be the scene where “Old Tyrant Song” whispered into Daozi’s ear.","Song Shuhang couldn’t make out what “Old Tyrant Song” was saying.","However, he wasn’t in a hurry to find out. After all, he would be the one saying it in the future, so there was nothing to be curious about.","After finishing his whisper, Daozi suddenly exploded with rage, shattering the void with a book.","In the dream, from a first-person perspective, Song Shuhang clearly sensed Daozi’s technique of smashing the void with the Confucian Scriptures!","*I wonder if I could pull that off too?* Song Shuhang thought, his mind suddenly racing.","When Daozi shattered the void, he was still in the process of becoming a Heavenly Dao, in a proto-Heavenly Dao state. At the moment, Song Shuhang’s main body possessed the “Immortal Fat Whale Golden Core” plus the “pseudo-immortal mode.”","The two were worlds apart in terms of power, but their statuses bore some similarities.","Song Shuhang carefully replayed every step of Daozi’s move in his mind, simulating it...","A few moments later, taking advantage of the “dreaming” state, he successfully grasped an attack technique — “Proto-Heavenly Dao Book Smash!”","This is a temporary name.","Later, he would change the name to something more like the Heavenly Emperor’s “Age Sword,” enhancing its gravitas.","With the Confucian Scriptures he now held, should he ever face a formidable enemy, he could unleash a proto-Heavenly Dao level book smash attack right to the face!","As he pondered, Daozi in the dream had already obliterated the “Void Guardian” and the “Stellar Doom.”","Daozi continued to ascend.","Finally, he officially made contact with the “Heavenly Dao.”","The immortal laws began to reshape Daozi.","*Boom!*","In an instant, the dream-state Song Shuhang felt like his brain was about to explode.","The “Immortal Fat Whale Golden Core” in his life-bound dantian swelled like a pufferfish, vigorously bouncing.","In a split second, Song Shuhang’s consciousness elevated to an unprecedented height.","His vision exceeded the limitations of the myriad worlds, rising above all immortal beings!"]},{"number":2960,"title":"Chapter 2960: Deriving the Path to Immortality, If Not Now, When?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2960: Deriving the Path to Immortality, If Not Now, When?","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In an instant... a moment so brief it’s impossible to describe, a time so short that for a normal person, it’s not even enough to form a single thought.","But for an entity of “Heavenly Dao” level, an instant is enough to accomplish countless tasks!","In this fleeting moment, Song Shuhang’s perception and thoughts were elevated to their absolute limits.","Thus, in this moment, his inner monologue could become extraordinarily rich.","He could compress countless thoughts into this “instant” and complete them!","At this moment, time for Song Shuhang had nearly come to a standstill!","—","—","[So, this is the data of the Heavenly Dao?]","As Song Shuhang entered the dream of the “Dao Child,” coming into contact with the Heavenly Dao and condensing an immortal body, he couldn’t quite believe it.","The secrets of the Heavenly Dao are the greatest mysteries in the universe. Even when a fragment is revealed, it’s only the tip of an immense iceberg.","Yet now, he had touched the essence of that iceberg.","Although his mind felt like it would explode upon contact, he had indeed accessed the core secrets of the Heavenly Dao through the “Dao Child.”","[To think I could even access this information in a dream!]","If he could tap into the core secrets of the Heavenly Dao in a dream, then there was nothing in the myriad worlds that he, Ba Song, couldn’t access!","From borrowing books, cheating the tribulation, borrowing laws, life experiences, karma, merits, and bosses, Ba Song had endured hardships to finally reach the ultimate secret of the universe.","Fortunately... his foundation was solid!","If he didn’t have the “Immortal Whale Golden Core” in his body, if he didn’t have the golden dragon pattern on his core that Senior White Two had drawn with Heavenly Dao authority, if he hadn’t experienced a “pseudo-immortal state,” or if he hadn’t repeatedly encountered “Heavenly Dao information” in the past... then in the moment he tapped into the Dao Child’s ascension to Heavenly Dao, he would have been utterly destroyed, both in body and soul!","Even if he were to be revived, he would have ended up in eternal slumber, much like the “Undying Lord” of old.","Luckily, his past accumulations had laid the most solid foundation for this moment of “accessing the core secrets of the Heavenly Dao”!","Additionally, his strong pain tolerance allowed him to maintain his thoughts even in the excruciating pain that felt like his brain was about to melt!","And as long as he could maintain some semblance of clear thinking, he could accomplish a great deal in that “instant.”","For example, deriving the “Path to Immortality”!","The information on the two paths to immortality within Song Shuhang’s body was already partially understood. Although he hadn’t fully grasped the “principle of immortality,” he could steadily advance toward the “Immortal” realm and achieve a state of “neither life nor death” as long as he followed the steps. Even if he didn’t fully understand it, the formula was already established; as long as his body followed the formula, the correct answer would naturally emerge.","The other path, related to the “Cultivation Chat System,” required a perspective far beyond that of an ordinary cultivator, one that looked down on the myriad worlds from the pinnacle.","[So, it’s now or never!] Song Shuhang focused all his remaining energy on deducing the “Cultivation Chat System’s Path to Immortality.”","Whether or not he succeeded, this was his only option at the moment!","If not now, then when?","Everything within Song Shuhang was mobilized, contributing to the deduction of the “Cultivation Chat System’s Path to Immortality.”","Compared to the “Neither Life nor Death Path to Immortality,” the “Cultivation Chat System’s Path to Immortality” was the true path that integrated all his potential into one grand avenue.","The 7+1 core, the super Heavenly Dao-level golden dragon pattern that Senior White Two had drawn, the star map on the golden core, the seven saint seals + world master seal, the law of root characters, the law of Hua Bei, the power of karma, the merit network, the immortal whale golden core, the pseudo-immortal body, the Cultivation Chat System—all these unique abilities of Song Shuhang converged at this moment!","The “Neither Life nor Death Path to Immortality” represented Song Shuhang’s singular specialty in the aspect of death.","The “Cultivation Chat System’s Path to Immortality” was the grand avenue that fully realized all of Song Shuhang’s attributes!","—","—","In the real world.","“Huh?” Pavilion Master Chu’s hair strand blinked in surprise.","Because suddenly, she sensed that Song Shuhang’s head had heated up to a terrifying degree, hot enough to burn even an immortal.","Moreover...","In that brief moment, she vaguely sensed that Song Shuhang’s body was constantly collapsing and reforming!","“Eighty times? Or ninety? Or maybe even more?” Pavilion Master Chu’s hair strand couldn’t calculate the exact number in that instant.","She only knew that after Song Shuhang’s head began to heat up, his body reached a critical point where it couldn’t bear the strain and started collapsing.","However, today, the “Immortal Whale Golden Core” within Song Shuhang seemed to have found a source of endless energy, continuously charging.","Each time Song Shuhang’s body collapsed, the Immortal Whale Golden Core immediately restored it.","This cycle repeated eighty or ninety times, perhaps even more—possibly over a hundred.","In that brief instant, Song Shuhang’s death count might have increased by three digits.","This was truly the act of burning with life.","“So hot!” Phoenix Claw also cried out, perched on Song Shuhang’s head. “What’s happening? The Heavenly Emperor’s ‘Dementia Sword’ didn’t have a head-heating effect, did it?”","“It’s probably not the Heavenly Emperor’s ‘Dementia Sword.’ That strike might have served as a trigger, guiding Song Shuhang into a deeper transformation,” the Stone Tablet Spirit said slowly.","As Ba Song’s tombstone, it always observed him with a unique perspective.","“For just a moment... there was a trace of Heavenly Dao,” Senior White Two’s voice sounded, crossing the channel between the “Evil Lotus World” and the “Core World.”","As soon as Senior White Two’s voice echoed, the “liquid metal windbreaker” on Song Shuhang’s back fluttered without wind.","The windbreaker was particularly sensitive to this voice!","It felt a deep-rooted loathing for this voice... yet in the deepest recesses of its core, it also felt a certain attachment, an unwillingness to part with this voice, or perhaps envy towards its owner.","In short, its emotions were very complicated.","After fluttering for a moment, the windbreaker calmed down again—it was just an avatar, and now was the time to focus on the main body’s condition.","“The main body is indeed accessing ‘Heavenly Dao’ information.” The windbreaker also spoke, “And I can confirm that the main body is likely retrieving his own power. I can sense a familiar scent in the ‘Heavenly Dao information’ he’s accessing—a scent that belonged to my main body in the past!”","Senior White Two was speechless.","Just by listening to the voice, Senior White Two could detect a strong sense of “pride” in Ball Shuhang’s tone.","Senior White Two’s gaze shifted again to the Nine Nether World, where a black metal mass had condensed to the size of a fist in its source.","He couldn’t wait to see the scene when Ball Shuhang finally revived!","Senior White Two eagerly anticipated the emergence of “Fatty ? Pufferfish ? Ball.”"]},{"number":2961,"title":"Chapter 2961: Gentle Immortal Yuelun","paragraphs":["Chapter 2961: Gentle Immortal Yuelun","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Just imagining Fat Ball getting so mad that it puffs up, sprouting spikes all over its round body, made White Senior Two incredibly amused.","He was curious just how big Fat Ball would get when it puffed up with spikes. If a small pufferfish can swell to the size of a little ball, then Fat Ball, in proportion, might expand to the size of a village-level grenade. Or maybe even larger—county-level? City-level?","As the ruler of the Netherworld, White Senior Two realized that to live happily, he needed a worthy opponent, someone who could occasionally bring him joy.","In the past, White Senior Two found Fat Ball quite annoying at times—but now that Fat Ball had truly revived, White Senior Two found himself oddly pleased.","“Senior Song has stopped heating up,” Black-Skinned Soft Feather, who was always attentive, pointed out.","The heat radiating from Tyrannical Song’s head had begun to dissipate, and his body was no longer disintegrating and regenerating.","The tuft of hair on Pavilion Master Chu’s head swayed elegantly as she cast a water-based healing spell, gently covering Song Shuhang’s head.","The healing spell from the Clear Water Pavilion was subtle yet effective, like a gentle mist enveloping him.","As it settled on his head, a faint “ssssss” sound was heard, and a soft white mist rose.","“Is he waking up?” asked the Red Cloud Sword.","Stele Daoist replied, “It doesn’t seem like it.”","“But his eyes look very alert,” added the Red Cloud Sword.","Black-Skinned Feathered Soft Child explained, “Senior Red Cloud Sword, those are actually the Sage’s Eyes, processing information. That’s why he looks alert. You should check out his Third Eye instead; it doesn’t seem to be focused.”","Red Cloud Sword was left speechless.","“I tried to @-mention Shuhang in the Cultivation Chat System, but it says he’s still in a shutdown state,” White Senior Two’s voice chimed in. “It seems he’s latched onto something truly extraordinary this time.”","White Senior Two had a hunch that Song Shuhang might be experiencing one of those “dreaming” states again.","“Fairy @#%×, you take care of Shuhang from here on out,” White Senior Two instructed.","The Merit Snake Beauty slowly coiled around Song Shuhang, using the power of merit to nurture his body.","The painful expression on Song Shuhang’s face eased, and the frown on his brow softened.","In the dream.","The Daoist had successfully completed the ritual, becoming the 8.5th Heavenly Dao.","At that moment, the Daoist had started to familiarize himself with the “Heavenly Dao Authority,” experimenting with using its rules and powers on a small scale.","Meanwhile, Song Shuhang finally emerged from that brain-melting state of deduction.","The aftereffects of that single moment of intense mental strain were overwhelming.","Even now, Song Shuhang’s brain remained in a daze. Although he was in the dream, attached to the Daoist’s body, he could only numbly sense the Daoist’s manipulation of the Heavenly Dao Authority. His foggy mind couldn’t comprehend any insights.","His brain was utterly exhausted.","This immense opportunity—personally experiencing the operation of the Heavenly Dao Authority—was something Song Shuhang could barely take advantage of in his current state.","Sometimes in life, you can’t have both the fish and the bear paw; you have to make a choice.","But fortunately, Song Shuhang didn’t feel any regret.","Because—besides him, there was also the “Old Tyrant Song!”","While he might not be able to seize this chance to experience the Heavenly Dao’s power, it didn’t mean he wouldn’t have another opportunity in the future. The “Old Tyrant Song” from the future would relive this moment anyway.","If you can’t have both fish and bear paw, then this time, I’ll have the fish, and next time, I’ll have the bear paw!","In the dream, the Daoist continued to familiarize himself with the Heavenly Dao Authority and began devising a plan to resolve the aftereffects of the Confucian disciples’ resurrection.","Meanwhile, Song Shuhang’s dazed mind slowly started to recover.","The mental exertion from that single moment was vast, but the rewards were equally significant!","Firstly... Song Shuhang had fully comprehended the “Non-Life, Non-Death Path to Immortality.”","This was an unexpected gain.","Song Shuhang had been using that brief moment of Heavenly Dao insight to deduce the “Cultivation Chat Immortal Path” and hadn’t intended to delve into the “Non-Life, Non-Death Path.”","After all, the framework for the “Non-Life, Non-Death Path to Immortality” had already been established, and it would unfold naturally.","But as he worked on the “Cultivation Chat Immortal Path,” his understanding of the “Non-Life, Non-Death Path” deepened.","Both paths were carved from his own body, both were his paths to immortality... so, naturally, they weren’t entirely separate.","The two immortal paths shared many commonalities, influencing and complementing each other. Gaining a deeper understanding of one also enhanced his understanding of the other.","As Song Shuhang had predicted, the “Non-Life, Non-Death Path to Immortality” was an extreme and brutal path to immortality.","Its extremity and brutality weren’t directed at others—but at Song Shuhang himself!","“It does have some similarities to Fairy Cheng Lin’s ‘dead as can be’ state, but they are fundamentally opposite.”","Fairy Cheng Lin’s path to immortality was the “Path of Birthing New Life.” She would give birth to a new version of herself periodically, shedding the old self in a process that made her stronger, shedding death, and achieving endless life.","Song Shuhang’s current “Non-Life, Non-Death Path to Immortality” was also a cyclical path, similar to Fairy Cheng Lin’s, with a transformation occurring after each cycle.","However, while Fairy Cheng Lin’s transformation leaned towards life, Song Shuhang’s path leaned towards death.","After each cycle, the “Non-Life, Non-Death Path to Immortality” would experience death, during which all negative effects would be “killed off,” followed by rebirth... In this way, the revived Tyrant Song would become stronger than before.","And typically, both Tyrant Song and Fairy Cheng Lin existed in a peculiar “Non-Life, Non-Death” state.","One cycle led towards life, while the other towards death.","“Non-Life, Non-Death is just a state of this immortal path... This path seeks life through death,” Song Shuhang murmured.","This was the counterpart to Fairy Cheng Lin’s “Path of Birthing New Life”: the “Path of Seeking Life Through Death.”","As Song Shuhang fully comprehended this immortal path, his physical body in the real world began to undergo a corresponding transformation.","The Realm of Three Corpses Calamity Immortal, in the Primordial Era, was also known as the “Weak Immortal Realm.”","If a Calamity Immortal in this realm truly grasped an immortal path, they would immediately attain the Way.","And now, the same was happening with Song Shuhang.","As he achieved enlightenment, a moon wheel quietly appeared behind his head.","Its glow was as gentle as water.","Though the “Non-Life, Non-Death Path to Immortality” was a harsh and extreme path towards immortality, the light of this moon wheel was incredibly gentle, revealing a rare, tender brilliance.","The soft glow illuminated the tuft of hair on Lord Chu’s head and shone upon Phoenix Claw’s paws...","It also bathed all of Song Shuhang’s nearby companions in its light.","Phoenix Claw stared blankly at the glow for a moment before blurting out, “Youyou!”"]},{"number":2962,"title":"Chapter 2962 - 2960: Teaming Up with Top Tycoons (Another Plea for Monthly Passes)","paragraphs":["Chapter 2962: Chapter 2960: Teaming Up with Top Tycoons (Another Plea for Monthly Passes)","“`","A Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender’s advancement to Immortal is immensely difficult, and Zither Master Phoenix Bearing has the deepest understanding of this among everyone!","Among the many pendants on Song Shuhang’s body, the one that signifies the hardships of proving his Dao and immortality belongs to Zither Master Phoenix Bearing’s main body.","Her main body was also a genius cultivator with extraordinary talent and a firm mind and willpower... However, she was just a hair’s breadth away from those monstrous geniuses who could truly step onto their own path to immortality.","The reason why Zither Master Phoenix Bearing later managed to prove her Dao and attain immortality was due to the assistance of the ‘Great Dao of the Ancient Heavenly Court’.","——This was also one of the key attractions of the Heavenly Emperor’s ‘ancient Heavenly Court’ back in the day.","Claws of Zither Master Phoenix Bearing remembered the process her main body went through to prove her Dao and achieve immortality; it was so arduous as to bring one to tears. If one were to describe it, it could be turned into an epic depicting the ‘experience of hundreds of tribulations and final attainment of immortality.’","But then there’s Tyrannical Song.","After being hit by the Heavenly Emperor’s ‘Senile Dementia Sword’ and crashing here for some time, a ‘gentle radiance’ of the Immortal’s Great Way Light Wheel suddenly appeared behind his head.","The whole process left the claws of Zither Master Phoenix Bearing dumbfounded, completely unable to grasp the principle behind it.","“Somehow, it feels a bit sour in my heart,” said the claws of Zither Master Phoenix Bearing.","“Don’t worry, if you keep feeling sour, you’ll soon become numb to it,” Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword comforted.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said, “As someone who has been there, I understand how you feel. But don’t worry, you will soon adapt.”","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing’s claws: “...”","“Moreover, if you think about it from another angle, the price and hardships Shuhang has paid to prove his Dao and attain immortality are not small either. For example, in that ‘instant,’ he died hundreds of times. Isn’t this an immortal realm that he exchanged for his life?” Pavilion Master Chu, with her dumb hair, is truly the most understanding big sister when it comes to consoling others.","She described the cost of Song Shuhang proving his Dao from a different perspective, giving the impression that Tyrannical Song’s path to immortality was also not easy.","Thinking about it this way, Zither Master Phoenix Bearing felt much better indeed.","“Right, to die hundreds of times in an instant... Although it was a short time, the tribulations he went through were not any fewer than ours,” said the claws of Zither Master Phoenix Bearing.","“I agree with that point. Ever since I started following Tyrannical Song, I never saw any other cultivator who, in the shortest time, underwent the most tribulations and suffered the greatest pains... Especially in the early stages, even though Tyrannical Song’s cultivation speed was fast, every increase in his realm was a desperate struggle for life. When it comes to enduring pain and death, I, Stone Tablet, acknowledge Tyrannical Song as the strongest!” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said solemnly.","“What kind of path to immortality did Senior Song step onto?” Black-skinned Soft Feather reached out her hand, attempting to catch the ‘gentle radiance’ from the Immortal Light Wheel.","The radiance of the Immortal’s Moon Wheel flowed over Black-skinned Soft Feather’s fingertips.","This scene was like a beautiful painting of a beauty under the moon, incomparably exquisite.","“For some reason, I always feel that Senior Song’s path to immortality... has a kind of melancholic flavor.” Black-skinned Soft Feather added.","This was also her confusion about Song Shuhang’s path to immortality.","Inside the gentle light of the moonwheel’s brilliance, there seemed to be traces of melancholy and cruelty.","Senior White Two’s voice came through, answering Black-skinned Soft Feather, “It should be a path to immortality that has evolved from that ‘neither living nor dead’ Dao.”","“Finally, Tyrannical Song has also reached the realm of Immortal, that’s great!” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said—now, Tyrannical Song has also become the ‘Immortal big shot’ he once described himself as. With this, the scenes of Tyrannical Song confronting ‘big shots’ should become much less frequent, right?","After all, other immortals could only be on the same level as him, and confronting an immortal wouldn’t be called ‘challenging a big shot’ anymore.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet felt like his own pressure had lightened a lot.","“`","“Has proving my Dao and attaining immortality really ended this simply?” Black-skinned Soft Feather put her hands down, blinked her eyes, and asked with confusion.","When one proved their Dao as an Eighth Stage Profound Sage, there would be tremendous scenes such as ‘showing their divinity in front of the masses’ and ‘Profound Sage Speech’ across the myriad practitioners in the universe.","Advancing to the Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender came with the ‘Thousand Days Tribulation’, a grand calamity. Once one proved their Dao, their primordial soul could project into the ‘Tribulation Transcender Void’. And when a new primordial soul appeared in the ‘Tribulation Transcender Void’... all the big shots sustained by it would feel it in their hearts.","But proving oneself as an Immortal just meant manifesting the ‘Immortal’s Great Dao Moon Wheel’ above their heads and then there would be no movement at all?","Is this what’s meant by great principles are of ultimate simplicity?","“Everyone’s path to immortality is different, and the grandeur of proving Dao as an Immortal varies as well,” Pavilion Master Chu’s dumb hair twirled slightly as she explained with a smile.","When she proved her Dao, she could attract an entire world; if the thriving and the withering tree were born without the suppression of the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion, they would directly manifest heaven and earth phenomena in a large world.","However, some paths to immortality prioritize a serene and quiet style, so proving Dao as an Immortal might just involve pausing for a moment, then crossing over into immortality in one step.","Each Immortal has a different character, different insights, and different paths they tread, so the style of their Dao proving varies naturally.","“I didn’t expect Tyrannical Song to be such a low-key person... This doesn’t seem to fit his image.” Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword remarked.","After all, Tyrannical Song had monopolized the ‘Profound Sage Speech’ for the last half-year.","For the past half-year, no one in the myriad realms could find a more flamboyant and high-profile character than him.","Just as Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword’s words fell, under the ‘Immortal’s Great Dao Moon Wheel’ above Song Shuhang’s head, the three flowers converged, and the three corpses he had cut down appeared.","The steel manifestation also stepped through space, stopping behind Tyrannical Song.","Even Dark Song from the Netherworld Realm directed her attention to this place.","“As expected, Tyrannical Song is still going to stir things up,” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet remarked.","“No, the main body isn’t intending to cause trouble... it’s just that he needs some nourishment,” chimed in Song Fat Ball Windbreaker, looking sharp.","Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword: “???”","“Do you need spirit stones?” Senior White’s voice rang out.","“I really wish I also had a ‘Senior White’...” Zither Master Phoenix Bearing’s claws said enviously.","Back when she cultivated, if she had such a nouveau riche Senior who lent spirit stones without even wanting interest, wouldn’t her cultivation path have been much smoother?","“Thank you, Senior White, but I feel like we need something else, something more suitable,” Good Corpse Tyrant Kindness said with his hands clasped together.","“But we can’t quite say what specifically we need,” Evil Corpse Tyrant added.","The last one, the Self-Corpse Overlord, also seemed to have said something.","While the Self-Corpse was speaking, the ‘Cultivator Chat System’ issued a grand system announcement.","[System-wide Announcement: Congratulations to VIP user ‘Primordial Demoness’ for slaying two ‘Void Sun Guardians’, submitting the task, and completing the first round of the ‘Myriad Realms New Year’s Event?Task One’, successfully exchanging for a super reward with the Will of the Heavens!]","“So soon?” Pavilion Master Chu’s dumb hair was surprised.","“Looks like some top-notch big shots have joined forces to test out the rewards for this event,” Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword hypothesized."]},{"number":2963,"title":"Chapter 2963 - 2961: The Main Body’s Three Corpses Seem Not Very Smart (Monthly Pass)","paragraphs":["Chapter 2963: Chapter 2961: The Main Body’s Three Corpses Seem Not Very Smart (Monthly Pass)","“Otherwise, even the top bosses of myriad practitioners in the universe couldn’t possibly slay two mission bosses in such a short time,” Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword continued.","‘Void Sun Guardians’ vary in strength.","The powerful ones, like the one Song Shuhang and others encountered in the ‘Dream Realm,’ are far stronger than average Immortals, and possibly even not weaker than Senior Devil Emperor Hezhi.","The weaker ones are like the one that was secretly observing in the ‘small black room of the Heavenly Dao’—which ended up being blasted apart by Song Shuhang’s ‘Pay-To-Win Strike’.","But even then, the strength of a ‘Void Sun Guardian’ is at least that of a top ‘Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender’ or even a ‘weak Immortal’ level.","At this moment, the tasks jointly released by the Cultivator Chat System and the Will of the Heavens had only been issued not long ago.","Just tracking down the traces of a ‘Void Sun Guardian’ would take up a considerable amount of time.","Even if a top boss had outrageous luck and just happened to encounter a weaker ‘Void Sun Guardian,’ dealing with it in such a short time wouldn’t be easy.","Not to mention, to handle two in one go!","Defeating two enemies that at the very least had the combat prowess of ‘top Tribulation Immortals’ or were of the ‘Weak Immortal Level’ was no easy feat.","Therefore, Scarlet Heaven Sword speculated that there must be a group of top bosses in the myriad practitioners in the universe who had collaborated, using some method to lock onto the ‘Void Sun Guardians’ in a short time and acted separately to take them down!","After slaying the ‘Void Sun Guardians,’ they then handed them over to this ‘Primordial Demoness’ to submit the tasks and claim the reward.","After all, to submit a task, one just needed to obtain the bodies of the ‘Void Sun Guardians’ or ‘Constant Star Destroyers’ and choose to submit them.","“I suspect that these top bosses are curious about the reward for the ‘New Year’s event tasks’ jointly crafted by the Heavenly Dao and the Cultivator Chat System. They are wondering whether the ‘super reward’ promised by the Heavenly Dao is worth their handiwork, to continue slaying ‘Void Sun Guardians’ or ‘Stellar Doomsday Demon Skulls.’ That’s why they’ve chosen to collaborate,” said Scarlet Heaven Sword.","“Fellow friend speaks wisely,” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet agreed.","Lady Kunna, who had always been secretly maintaining the ‘Cultivator Chat System,’ revealed an ‘illuminated smile with concealed merit and fame’ from the shadows.","Indeed, it was with the collaboration of the Primordial Demoness and several top bosses that they quickly slew two ‘Void Sun Guardians.’","However, the reason the proud top bosses chose to collaborate was not just out of curiosity about the super reward promised by the Heavenly Dao; there was also Lady Kunna, Fairy Cheng Lin, and a group of hidden Tyrant Blowers who were secretly stirring the waters.","Under their covert influence, the current scene of the ‘Primordial Demoness’ submitting the tasks came to pass.","Although the three major tasks jointly released by the Heavenly Dao and the Cultivator Chat System had excited everyone in the myriad practitioners in the universe, everything needed a ‘good start.’","The more impressive this ‘good start,’ the more it would benefit the subsequent development of the tasks.","[System Notification: Task Evaluation has begun!]","[The remnants of the two ‘Void Sun Guardians’ meet the minimum criteria for receiving task rewards.]","[Congratulations to VIP user ‘Primordial Demoness,’ you will be awarded a three-year Supreme VIP qualification for the ‘Cultivator Chat System’ provided by ‘Tyrannical Song.’ You will become the first Supreme VIP member.]","[Congratulations to user ‘Primordial Demoness,’ you will receive a ‘Sub-immortal Information’ gift package provided by the ‘Heavenly Dao!’ Please check for it.]","These messages were all public announcements made by the ‘Cultivator Chat System’—received by every member who had installed the ‘Cultivator Chat System client’—and they were explosive!","Features like ‘Supreme VIP’ were essentially gimmicks to the top bosses of the myriad practitioners in the universe.","After all, every one of the bosses was wealthy beyond measure and didn’t lack money in the slightest.","Once the ‘Cultivator Chat System’s’ charging function was perfected and the VIP features were acknowledged by the bosses, they wouldn’t mind spending a portion of spirit stones to equip themselves with Supreme VIP features.","After all, anything that could be solved with spirit stones wasn’t a problem for the bosses!","But that ‘Sub-immortal-level Information’ gift package was like an atomic bomb of news to the Immortals!","“”","Although the information package is prefixed with ‘sub,’ it is still related to ‘immortality’!","Any information related to ‘immortality’ possesses an endless allure for the cultivators of the myriad realms.","And to be honest, if the package hadn’t been prefixed with ‘sub,’ these big shots would be somewhat afraid to accept it... If their foundational strength isn’t sufficient, directly contacting ‘immortal information’ is like consigning themselves to eternal sleep.","The big shots understand this very well.","Once the ‘sub’ is added to the prefix, it indicates that this package falls exactly within the range that these top Immortals can handle!","With this ‘Sub-immortal Information Package,’ they might have the chance to advance even further in their realms and reach the domain of the ‘Confucianism Sages and Heavenly Emperor.’","Only by standing at the level of Sages and Heavenly Emperors can one, as a mortal, ponder the ‘Great Way’s immortality!","“It’s worth it!” The Primordial Demoness quickly typed in the ‘Tyrannical Song Research Exchange Group.’","After submitting her task, she received a segment of extremely mysterious information directly from the ‘Cultivator Chat System,’ which was somewhat similar to Song Shuhang’s ‘pseudo-eternal mode’—it was the realization Daozi had before proving his Dao, during his ‘Sub-Heavenly Dao’ phase.","[Group Leader] Black and White Dragon Lady","Fairy He Cheng: “@Primordial Demoness, can you describe the content of the ‘Information Package’ you received?”","The highest realm of adding fuel to the flames is to guide others imperceptibly, making them say what you want to hear.","“I’m very sorry, fellow friends. The data content in the ‘Sub-Immortal Information Package’ I received can be understood but not conveyed... I simply cannot describe it in words,” the Primordial Demoness said.","Sound Realm Master ? Feng Luo Fairy: “It’s understandable. If the information involves immortality, what value would it have if it could be easily described? If two ‘Virtual Sun Guardians’ of not so strong strengths can exchange for a ‘Sub-Immortal Information Package,’ then what are we waiting for?”","“Let’s get moving!” the Notionless King spoke solemnly, “I have already locked onto the position of a ‘Constant Star Destroyer,’ who will team up with me?”","The enthusiasm of the big shots from all across the myriad realms for this event was ignited!","...","...","Meanwhile.","Song Shuhang obtained the remains of two ‘Virtual Sun Guardians’ through the ‘Cultivator Chat System.’","Daoist Senior showed no interest in the task items and, as the Heavenly Dao, he didn’t need to collect ‘Virtual Sun Guardians.’ Therefore, all the task items conveniently went to Song Shuhang.","Hum~","Good Corpse ? Tyrant Kindness reached out into the vacuum and fished out the body of a ‘Virtual Sun Guardian.’","“Can it be put to use?” Evil Corpse ? Tyrant queried.","“Let’s try and see,” the Good Corpse replied.","Then, they carefully handed over the fragmented—shattered illusionary small suns—to the main body of Tyrannical Song.","“What are you two doing? How could the main body directly absorb these ‘Void Sun’ items?” said Song fat ball discontentedly here.","As the main body’s ‘clone,’ Song fat ball felt the three corpses weren’t very bright.","The main body was a pure human being, not some tentacle monster. To absorb the ‘Void Sun,’ it certainly needed to undergo a transformation process.","“Leave it, I’ll do it!” Song fat ball declared.","Its windbreaker expanded, and the robe stretched out, covering the sky and enveloping the ‘Void Sun’ in one go.","Then, using its own body, it melted the ‘Void Sun,’ turning it into an entity close to pure energy!"]},{"number":2964,"title":"Chapter 2964 - 2962: Tyrannical Song, Become the Savior of Cosmic Demons!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2964: Chapter 2962: Tyrannical Song, Become the Savior of Cosmic Demons!","Fat ball Song Shuhang proved to be extremely effective.","Song Shuhang’s ‘three corpses’ looked embarrassed and shy, unable to show their faces, quietly joined the steel manifestation for a game of mahjong, standing behind the main body as onlookers.","Thereafter, under the watchful eyes of the public, the ‘Virtual Sun Guardians’ residues were transformed by ‘Fat Ball Cloak Song Shuhang,’ filtered into a special energy that Song Shuhang’s main body could absorb.","This special energy, besides being a massive source of energy, also carried a portion of ‘Immortal Attributes,’ which could be attributed to ‘Immortality Material.’","Fat Ball Cloak Song Shuhang looked satisfactorily at this ‘Immortality Material’ energy, his cloak swaying gently.","However... even after one round of filtration, ‘Fat Ball Cloak Song Shuhang’ was still not entirely at ease. It worried that direct absorption of this ‘Immortality Material’ by the main body might lead to indigestion.","Thus, ‘Fat Ball Cloak Song had voiced a reminder to Fairy Almighty Seller, “Virtuous lamia, please summon the main body’s Pillar of Longevity: Virtual Sun Pillar, and absorb this ‘Immortality Material’ once more through it before transferring it to the main body, to ensure a foolproof process!”","The evil corpse among the three corpses, ‘Ba Er,’ also had the ability to summon the ‘Overlord God Pillar,’ but Fat Ball Cloak Song felt the three corpses seemed somewhat unintelligent and unreliable. Therefore, he entrusted this task to Fairy Almighty Seller.","The virtuous lamia blinked, then she reached out and pulled out the ‘Overlord God Pillar: Virtual Sun Pillar.’","A 60-meter Virtual Sun Pillar appeared, and it immediately resonated with the filtered ‘Immortality Material’ from the ‘Virtual Sun Guardians’—the two originated from the same source, and the familiar feeling was particularly enthusiastic.","If the familiar feeling were translated into words, it would probably go like this:","[Eh, you’re also material transformed from the death of Virtual Sun Guardians? Were you also killed by Tyrannical Song?]","[Yes, what a coincidence, you too? When were you killed?]","[I was killed last month, how about you?]","[We were just recently killed.]","[What a coincidence, this must be fate.]","After the awkward yet enthusiastic resonance ended, the Virtual Sun Pillar began to swallow the ‘Immortality Material.’","During the second filtration, the Virtual Sun Pillar completely absorbed the residual attributes of the ‘Virtual Sun Guardians’ from the Immortality Material, using them to strengthen itself, and then transmitted the perfected ‘Immortality Material’ to Tyrannical Song!","As this wave of ‘pure Immortality Material’ energy flowed in, the energy that Song Shuhang had exhausted during the moment of enlightenment was replenished.","The moon wheel of ‘Path of Seeking Life Through Death’ on his head grew even brighter!","Among the Tribulation Transcenders, there exists a top Tribulation Immortal, known as ‘one who has condensed the embryonic form of the Dao of Longevity’― this type of Tribulation, destined to become immortal, only needs time to accumulate energy, after which they can effortlessly achieve the Dao of immortality.","Back then... when Wielder of the Will White proved the ‘Immortal Heavenly Dao,’ he was in this state.","The ‘Immortality Material’ energy that Song Shuhang has just absorbed is exactly what these ‘immortal embryonic form Tribulation Immortals’ lack.","The ‘Immortality Material’ he just absorbed is equivalent to hundreds of years of arduous cultivation for an ‘immortal embryonic form Tribulation Immortal’!","Song Shuhang’s pace of advancement is always unique.","He first reaches the realm of a weak Immortal by ‘cutting three corpses,’ then through ‘Great Enlightenment,’ he thoroughly comprehends his ‘Path of Seeking Life Through Death’ and proves himself as an ‘Immortal’ ... The final step, he then turns around to absorb this ‘Immortality Material Energy’ to replenish himself.","He is very well-suited to the ‘Flower Rule,’ cultivating all along the way, using now and paying later.","“It’s feasible.” Fat Ball Cloak Song Shuhang, seeing that the main body had successfully absorbed the ‘Immortality Material Energy’ without any signs of indigestion, expressed satisfaction.","Next, he also covered a second ‘Virtual Sun Guardian’ with his cloak, repeating the previous process.","Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword pondered, “I remember, the ‘Myriad Realms New Year Event’ has just started, right? That means, are there going to be many more ‘Virtual Sun Guardians’ sent over, all of which can be transformed into immortality material that Song Shuhang can absorb?”","“We can’t use it all at once; we still need to store some,” Song fat ball carefully analyzed, “because the main body doesn’t have just one ‘path to immortality.’ Besides this ‘Path of Seeking Life Through Death,’ there might be another path to immortality we need to cultivate.”","That path related to the ‘Cultivator Chat System’ seemed even more majestic than the ‘Path of Seeking Life Through Death.’","Eventually, it would definitely consume more energy!","Senior White Two, who was secretly paying attention to Song Shuhang, watched this scene and felt his pleasure increase, plus one, plus one...","After the two ‘Void Sun Guardians’ finished absorbing the immortality material, Song Shuhang’s ‘Virtual Sun Pillar’ became stronger, and the Great Way Light Wheel above his head also became more solid.","At this moment, Tyrannical Song, purely in terms of realm, was already a complete Immortal!","At the same time... the ‘plot’ of Song Shuhang’s dream began to gradually synchronize with the main world.","Daozi was intentionally guiding this.","Daozi, after resolving Song Shuhang’s obsession and allowing those bound within the ‘Great Dao of the ancient Heavenly City’ to seek resolution, achieving Song Shuhang’s redemption, then paused his actions.","He was waiting for Song Shuhang to complete the ‘Path of Seeking Life Through Death’ and for his ‘dream plot’ to synchronize.","In the dreamland.","Once the two synchronised, Daozi spoke, “Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song... Next, I need your help.”","“Senior brother Daozi, please speak,” Song Shuhang replied.","Daozi said politely, “Just call me Daozi; no need to be polite with me. I have now resolved my own obsession and helped Song timber achieve his redemption... Next, I need to fulfill another companion’s wish. Do you know about cosmic demons?”","“Yes, wild BOSS, monster farming, drops treasures. And each time, the items dropped are pretty good,” Song Shuhang replied.","He still remembered the joyful scenes when the seniors of the ‘Nine Provinces Number One Group’ joined forces to farm monsters.","Daozi: “...”","The cosmic demon clan has really suffered over these years.","Suddenly, Song Shuhang also realized, “The wish we’re going to fulfill next is related to the ‘cosmic demons’?”","“Yes,” Daozi explained, “The cosmic demon clan, from the Eternity era to the ancient times, was afflicted with a tremendous curse. The entire clan, losing their intelligence, became only capable of destruction and collecting treasures. If it weren’t for my comrades guarding in secret, the cosmic demon clan would have long since gone extinct.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","That’s too tragic, isn’t it?","So tragic that one would feel like biting their finger, and writing the word ‘tragic’ on the caster’s leg with blood as relief.","“What do you need me to do?” Song Shuhang asked.","“I’ve noticed the special nature of your ‘Path of Seeking Life through Death,’” Daozi said slowly, “so I want to use you as a medium, borrow the power of Heavenly Dao, and in a short time project your path of immortality onto all the ‘cosmic demons,’ letting them experience a cycle of ‘death’ and ‘rebirth,’ then with the authority of Heavenly Dao, help them break free from the curse.”","Are you willing to become the savior of the cosmic demons, Tyrannical Song?"]},{"number":2965,"title":"Chapter 2965 - 2963: Shuhang Everywhere","paragraphs":["Chapter 2965: Chapter 2963: Shuhang Everywhere","Daozi wanted Song Shuhang to lend him a helping hand—but in fact, he was going about it in a roundabout way to give Song Shuhang a benefit.","With his 8.5 level authority as Wielder of the Will, even without involving Song Shuhang, he had plenty of ways to solve the curses on the cosmic demons.","Even among these solutions, many were easier and more convenient than going through Song Shuhang’s projection of the path to immortality.","But as a scholar of Confucianism, Daozi always thought of reciprocating Song Shuhang’s kindness—with anything good within his capabilities, he always thought to include Song Shuhang.","If, in the future, Song Shuhang was willing to lend him a helping hand in solving the curse on the cosmic demon race, it would surely consume a lot of energy. However, the gains would be even greater!","First, after lifting the curse, Tyrannical Song would gain the gratitude of the entire cosmic demon race, earning substantial goodwill.","Second, in the process of lifting the curse, he would create momentum for Tyrannical Song—making sure cultivators throughout the myriad practitioners in the universe saw Tyrannical Song lifting the cosmic demon race’s curse, pushing Tyrannical Song’s popularity to a new level! After all, Daozi knew that he was just a “transitional 8.5 Wielder of the Will,” with the ninth Wielder waiting in the wings.","Daozi hoped to boost Tyrannical Song’s reputation as high as possible before the competition for the ninth Wielder of the Will began!","Third, after lifting the curse, Tyrannical Song, as an ‘assistant to the Wielder of the Will’s work,’ would naturally reap a wave of light of virtue plus Heavenly Dao’s blessing, greatly benefiting his future development.","“So, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, are you willing to lend me a hand?” Daozi Senior asked softly.","He would not force Song Shuhang; even if it was a benefit, if Tyrannical Song did not agree, he would not insist—Song Shuhang’s kindness to Confucianism was too great, so everything depended on Tyrannical Song’s own intent.","“It’s merely a matter of lifting a finger. If you need my help, Daozi brother, I naturally won’t hesitate,” said Song Shuhang in his dream state.","He knew that Daozi, who was now the Heavenly Dao, could definitely “hear” his words in the dream state, just like Senior Scarlet Heaven and the Sage previously.","The Confucian side was thanking Song Shuhang, so they were willing to stand by Song Shuhang’s side and help him in everything.","And Song Shuhang also held enormous goodwill towards Confucianism; carrying the “Scholarly Sage’s Eye,” accompanied by Fairy Creation who had a long-term temporary residence permit, his parents were being taken care of by Confucianism in the world of the golden lotus.","Confucianism had helped Song Shuhang a lot, relieving him of many worries.","Therefore, if Confucianism needed help, Song Shuhang generally would not refuse.","This mode of interaction, where both sides consider each other’s needs, was truly mutually beneficial.","“Kind!” Daozi brother laughed.","He knew that with Tyrannical Song’s gentle and refined nature, whenever possible, he would not refuse to help a worthy individual.","“Then, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, get ready, connect all of your body’s backup energy sources properly. We’re about to start and solve the curse on the cosmic demons drifting in the myriad practitioners in the universe in one breath,” Daozi brother said.","“No problem,” Song Shuhang replied.","Currently, he was carrying several backup energy sources.","Seven small golden cores, the ghost spirit fairy maiden, Dark Song, the backup battery ‘Sealed Ancient God’, and so on...","Additionally, at this moment he himself was already a genuine Immortal, so being drained dry would not be easy.","...","...","About five breaths of time later.","The cultivators throughout the myriad practitioners in the universe suddenly felt their hearts stir once more.","Today, their hearts had been unusually active, like teenagers in love, stirring from time to time.","The re-establishment of the ancient Heavenly City, accessing the new Heavenly Dao, completing the New Year tasks in the Cultivator Chat System... and now, another stirring!","Furthermore, everyone knew this wouldn’t be the last stir of the day.","Today, everyone was ready for their hearts to keep moving!","“What’s the situation this time?” the cultivators throughout the myriad practitioners in the universe wondered, skillfully looking up towards the void.","After a year of refining, all cultivators now have a strong heart, and unless there is extremely explosive news, they won’t be too surprised.","When everyone looked up into the vacuum, they saw a ‘great light’ descending from the depths of the world!","That ‘great light’ was the work of the Will of the Heavens, cast from the source of myriad practitioners in the universe, illuminating every corner of the Myriad Realms!","Moreover, before the initial ‘great light’ scattered, it even passed through the body of an Immortal.","The cultivators across the Myriad Realms couldn’t help but use their hands to shield their eyes, for the light was too dazzling... But everyone was reluctant to close their eyes, instead squinting as much as possible to observe the figure pierced by the ‘great light’.","It was Tyrannical Song!","The one pierced by the ‘great light’ was Big Shot Tyrannical Song!","At this moment, Big Shot Tyrannical Song stood firm, his demeanor humble.","Above his head shone a dazzling ‘Immortal Moon Wheel’, radiating gentle light.","That gentle light seemed to possess the power to heal minds, softening the hearts of those who looked upon it...","This was also the first time the cultivators of the Myriad Realms had seen Big Shot Tyrannical Song manifest his ‘Immortal Moon Wheel’!","That means, before this moment, none of the powerful experts who challenged Tyrannical Song had managed to force out his ‘Immortal Moon Wheel’, indicating Tyrannical Song had never used his full strength!","[Is this Tyrannical Song’s ‘Way’? It actually contains the completely different auras of ‘life and death’.]The top powerhouses with keen insight finally got some insights into Tyrannical Song’s way of immortality from his ‘Great Way Moon Wheel’.","[No wonder he is so strong, a Way containing the elements of ‘life and death’ is naturally among the top rules.]","[But what is Tyrannical Song doing now? Why did the Heavenly Dao use the ‘great light’ to pierce through him?]","It seemed there was a cooperative relationship between the Heavenly Dao and Tyrannical Song?","As they pondered, the great light scattered about, falling upon the Myriad Realms.","And with that dispersed great light, the tip of every beam of ‘light’ seemed to bear the form of a ‘Tyrannical Song’.","Countless lights, countless Tyrannical Songs!","As many lights as there were, there were just as many Tyrannical Songs!","For a moment, Tyrannical Song was everywhere in the Myriad Realms!","All the cultivators were dumbfounded.","At the same time, some powerful cultivators and experts locked onto the ‘Tyrannical Song’ within their own world, their consciousness closely following ‘Tyrannical Song’, eager to see what he intended to do.","In their consciousness’ lock, it soon became clear that each ‘Tyrannical Song’ had a targeted mission.","The Tyrannical Songs were targeting the tracks of the ‘cosmic demons’.","In the puzzled gazes of the powerhouses, these ‘Tyrannical Songs’ entered the bodies of the ‘cosmic demons’.","“What is this for?”","“Could it be that the Heavenly Dao is using the Hand of Tyrannical Song to obliterate the cosmic demons? Does the current Heavenly Dao have enmity with the cosmic demons?”","Boom, boom, boom —","As the powerhouses speculated, in every corner of the Myriad Realms, all the ‘cosmic demons’ exploded!","The scene was extremely bloody, not suitable for children!",".",".","Since there are no book reviews and chapter comments... why don’t I recommend another book? ‘Great Ming Excellent Youth’, I’ve followed his previous book for a long time – hoping his new book takes off!"]},{"number":2966,"title":"Chapter 2966 - 2964: Willing to be at the front and back of the horse for my fellow friend","paragraphs":["Chapter 2966: Chapter 2964: Willing to be at the front and back of the horse for my fellow friend","“`","[The cosmic demons outside the domain just got wiped out like that?]The big shots who were paying attention to ‘Grand Light Tyrannical Song’ witnessed the extinction of the cosmic demons with their own eyes.","Truth be told, the cleaning out of the cosmic demons is quite a pity.","All the powerhouses present, when they were young, hadn’t they all farmed ‘cosmic demons’?","It can be said that cosmic demons were the joy of many cultivators in their youth.","Every time the cosmic demons descended, it was a good opportunity for cultivators to grind for experience, prestige, and equipment.","Even some powerhouses had their rise to prominence when they were young thanks to opportunities they obtained from the ‘cosmic demons’.","...","...","In the ‘Tyrannical Song Research Exchange Group’.","The big shots in this ‘Tyrannical Brag Group’ were also paying attention to this issue.","“It’s a pity, without the ‘cosmic demons,’ the youngsters will lose a lot of opportunities,” lamented Supremacy Golden Meow.","Clown Emperor sighed, “Now, we can only hope that the New Year’s task 3? [Defeat members of ‘Sun Worship Sect’ or ‘Starfall Cult’] jointly released by the ‘Cultivator Chat System’ and ‘Will of the Heavens’ will last for a while. In this way, it might somewhat make up for the loss of the cosmic demons.”","“Speaking of the Starfall Cult, I once secretly sent people to infiltrate the Starfall Cult in the Beast Realm, and now they have become one of the four Dharma Kings of the Starfall Cult’s sub-sects... Now, it’s time to eradicate the Starfall Cult in the Beast Realm all at once,” stated Sage of Beast Tamer.","Not long ago, the undercover agent had sent a coded message, asking when he could end his undercover mission? If this continued, he was about to become the leader of the Starfall Cult in the Beast Realm.","Primordial Demoness: “[Cover mouth light chuckle emoji] Sage, you’ve also done such a thing? In my lineage, someone also infiltrated the ‘Sun Worship Sect’ and obtained a lot of detailed intelligence. In fact, I’m also ready to close the net.”","Notionless King: “If I had known that members of the ‘Sun Worship Sect’ and ‘Starfall Cult’ would become so valuable, I would have had my people stockpiling them earlier. Then, when combined into a Supreme Gift, a hundred consecutive openings could possibly yield some good treasures.”","“These are minor matters to us... The real big catch is only those ‘Void Sun Guardians’ and ‘Stellar Doomsday Demon Skulls’, the sub-immortal information is the true treasure that is useful to us,” said Sound Realm Master ? Feng Luo Fairy.","“Huh? Wait a minute!” At this moment, Saint Scythe Heavenly King suddenly called out.","Sage of Beast Tamer: “Something unexpected has occurred on my end as well, the cosmic demons destroyed by ‘Grand Light Tyrannical Song’ seem to have not died.”","“The same here,” said Clown Emperor.","The members of the group, puzzled, paid close attention to the ‘cosmic demons’ within the range of their consciousness.","The cosmic demons that were bombed to annihilation have once again given birth to new vitality!","“With the Tyrannical Song + Will of the Heavens combo, if they wanted to destroy the ‘cosmic demons,’ they wouldn’t have allowed them any chance at survival!” The part-time Tyrannical braggart—master of the Titanium Temple—logged on and began to instigate further discussion.","Following the master’s speculation, Primordial Demoness deduced, “Does this mean... that this is something Tyrannical Song and the Will of the Heavens did intentionally?”","“They’ve resurrected; in the Sound Realm I inhabit, many ‘cosmic demons’ have all been resurrected,” announced Sound Realm Master ? Feng Luo Fairy.","“Same here,” said Clown Emperor.","In the myriad practitioners in the universe, the cosmic demons that had just been obliterated by ‘Grand Light Tyrannical Song’ resurrected en masse at nearly the same time, with new vitality being born within them, one after another.","After their resurrection, countless cosmic demons floated quietly in the vacuum, motionless.","The powerhouses of the myriad practitioners in the universe who had their eyes on the cosmic demons also refrained from attacking them—after all, it was clear that there was a plan involving Tyrannical Song + Will of the Heavens, so it was better not to act rashly at this moment.","About ten breaths later.","“`","The cosmic demons from myriad practitioners in the universe, the most powerful batch of them, began to regain their sanity.","The originally violent and senseless cosmic demons, known only for destruction, were actually recovering one by one.","The moment they regained their sanity, those strongest cosmic demons suddenly clutched their heads and began to weep bitterly...","In this crying, there was joy as well as immense sorrow.","[Eh? The cosmic demons seem to have changed, no longer senseless monsters that only know destruction?] The Beast Taming Genius spoke out.","[Is this the true goal of Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song cooperating with the Will of the Heavens? To restore the cosmic demons to normal?] Notionless King said in a deep voice.","The authority of the Will of the Heavens is truly omnipotent... This is what makes the Great Way indestructible so attractive!","[All cosmic demons have regained their sanity. From today on, cosmic demons will no longer be wilderness bosses; they have become a normal race among the myriad practitioners in the universe.] The Primordial Demoness concluded.","As long as they have sanity and are no longer senseless monsters bent on destruction, if they unite once again, the cultivators of the myriad practitioners in the universe will no longer treat the cosmic demons as wilderness bosses to farm—after all, the ones who restored the sanity of the cosmic demons are Tyrannical Song + the current Will of the Heavens.","With these two powerhouses backing the cosmic demons, who in the myriad realms would not give face?","About ten breaths later, in the myriad practitioners in the universe.","All cosmic demons, regardless of their strength, completely returned to normal.","After weeping bitterly, the cosmic demons calmed down.","They knelt in the direction in front of them, bowing deeply toward the phantom of ‘Tyrannical Song.’","This was a great favor that saved their entire race!","If not for Tyrannical Song and the Will of the Heavens taking action, then in the future, the cosmic demon race would eventually face complete extinction.","The violent and senseless cosmic demons, while also having the instinct to reproduce, had difficulty raising their offspring due to chaos...the number of cosmic demons in the myriad practitioners in the universe had been steadily decreasing.","All cosmic demons in the myriad practitioners in the universe bowed to Tyrannical Song.","From now on, Tyrannical Song would be the benefactor of the entire ‘cosmic demon’ race; with just a word from him, cosmic demons from the myriad realms would fight to the death to assist him.","For a time, a massive amount of virtue power converged towards Song Shuhang’s main body. And within this wave of virtue power, there were also blessings attached from the Daozi of the Will of the Heavens.","And Song Shuhang’s prestige, with push and drive from Daozi, reached a new peak once again.","In this ‘Restoration of Cosmic Demons’ Sanity’ event, Daozi deliberately lowered his presence, striving to channel all the prestige onto Tyrannical Song—this was also why Daozi deliberately created the scene of ‘countless Tyrannical Song projections.’","His purpose was to make all cultivators in the myriad practitioners in the universe know that Tyrannical Song played a part in this!","Then, let the fame of Tyrannical Song be sung throughout the myriad practitioners in the universe.","[In this way, if Tyrannical Song wants to compete for the Ninth Heavenly Dao, his foundation will be even more solid.] Daozi slightly smiles, staying modest about his accomplishment and fame.","Main world.","The Eight-Armed Primordial Cosmic Demon displayed a smile of relief on its face, repeatedly mumbling several phrases in ancient language.","It should be words similar to ‘it’s so good.’","After mumbling for quite a while, it too turned around and bowed in the direction of Song Shuhang’s main body.","“From this moment, the curse laid upon our race by the Fourth Heavenly Dao has finally dissipated. Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, I will etch this kindness deeply in my heart. After this affair, should Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song wish to prove his Dao and become immortal, I am willing to serve loyally before and after the horse.” The leader of the Eight-Armed Outer Heavenly Demon spoke out."]},{"number":2967,"title":"Chapter 2967 - 2965: The Will of the Heavens Takes You Flying!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2967: Chapter 2965: The Will of the Heavens Takes You Flying!","The eight-armed cosmic demon grandee was indebted to Tyrannical Song for a favor—he was in an exceptionally good mood after witnessing Tyrannical Song assist “Daozi” in removing the curse on the cosmic demon clan. Looking towards Song Shuhang’s position, he made a promise.","Someday, if Tyrannical Song intended to compete for the Heavenly Dao, he was willing to lend him a helping hand!","After all, the eight-armed cosmic demon himself had no intention of competing for the Heavenly Dao. Partly because he had been through much, and partly because of the curse laid upon his cosmic demon clan.","Since he harbored no thoughts of contending for the Heavenly Dao, if the next Heavenly Dao was on good terms with their cosmic demon clan, that would be a great choice!","At least, they wouldn’t have to worry about their cosmic demon clan being targeted again.","After the voice of the eight-armed cosmic demon grandee fell, a “Heaven and Earth Phenomenon” manifested in the vacuum, descending upon him and Tyrannical Song.","Golden mythical beasts danced around the eight-armed cosmic demon, becoming the carrier of the “promise”!","—This was the Heaven and Earth Phenomenon caused by the witnessing of the Heavenly Dao.","Seeing the eight-armed cosmic demon voluntarily coming forward, becoming the assistant for Tyrannical Song in the competition for the next Heavenly Dao, Daozi naturally took the opportunity to secure this “assistant”!","Like the thought of the cosmic demon from the eight domains, Daozi also felt that if the next Heavenly Dao was Tyrannical Song, who was on good terms with Confucianism, it would be a very good choice.","Thus, there would be no need to worry about Confucianism being targeted again.","Under a mutual agreement, this promise was witnessed by the Heavenly Dao and spread to the myriad practitioners in the universe.","All cultivators in the myriad practitioners in the universe were moved again.","Today, everyone had been forced to experience heart movement multiple times; in fact, their hearts had become slightly numb.","Summing up this “Heavenly Dao witnessing”... in the future, if Tyrannical Song were to compete for the next Heavenly Dao, the cultivators of the myriad practitioners in the universe, apart from having to defeat “fat ball Song” first, might also have to challenge the eight-armed cosmic demon grandee before having a shot at challenging Tyrannical Song.","Utterly merciless, giving no chance to others!","However, some perceptive grandees suddenly noticed something— the newly incumbent Heavenly Dao was actually witnessing the oath for “the eight-armed cosmic demon assisting Tyrannical Song in competing for the next Heavenly Dao.”","This was indeed intriguing!","Could it be that the freshly appointed “Heavenly Dao” had already decided when to “retire successfully”? Was he secretly designating “Tyrannical Song” as the next Heavenly Dao candidate?","Was the seat of the Heavenly Dao about to become hereditary?","What undisclosed secret negotiations existed between Tyrannical Song and the new Heavenly Dao “Daozi”?","What secrets lay hidden behind the succession of each generation’s “Immortal Heavenly Dao”?","Had Tyrannical Song and the new Heavenly Dao deciphered this secret and conspired to alternate in proving their Dao to immortality, cycling through the Heavenly Dao seat, and then transferring the seat of the Heavenly Dao to other fellow friends?","At that moment, some of the top immortals among the myriad realms had thousands of thoughts—tonight, this group of top immortals would probably find it hard to sleep.","...","...","In the main world.","After making the promise, the eight-armed cosmic demon grandee closely sensed Tyrannical Song’s location and his condition.","A moment later, he took out a small jade box from his chest.","Inside the jade box, there was a polygonal elixir, as beautifully cut as a diamond.","The eight-armed cosmic demon grandee tossed the elixir towards Song Shuhang’s position.","—He had just sensed that Song Shuhang had collaborated with “Daozi” to incarnate thousands to lift the curse on the cosmic demon clan and had then fallen into extreme weakness.","This time, Tyrannical Song was truly almost drained dry.","Therefore, the eight-armed cosmic demon grandee sent over this precious elixir, the effects of which were similar to the twice-filtered “Void Sun Guardians” absorbed by Song Shuhang.","The elixirs containing ‘Immortality Material’ could be refined during the ancient times, but nowadays they can hardly be produced... unless one were to kill an Immortal and offer it to the heavens?","After handing over the small jade box, the Eight-Armed Outer Heavenly Demon let out a deep sigh of relief as if he had set down an enormous burden.","His figure merged into the giant statue, temporarily lurking.","...","...","Song Shuhang’s location.","“Is it over?” Black-skinned Soft Feather looked up and asked.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet gently nudged Song Shuhang’s waist and said, “Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song seems to still be unconscious.”","Senior White two pondered for a moment and guessed, “It seems that Shuhang wants to take this opportunity to completely perfect his second path to immortality.”","He could sense that the ‘Cultivator Chat System’ was continuously upgrading in the background.","Once the second path to immortality was completely perfected, there was no need to step out immediately, but it could be used as a backup path like the original Heavenly Emperor.","Should the currently proven ‘Seeking Life Through Death Path to Immortality’ that Song Shuhang has dissipate, the backup path of immortality could be activated immediately!","...","...","In the dream plot.","“Thank you, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, for lending me a hand,” Daozi said with a smile.","Song Shuhang replied, “Daozi senior brother, it is clearly I who benefitted here, I should be thanking you.”","“Mutual benefit,” Daozi said tiredly, sitting on the throne, “Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, I saw you deducing a vast path to immortality in a ‘moment’ earlier?”","Even Daozi, who was an 8.5 Tier Heavenly Dao, felt that the path to immortality was ‘vast’, almost equal to the Confucian Dao developed by his teacher.","The path to immortality of the Confucian sage was enormous and comprehensive, and within it, many branches of the path to immortality could even extend, each providing the thirteen Tribulation Transcenders of Confucianism with an opportunity to ‘prove their Dao’.","“Indeed, that is my second method to immortality. But this method is too vast, beyond the vision of ordinary immortals to perfect,” replied Song Shuhang.","Even using ‘Dark Song’s ruler of the Netherworld privileges seemed insufficient to complete it.","Song Shuhang, using the moment of ‘Great Way Light Wheel’ status, did gain a lot of insights... but it was still short of being completely perfected.","That is to say, the path to immortality related to the ‘Cultivator Chat System’, its vastness was such that even the Heavenly Dao could not perfect it in a ‘moment’!","“Then, how about I lend a hand to Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song?” Daozi responded.","With his friend’s obsessions resolved and the redemptions to be fulfilled already completed, now was Daozi’s brief rest period.","“Daozi senior brother, would you help me deduce the path to immortality?” Song Shuhang’s eyes brightened.","“The path to immortality is best deduced by oneself,” Daozi said with a slight smile, “I can assist you from the side. First... let us broaden our horizons, and from the perspective of the Heavenly Dao, observe the myriad practitioners in the universe.”","The path to immortality, after all, is a very personal affair.","Upon saying this, Daozi pressed his hands before his eyes.","Song Shuhang’s visual perspective synchronized with Daozi’s.","The next moment, every realm and every detail of the myriad practitioners in the universe appeared before Song Shuhang’s eyes.","The explosion of data nearly burst Song Shuhang’s head!"]},{"number":2968,"title":"Chapter 2968 - 2966: You Are Courting Death!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2968: Chapter 2966: You Are Courting Death!","However, with the Scholarly Sage’s Eye diligently protecting Song Shuhang,","there was no chance for Song Shuhang’s head to explode.","At this moment, all the planes of the myriad practitioners in the universe appeared in Song Shuhang’s eyes simultaneously, in a manner of overlapping lines.","This type of vision far surpassed the concept of optical vision; it was an impact that came from the depths of the soul!","The immense shock immediately caused terms like “Holy cow, awesome, truly magnificent, incredible” and such to flood Shuhang’s mind...","The impact of the visuals was so intense that it caused Song Shuhang to lose all the words he had accumulated over more than a decade of education—to the extent that they seemed sent off to Wa Claw Country!","Apart from terms like ‘Holy cow, awesome,’ for a moment, he couldn’t squeeze out any more appropriate idioms.","Perhaps once he calmed down a bit, he could think of some fitting phrases...","“Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, calm down and thoroughly experience this myriad world. Viewing the world from the Heavenly Dao’s perspective should be of some help to you... Huh?” While speaking, Daozi suddenly paused.","He seemed to have sensed something!","At the same time, Song Shuhang, through Daozi’s viewpoint, noticed what he had focused on.","—Among the myriad big and small planes of the universe, there were countless light points.","Those were the myriad stars of the universe.","Under the gaze of Daozi, the secrets hidden within the stars could not be obscured and were seen through in a glance.","“Is this the Stellar Destruction Virus?” Daozi asked aloud.","He had recently learned a bit about the ‘Stellar Destruction Virus,’ ‘Virtual Sun Guardians,’ and ‘Stellar Doomsday Demon Skull’ through his interaction with Tyrannical Song.","However, he had not expected the virus to have spread to such an exaggerated extent!","In the myriad stars of the universe, at least over 60% were densely infected by the ‘Stellar Destruction Virus,’ causing a tingling sensation on Daozi’s scalp.","This was a method capable of destroying ‘all the realms of the universe,’ a catastrophe of unprecedented magnitude!","If these ‘Stellar Destruction Viruses’ were activated, no one in all the realms would escape... not even the ‘world of the golden lotus’ knew if it could survive this calamity!","“[I just managed to erase the ‘Resurrection Aftereffect’ for my junior brothers, and just managed to complete my own obsession, and now you want to play out a ‘world doomsday’ plot?]”","At this moment, Daozi’s heart was filled with anger and irritation.","You are courting death!","“Yes, that’s them.” Song Shuhang replied.","He too felt his scalp tingle and his hair stand on end.","From Fat Ball Song’s investigation, Song Shuhang had obtained some data on the ‘Stellar Destruction Virus.’","But, merely the numbers were nothing compared to the visual impact he saw with his eyes.","This was similar to the principle of how exhilarating credit card spending is... when you’re only swiping numbers, it’s different from actually paying with money.","“Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, you observ carefully this myriad realms, I need to recuperate a bit.” Daozi said solemnly.","After all, he was only a supplementary 0.5 part of Heavenly Dao, and there were still differences from the true Heavenly Dao. Thus, after completing his obsession with Song Eldest and the Eight-Armed Outer Heavenly Demon in one breath, he was a bit exhausted. If he wanted to create big news, he needed to recuperate a bit.","At the same time, he also needed to temporarily familiarize himself with the Heavenly Dao’s laws that would be ‘targeted against the Stellar Destruction Virus’.","During this period, Daozi completely shared the ‘Heavenly Dao’s view’ with Song Shuhang, allowing him to stand in the spectator mode’ perspective and view the world through the eyes of the Heavenly Dao.","All things were in sight, and everything in the world seemed to be under control.","This is the Heavenly Dao!","...","...","At the location of Song Shuhang’s main body.","The Scholarly Sage’s Eye was frantically engaged in calculation, and this time, even the third eye joined in, lightening the computational burden on the Scholarly Sage’s eyes.","In the dream, Song Shuhang’s vision split into two different states.","He could pay attention to the entire myriad realms simultaneously and could also lock onto certain detailed parts to observe closely.","Through the “Heavenly Dao’s View,” Song Shuhang first scanned the familiar location of Jiangnan College Town.","This was where his magnificent cultivation career had begun.","Here, he had met Soft Feather, Sixteen, Senior Medicine Master, and Doudou and even picked up Senior White who was coming out of secluded meditation!","Now, after experiencing the incident with evil spirits and the eruption of the world’s spiritual qi tide, Jiangnan College Town had also changed.","The evil spirits on modern world-Earth were completely exterminated by the demons of the Ninth Stage sent by Song Shuhang, the disaster was over.","However, the rejuvenating spiritual power added an extra touch of fantasy to the world.","At this time, Jiangnan College Town was sparsely populated.","Not because it was abandoned, but because ... it was winter break!","“Winter break, I always feel it’s a very distant term,” Song Shuhang reflected inwardly.","It felt so close yet so far away.","Song Shuhang’s gaze swept over Jiangnan College Town.","Even during winter break, there were still some members lingering in the school.","It seems that Jiangnan College might add a few special classes next semester?","Senior White’s pet, monster willow Soft Feather, was still rooted in Jiangnan College Town.","Song Shuhang’s gaze locked onto her—monster willow Soft Feather had always been attending school on his behalf, covering for him.","Afterward, he must not treat her unfairly.","Should he talk to Senior White and raise her benefits?","The monster willow Soft Feather also felt a movement in her heart, as if being watched, she lifted her branches, turning around in puzzlement.","But the observation of the Heavenly Dao, she truly could not sense anything.","So, she swayed her branches, stretched out a pair of little hands from her trunk, took out her phone, opened the chat app, and pulled up a group chat.","The group name was “Lifelong Good Buddies.”","Inside were Tubo, Gao Moumou, Yang De ... and Soft Feather.","Song Shuhang himself, however, wasn’t in the group!!","Suddenly, he had a feeling of being abandoned by his good buddies.","Song Shuhang’s gaze then swept over Soft Feather’s chat history.","Immediately afterward, he discovered that his three roommates were asking Soft Feather about cultivation issues.","It must have been the safety net left by Song Shuhang that worked, combined with the incident involving evil spirits and the rejuvenation of the world’s spiritual power, his three roommates were completely convinced about the existence of cultivation.","Monster willow Soft Feather, with a hobby of “fostering salted fish roommates,” began to guide them in cultivation.","For now, Soft Feather was gradually turning Song Shuhang’s three roommates into housebound cultivators, who only knew to remain in secluded cultivation at home every day.","Song Shuhang: “...”","The matter with his three roommates could be put aside for now.","When the calamity of the world’s end was resolved, when everything was over, he could free up his hands to truly help them.","For now, it was fine letting Soft Feather take care of them.","Then, Song Shuhang’s gaze swept over the Immortal Farming Sect, Chuchu’s home, and the sea urchin warrior clan at the bottom of the ocean.","He was scanning familiar places one by one, according to the events he had experienced in his memories.","A moment later, Song Shuhang’s eyes grazed over the mysterious island!","On the mysterious island, he saw a golden Cheng Lin, standing in front of The White Dragon’s dragon tomb.","“Eh?” Song Shuhang’s eyes suddenly brightened."]},{"number":2969,"title":"Chapter 2969 - 2967: Obviously, You’re Not the One I’ve Been Mainly Waiting for!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2969: Chapter 2967: Obviously, You’re Not the One I’ve Been Mainly Waiting for!","Golden Tranquil.","But it was not Cheng Lin!","Song Shuhang knew Cheng Goudan all too well.","Although Cheng Goudan wasn’t like Chu Pavilion Lord’s Dumb Hair, Fairy Creation, or @#%× Fairy, stuck on Song Shuhang, Cheng Goudan had always been one of Song Shuhang’s distant cheats and also a bridge between Song Shuhang and Father Goudan.","Therefore, even though this golden Cheng Lin looked almost exactly like Cheng Lin and had a very similar demeanor, Song Shuhang could tell at a glance that this Cheng Lin wasn’t that Cheng Lin.","Moreover, Song Shuhang was currently observing the mortal world through “Heavenly Dao’s Vision.”","Golden Tranquil stood calmly in front of the dragon tomb’s “crystal coffin,” her right hand gently pressed on the coffin, seemingly whispering something.","Above the dragon tomb, a silver-haired fairy with a scar on her back and a bald fairy stood side by side, seemingly watching the changes occurring within the dragon tomb.","Not far above the mysterious island, the resurrected Heavenly Emperor, wrapped in a sheet and barefoot in the vacuum, overlooked the mysterious island but did not attack right away, seeming to stand there observing.","In the vacuum not far from the mysterious island, the figure of a great lord shimmered in and out of visibility — the aura emanating from this great lord bore some resemblance to that of Senior Copper Trigram from the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","Further away, two figures were rapidly approaching.","One was Senior Golden Trigram, who had completed his agreement with Song Woodhead and others, and the 8.5 Heavenly Dao Ceremony had ended.","Now he was hurrying back to the mysterious island.","Next, he was waiting for Daozi to fulfill their agreement and concentrate all aspects of the “Heavenly Emperor’s Path” onto him, making Golden Trigram the unique, second-generation Heavenly Emperor of the myriad practitioners in the universe.","The other was Immortal Fairy White Bones who, for some unknown reason, felt a calling and accompanied Golden Trigram in rushing back to the mysterious island.","Song Shuhang swept a glance through “Heavenly Emperor’s View” over the location of the mysterious island before returning his gaze to Golden Tranquil and that bald fairy, focusing on them.","“I was thinking of delaying our meeting a bit longer... at least until all the crises in the outside world had ended,” Golden Tranquil said softly to the crystal coffin. “But now, it seems, I do not have much time left.”","However, the White Dragon Sister was not in the dragon tomb this time and showed no signs of returning—she was still accompanying Sixteen in overcoming tribulation.","Golden Tranquil showed a beautiful smile, and like the real Cheng Lin, she adjusted her slightly skew daoist cap with her hand.","Then, she approached the ‘bloodletting slot’ of the crystal coffin.","This time, the circle of ‘ancient bronze coffins’ around the crystal coffin remained still. The Bone Dragon Artifact Spirits within them quietly awaited.","Golden Tranquil stretched out her hand and gently pulled it through the vacuum.","A large sawtoothed blade materialized in her palm.","She gripped the sawtoothed blade and began to vigorously saw her own wrist area.","Sparks flew, the teeth of the blade and her skin creating a frenzied friction and bursts of dazzling sparks.","Even under Golden Tranquil’s control, the sound of the blade sawing against her wrist started to take on a rhythm similar to that of a cello—it was Offenbach’s “Jacqueline’s Tears.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","For some reason, this scene had a taunting flavor.","It felt as if Golden Tranquil was signaling to others: Hey, little brothers, are your defenses any good? Look at mine. Golden armor, sawing with a serrated blade, sparks flying everywhere, and yet not a scratch!","Sometime after the continuous sawing, Golden Tranquil’s wrist finally breached.","From her wrist flowed a golden blood, continuously pouring into the crystal coffin’s blood slot.","Upon seeing this scene, Song Shuhang couldn’t help but think about gripping his own wrist—if it had been him, after sawing for a while with a serrated blade, his wrist would probably detach itself from the elbow. But he wouldn’t have to worry about blood.","His Tyrannical Song self, even if cut into ten or eight pieces, wouldn’t drip a single drop of blood!","That was his advantage.","Within his field of view.","Golden Tranquil’s blood filled the groove and flowed around the crystal coffin along a channel, enveloping the entire coffin layer by layer.","Exactly like the scene where Song Shuhang had his blood fill the coffin.","Golden blood traced out a beautiful formation on the crystal coffin.","The crystal coffin resonated with the golden blood.","“Is the White Dragon finally going to resurrect?” Song Shuhang thought to himself.","But moments later... the resonating golden formation dimmed again.","Golden Tranquil: “???”","She widened her eyes, incredulously staring at the small white dragon in the crystal coffin.","This was completely beyond her expectations.","“Could it be that I didn’t let enough blood?” Golden Tranquil asked.","“No, fellow friend, the blood you let was already more than enough.” From the side, the skeletal flood dragon spirit popped out its little head and spoke.","“Then, which part of the ceremony went wrong?” Golden Tranquil asked again.","The bone dragon artifact spirit: “No, there were no issues with the ceremony from start to finish.”","“Then why hasn’t she resurrected yet?” Golden Tranquil said.","“Obviously.” The bone dragon artifact spirit replied, “You are not the person my master is waiting for.”","Golden Tranquil: “...”","The bone dragon artifact spirit: “...”","Song Shuhang: “...”","“Could it be a glitch in the procedure? Should I let more blood and try again?” Golden Tranquil said.","The bone dragon artifact spirit did not discount her kindness: “If you are willing, fellow friend, feel free to try as many times as you want.”","Golden Tranquil, not convinced, picked up the serrated knife and started cutting her own wrist again.","After a long while.","Golden fresh blood dripped out.","But just as the golden blood was about to drip, Golden Tranquil’s other hand swept over it, slicing through the golden elements in the blood.","The part of the blood that was golden was cut away and hovered beside her.","Then, blood with a hint of gold color fell into the groove.","The blood resonated with the crystal coffin once more!","“This time it should be settled.” Golden Tranquil patted the crystal coffin and said, “White Dragon sister, come out now, stop causing trouble. I really don’t have much time left.”","Squeak~Crack~","The crystal coffin vibrated intensely for a moment.","Then, it returned to calmness.","Golden Tranquil: “!!!”","“It failed again, fellow friend.” The bone dragon artifact spirit slowly said: “There’s no need to force it, you really are not the person my master is waiting for.”","Golden Tranquil: “...”","The atmosphere turned awkward.","In the void, even the Heavenly Emperor’s daughter couldn’t bear to watch.","The awkward atmosphere made her uneasy.","Therefore, she made her move.","“Future Sword – Live as long as the universe, shine as the sun and moon!” The Heavenly Emperor swept her sword across.","This sword, passing through ‘the present’, appeared right beside Golden Tranquil.","And coincidentally, Golden Tranquil instinctively dodged to the left.","Her evasion led her right into the path of the Heavenly Emperor’s sword light.","The sword light shaved off, removing the golden coating on Golden Tranquil’s skin, revealing an inner body as beautiful as glass gemstones."]},{"number":2970,"title":"Chapter 2970 - 2968: Perfect Saber Intent Armor","paragraphs":["Chapter 2970: Chapter 2968: Perfect Saber Intent Armor","The effect of the Heavenly Emperor’s Son’s “Future Sword” seems to have the ‘Guaranteed Hit’ effect, similar to the Ancient Nether Clone’s spear technique ‘Karmic Spear’ in the Black Dragon World.","However, the ‘Karmic Spear’ is a method of reversing karmic causality.","And the “Future Sword” doesn’t strike the present—it strikes the future!","The moment the sword is swung, under the influence of temporal laws, the target is bound to be hit by this strike unless you can master a method to counteract the ‘Space-Time Traversal’.","Golden Tranquil dodged the ‘present’ but then collided with the sword light of the “Future Sword.” A layer of golden paint was scraped off, revealing the interior beneath the coat of gold.","Song Shuhang, who had been observing Golden Tranquil with the ‘Heavenly Dao’s Vision,’ slightly focused his gaze, locking onto the scraped area of Golden Tranquil.","The body beneath, clear and pretty like glass gemstones, seemed very familiar.","“So that’s it, it’s just a layer of golden paint,” Song Shuhang slowly said.","In all the myriad practitioners in the universe, the only one who would do this, and to oneself no less, is probably just one.","“Repainting is expensive,” Golden Tranquil said nonchalantly after being hit by a sword from the Heavenly Emperor’s Son—perhaps because her face also had a layer of golden paint, her true complexion couldn’t be seen.","From the outside, apart from having a layer of paint scraped off, her main body seemed to be unharmed.","It must be noted that the Heavenly Emperor’s Son’s recent sword strike was not a mere probing cut but a real sword technique imbued with killing intent.","“Fellow friend, someone is trying to chop you down, and you’re worried about some paint?” the Bone Dragon Artifact Spirit couldn’t help but say.","It’s like someone across from you is coming at you with a knife, and you’re concerned about a tear in your clothes?","Focus on what’s important!","Your life is at risk, and yet you’re worried about some paint?","“Don’t underestimate this gold paint. Although it’s just a scratch on the surface, if I want to fix it, I have to repaint this whole area. And the color tone of the repainted area won’t match the original, making it impossible to restore perfectly,” Golden Tranquil pointed at the region on her shoulder as she spoke.","Bone Dragon Artifact Spirit: “...”","“By the way, Artifact Spirit fellow friend, would you like some paint? Aside from Domineering Gold and Stylish Silver, I’ve also developed Noble Purple, Melancholy Blue, and Vibrant Multicolor. There’s definitely one that would suit you!” Golden Tranquil took the opportunity to pitch her products.","“...” Bone Dragon Artifact Spirit: “Fellow friend, you should focus on saving your own life first.”","“No worries, I don’t actually have any major conflict with the Heavenly Emperor’s Son. If I let her chop at me a few times, she’ll calm down,” Golden Tranquil waved her hand nonchalantly.","Bone Dragon Artifact Spirit: “...”","Song Shuhang: “...”","“Hehe.” A pleasant...sneer echoed from the void.","Some people’s voice lines just aren’t meant for sneering. Even the coldest laugh from them doesn’t sound threatening—in this case, Soft Feather’s voice line was such, not suited for a cold demeanor.","A few sword strikes to cool off?","Simply wishful thinking.","The relationship between her, Cheng Lin, and Song Shuhang qualifies as a life-or-death struggle.","Song Shuhang and Cheng Lin want her.","She equally yearns for Song Shuhang and Cheng Lin.","Neither side will give in.","“Since you want to stand there and let me land a few strikes to vent, then just stand still,” said the Heavenly Emperor’s Son Ping, raising her sword in hand.","The weight of many years bore down on the tip of the sword.","Powerful enough to ‘Destroy Stars,’ those laws and power were concentrated at the tip of the Heavenly Emperor’s Son’s sword.","If this strike were to land, even if the power was controlled and compressed, neither the mysterious island nor the dragon tomb would survive the aftermath.","“Don’t fight here! Please, don’t fight in this place!” the Fairy with silver hair and a scar on her back couldn’t help but stand up and plead.","She didn’t want her shelter to be destroyed.","“No need to worry,” the Heavenly Emperor’s Son fluttered the long sword in hand, and the power that was previously concentrated at the tip of the sword was further compressed to a tiny pinpoint: “The moment I kill him, I’ll instantly teleport away.”","This degree of control was something the Heavenly Emperor’s Son could still achieve.","“Don’t move a muscle, just stand there, Cheng Lin,” ordered the Heavenly Emperor’s son as he thrust his sword forward.","“You’ve got the wrong person... Fairy,” the golden-hued Cheng Lin’s figure turned into nothingness, vanishing beside the dragon tomb.","There are only two kinds of people who would not dodge such a strike.","One is truly badass.","The other is truly foolish.","And she was neither.","“Actually, my name is Cheng Goudan. Cheng Lin is really dead, truly dead... You don’t believe it? Why don’t you divinate it?” At the same time as she turned into nothingness, the lingering voice of golden Cheng Lin called out.","“Whether you’re Cheng Goudan, Golden Goudan, or Silver Goudan, the outcome will be the same,” the Heavenly Emperor’s son said as he flicked his arm, creating a flourish of his sword in the vacuum!","She hadn’t been standing still in the vacuum, refraining from acting just to watch the show.","The space near the mysterious island was already under the absolute spatial sealing array she had laid out.","Around the edges of the dragon tomb, she had secretly scattered many new kinds of Spatial Imprisonment Techniques.","Her Spatial Imprisonment Techniques weren’t just simple spatial locks... they were true ‘Space-Time Imprisonments.’","The powers of both time and space here transformed into the ‘domain’ of the Heavenly Emperor’s son.","The once nothingness-transformed golden Cheng Lin was suddenly forced out of her ‘void’ state.","Then, just like the ‘Future Sword,’ countless beams of sword light burst forth in the vacuum, relentlessly striking the golden Cheng Lin.","Each beam of sword light stripped away a piece of golden paint from her body.","The clouds of golden paint turned to powder and drifted down from the sky...","A small part of it fell into a groove of the crystal coffin, mixing with the fresh blood that golden Cheng Lin had previously placed there.","On the crystal coffin, the formation that The White Dragon had set up by herself lit up faintly once more.","Neither the confronting golden Cheng Lin nor the Heavenly Emperor’s son noticed this subtle change.","However, Song Shuhang, who was observing the world meticulously through the ‘Heavenly Dao’s Vision’ mode, keenly caught onto it.","‘Golden paint powder + fresh blood’?","Or maybe, The White Dragon didn’t need fresh blood to resurrect... but instead, the gold paint?","Could the pattern on the crystal coffin be a setup to collect gold paint for her?","Even in resurrection, she wanted to come back in the form of the ‘ancestral golden dragon’?","[Should I privately message The White Dragon and ask for the answer?]","The thought flashed by and was temporarily stored in his ‘memo’ in memory.","Then, Song Shuhang’s gaze once again locked onto Cheng Lin.","At this moment, Cheng Lin, stripped of all her golden paint, revealed her complete, shiny, glass-like body, glistening like a piece of art.","Cheng Lin sighed softly as she circulated her true qi.","In the next moment, a set of exquisite ‘female armor’ covered her body, arming her.","Armor intent?!","No, it was saber intent!","The full name: saber intent armor.","Before Tyrannical Song, it seemed no one among the myriad practitioners in the universe had ever managed to develop this special type of saber intent.","But now, it materialized and took shape on ‘glassy Cheng Lin.’","The exquisite saber intent armor fitted glassy Cheng Lin’s figure perfectly, except for the crooked daoist cap on her head. Everywhere else, the saber intent armor was flawless.","Song Shuhang, perceiving through Heavenly Dao’s View, let out a soft sigh, and then he focused his mind, staring intently at glassy Cheng Lin.","He wanted to try whether Heavenly Dao’s Vision had the ability to appraise or check an item’s attributes."]},{"number":2971,"title":"Chapter 2971 - 2969: Ding~ Homeless Little Song Song added you as a friend","paragraphs":["Chapter 2971: Chapter 2969: Ding~ Homeless Little Song Song added you as a friend","Song Shuhang had confirmed from the very beginning that this Cheng Lin, originally golden and now of a glass gemstone color, was not the “Cheng Goudan” he had been in contact with.","He was clear on this point.","However, from many characteristics, although the glass gemstone-colored Cheng Lin was not the “Cheng Goudan” Song Shuhang knew, she might indeed be the real Cheng Lin.","This point is actually not hard to understand—because as a fragment of “Ghost God Cheng Lin,” Cheng Goudan can fuse with other fragments.","Father Goudan had also assigned Song Shuhang a long-term task of ‘collecting Cheng Lin’s fragments.’","Unfortunately, Song Shuhang cultivated until he reached the Immortal Realm and hadn’t encountered any other fragments of Cheng Lin.","And now, the true identity of this glass gemstone-colored Cheng Lin, if not mistaken, should be Song Shuhang.","Apart from Song Shuhang, no one else would be so unreserved to come before The White Dragon’s dragon tomb with such a confident expression, intending to resurrect her using blood.","Added to that are his peculiar fancy for applying golden paint...and that glass-like body, along with many details.","It is evident that the glass gemstone-colored Cheng Lin?Song Shuhang never intended to hide his real identity from the very beginning.","Song Shuhang guessed that the other party was Song Shuhang.","But what he wanted to ‘see’ clearly was the deeper identity of Song Shuhang—the culprit who led to him being mistaken and severely beaten by The White Dragon, Heavenly Bamboo Shoot, and leaders from the ancient Heavenly City—his true identity!","In fact, quite early on, Song Shuhang had speculated about the identity of ‘Song Shuhang.’","But he had no evidence, and it was just a speculation.","Moreover, with too many karmic entanglements on Song Shuhang, Song Shuhang hadn’t shared his thoughts with anyone.","Now, with the help of Heavenly Dao’s Vision, he just might validate his thoughts.","As a thought arose in Song Shuhang, Daoist Senior lent him the ‘Heavenly Dao’s Vision,’ which truly materialized the corresponding function.","A row of ‘profile’ information emerged beside the glass gemstone-colored Cheng Lin.","[Two-fifths Ghost God?Cheng Lin?Tyrannical Saber Song One]","[Major Event?Tyrannical Saber Song One: Ancient Heavenly City member ‘Song Shuhang,’ a renowned member during the Heavenly City era. In the later stages of the ancient Heavenly City, he stole the ‘Heavenly Emperor’s Mandate,’ and at the end of the ancient Heavenly City era, he replaced the ‘Heavenly Emperor’ in power, attempting to obliterate the ‘Ancient Heavenly City’s path’ from within...The obliteration of Heavenly City’s path failed; Plan A failed, Dao shattered and collapsed.]","[Major Event?Cheng Lin: ‘Jade Lake Empress’ from the ancient Heavenly City, a top-tier immortal among the Heavenly City era, ranked alongside the Four Great Emperors and the Ancestral Dragon. After the failure of Plan A, she took the lead in directing Plan B, inheriting the collapsed Tyrannical Saber Song One, the destroyer of the Heavenly City.]","Song Shuhang: “!!!”","He initially wanted to see if he could find the answers he sought from ‘Song Shuhang.’","But instead, he unearthed major news.","In the middle and later stages of the ancient Heavenly City era, Song Shuhang had already stolen the Heavenly Emperor’s mandate?","And, at the end of the Heavenly City era, he even replaced the Heavenly Emperor’s child to become the Heavenly Emperor?","Did the people of the Heavenly City not notice that the ‘Heavenly Emperor’ had been switched out?","Da Da Zi, this Heavenly Emperor, was he a bit wronged?","And how did he manage it? Secretly replacing the Heavenly Emperor’s child?","[Let’s note this down in the memo first, and go directly to ask the persons involved, Cheng Goudan and Da Da Zi, later.]","Song Shuhang noted it down first.","He then continued to focus on the glass gemstone Cheng Lin, reading deeper layers of information.","Beneath, the glass gemstone Cheng Lin, wearing ‘saber intent armor,’ suddenly shivered.","“Really, Song Shuhang sometimes is just too impatient.” She whispered, “At least, let me clear the obstacles for you before I die...make full use of me, don’t let me die in vain.”","As she spoke, she gestured in the vacuum, projecting a ‘QR code.’","It was the QR code for adding someone to the ‘Cultivator Chat System.’","Cheng Lin had always preserved this “QR code.”","In the void.","When the Heavenly Emperor’s Son saw Cheng Lin suddenly produce this pattern, he frowned and paused his attack.","Below.","Seeing that the Heavenly Emperor’s Son paused his attack, glass gemstones Cheng Lin turned back and resumed her operations.","She gently swept her mental energy over this “QR code.”","[Ding~ Congratulations, you have added ‘Big Shot Tyrannical Song’ as a friend. From now on, there is no distance between you, regardless of the ends of the world, no matter how far, both hearts can communicate without any barriers.]","Song Shuhang, on his part, also received the notification of a new friend request at the same time.","[Ding~ New user ‘Song Shuhang’ requests to add you as a friend—do you agree? Choose yes!]","[Automatic title generation in progress...]","[Homeless Little Song Song]","[Your new friend and [Blacklist 1?Dead Fairy Cheng Goudan], [Crisp (Crossed Out) Beautiful Forehead] Slow-Witted Song, [Orthopedics Department] Immortal Fairy White Bones, [Golden Dragon Scarf] The White Dragon, [Heavens] Senior Turtle... might know each other. Would you like to add them to [Nine Provinces Number Two Group] or [Da Dazi’s Heavenly Court] group?]","The ‘Cultivator Chat System’ proactively recommended this to Song Shuhang—it was clearly a new function churned out on overtime by Lady Kunna, making the ‘Cultivator Chat’ more user-friendly.","Something stirred in Song Shuhang’s mind.","He reached out to add the new member to the ‘Nine Provinces Number Two Group.’","Since it was the server itself adding a person, all members of Group Two received a ‘system alert’ as soon as he joined.","[System Alert: [Homeless Little Song Song] Song Wood has joined ‘Nine Provinces Number Two Group,’ welcoming the new member, please take good care of them!]","[Homeless Little Song Song] Song Wood: “!!!”","Private chat, huh? Why add me to the group?","And, the members of this group...","[Dead Fairy] Cheng Goudan: “New member, oh ho, Wood.”","[Golden Dragon Scarf] The White Dragon: “???”","Yo, Dragon Sister, I’m at the Mysterious Island Dragon Tomb. What are your conditions for revival? Song Wood quickly texted.","The White Dragon: “...”","Cheng Goudan: “Oh ho, doomed.”","Fairy Lychee: “Although I don’t know what happened... Oh ho, doomed.”","Glass gemstone Cheng Lin’s arm muscles tensed.","She quickly pulled out Song Shuhang’s private chat: “What are you doing!”","But the dreamland-engrossed Song Shuhang didn’t respond directly to her.","Song Wood: “My identity, Ah Song, you should have guessed it by now, right? I can sense that you are now typing at me through the ‘Heavenly Dao’ channel, so...why did you add me to the group?”","Song Shuhang in the dreamland state, received the private messages.","“This is trouble,” Song Shuhang rubbed his temples.","It was initially just a guess, but now Song Wood’s reply proved his guess was correct.","The first ghost spirit that disappeared last year, now for the first time using the ‘Cultivator Chat System’ and ‘Dreamland’ as a relay, reached out to him.","“Kick me out quickly, otherwise I’ll let all the members know that you are my dad,” Song Wood added then.","Song Shuhang: “???”"]},{"number":2972,"title":"Chapter 2972 - 2970: The Influence of the Will of the Heavens","paragraphs":["Chapter 2972: Chapter 2970: The Influence of the Will of the Heavens","Even Song Shuhang, who had been seasoned through the trials of the Nine Provinces Number One Group, was momentarily stunned.","However, it only lasted for less than an instant.","Sometimes, you just got to brush off the nonsense talk; take it seriously and you lose.","But...","Could something like time travel truly be achieved?","Song Shuhang’s own “dreamland” skill could let him dream of the past, but after all, the dreamland was just an illusion, like accessing a memory and personally experiencing it.","The reason “dreamland” could affect the past was related to the strength of the one being dreamt of.","Only those whose strength surpassed beings like Senior Scarlet Heaven could sense Song Shuhang in his dreamland state—this sensing was based on the great ones’ powerful intuition, as well as methods like divinations of the “future”.","If the subject of the dreamland could not sense Song Shuhang, then he couldn’t possibly cause the slightest impact on the “past”.","“Can something like time travel really be done?” Song Shuhang suddenly inquired.","On the other side, Little Song Song, the one without a home: “...”","No techniques work against the non-technique; Song Shuhang didn’t respond to his nonsense talk. Even if his verbal attack skills were maxed out, they were ineffective. Without serious conversation, Song Shuhang might end up talked to death.","“Normally, it’s impossible. Any entity with physical substance thinking of time travel... the rules of the Heavenly Dao would certainly not permit such a thing to happen,” Little Song Song without a home said after a moment’s thought. “Unless, it’s like the ‘dreamland state’ your dad has.”","Song Shuhang reflected on this.","Besides his own ‘dreamland,’ he also remembered the ‘Future Child’ form of Soft Feather.","He had encountered that special state of Soft Feather.","“Then, what’s your story?” Song Shuhang asked.","Little Song Song without a home: “Dad, you’re asking this in a very professional way... My answer is, I know nothing.”","That was the truth; he did not have an answer himself either.","Song Shuhang: “...”","Was the person opposite to him now addicted to acting? Calling him dad always felt like calling his own father.","“I know you, dad, have many questions for me, and after some time... It won’t be long, I will return. By then, everything about me will come back with my return. The answers you seek will all be answered,” Little Song Song without a home continued.","With this, he made his identity official.","—The vanished petty ghost spirit would return soon, possibly bringing back all its memories and... power?","Song Shuhang raised his eyebrows slightly as he read this reply.","He had thought his heart would be complicated when he got this answer.","But to his surprise, when he actually heard the reply, Song Shuhang found his heart to be undisturbed!","He had a great heart passed down from his ancestors, and his mind and willpower were fairly firm, he had experienced much.","But such tranquility at this moment was clearly abnormal.","It seemed that there was nothing left in the world that could still surprise him.","“This state is clearly not right,” Song Shuhang furrowed his brows.","After a bit of thought, he guessed a possibility.","Could it be the influence of the Heavenly Dao’s vision?","The Heavenly Dao, the information of eternity, combined with the ‘Heavenly Dao’s View’ Daozi shared with him, these things might be affecting him continuously.","Once the cumulative effect reached a certain level, Song Shuhang’s heart would become ‘undisturbed’.","In the face of any information from the myriad practitioners in the universe, he could not stir any emotion.","“Is it that each Heavenly Dao is affected? Or is the ‘incomplete’ Heavenly Dao being disturbed by ‘Heaven’s Will’?”","Upon further thought, the fat ball, which was the Heavenly Dao, seemed to have entered robot mode in the later stages, mechanically enforcing the laws of the Heavenly Dao and processing events programmatically.","Could it be that the flight of each Heavenly Dao is related to this issue as well?","After a calm contemplation, Song Shuhang noted this down in his ‘memorandum’ to discuss thoroughly with Senior White, Senior White two, Father Goudan, and the three-eyed young senior once the ‘dreamland’ ended.","Then, Song Shuhang replied, “Do you have something else to do? Why do you need to wait a while before returning? Is my current state still unable to withstand it?”","After all, Song Shuhang had already stepped onto the Path of Seeking Life Through Death and had become a true Immortal.","If not even an ‘Immortal’ could withstand it, did he need to aim for pseudo-immortality?","“Now, I have completed the ancient Heavenly City’s obsession with the help of Daozi’s hand. However, there are some things that I would like to settle at the end.” Little Song Song without a home replied—and moreover, if Daozi completes the mission of the 8.5th Heavenly Dao and enters the official 9th Heavenly Dao battle, he would need to use the ceremonial formation to extract and resurrect the ‘portion of existence’ that Daozi had previously preserved.","Song Shuhang: “Alright.”","To be honest...","Song Shuhang’s strength was already to the point where he was indifferent to one more or one less pendant.","The pendants on him were all incredibly powerful, basically starting from Immortal or divine weapons, one more wouldn’t matter, one less wouldn’t hurt.","Therefore, whether petty ghost spirit number one chose to return now or later wasn’t urgent for Song Shuhang; he was just casually inquiring.","By contrast, it was a big question how to handle the personal relationships when the other party returned.","“Also... if you, dad, are using ‘Heavenly Dao’s View’ to watch the myriad realms, you should have seen that scene, right?” Little Song Song without a home suddenly brought up.","“The Stellar Destruction Virus?” Song Shuhang asked.","Little Song Song without a home: “Yes.”","“Daozi’s consciousness has returned... He should be about to take action against these ‘Stellar Destruction Viruses’,” Song Shuhang said aloud.","As he spoke, Daozi’s intent resurfaced, pressing down on the myriad practitioners in the universe.","“Sorry to keep you waiting, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song,” Daozi spoke.","He had just taken a moment to rest, to recover, and to familiarize himself with the ‘Heaven’s Will’.","“Not at all—I have gained many insights into the myriad realms through ‘Heavenly Dao’s Vision,’ and I have yet to thank Daozi for it,” Song Shuhang replied.","“That’s good then,” Daozi emitted an emotionless chuckle.","Though laughing, the laugh was without a ripple.","He seemed to have been affected by the information of eternity as well.","“If Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song is ready, then experience my actions carefully next. It might be helpful for you to condense your second path to immortality,” Daozi added.","He was only affected, but his reason and thoughts were not problematic.","Song Shuhang nodded without saying anything further, and calmly maintained the link with Daozi through the ‘dreamland’.","What followed was Daozi’s time to enforce the laws."]},{"number":2973,"title":"Chapter 2973 - 2971: Then kill the person who’s pressing the nuclear button!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2973: Chapter 2971: Then kill the person who’s pressing the nuclear button!","“`","Under Song Shuhang’s sensing, Daozi reached out and started to act within the vacuum.","The principles belonging to the Heavenly Dao were being pulled over one by one.","—To Song Shuhang, this process seemed like it was “pixelated,” unclear to see.","“Annihilate!” Daozi pulled hard with his hand.","In the myriad practitioners in the universe, every star that had been infected with the “virus” felt the pull of the laws of the Heavenly Dao.","Daozi wanted to use the “Heavenly Dao Authority” to directly eradicate the viruses from the stars of the myriad practitioners in the universe, completely destroying all the viruses.","[Will it be successful?] Song Shuhang looked forward to the scenes of the myriad practitioners in the universe with some anticipation.","But at this time, his heart remained eerily calm.","Even at the moment “Daozi” made his move, Song Shuhang had already faintly sensed the outcome of Daozi’s action deep in his heart!","Whoosh~","First, across the myriad realms plane, a large portion of “stars” had their replicating “viruses” pulled out!","These viruses were categories of the “Stellar Destruction Virus” that kept on spreading.","Children and grandchildren, endless generations of viruses... They differed greatly from the Virus Mother Body.","These “great-great-grandchildren” viruses could not resist the lure of the Heavenly Dao Authority and were uprooted.","With Daozi’s command of “Annihilation,” these viruses instantly turned to ashes!","Song Shuhang carefully experienced the details of Daozi’s actions, and his comprehension of the Will of the Heavens related to the “Cultivator Chat System” suddenly deepened a bit more.","This time, what deepened was the comprehension related to “authority and commands.”","Whether it was seeing through the Heavenly Dao or attaching to it to sense its use of authority, both could enhance Song Shuhang’s comprehension of the Will of the Heavens related to the “Cultivator Chat System”—this second Will of the Heavens seemed to be aiming to comprehend all the functions of the “Heavenly Dao.”","Next is the region with the “Void Sun Guardians” clones staying in some of the stars.","In these regions, the Void Sun Guardian clones are obtaining “undying components” through some means and constantly creating “Stellar Destruction Viruses” with them.","Under the compulsion of the “Daozi” Heavenly Dao Authority, even the clones of the Void Sun Guardians couldn’t keep all the “Stellar Destruction Viruses.”","These viruses, too, were forcibly extracted by the Heavenly Dao Authority and began to enter the annihilation phase.","But obviously, these viruses, which were made with similar “undying components” to Cloud Gauze Three View Moon or Tyrannical Song, were more difficult to handle.","They were permeated with the “aura of eternity,” and when faced with the Heavenly Dao Authority’s effort to deal with them, they could even resist for a short time!","Using eternity to combat eternity.","As for the clones of the “Void Sun Guardians,” upon sensing the coercive measures of the Will of the Heavens, they instantly began to withdraw. Some of the “Void Sun Guardian clones” even dissolved on the spot, dissipating without a trace.","The existence of the Immortal Realm is still nothing to the “Heavenly Dao”... but for “Daozi,” who could only count as ‘half a Heavenly Dao,’ eradicating them root and branch would take some effort.","And Daozi was currently focusing all his effort on the “viruses.”","The converging and fleeing “Void Sun Guardians” would have to be given a chance to catch their breath for now.","...","...","About ten breaths’ time had passed since Daozi made his move... and at least seventy percent of the infected “stars” were rescued!","During this period, Song Shuhang saw that inside these “stars,” there were forces of the virtuous network hidden.","—The legacy of Daoist Priest Virtue to suppress the “Stellar Destruction Virus” was secretly assisting “Daozi’s” actions, working with him to uproot the viral menace.","This was also why “Daozi’s” actions were so smooth.","Even those viruses made with “undying components” were actually being suppressed by the virtuous network!","A few moments later...","The majority of the viruses made with “undying components” were wiped out, and finally, a batch of special “Constant Star Destruction Virus Mother Bodies” appeared before “Daozi” and Song Shuhang.","These “Virus Mother Bodies” were guarded by both the Void Sun Guardians and the Stellar Doomsday Demon Skulls.","“`","“Annihilate!” Daozi issued the annihilation command without hesitation.","—He had just managed to help Confucianism through a crisis, allowing the resurrection of the Confucian junior brothers and sisters to no longer be incomplete, providing a chance for the Confucian system to thrive once again.","But now, someone was actually fiddling with the idea of destroying the world.","Daozi certainly wouldn’t be courteous.","Today, he intended to completely cleanse the “virus.”","Boom~","The “laws of the Heavenly Dao” activated by Daozi acted upon the star, directly pulling at that portion of the “Stellar Destruction Virus Mother Body.”","The clones of the Void Sun Guardians and the Stellar Doomsday Demon Skulls by his side couldn’t withstand it, their bodies were blown away, and cracks appeared all over them.","These cracks couldn’t be healed with ordinary self-recovery methods, after all, they bore the marks left by the Will of the Heavens.","The Stellar Destruction Virus Mother Body was washed layer by layer by the “laws of the Heavenly Dao.”","The virus’s outer shell was completely eroded away... revealing its core at last.","It was an object that looked like a grain of iron.","“It’s indeed meticulous to say that iron is the star’s doomsday,” Song Shuhang thought to himself with a strange calmness.","While contemplating, the annihilation power of the Heavenly Dao washed over the iron grain-like object.","But at that moment, an “immortal” aura emerged from those tiny iron grains...","Just like Song Shuhang’s “undying fat whale golden core” or Cloud Gauze Three View Moon’s “bone of eternity.”","Both possessed eternal energy but lacked the authority of the Heavenly Dao—an Immortal Material!","Eternity was an attribute that even the authority of the Heavenly Dao couldn’t breach... Once, there was a Daozi who couldn’t even change his hairstyle at will.","The moment one becomes “immortal,” even the state of one’s body and nails at that instant would be fixed in eternity.","Not even the Heavenly Dao could cut its own hair.","At this moment, Daozi’s “Annihilation Command” also failed to completely obliterate these “iron grain materials.”","“It really is so...” Song Shuhang whispered inwardly.","In fact, Daozi wasn’t the first Heavenly Dao to do such a thing; Immortal Daoist Virtue had also done similar acts against the Stellar Destruction Virus before.","The virus offspring born and spread from the Virus Mother Body could be destroyed by the authority of the Heavenly Dao.","But this Mother Body, with its eternal attributes, remained untouchable even by the authority of the Heavenly Dao!","“Immortal?” Daozi spoke calmly, yet even in his calm tone, one could sense a hint of surprise from Senior Daozi.","“Yes... indestructible and eternal,” Song Shuhang spoke up.","Daozi furrowed his brows, his fingers tapping on the Throne of Wealth’s armrest.","Using something indestructible and eternal as the “virus” mother body...","Not even the authority of the Heavenly Dao could erase them.","What to do now?","“Is it only possible to let them be? Or should they be sealed?” Daozi was somewhat unwilling.","“Perhaps, I have a way,” Song Shuhang said.","These virus mother bodies were indeed terrifying; they were like atomic bombs, highly threatening once detonated.","However, since the “virus mother bodies” couldn’t be dealt with, could the mastermind controlling them be dealt with instead?","If you can’t bomb the atomic bomb, then take out the person holding the button for it.","With a thought, Song Shuhang began to summon his “Cultivator Chat System.”","The “restorable gray account” he held in his hand was about to be put to use!"]},{"number":2974,"title":"Chapter 2974 - 2972: Haha, this wave is stable!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2974: Chapter 2972: Haha, this wave is stable!","In the myriad realms, the big players always have a variety of clever maneuvers.","And the big player hidden behind the ‘Void Sun Guardians’ and ‘Stellar Doomsday Demon Skulls’ had means that were particularly cunning.","It had quietly downloaded the ‘Cultivator Chat System’ client and even registered an account...","But its intention in registering was not to use the ‘Cultivator Chat System’ normally but to study and hack it. It attempted to seize control of the ‘Cultivator Chat System’ when Song Shuhang exploded into a bloody mist, aiming to turn the tables.","Regrettably, it miscalculated the primary and secondary relationship between the ‘Cultivator Chat System’ and Song Shuhang and also underestimated the system’s uniqueness.","The big player’s plan to seize control of the ‘Cultivator Chat System’ failed.","At the moment of failure, it immediately used its clever maneuvers to erase its account, deleting the account and exiting!","If it wasn’t for Song Shuhang’s ‘undying fat whale golden core’ also quietly restoring the ‘data’ during its resurrection, maybe this big player behind the scenes would have succeeded.","Now, Song Shuhang held a restored ‘grey offline ID account’ in his hands.","This account was closely linked to the big player behind the scenes.","As long as he used it, Song Shuhang could lock onto the other party’s location and track them down.","If the problem can’t be solved... then let’s solve the person who caused this problem!","Song Shuhang shared his thoughts with Daozi.","[Directly dealing with the existence that created the ‘Stellar Destruction Virus’? If it’s feasible, that would indeed be a good idea,] Daozi pondered and replied.","However, to go through with this, a preventative measure would be necessary for the myriad realms.","–If the person pulling the strings behind the scenes could be killed by him, there would be two possible outcomes.","One is that this crisis would be averted, which would be cause for celebration.","The second is that upon the death of the string-puller, all the Stellar Destruction Viruses might go out of control and trigger instant self-destruction, dragging down a large swath of the myriad realms with it. This would have to be guarded against.","–But it’s also possible that the figure behind it all won’t be so easily dealt with.","After all, they hold the true ‘immortal information’ and might themselves be in an immortal state.","In that case, going directly to their doorstep could not only fail to resolve the issue but also trigger their deeper vigilance, losing the element of surprise afforded by Song Shuhang’s ‘grey ID account’.","This too had to be guarded against.","[I need to make some preparations,] Daozi said to Song Shuhang, [Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, your state is about to end, so be ready to ‘Exit Dream’ at any moment. Then, in the final moments of your state, I will try my best to conceal your actions. Let’s hope that when you use the ‘grey ID account’ to lock onto the other party, they won’t detect it...]","[Alright,] Song Shuhang nodded in response.","Daozi once again sought to buy time, easing the state he was in.","At the same time, he began trying to communicate with that ‘Virtuous Network’ in all the myriad realms—when Song Shuhang was using ‘Heavenly Dao’s Vision’ to observe the myriad realms, Daozi also shared the details Song Shuhang was focusing on.","He had seen how this virtuous network had assisted him while he was dealing with the ‘Stellar Destruction Virus’.","This formidable virtuous network was a creation of the Heavenly Dao!","It was probably left behind by one of the previous Wielders of the Will during their tenure.","The purpose of the virtuous network was clear, to counter the ‘Stellar Destruction Virus’ and to suppress it.","If he could borrow the power of this virtuous network, he could patch up his next action—if killing the ‘person pulling the strings’ led to an uncontrollable outbreak of the virus, the virtuous network could suppress the viruses.","Afterward, Daozi could free up his hands to either seal these viruses or slowly deal with them.","A moment later...","Daozi successfully connected with the virtuous network, which upon sensing that Daozi’s target was the ‘Stellar Destruction Virus’, agreed immediately to his access request.","[Good, now we have our preventative measure,] Daozi thought to himself.","Taking advantage of the last moments, Daozi began using the ‘Heavenly Dao Authority’ to strengthen the ‘Virtuous Network’, striving to boost it to its peak condition.","“`","Daozi’s actions directly benefited ‘Sage Monarch Melon Eater,’ who was overcoming tribulation.","The reinforcement of the virtuous network allowed Sage Monarch Melon Eater to soar in the sea of heavenly tribulation as if a whale had grown wings!","...","...","About twenty breaths later.","“Are you ready, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song?” Daozi asked.","“All set,” Song Shuhang replied.","Daozi said in a deep voice, “Next, I will conceal your actions, and you will lock onto the opponent.”","The Will of the Heavens took action personally, stirring up all heaven’s secrets related to Song Shuhang.","They strived to prevent the opponent from detecting Song Shuhang’s actions and to preserve the effects of this ‘Grey ID Account’ as much as possible.","In case... if he could not deal with the opponent, they might have to rely on the ‘Grey ID Account’ again in the future to lock onto the opponent and deal with this person behind the scenes.","Daozi did not have blind confidence in his Heavenly Dao Authority; he had left himself a way out.","In case he wasn’t up to the task, there were still Tyrannical Song and Fellow Daoist White or others who could step in.","After stirring up Song Shuhang’s heaven’s secrets, Daozi thought for a moment and decided to further enhance the concealing effect.","He simply veiled all the ‘Heavenly Mechanism’ of the entire myriad practitioners in the universe.","Heavenly Mechanism became obscured; at this moment, all divination methods in the myriad practitioners in the universe lost their effect.","Even the ‘intuition’ of crisis for the big shots was blocked.","This was Daozi’s double protection for Song Shuhang.","If only Song Shuhang was shielded, it would be like a sign proclaiming ‘No Silver Here,’ and the opponent, upon divination, could easily guess the reason upon finding only Song Shuhang’s heavenly secrets were concealed.","But by shielding the heavenly secrets of the entire myriad practitioners in the universe, the opponent would be unable to figure out anything—under such circumstances, the secondary shielding on Song Shuhang would achieve a perfect effect.","All cultivators in the myriad practitioners in the universe felt a stir in their hearts at this moment.","“Here it comes again, that feeling of heart movement,” the Almighty Merchant said slowly as he looked up at the sky—he too had a connection with the ‘Virtuous Network.’","Therefore, both he and his disciples ‘Almighty Seller’ and ‘Fairy’ felt a particularly strong sense of heart movement this time.","With the heavenly secrets of the entire myriad practitioners in the universe concealed, what major action is the Will of the Heavens planning now?","Elsewhere.","The ‘Void Sun Guardians’ and ‘Stellar Doomsday Demon Skull’ from the myriad practitioners in the universe also began to grow uneasy.","The Will of the Heavens acted again and again, plucking out the Stellar Destruction Virus.","Next, it would probably be a desperate final blow from the Will of the Heavens.","“Now is the time, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song,” Daozi reminded in the best timing.","Song Shuhang, who had long been ready, pulled out that ‘Grey ID Account’ and used it to directly lock onto the person behind the ID account.","These days, don’t think that causing trouble online means you won’t face consequences.","If you really stir up a big incident, you might even be struck down along the internet cables.","“Found them, in the Dream Realm? They’re actually here!” Song Shuhang said.","It’s now in Senior White’s territory.","Ha, this round is secure!"]},{"number":2975,"title":"Chapter 2975 - 2973: It’s actually you, Ball Sky Path!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2975: Chapter 2973: It’s actually you, Ball Sky Path!","Perhaps sometimes, the most dangerous place is actually the safest — under the principle of “darkness beneath the light.”","However, when facing Senior White, this principle is certainly inapplicable.","If one is related to Senior White, and moreover stands in opposition to him... then the most dangerous place truly becomes the most perilous, devoid of any sense of security.","“It’s the Dream Realm, hidden right here,” Song Shuhang conveyed the clue to Daozi.","At the same time, a thought emerged in his heart.","Previously, Senior White was in a hurry to perfect the ‘God Creation Plan,’ forming the ‘World Tree’ in the Dream Realm and taking control of the Dream Realm’s sector lord authority... could it be because Senior White was instinctively preparing for this scenario?","At the end of last year, it was the only time since Song Shuhang had met Senior White that he noticed Senior White urgently wanted to accomplish something.","At that time, Senior White’s pace of life suddenly became hurried, as if summer vacation was about to end and homework was due soon.","It must be right!","The urgency of Senior White’s ‘God Creation Plan,’ with the timing set just before this critical moment, must mean that Senior White was instinctively preparing for this event and incidentally suppressing the entity pulling the strings.","Perhaps when ‘Daozi’ directly confronts the mastermind later, Senior White’s arrangements in the Dream Realm could also come into play!","This wave is steady —","This is Senior White’s home ground, and he stands on his side. There’s no reason to lose!","[“Go on, Senior Daozi!”] Song Shuhang was brimming with boldness, as though he had already seen victory.","Daozi’s demeanor, influenced by the ‘Heavenly Will’ and thus calmed, seemed at this moment to be affected by Song Shuhang’s spirit, stirring a sense of valor.","[“Let’s see who you really are,”] Daozi said solemnly.","In the state where the Heavenly Dao blocks the Heavenly Mechanism of the Myriad Realms, even one’s ‘Crisis Intuition’ can be affected.","Daozi exercised the Heavenly Dao Authority, and the intent of the Heavenly Dao descended directly to a coordinate in the Dream Realm.","That location was a connected area between the Dream Realm and the ‘Chaos Heavenly World.’","The Chaos Heavenly World is one of the myriad realms’ planes and is a rare world still retaining many ancient ruins from ancient times.","And that mastermind behind the scenes was, at this moment, residing within an interspatial pocket where the Dream Realm and the Chaos Heavenly World intersect.","The interspatial pocket belongs to the range of the Dream Realm, with a separate world within.","Daozi’s ‘Will of the Heavenly Dao’ broke directly into this pocket.","[“There’s a protective barrier with an effect similar to the ‘small black room.’”] During the incursion, Daozi’s intent perceived that special kind of barrier.","“Dissipate,” the intent of Daozi commanded.","As soon as these words were spoken, the barrier simulating the effects of the ‘small black room’ was directly erased.","At the same time, the camouflaged mastermind hidden in the interspatial layer also became aware of Daozi’s arrival — in fact, as soon as Daozi began to eliminate the stellar viruses in the myriad practitioners in the universe, the mastermind was already prepared.","It just didn’t expect Daozi to find it so quickly!","Daozi’s intent entered this ‘interspatial world,’ surveying the surroundings — his intent was the vanguard, and at the same time, Daozi’s ‘Body of Eternity’ was also ready, prepared to step into the main world at any moment.","The vision of Song Shuhang’s dreamland skill attached itself to Daozi’s intent, allowing him to see the interspatial world.","It was a world akin to a desert.","In this world, aside from small mounds of earth scattered about, there was nothing else.","Upon closer inspection, it could be seen that those black mounds were actually comprised of particles resembling ‘Black Iron Sand,’ piled up on top of one another.","Daozi’s intent focused his gaze.","Each and every one of those small mounds of dark earth were composed of ‘pseudo-eternal parts’.","At the core of each little mound, there was a grain of genuine ‘Immortal Iron Sand’—objects that carry the aura of eternity, which not even the Heavenly Dao Authority could erase.","Daozi’s gaze finally settled on the center of the interspatial pocket.","There, a Dark Sun was slowly rising.","It was the target that Song Shuhang and Daozi were searching for.","The Dark Sun appeared insubstantial, more like an illusion—an entity with a state similar to the ‘Void Sun Guardians’ outside.","And within the core of this Dark Sun, the scent of immortal information was similarly wafting out.","When confronted with Daozi’s unyielding intent, the Dark Sun on the opposite side showed no signs of fear.","It calmly ‘gazed’ back at Daozi’s intent, standing opposite Daozi with an attitude of equality.","Daozi’s intent let out a silent sigh—indeed, the other party possessed an ‘eternity’ that Daozi least wanted to encounter.","[Apart from the aura of eternity... it bears the scent of the ‘ruler of the Netherworld.’] Song Shuhang, who was delving into the dreamland skill, noticed this fact.","The Dark Sun bore a scent belonging to the Netherworld’s ruler.","A scent too familiar to Song Shuhang.","After all, he might be the creature with the best relationship to the ‘ruler of the Netherworld’ throughout ancient and modern times among the myriad practitioners in the universe. He was also the man who had come into contact with the ‘ruler of the Netherworld’ the most.","Even Daozi, the 8.5 Wielder of the Will, did not understand the ruler of the Netherworld as clearly as Song Shuhang did—after all, Daozi hadn’t condensed his own ‘ruler of the Netherworld’.","While Song Shuhang, he had a manifestation, ‘Dark Song.’","Therefore, Song Shuhang detected the presence of the ‘ruler of the Netherworld’ on the other party before ‘Daozi’ did.","[Ruler of the Netherworld? As expected, it involves eternity and also the ruler of the Netherworld... This guy is surely a past incarnation of the Heavenly Way.] Daozi responded.","But which incarnation of the Heavenly Way is the opponent?","[The liquefied metal ball represents the Eighth, above that is Wielder of the Will White, above him is the Immortal Daoist Virtue... and then I’m unclear about the Fifth and Fourth. The Third is Heavenly Dao Goudan’s father, and the Second is Heavenly Dao’s Three Eyes, with no information remaining on the First. If not for Senior Three Eyes being clear about being the Second, maybe even the very concept of a First Heavenly Dao would have been forgotten.] Song Shuhang replied.","Does that mean this Dark Sun Opposite us is either the Fifth or the Fourth Heavenly Dao?","The chance that it is the First Heavenly Dao is very slim since it seems there is no corresponding ‘ruler of the Netherworld.’","But we can’t rule out the contingency plans of other Heavenly Daos—perhaps one of them, like Wielder of the Will White, once severed a part of his Netherworld’s ruler flesh for research, leaving behind this Dark Sun as his backup?","The three-eyed young senior corresponding to the Heavenly Dao’s Three Eyes doesn’t seem to be someone benevolent. The three-eyed young senior is deeply cautious about his own Heavenly Dao.","[One of the Fifth or Fourth Heavenly Daos?] Daozi’s intent calmly faced the other: [I’m about to pull over my fleshly body.]","In face of eternity, he had to bring over his Immortal Body.","Mere ‘intuitive manifestation’ was insufficient to deal with the opponent.","With a thought, the space behind Daozi’s intent waved slightly.","Then, Daozi’s Immortal Body quietly emerged.","An aura of Indestructible settled into the air.","The moment the Heavenly Dao Body appeared, all ‘undying components’ throughout the interspatial pocket scattered!","“You... are not the Ninth Wielder of the Will... Are you Ball Heavenly Dao?” At this moment, the Dark Sun opposite suddenly spoke with a tone of surprise."]},{"number":2976,"title":"Chapter 2976 - 2974: No, you need me! Your body is saying you need me!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2976: Chapter 2974: No, you need me! Your body is saying you need me!","Daozi: “???”","Across from him.","The Dark Sun watched Daozi—it had initially thought that the one proving their Dao this time was the Wielder of the Will, the Ninth Heavenly Dao.","But when Daozi’s aura of eternity silently arrived, the Dark Sun recognized the aura on him right away.","This was clearly not the Ninth Heavenly Dao but rather the aura of the Eighth Heavenly Dao “Sphere Heaven Dao,” which had recently ‘collapsed’ before all in the myriad practitioners in the universe!","In other words, this was the backup plan of the Eighth Session Heavenly Dao!","It was Sphere Heaven Dao’s second attempt at proving his Dao!","Was the Sphere Heaven Dao deliberately using ‘collapse’ as a way to exit the Heavenly Dao seat and seek detachment by going through the process of ‘proving his Dao for eternity’ again?","“Is this your backup plan, Sphere Heaven Dao? I didn’t expect you to hide it so deeply,” the Dark Sun spoke solemnly.","To be honest, not even he had anticipated the extent and limit of Sphere Heaven Dao’s tactics.","Moreover, after deducing the plan, it discovered that such a second proving of Dao really held the hope for ‘complete detachment.’","However... it’s easy to talk about a second proving of Dao, but the execution is far from simple.","Among the many sessions of Heavenly Dao so far, only the current ‘Sphere Heaven Dao’ had completed the process of a second proving of Dao.","Nobody knew how he managed it.","Indeed, none who proved their Dao to achieve eternity and became the Heavenly Dao were simple characters!","Even the ‘Daoist Priest Virtue,’ who seemed to have been the weakest link in the history of Heavenly Dao, turned the tables at the last moment. Just as it was about to succeed and truly ‘detach,’ it smashed its plans to smithereens, severing all the karmic ties of myriad practitioners!","Faced with the praise of the Dark Sun, Daozi remained expressionless.","Daozi’s intent slightly retreated, merging with his Indestructible body—the Heavenly Dao True Body Descending Mode!","In an instant, the interspatial pocket within the Dream Realm began to contort.","In what had been a barren world, golden lotuses blossomed out of nowhere.","After those ‘Immortal Aura Sand Piles’ had been blown away, pavilions and towers appeared in their place.","Rivers, lakes, small trees, and green grass started showing their divinity.","In the blink of an eye, the interspatial world was transformed into a vibrant small world.","Moreover, these changes weren’t an illusion but real alterations.","It was the True Heavenly Dao Body arriving that caused the myriad practitioners’ universe to automatically evolve to complement the true rewrite!","This change was not only in the environment but also the evolution of the entire interspatial pocket into ‘Daozi’s domain, squeezing the Dark Sun’s control over this area!","Across from him, the Dark Sun didn’t mind its ‘domain’ being invaded.","It looked at Daozi, its tone growing impassioned: “A second proving of Dao, a person proving eternity twice... Is this the ‘Transcendence Method’ you’ve devised? This is a path I had not considered.”","“But you still failed, Sphere Heaven Dao!”","“You haven’t detached completely.”","“That means your ‘Path of Transcendence’ is incorrect.”","It could see that ‘Sphere Heaven Dao’ across from it, who had proven his Dao twice, was still bound by the laws of the Heavenly Dao and was still burdened by this ‘myriad practitioners’ universe’—like a kite tied with a string, bound to the myriad realms and unable to fully detach.","But for the Dark Sun, this was good news!","Since the ‘Sphere Heaven Dao’s’ second attempt to detach failed, it meant there was an opportunity for cooperation between it and the ‘Sphere Heaven Dao!’","The Sphere Heaven Dao had failed, so he would need to find a new method for transcendence!","That was the contract for their cooperation!","As long as there was an opportunity for cooperation, the contradiction between the two could be resolved through negotiation.","“So, Sphere Heaven Dao... what you now need is a brand-new, viable Path of Transcendence!” In the midst of the Dark Sun, a black flame sparked, forming a hand extended toward ‘Daozi’: “You need me!”","“I don’t need you,” Daozi replied, your lump of dark sun is ugly!","“No, you do!” the Dark Sun shouted: “You, like me, are part of the pursuit of ‘detachment.’ Detached from the Heavenly Dao, completely detached from everything, no longer limited, with freedom and eternal life, rather than a constrained eternity! Your body is answering me, you need me, you need to cooperate with me to gain a brand-new ‘Path of Transcendence!’”","Daozi: “...”","He had a feeling that the other party had misunderstood something.","“A perfect Path of Transcendence! And my ‘Transcendence Method’ has even been tested once. At the end of the test... I had seen the point of complete detachment,” the Dark Sun spoke seductively.","There was a charming allure in its voice that made one unable to resist the temptation to hear more of what it had to say.","Daozi gently pinched his fingers.","But, apparently attracted by what the other side had said, Daozi didn’t launch a direct offensive attack.","Seeing its topic taking effect, the Dark Sun revealed a smile in its heart.","It knew that Sphere Heaven Dao couldn’t resist this topic!","Sphere Heaven Dao, like itself, sought true detachment, true freedom. Unlike the scum bum ‘Daoist Priest Virtue’ from before.","“Since you, Sphere Heaven Dao, are already seeking the ‘Transcendence Method’ and have attempted detachment once, you must have realized that the authority of the Heavenly Dao and our Indestructible bodies, while bestowing upon us supreme insight and immortality, also bind us like ropes to this ‘myriad practitioners’ universe.’ Over time, even our ‘self’ can be affected, turning us into the Heavenly Dao instead of the Heavenly Dao becoming us,” the Dark Sun began to elaborate on its temptation.","“But my Transcendence Method is about completely undoing these ‘Binds.’ The Heavenly Dao authority grants us immortality, we can outlast the decay of heaven and earth... the answer is actually very clear.”","“The Heavenly Dao authority’s ties bind us to the myriad realms, and we cannot completely sever this rope. Unless we forsake the Heavenly Dao seat, forsake this ‘Indestructible’ body.”","“If so... why don’t we think in reverse?”","“The previous Heavenly Daos actually fell into a thinking trap. Why must we sever that rope? Why can’t we obliterate the ‘myriad practitioners’ universe’ that the rope is tied to?”","“If this myriad practitioners’ universe turns to ashes, even if we are still bound by the so-called ‘Heavenly Dao’ rope, there would be nothing left on the other end to hold us back. We would still have truly achieved transcendence, would we not?”","“I’ve already conducted one experiment, I was one step away from achieving true transcendence, true freedom. No worries about being limited by the Heavenly Dao laws, no worries about losing oneself...”","“In that instant before the myriad practitioners’ universe was completely destroyed, I felt true detachment.”","“So, cooperate with me, Sphere Heaven Dao!”","The Dark Sun, looking at ‘Daozi’.","He was certain that Sphere Heaven Dao would never refuse this cooperation!"]},{"number":2977,"title":"Chapter 2977 - 2975: Saying No!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2977: Chapter 2975: Saying No!","Just like ordinary Tribulation Transcenders and Immortals crave for “immortal information,” the true Will of the Heavens similarly possesses an insatiable desire for “Transcendence Information”!","Except for someone like Daoist Priest Virtue, who is a salted fish... That guy is definitely a fake Will of the Heavens.","And since the “Sphere Heavenly Dao” before me has already attempted “transcendence,” a truly viable and flawless “Path of Transcendence” would be an irresistible temptation for it!","The Black Sun believed that the Sphere Heavenly Dao before him would not disappoint.","Throughout this time, it had been closely observing the ‘Sphere Heavenly Dao.’","Although the other party still wore an expressionless face, some details in his body movements betrayed that the ‘Sphere Heavenly Dao’s’ current state was not as calm as his expression suggested.","He was definitely tempted!","If the experienced ‘Sphere Heavenly Dao’ cooperated with him this time, his “Transcendence Plan” would surely be perfectly realized.","This time, there wouldn’t be another salted fish like Daoist Priest Virtue to turn the tables at the finish line.","“Since he’s tempted, I’ll add the final push,” the Black Sun thought to himself.","He was certain that simply by mentioning the last “deductive result,” the ‘Sphere Heavenly Dao’ across from him would definitely agree to finalize their cooperation contract.","With the ‘Sphere Heavenly Dao’ as his ally, it would be possible to spread the ‘Stellar Destruction Virus’ across all the myriad practitioners in the universe in a short time... and then, on an auspicious day, offer the grandest fireworks for myriad practitioners in the universe!","To offer the entirety of myriad practitioners in the universe as a sacrifice to achieve transcendence.","After a slight pause, the Black Sun slowly said, “Moreover, I have a very critical deduction here, Sphere Heavenly Dao, you might want to listen. Perhaps... you could deduce it again yourself.”","“Since last time, when my transcendence plan was thwarted at the final stage, I secretly deduced again. From beginning to end, every step, every detail, I painstakingly reanalyzed it. Eventually, I realized that the timing had not been right.”","“Through my continuous deductions, I discovered that the final opportunity lies in the ‘Ninth Heavenly Dao’s’ sequence of time!”","“That is to say, the Ninth Heavenly Dao is a very important stage.”","“Sphere Heavenly Dao, you flawlessly retired from the position of the Eighth Heavenly Dao and then, in a short time, proved your immortality again, completing a consecutive term as Heavenly Dao. If anyone, Sphere Heavenly Dao, are both the Eighth and Ninth Heavenly Dao.”","“Now, the time is ripe!”","“We have got everything we need: the right time, the right place, and the right people!”","“You can deduce this point again yourself, Sphere Heavenly Dao. I believe the results you derive will be similar. Being the Ninth Heavenly Dao now, you are the pivotal change.”","“Nine is the extreme, the end of everything, and also the beginning of something new.”","“Serving consecutive terms as both the ‘Eighth and Ninth Heavenly Dao,’ was indeed the correct choice.”","“This is the karmic consequence between us. Although your ‘contract for consecutive Heavenly Dao tenures to attain transcendence’ failed, because of your tenure, you became the Ninth Heavenly Dao, and you met me.”","The Black Sun once again extended his dark, fiery palm, greeting Daozi with a steady voice, “No need to hesitate any longer, Sphere Heavenly Dao. Our time for transcendence has come!”","Daozi started deducing, flicking his fingers.","It seemed he was really deducing whether the information that “the Ninth Heavenly Dao is the pivotal point” was accurate. Under the cover of Heavenly Mechanism, only Daozi could now use the ‘Heavenly Dao Authority’ to deduce the future.","Opposite him, the Black Sun maintained his outstretched hand gesture. From the moment Daozi started ‘deducing,’ he knew that significant success was imminent!","Once he deduced the answer, the Sphere Heavenly Dao would definitely agree to collaborate with him.","Daozi deduced for a long time.","But the Black Sun was not anxious.","After a while, Daozi finished the deducing process and looked up at the Black Sun, “Indeed... the Ninth Heavenly Dao will be a very special link.”","“So, you need me,” the Black Sun said with satisfaction. “Now, what is your decision, Sphere Heavenly Dao?”","“Pleased to collaborate,” Daozi nodded.","He also extended his right hand, reaching for the Black Sun’s palm composed of black flames!","Song Shuhang, through his dreamland skill, could sense how terrifying that black flame palm of the Black Sun was—within those black flames was a hint of heavenly punishment, a power capable of obliterating everything.","If all the mental energy in the black flame palm were released, it could effortlessly destroy heaven and earth.","But at this moment, ‘Daozi’ had an Indestructible Body.","His palm firmly grasped the Black Sun’s black flame palm.","Compared to the hand of black flame, Daozi’s hand was much smaller.","A large hand and a small hand gently clasped, marking a historic handshake between different eras’ ‘Heavenly Dao.’","At this moment, the Black Sun finally felt settled inside.","—He was very confident and convinced he could tempt the ‘Sphere Heavenly Dao’ into cooperation, but as much as he trusted this confidence, it wasn’t until the ‘Sphere Heavenly Dao’ confirmed their cooperation that he truly felt at ease.","“Pleased to collaborate,” the Black Sun replied.","Next, it was time to discuss specific details of the cooperation with ‘Sphere Heavenly Dao.’","Although many of the ‘Stellar Destruction Viruses’ had been eradicated by the ‘Sphere Heavenly Dao’ using Heavenly Dao Authority before, in the myriad realms, only the indestructible ‘Virus Mother Body’ remained.","But no worrying... Just give it a little time, and the progeny of the ‘Stellar Destruction Virus’ could quickly reproduce.","With ‘Sphere Heavenly Dao’ assisting him at his side, this process would be extraordinarily fast.","“So, Sphere Heavenly Dao, let’s discuss how we shall proceed with our cooperation,” the Black Sun spoke out.","Daozi: “What do you need me to do?”","“Definitely... I will first transfer to you the initial template of the ‘Stellar Destruction Virus,’ the first half of it. In doing so, Sphere Heavenly Dao, you can also assist me in creating the ‘destruction virus,’ speeding up the virus creation process,” said the Black Sun.","Having the precedent of a salted fish like Daoist Priest Virtue, the Black Sun was somewhat cautious in this cooperation.","He aimed to get the ‘Sphere Heavenly Dao’ fully involved as soon as possible, letting him directly enter into the ‘virus’ creation process.","This move was a show of trust, and it also sped up the virus creation process.","As the cooperation deepened further, he could also hand over the entire initial template of the virus to him!","While speaking, the Black Sun transferred a set of ‘data’ to Daozi.","Daozi silently received this data, scrutinizing it closely.","The Black Sun did not disturb Daozi.","He waited quietly.","Inside, he was full of anticipation.","Time passed slowly.","The Black Sun’s guard against ‘Daozi’ finally lowered to a critical point!","Daozi seized the moment.","Then, without hesitation, he struck.","The Indestructible Body of the Will of the Heavens directly suppressed the Black Sun!","The Black Sun: “???”","“I, Daozi, always enjoy saying ‘no’ to those who are too sure of themselves,” Daozi said calmly."]},{"number":2978,"title":"Chapter 2978 - 2976: Just One Is Enough!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2978: Chapter 2976: Just One Is Enough!","Daozi’s “Immortal Heavenly Dao Body” acted, releasing thousands of threads of power of the Laws from his fingertips. They spread out, pierced the vacuum, infiltrated into the myriad practitioners in the universe, and locked onto all pre-identified targets!","“If Daozi really was the ‘Ball Heavenly Dao’,” the Dark Sun speculated, it might actually strike a chord and then agree to cooperate with its plan.","But he was not.","Moreover, the opposing powerhouse’s trump card—that the Ninth Heavenly Dao was the turning point—had detonated at the wrong time!","Daozi was not the legitimate, procedurally inaugurated ruler of the Heavenly Dao; he was very clear about his own position.","On the surface, he indeed seemed like the ninth member to assume the ‘Heavenly Dao’ seat amongst the myriad practitioners across the universe. However, in truth, he wasn’t of the ninth term but occupied the 8.5 term—a difference of 0.5, which completely changed the significance.","The Dark Sun played its trump card, but it only managed to hit Daozi’s three of spades.","Thus, Daozi took the opportunity to employ the ‘Heavenly Dao Authority’ and deduced not information on ‘the ninth term of the Heavenly Dao’ but rather, the location of all ‘Immortal Material’ related to the presence before him, the Dark Sun.","Shielded by the Heavenly Mechanism, the Dark Sun opposite him failed to detect Daozi’s covert deductions.","To not act is to retreat; but if one acts, it must be with full force!","Daozi understood clearly in his heart that if he didn’t gather and deal with all of the ‘Immortal Material’ related to the Dark Sun in one fell swoop, it would seize the chance to escape. Then, locating it next time would not be so easy.","After deducing the position of all ‘Immortal Material,’ while moving against the Dark Sun, he also locked onto and forcibly seized all ‘Immortal Material’ scattered across the myriad practitioners in the universe!","Gather them together for a collective beating.","“Why!” the Dark Sun demanded.","A completely viable ‘Transcendence Method’ lay before it, one proven through experimentation.","Daozi remained expressionless—by this point, he had become stricken with facial paralysis, unable to voluntarily alter his facial expressions.","Daozi didn’t answer but focused on driving the Heavenly Dao Authority, hammering the ‘Dark Sun’ and all the ‘Immortal Material’ he had forcefully brought over to death.","The Dark Sun, observing Daozi’s cold and cruel demeanour, suddenly had an epiphany.","Unless...","[Does the other party think that two Transcendents are too many?]","After putting itself in the other’s shoes, the Dark Sun felt it had vaguely guessed the answer.","[After all, I have already explained the principles of my ‘Transcendence Method’ to the Ball Heavenly Dao, almost without reservation. And... I even provided the first half of the initial template of the ‘Stellar Destruction Virus’ to them as well.]","[With the capabilities of a Heavenly Dao, possessing half of the ‘Stellar Destruction Virus’ template and deducing the complete template isn’t impossible, just a waste of time at most.]","[And since the principles behind the ‘Transcendence Method’ have been understood, and the ‘Stellar Destruction Virus’ is in hand... then, as the present ‘Ball Heavenly Dao,’ indeed there is no need to share ‘Transcendence’ with another.]","[If one can transcend alone, why bring another, increasing the risk involved in transcendence? Transcendence is like crossing a log bridge—the fewer who attempt it, the easier it becomes.]","[If it were the old me... I might also make the same choice as the Ball Heavenly Dao, with a certain probability.]","[How marvellous—truly!]","Following this line of thought, the Dark Sun felt not dismay but a strange excitement.","Even while being ruthlessly hammered by ‘Daozi,’ its pleasure could not be concealed.","In fact...","Daozi stood before the ‘Dark Sun,’ which was incomplete.","As Song Shuhang had sensed before, the Dark Sun in front of him was related to the ‘ruler of the Netherworld’—although it possessed a large amount of ‘Immortal Material’, at its core, it was transformed from the ‘ruler of the Netherworld’!","The Dark Sun, the ‘Heavenly Dao Body’, to be precise, is a ‘primordial weapon,’ those granular iron sand-like ‘Immortal Materials.’","It is one of the rare Heavenly Daos whose main body managed to leave something behind in the main world after the collapse from the Heavenly Dao seat—this is also related to its real body.","Just as Song Shuhang once speculated, the Dark Sun’s main body was originally disparate. Therefore, even becoming immortal wouldn’t change its inherently fragmented nature.","Just like the Fat Ball Heavenly Dao, which is a ball of liquid metal, after becoming a Heavenly Dao, it would still not lose its elasticity and could flow like a liquid—although the Netherworld’s Fat Ball could pluck globs of liquid from its own body, the liquefied metal ball couldn’t do the same.","After the Dark Sun’s Heavenly Dao Body collapsed from the Heavenly Dao seat, it utilized countless ‘Transcendence Experiments’ and a variety of backup plans it had set up, and eventually, some ‘Immortal Material’ remained in the main world.","And when the experiments went awry, leading to the ‘collapse of the Heavenly Dao,’ the Heavenly Dao Dark Sun sent these ‘Immortal Materials’ into the Netherworld Realm.","Under the operation of the contingency plans it left behind, the ‘Immortal Material’ merged into its own ‘ruler of the Netherworld’ self, combining with the ruler of the Netherworld to turn into the present ‘Dark Sun.’","This ‘Dark Sun,’ after the transformation, lost the ‘ruler of the Netherworld’s’ authority, was repelled by the Netherworld Realm, and was forcibly merged.","—The Netherworld Dark Sun might be one of the most unfortunate among the rulers of the Netherworld.","Even its own will was interfered with and assimilated by its own ‘Heavenly Dao.’","The will of the ‘Dark Sun’s’ Heavenly Dao Body, despite collapsing, did not completely dissipate but instead flickered on and off.","Past Heavenly Daos who have ‘collapsed’, some have truly dissipated, merged by the ‘laws of the Heavenly Dao.’","Others, after going off the rails... though they collapsed, have never appeared in the ‘main world’ again.","But from various indirect evidence, it seems that a few of these ‘Heavenly Daos’ have not completely dissipated!","Such as the ‘Wielder of the Will White,’ who could converse with Song Shuhang across space and the distant future.","The ‘Dark Sun’s’ will of the Heavenly Dao is even more special; it intermittently interfered with the ‘Dark Sun,’ the manifestation transformed from the ‘Netherworld Ruler Body.’","For example, previously... its Heavenly Dao will clandestinely interfered with the Dark Sun, directing it to hand over the initial template for half of the ‘Stellar Destruction Virus’ to ‘Daozi.’","“How greedy you are, Heavenly Dao Fat Ball,” said the Dark Sun.","With ‘Immortal Material’ in possession, not even the Heavenly Dao could completely obliterate it.","Even if Daozi hammered it fiercely, at most, he could only weaken it.","Or, he could temporarily suppress it, much like how ‘Daoist Priest Virtue’ did in the past.","[Your greed... is truly wonderful.]","[The Ninth Heavenly Dao is a turning point, but that doesn’t mean the Ninth Heavenly Dao itself can become detached!]","[As long as you come into contact with the ‘Stellar Destruction Virus,’ even if you are just a bit curious about it and start to ponder over it, studying it—that will be enough.]","[Indeed, for those who transcend... just one is enough!]"]},{"number":2979,"title":"Chapter 2979 - 2977: What are you doing during the New Year, are you free? Can you come to the rescue?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2979: Chapter 2977: What are you doing during the New Year, are you free? Can you come to the rescue?","Some things are only interesting because they are unique. Some things, the true power lies in not sharing them with anyone.","“You can’t kill me... Sky Dao. What the nature of ‘eternity’ is, you yourself should know best.” Even though the Dark Sun was shattered time after time, its true nucleus was made of ‘eternal and indestructible’ Heavenly Dao material.","Being shattered and then reassembling was all in a day’s work.","As long as Daozi couldn’t obliterate the ‘eternal and indestructible’ material, it would be impossible to kill it.","——Moreover, unlike the combination of ‘Cloud Gauze Three View Moon + bone of eternity’, the relationship between the Dark Sun and the Indestructible Material originated from the same source, so there was no worry about the ‘Heavenly Dao eternal material’ being seized by others.","Even if the Indestructible Material in its body was forcibly taken away and it exploded, a new entity would still condense atop the Immortal Heavenly Dao Material. Moreover, it could condense upon any grain of ‘Indestructible Material’!","Boom~ Daozi, cold as ice, blasted the Dark Sun apart yet again, continuously weakening the power of the Dark Sun.","The Dark Sun, after all, was no longer the ‘current Heavenly Dao’.","Therefore, theoretically, as long as the battle continued, there would come a moment when its energy would be completely exhausted.","After its energy was entirely depleted, despite its eternal nature, it would have to lie down obediently and no longer cause trouble.","“This is meaningless, Sky Dao. You can’t destroy ‘eternity’ just like you can’t destroy yourself,” said the Dark Sun.","Although it was constantly taking a beating, the Dark Sun retained an unyielding demeanor and never showed weakness with its words.","And it wasn’t truly without the power to counterattack.","If it concentrated all its ‘Indestructible Material’ power to erupt in an instant, it could even battle the Heavenly Dao for a short while... but that was unnecessary.","The opponent was the current Heavenly Dao, in an unbeatable state, while in office.","What’s the point of fighting back?","Even if it could match the Heavenly Dao in strength for a short time, it would still end up being pinned down and ground into the dirt once its burst of power ended.","Perhaps retaliating would only excite the opponent even more, making the beating even more passionate?","So, there was no need to show weakness with words.","In terms of action, just going through the motions was enough.","“I am quite curious.” Even while brutally beating down his opponent, Daozi maintained a graceful demeanor, his hair flowing in the wind, and his clothes unruffled.","Even the cruel beating was carried out with an air of elegance.","The only imperfection was that Senior Daozi was in a state of facial paralysis, unable to further express his refined attributes through facial expressions.","Dream-entering Song Shuhang discovered for the first time that beating someone could also be like art, possessing an innate elegance and charm.","Truly worthy of being the top disciple of a Confucian Sage!","Too bad it’s unlearnable.","“You have already collapsed from the position of the ‘Heavenly Dao’, and you still maintain the ‘eternal’ nature. So why continue making a fuss?” Daozi asked while continuing to pummel.","“You too have gone through the process of ‘collapse of the Heavenly Dao’, so surely you understand the state after the collapse,” retorted the Dark Sun with a sneer.","“Indeed, not too pleasant,” nodded Daozi — it was almost time to end this!","“It’s about time,” said the Dark Sun at the same time.","No sooner had its words fallen than Daozi changed his stance.","From an elegant beating pose, he shifted into a condescending mode.","Daozi stretched out his palm and made a pressing motion towards the Dark Sun.","Boom~","The power of Creation exploded from Daozi’s palm.","As Daozi’s fingers enshrouded it, within the palm, a world akin to Purgatory materialized, enveloping both the ‘Dark Sun’ and all ‘Indestructible Material’.","With a mere gesture, a temporary world was opened up.","Once the Dark Sun and the ‘Indestructible Material’ were engulfed, the Purgatory World began to continuously Refine them.","“`","This kind of refinement process could not truly obliterate the “eternal and indestructible” Black Sun.","But it could, like a seal, temporarily imprison them.","“In the end, it’s just like Daoist Priest Virtue, only able to suppress it temporarily,” the Black Sun’s inner self was incomparably calm.","Even things like ‘seals’ — trying to imprison it was extremely difficult.","Even ‘Heavenly Axiom-level’ seals couldn’t contain it for too long.","The very nature of being ‘eternal and indestructible’ was like cheating.","No matter how sophisticated the seal, by grinding against the attribute of ‘eternal and indestructible’, it could slowly be worn away.","...","...","Daozi reached out and grasped, pressing the Purgatory Small World into his palm.","But what to do with this thing next was also troubling Daozi.","He couldn’t possibly carry this ‘Purgatory Small World’ around with him at all times.","As the 8.5th Sect Lord of Heaven... he was actually very unstable.","Even he himself didn’t know when he might suddenly undergo a cultivation reaction and collapse, fusing into the Will of the Heavens.","It was precisely because of this instability that Daozi had been eagerly resolving all the obsessions of fellow friends as soon as he took office, to prevent any accidents.","Daozi had thought about ‘sealing’ the opponent, but having just assumed the role of Heavenly Dao, he was temporarily unable to fiddle with a suitable seal.","“If the ‘Indestructible Material’ cannot be resolved... it is destined to be insoluble,” Daozi sighed.","Facing such an insurmountable force, even if he had strong teeth, he couldn’t bite down.","“Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, what do you think?” Daozi asked, holding the ‘Purgatory Small World’ in his hand, “I can’t hold out for too long... I don’t even know when I myself will collapse. There’s not much time left for you.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","Senior brother Daozi, you’ve really asked the wrong person here.","If anyone in the myriad practitioners in the universe knew how to resolve ‘Immortal Material’... that person definitely wouldn’t be me!","Moreover, this ‘Immortal Material’ has an owner.","Otherwise, he might have let his ‘fat whale golden core’ jump out to see if it had an appetite to swallow them.","But since there is an owner, Song Shuhang doesn’t dare to act recklessly.","The ‘fat whale golden core’ is now Song Shuhang’s lifeline—in a physical sense.","Even if Song Shuhang’s head were made of iron, he wouldn’t dare to use his ‘fat whale golden core’ to court death.","“So you also have no ideas?” Senior brother Daozi said.","That’s right, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song is after all just a novice... Sometimes, one shouldn’t put too much pressure on him.","Song Shuhang furrowed his brow in thought.","A moment later.","He opened the ‘Cultivator Chat System’ and contacted Senior White in dreamland skill.","Senior White, for the first time in his life, worked frantically in the Dream Realm to complete the ‘God Creation Plan’, and planted a World Tree in the Dream Realm, holding the sector lord authority of the Dream Realm.","With Senior White’s luck, the fact that he was working so hard must mean the matter holds special significance.","And now, seeing the ‘Purgatory Small World’ in Daozi’s hands, Song Shuhang felt he had an insight.","“What’s Senior White doing, are you free? Can you come and save me?” Song Shuhang sent a message.","Senior White: “Eating the Year Beast, ( ̄~~ ̄) nom!”","“`"]},{"number":2980,"title":"Chapter 2980 - 2978: A White Horse Casually Passing By","paragraphs":["Chapter 2980: Chapter 2978: A White Horse Casually Passing By","“Shuhang, is it urgent over there? If it’s not... I would like to finish eating the Year Beast rib rack,” Senior White added.","Considering that Song Shuhang can still send such long messages asking for help, his situation probably hasn’t reached a life and death crisis yet.","The Year Beast rib rack is truly delicious!","Immortal Fairy Bie Xue’s culinary skills have improved a lot.","The members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group are currently enjoying the fruits of Immortal Fairy Bie Xue’s enhanced skills—the New Year’s banquet’s feature dish “Five Ways of Cooking the Year Beast.”","The “heavenly tribulation menu” that Song Shuhang gave to Immortal Fairy Bie Xue allowed the fairy to think outside the box, taking her culinary skills to the next level.","—Heavenly tribulations, evil spirits, Inner Demons, these things could actually become ingredients; then with a bit of processing, they could even be turned into ‘seasonings’ in the hands of Immortal Fairy Bie Xue.","Especially the Inner Demon, possessing the divine effect of tempting the heart and causing cultivators to indulge in it. After being turned into an ingredient, the Inner Demon’s this particular characteristic, once harmlessly preserved, could be retained.","After Immortal Fairy Bie Xue processed it into a seasoning, her already ‘ultimate’ culinary delights reached a new level of divinity that conquered and made one’s taste buds tremble.","Even Senior White was full of praise for Immortal Fairy Bie Xue’s cooking skills today.","Behind the scenes, Immortal Fairy Bie Xue revealed a satisfied smile—she was one step closer to conquering White!","“I almost forgot, today is the first day of the New Year,” Song Shuhang remarked with emotion after receiving a reply from Senior White.","It was supposed to be a peaceful first day of the New Year, a fresh start, a day of joyous celebration.","But he, Tyrannical Song, started with ‘self-destructing.’","Next, he was involved in Daoist Senior’s 8.5 Apocalyptic Plan,","then comprehended his own Horizon Dao one, supplemented his Immortal Path two, and incidentally ascended to become an Immortal.","No sooner had he become a true ‘big shot’ in the myriad practitioners in the universe, he tirelessly accompanied Daoist Senior in solving the cosmic demons’ curse.","No sooner had the curse been lifted than Daoist Senior took him flying to challenge the Dark Sun—the previous Will of the Heavens’ remnant hand. Although Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet wasn’t in hand, Daoist Senior could still take him along to confront the most powerful big shots in the myriad practitioners in the universe!","At the start of the New Year, he had experienced more events than most cultivators would in a month.","[Ah, another fulfilling day begins.]","The very first day of the year was so fulfilling, as if all the events had chosen the first day of the New Year to come knocking at his door.","Song Shuhang couldn’t help but feel despair about his days in the coming year.","Chinese people pay attention to ‘omens’ during the New Year... it’s not superstition, but a mindset.","“Are the seniors having fun?” Song Shuhang inquired further.","As the host, he was the one who was supposed to take care of the members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group, leading the seniors in his group to celebrate the New Year at his home.","Yet, halfway through, he, the host, blew up and was unable to properly entertain his guests.","He felt apologetic for the inadequate hospitality.","And... he missed out on Immortal Fairy Bie Xue’s ‘Year Beast rib rack,’ which sounded very delicious.","Senior White replied, “Eating well, drinking well, playing well, all is well.”","At the New Year, Song Shuhang suddenly exploding into a brilliant firework indeed gave everyone in the Nine Provinces Number One Group quite the scare.","But after confirming that Song Shuhang had entered the resurrection phase, the seniors in the group calmed down.","Then they sat back and watched Song Shuhang pull off various showy operations.","Like mooching off Daozi’s grand event of proving his ‘Undying,’ like Tyrannical Song turning into myriad forms to save the cosmic demons, like Tyrannical Song teaming up with Daozi to hold a ‘New Year event.’","With their minds at ease, the group members went back to what they were doing.","The dishes at the immortal banquet were served one after another...","The performances from the members of the chat group also took to the stage one by one under Soft Feather’s hosting...","The movie “Apocalypse War,” starring members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group, played on the nearby screen, adding to the festive atmosphere of the New Year.","“Now on stage, performing is your virtuous lamia. Her acts include sword swallowing, playing dead, reciting ‘Tyrannical Song’s Quotations,’ and playing the zither in duet with Fairy Creation,” Senior White added.","Song Shuhang: “...”","What else can I say?","I’m just an extra without lines, a tool-man Ah Song at this point.","“Hmm, I’ve finished eating,” Senior White replied.","He had just sped up his eating, and now his mouth was still full of the meat from the Year Beast’s ribs.","“Before the fifth course, ‘Year Beast Cuisine,’ is served, I’ll have a bit of free time... What do you want me to help you with?” Senior White asked.","He remembered that Song Shuhang was currently with Daozi of Will of the Heavens, right?","If he was with Daozi, was there something that even ‘Will of the Heavens’ couldn’t solve?","Could something that even the Will of the Heavens couldn’t solve be something he could deal with?","In fact, Senior White was also quite puzzled.","“It’s like this... Daoist Senior and I are currently facing a tricky problem,” Song Shuhang explained the headache-inducing situation with Daozi to Senior White.","Facing an opponent that couldn’t be killed or sealed easily, and required Daoist Senior’s constant suppression was indeed a headache even for the Will of the Heavens.","Besides, Daoist Senior, as a temporary 8.5 Will of the Heavens, was very unstable.","Who knows, he might collapse in the next second?","After listening, Senior White rubbed his temples with a troubled expression.","“Shuhang, even I’m not truly omnipotent,” Senior White said.","Truthfully, he had no idea how to suppress the ‘Black Sun’.","Although Song Shuhang deduced that he was desperately working on the ‘World Tree project’ in the Dream Realm and it might come into play soon,","But Senior White himself couldn’t figure out what effect the World Tree and the Dream Realm could have on something ‘undying.’","“How about, Senior White, you come over for a visit? Maybe as soon as you arrive in the Dream Realm, it will immediately activate some hidden attribute of the Dream Realm and the World Tree?” Song Shuhang suggested.","It doesn’t cost anything to try, after all.","If it’s successful, that’s a win.","“Do you have any ideas from Netherly White?” Senior White asked.","Song Shuhang: “I haven’t had the chance to ask Senior White two yet.”","“Go ask in a private chat, he’s awake now anyway. Also... add the Unknown White No. 1-33 to your friends list, do you have any other ‘Ah White’ friends? Bring them all in,” Senior White contemplated.","Song Shuhang replied, “There shouldn’t be any other Senior Whites... if we really count, there should be one white horse, Senior White two’s horse from his younger days. But that white horse always comes and goes mysteriously, and I don’t have its contact information.”","The moment Song Shuhang finished speaking,","Suddenly, right in front of his eyes... accurately, in front of Daoist Senior, a white figure flitted past lightly.","It was a pure white horse walking with a particularly swaggering gait."]},{"number":2981,"title":"Chapter 2981 - 2979: Is the Immortal Information in Me Fake?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2981: Chapter 2979: Is the Immortal Information in Me Fake?","Having survived thus far with such a dismissive stride was definitely a sign of being a top-tier entity.","Had Daozi not been controlling the ‘Purgatory World,’ fully suppressing the murky black sun’s eternal attributes, he might have not been able to resist throwing a punch at the horse for its arrogant walk.","In this interstitial world that had become Daozi’s ‘Heavenly Dao Descent Domain’, a figure forcefully intruding and strutting about was a matter to be approached with utmost caution!","Even landing a direct punch wouldn’t have been too much!","Furthermore, Daozi was now embodying the ‘Heavenly Dao Body,’ filled with immortal information—ordinary cultivators, even those of the Immortal Realm, would immediately get struck by the ‘immortal information’ upon seeing the Heavenly Dao’s main body, plunging into eternal slumber or, if unlucky, being shattered by the immortal information was quite normal.","Yet this white horse in front of him faced the ‘Heavenly Dao Body’ and didn’t flinch in the slightest.","“Senior White Horse!” Fortunately, Song Shuhang’s excited exclamation while synchronized in the dream state eased Daozi’s wariness slightly.","However, this unexpectedly appearing white horse seemed to be a good friend of Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song?","Hisss—Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song’s wide circle of friends truly astonished Daozi.","It always felt as if pulling out any ‘top leader from the myriad realms’ might know Tyrannical Song, and seem quite familiar with him.","Even his own master, the Sage, had many connections with Tyrannical Song.","All Confucians still firmly believe that Tyrannical Song is the reincarnation of the Confucian Sage!","No wonder he was the man who devised the ‘Cultivator Chat System,’ possessing a great ability to foster friendships, naturally endearing himself to mighty figures with a +100 friendly value attribute.","“Fellow Daoist, hello, I am also a good friend of Tyrannical Song,” Daozi said expressionlessly to the white horse.","Opposite him, the white horse stood upright, revealing a human-like smile.","[Daozi Senior, I will contact Senior White right away... Senior, please let Senior White Horse wait here for a little while.] Song Shuhang hurriedly said.","Daozi nodded, [Alright. But what is the origin of this white horse?]","[He has a very direct connection with the previous Heavenly Dao.] Song Shuhang replied.","Daozi: “...”","Although Daozi had guessed as much when he saw that the white horse was unaffected by the ‘Heavenly Dao information’.","Still, after receiving a confirmed reply from Song Shuhang, he couldn’t help but feel ‘a stir’ in his heart.","This white horse, indeed, was an ace in the hole saved by the retired Heavenly Dao.","“Senior White Horse, please wait a moment, Tyrannical Song has something he would like to ask for your help with.” Daozi spoke in ancient language.","He wasn’t sure what language the white horse opposite him spoke. Could ancient language be used to communicate?","The white horse set all four hoofs on the ground and nodded slightly.","It seemed they could communicate... Daozi let out a sigh of relief internally.","After all, he didn’t understand horse language.","...","...","Elsewhere.","Song Shuhang quickly contacted Senior White: [Senior White, the Heavenly Dao white horse has also arrived. Now, Senior White + Nine Nether White + Unknown Whites No. 1-33 are all here!]","Senior White picked up his teacup, sipping on immortal tea, swallowing the food in his mouth.","He choked a bit...","After a brief moment, Senior White transmitted to Immortal Fairy Bie Xue: “Fairy Bie Xue, when will the next dish be served? Is there a few minutes break?”","“There is,” Immortal Fairy Bie Xue replied.","“Good~” Senior White reluctantly put down the teacup, gazing at the lavish “New Year’s Banquet” spread on the table.","A few moments later, Senior White closed his eyes.","His form faded, vanishing into the vacuum.","“Eh? Senior White?” Senior White Crane widened his eyes as he watched Senior White disappear.","Where is my Senior White? The Senior White who was sitting next to me, where did such a large Senior White go?","Heartache.","After much difficulty, she had finally secured a spot next to Senior White!","...","...","As Senior White’s figure was fading, he also contacted Netherly White and Unknown White No.1-33 through the ‘Cultivator Chat System.’","The world of Unknown White had already become a part of the ‘Overlord World.’","Their maintained sealing formation was still in place, but sending out an ‘Unknown White’ for a short duration wasn’t a problem.","A few moments later.","In the interlayer world of the Dream Realm.","‘Daozi’ had specifically left an entrance to the pathway.","Then, the real body of Senior White, a large ethereal leg combined with the Hamster, and the smallest Unknown White No. 33, all emerged from this pathway.","Upon entering the interlayer world, a gentle force on the ethereal white leg enveloped the Hamster, turning it into a ball shape and sealing its senses—because this time, they were directly facing the ‘Heavenly Dao Body’ of ‘Daozi’!","Facing the Immortal Heavenly Dao Body was too much of a shock for the Hamster.","The Hamster was different from No. Tyrannical Song; it didn’t have Tyrannical Song’s innate ability to endure pain, nor could it withstand the ‘Heavenly Dao Immortal Information’ very well.","After handling the Hamster, the ethereal white leg paused slightly.","After a moment of stiffness, it adapted to this special force field of ‘Heavenly Dao Data.’","After all, this leg had been cut off by the previously ‘Wielder of the Will White’ and had undergone numerous experiments, naturally fearing no disturbance from Heavenly Dao information.","Next to him, Daozi glanced at Netherly White and sighed inwardly—not affected by the Heavenly Dao information +2","Once Senior White confirmed he was unharmed, his consciousness swept over the current Senior White and Unknown White next to him, wondering if they would be affected?","—Unknown White No.33 had a dumbfounded expression, apparently still not fully awake. But he was also unaffected by the ‘Heavenly Dao Information.’ They were like ‘primordial treasures’ themselves, concocted by the Wielder of the Will White.","Next to him, Daozi thought: [Unaffected by the Heavenly Dao Information +3.]","—As for the current Senior White, he was the only one among the three affected by the Heavenly Dao information.","However, the impact on him was positive!","After facing Daozi’s ‘Body of Eternity,’ the current Senior White’s eyes flickered, entering a ‘distracted’ state.","This ‘distracted’ state wasn’t due to an overwhelming shock, but simply Senior White calculating some data.","And what Senior White was calculating was the ‘Immortal Information’ data from Daozi’s body!","At the same time, wafts of ‘Immortal aura’ began to emerge gradually from Senior White’s body.","He was accepting ‘Immortal Data’ and on the spot deducing the embryonic form of his own ‘Path to Immortality’!","Daozi: “...”","Not affected by the Heavenly Dao Information +4.","Not only was Fellow Daoist White not overwhelmed by the immortal information to ‘fall into eternal slumber,’ but he also cracked the data on the spot and deduced his own ‘Path to Immortality.’","Indeed, he was a monster even stronger than Tyrannical Song.","When Tyrannical Song was meddling with ‘Seeking Life Through Death Path,’ it was Daozi who actively cooperated and assisted in the deduction.","But Senior White merely glanced at him and directly deduced the Path to Immortality for himself.","Is the immortal information inside me watered down, fake?","Daozi began to doubt himself.","How could my Heavenly Dao information be so discredited!"]},{"number":2982,"title":"Chapter 2982 - 2980: I feel like twenty or thirty days is enough.","paragraphs":["Chapter 2982: Chapter 2980: I feel like twenty or thirty days is enough.","Song Shuhang, in his dreamland state, vaguely sensed the fluctuations in Senior Daozi’s emotions.","So, he consoled him, “Daozi, you’ll get used to it. After all, everything is possible with Senior White!”","Daozi: “...”","In the myriad realms and amongst countless cultivators, you’re the last person who has the right to say this to me!","You, too, are an existence that others need to ‘get used to’.","After adjusting his mentality slightly, Daozi looked at White, who had fallen into a state of ‘Deduction Immortal Path,’ and said, “What should we do now? Fellow Daoist White is in the process of deducing the immortal path, and it’s uncertain when he will recover.”","Normally, once a cultivator begins to comprehend their own path to immortality, they need to go into extended seclusion—Tyrannical Song was exempted from this tedious process only because he had someone in an 8.5 Heavenly Dao state assisting him by his side.","“No need to worry, the current-world White will stop after he comprehends an ’embryonic form of the Immortality Great Way,’ just wait a moment,” said Senior White Two’s golden thigh, using a technique similar to ‘Sound Transmission’ to speak.","The white horse snorted and lay down.","Unknown White No. 31 looked around curiously at this world transformed into a ‘Heavenly Dao Understanding’ layer, feeling a desire to explore kindling in his heart after being trapped on the ‘Giant Asteroid.’","While they were talking, the Immortal aura emanating from Senior White began to stabilize and ceased to grow.","He stopped deducing the ‘Immortality Great Way’ and only advanced his domain to the level of an embryonic form of a Tribulation Transcender of the Immortality Dao before stopping the enlightenment calculation.","“Fellow Daoist White, you’re not going to continue? The opportunity is rare, and you could actually deduce further—we wouldn’t mind waiting a bit more,” Daozi said, reminding him.","The chance for sudden enlightenment, the deduction of the Immortality Great Way, was precious. As someone who had been through it, Daozi knew very well its difficulty.","Once you grasp the opportunity, you shouldn’t waste it lightly.","Because you don’t know how much time and effort it will take to make up for it if you miss the chance to comprehend the ‘Immortality Great Way’!","“There’s no need; this is enough.” Senior White slowly opened his eyes and replied with a smile—his true opportunity to ‘Perfect the Immortal Path’ had not yet arrived, and with this in mind, he halted his calculations.","Daozi: “...”","So capricious?","[Perhaps, for Senior White, simply reaching the embryonic form of a Tribulation Transcender of the Great Way is enough.] Song Shuhang in the dream state said to Senior Daozi.","Daozi: “I find my way of thinking is not on the same wavelength as yours.”","[I’m still relatively normal. If I came across the opportunity to evolve the Immortality Great Way, I would definitely take it to the end. However, Senior White really is an exception... I remember, the Heavenly Will before the last one, when he was competing for the position of the Heavenly Will of the one before him, he was in the state of ‘comprehending the embryonic form of a Tribulation Transcender of the Great Way.’] Song Shuhang replied.","Daozi: “What?”","He reached for the position of ‘Heavenly Will’ while only at the stage of ‘comprehending the embryonic form of Tribulation Transcender’? Even his teacher, the Sage of Confucianism, wasn’t that incredible, right?","Besides... why do you, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, know so much about the top secrets of the myriad worlds? And many of them are related to the Heavenly Dao?","[Senior Daozi, you might inquire with the Seniors White if they have any ideas or plans? My dreamland state is about to end, so let’s try to resolve the matter of the ‘Dark Sun’ before that happens, okay?] Song Shuhang suggested.","With his ascension to the ‘Immortal’ realm, his understanding of entering dreamland had naturally improved, and now he could clearly sense the end of the dream.","Daozi nodded slightly.","In fact, without needing to be reminded, as soon as Senior White from the main world opened his eyes, three different ‘Whites’ plus the white horse had already faced each other in a circle, holding a conference among themselves.","“Senior White of the main world, can your sector lord authority and the World Tree be of any use?” asked Senior White Two.","Senior White shook his head, “The gap is a bit too large. To suppress something with the ‘eternal’ attribute, just relying on the World Tree and the Dream Realm is far from enough.”","“Perhaps we can be of some use.” At this moment, Unknown White No. 33 raised his hand, “We were originally able to combine into a Sealing Array, which is the only function we have. Besides forming a group to seal, we can’t be of any other help.”","Senior White Two said, “Then, shall we center the Sealing Array around Unknown White Nos. 1-33 and strengthen it?”","“Can the entire sealing formation be moved over here? If it can be brought here, I can use the World Tree of the Dream Realm to assist in its reinforcement,” asked Senior White.","“To transfer the large formation, we need the Combined Magical Treasure of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts, and two sets of it,” replied Unknown White No. 33.","They themselves were created with the ‘Combined Magical Treasure of the Thirty-Three Beasts’ as a blueprint.","Senior White Two said, “Shuhang has one set, and my set has always been with him. Moreover, both have reached the level of a weak Immortal. They should be sufficient.”","“I also have one set. I can provide one set, and we can get another set from Shuhang,” said Senior White.","Unknown White No. 33 smiled sweetly, “If there are three sets, then we want all three! And during the relocation process, I need Shuhang to cooperate and perform the ‘Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Technique’.”","Daozi said, “Little friend Song Shuhang said he has no problem.”","8.5 Daozi has already become an emotionless messenger.","“But the Sealing Array of the 33 Unknown Whites + the World Tree of the Dream Realm is still not enough, right?” Senior White tapped his temple, “We still need something to anchor the formation.”","Saying this, Senior White looked toward the white horse.","The white horse nodded, then raised its head and gave a long whinny.","Daozi said, “Little friend Song Shuhang said: Fellow Daoist Ma said it has no problem. It’s been quite unoccupied lately and can come personally to anchor the formation eye of the Sealing Array. However, its state is very special, and it can’t stay in the main world for too long... Thus, it needs something to sustain its presence.”","Senior White Two: “...”","Song Shuhang had no innate skill in the ancient languages, but he had a special talent for some obscure and minor languages.","How could those few whinnies from the white horse be understood to be such a long speech?","“As for the sustenance, what is needed?” asked Senior White.","Upon hearing this, the white horse immediately stood upright.","“Don’t strike that damned pose at me!” warned Senior White Two.","The white horse’s hooves froze mid-air: “...”","Moments later, the white horse extended a hoof and pointed at Senior White Two’s golden thigh.","If a sustaining item was needed, there was nothing more suitable than the golden thigh of Netherly White. Moreover, this golden thigh had been the subject of countless experiments by the Wielder of the Will White for the Transcendence Plan, containing many mysteries of Wielder of the Will White within it.","With it, and coupled with the ‘Sealing Array of Unknown White Nos. 1-33’ created by the hand of Wielder of the Will White, as well as the ‘World Tree of the Dream Realm’ forged by Senior White due to pressure, it would be completely sufficient to suppress the ‘Dark Sun’ for a short time.","There was no need to suppress it for too long.","About twenty to thirty days should be enough."]},{"number":2983,"title":"Chapter 2983 - 2981: Faint Glimmer","paragraphs":["Chapter 2983: Chapter 2981: Faint Glimmer","Senior White two: “...”","At this moment, he really wanted to give the white horse a kick.","What do you think my thigh is? Always coveting it?","If it weren’t for the fact that I couldn’t affix my thigh back on, I wouldn’t give you the chance to covet it.","The white horse blinked at White two and drew something in the vacuum with its hoof.","It wasn’t writing in the ancient or remote language, but a script known only to it and White two, a script unique to the Heavenly Will White.","Those around had no idea what it was writing.","Netherly White’s gaze passed through the golden thigh and glanced over that line of text.","A moment later...","“I’ll borrow it!” Senior White two’s voice sounded like he was gritting his teeth—he felt like he had been utterly consumed by ‘Heavenly Will White’ in his life.","Even though they were two different entities extended from the same ‘main body,’ why was it always him taking the loss?","Upon hearing his words, the white horse showed its white teeth, smiling like an innocent child.","Senior White two sighed and said to Daozi, “Then, let’s give it a try... Daoist Daozi, you assist from the side. If anything unexpected happens, you can step in right away to remedy it.”","Thinking about it, as the ruler of the Netherworld synonymous with destruction and ruin, why on earth did he have to go to such lengths to save the world?","The ruler of the Netherworld saving the world sounds twisted no matter how you frame it.","“No problem, thank you all Fellow Daoists White for assisting at this time. I’ll use the Heavenly Dao Authority to remedy situations as they arise. If only we can temporarily seal this guy tight, that would be great,” replied Daozi.","If these tricked-out ‘Fellow Daoists White’ could really temporarily seal the ‘Dark Sun’ securely, he could free his hands to make some preparations in the myriad realms—such as going mad reinforcing the ‘Virtuous Network’ and setting up nodes of virtue power to assist the network.","Given enough time, he also hoped to research how to counteract the viral transmission of the ‘eternal Dark Sun.’","Conveniently, he had in his hands half of the ‘Constant Star Virus Initial Version’ previously transmitted to him by the ‘Dark Sun,’ and with a bit of deep research, creating a plan to suppress the virus’s transmission rate should not be too difficult.","Daozi was already planning for the future.","He wanted to play for time.","In the interim between the collapse of himself as the ‘8.5 Heavenly Will’ and the ‘succession of the new Heavenly Will,’ he hoped to keep the ‘Dark Sun’ firmly pressed within its seal and prevent it from causing trouble.","If it were to break the seal before the Ninth Heavenly Dao took office, Daozi hoped that the contingencies he left would buy time for Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song.","Previously, the Dark Sun had also mentioned that the Ninth Heavenly Dao is a very special term of Heavenly Will.","This term of Heavenly Dao... will be a turning point for the world.","This key term of Heavenly Dao, Daozi hopes to have ‘Tyrannical Song’ at the helm.","He trusts Tyrannical Song.","Moreover, there was no one more suitable than Tyrannical Song among those he knew.","In fact, ‘Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven’ was a very suitable candidate for the ‘next Heavenly Will.’ He had the strength, profound knowledge, and a good temperament.","The first time Daozi saw Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven, he even felt that the other’s demeanor was somewhat similar to that of his master ‘Sage of Confucianism.’","Both were very reliable entities.","Unfortunately... Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven did not aspire to be the Heavenly Will; his interest was in nurturing a Heavenly Will to take over.","Beyond Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven, the other acquaintances were either disinterested in the Heavenly Dao or had personality flaws.","[You can do it, Tyrannical Song.]","Internally, Daozi blessed Song Shuhang.","The next term of the Heavenly Dao was too significant, potentially facing the ‘Dark Sun’s’ plan to destroy the world upon taking office.","The responsibility was extremely heavy.","And if by bad luck the Dark Sun broke out early... and the contingencies he left were not of much use, then before the next Heavenly Dao assumed office, it would be starting in hell mode.","I’m afraid that as soon as I take office, I’ll have to face a collapsing myriad practitioners in the universe.","“Not only do I have to beat the time difference, but I also need to give Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song an opportunity for reinforcement. I strive to push him to the position of the Ninth Heavenly Dao in the shortest time possible,” Daozi thought to himself.","“So, let’s start the action. Fellow Daoist, please bring Shuhang out of his dreamland state,” Senior White two said.","Before anyone realized it, Senior White two had become the person in charge of the next action, commanding the overall situation.","“No problem.” As a Wielder of the Will, ‘Daozi’ seemed to be a mere executor.","...","...","Within Song Shuhang’s ‘Tyrant Realm.’","The Giant Asteroid had now become the ‘Tyrant Star,’ slowly rotating alongside the sun boat.","Song Shuhang reluctantly ended his ‘dreamland skill’ state.","Heavenly Dao’s View is truly a wonderful thing.","When dreaming through the eyes of the Heavens, observing the myriad practitioners in the universe, every minute and second brought unimaginable comprehension.","“If only I had another chance to dream into the state of Senior Daozi again... wait, I might actually have the opportunity to dream into Senior Daozi’s state once more!” Song Shuhang thought of ‘Old Tyrant Song.’","If Old Tyrant Song is me in the future, that means that one day in the future, I will dream into the state of ‘Senior Daozi proving his undying’ again, and observe the myriad practitioners in the universe through the ‘Heavenly Dao’s Vision.’","“Don’t get distracted, Shuhang,” Unknown White No. 31 said.","“Present!” Song Shuhang came back to his senses.","At this moment, three sets of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure were rotating around him.","One of them had a mature temperament, the set left by Wielder of the Will White for Senior White.","The two others were highly active.","Leading them was the Defiant Whale Tool Spirit Fairy, followed by sixty-five little light orbs, rotating behind their big sister, the artifact spirit fairy.","“Go.” Song Shuhang extended his finger and gently tapped the artifact spirit fairy.","“Yiya~” The artifact spirit fairy obediently nodded. She extended her finger and pointed toward the large formation of Unknown White Nos. 1-33 below.","The next moment, the three sets of combined magical treasures dived into the formation below, merging into it.","Even the Defiant Whale Warrior Glove on Song Shuhang’s right hand fell off.","Once the glove was gone, Song Shuhang’s ‘secret appraisal technique’ began to stir restlessly.","“The Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Technique.” Below, a call from an Unknown White was heard.","“Let’s move.” Song Shuhang fully circulated the immortal yuan in his body.","With the Immortal level power driving the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Technique, the phantoms of thirty-three animals transformed into substance, appearing behind Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang’s ‘Holy Ape Choir’ added 33 more Holy Apes to its strength!","Under the resonance of magical treasures, techniques, and sealing formations, all Unknown Whites plus the formation were lifted and fled toward the already opened spatial passage, heading for the Dream Realm opposite!","On the other side, Senior White two loosened his control over the golden thigh.","The white horse transformed into a beam of light, sustaining itself within the thigh.","The golden thigh soared into the sky, landing at the core of the sealing formation, becoming the very foundation of the seal.","But the reinforcement wasn’t over.","Senior White controlled the ‘World Tree,’ drawing upon the authority and power of the Sector Lord of the Dream Realm, bestowing it on the sealing formation.","“Is it done?” Song Shuhang returned to the Dream Realm and asked softly.","At this moment, no one noticed that Song Shuhang’s right hand, which had lost the glove, was slightly trembling in the vacuum, faintly emitting a weak light."]},{"number":2984,"title":"Chapter 2984 - 2982: The Delicate and Gentle Song","paragraphs":["Chapter 2984: Chapter 2982: The Delicate and Gentle Song","As the faint glow unconsciously emitted from Tyrannical Song’s right hand, the surrounding space seemed to become more amiable.","In the interspatial pocket, the spiritual power that had been agitated due to “Heavenly Dao?Daozi crushing the Dark Sun” was quietly soothed and affectionately enveloped around Tyrannical Song.","Add to that, above Song Shuhang’s head hung a ‘Full Moon of the Immortal Realm,’ emitting a gentle light.","This made his entrance naturally carry a ‘gentle’ atmosphere.","This subtle change was nourishing and silent. Moreover, as Song Shuhang moved, this nourishment continued to spread...","Snap~","At that moment, a small spherical object suddenly flew toward Song Shuhang from a distance.","He instinctively reached out to catch the small sphere.","The next moment, his slightly flickering right hand activated another secret technique.","[The sealed Hamster: Sealed personally by Senior White Two, blocking the shock of the Immortal information of the Heavenly Dao.]","Senior White Two had lent his ‘golden thigh’ to the white horse to guard the formation eye and could no longer take care of the Hamster. Thus, he had thrown the Hamster to Song Shuhang for protection—unlike the present-day White, who could kill a pet, Senior White Two was skilled in raising them.","“Yo, it’s Hamster,” Song Shuhang received this energy sphere.","Now when he appraises the Hamster, the cost is almost imperceptible... Not to mention feeling pain, even the energy needed for appraisal was almost nonexistent.","The realm of the Immortal big shot was just that ruthless.","“However, thanks to Senior White Two for sending over the Hamster,” Song Shuhang said, holding the energy sphere of the Hamster in his right hand.","Otherwise, with his ‘secret appraisal technique’ activated, if he appraised something with vast information, it would be painful.","“It looks like I need to find some time to practice controlling the switch of the ‘secret appraisal technique,’” Song Shuhang added.","Now that he had ascended to the Immortal Realm, as long as he spent some time figuring it out, he should be able to fully master the deployment and retraction of the ‘secret appraisal technique,’ at least preventing it from activating randomly.","As an Immortal, wouldn’t it be embarrassing not to be able to freely control a technique?","This task also needed to be noted in his memo, and marked with a star, highlighted.","...","...","Subsequently, Song Shuhang reached out and placed the Hamster above his head, where his hair formed two small palms, leaf-like, supporting the Hamster Ball.","[Speaking of which... if another small sphere is sealed, stacked on top of the Hamster Ball, I could turn into a Calabash Brother.] Song Shuhang nodded in satisfaction.","“What are you doing? Trying to use it as a decoration?” Chu Pavilion Lord’s Dumb Hair said—the recently, whatever it was, Song Shuhang always thought of putting things on his head, invading her space.","Song Shuhang was taken aback and reached up to tweak the dumb hair on top of his head, “Senior Chu, how are you still... Oh heavens, I forgot I had not taken you down!”","Before coming to this Dream Realm interspace, knowing that he was about to meet the Heavenly Dao True Body of Daoist Senior, he had taken off some ‘external accessories’ from himself.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, Zither Master’s Claw, Black-skinned Soft Feather.","Only the primordial treasure ‘Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber’ had been brought over.","The Scarlet Heaven Sword and the virtuous lamia + Fairy Creation had stayed on the stage of the Nine Provinces Number One Group’s annual meeting to perform sword swallowing.","He took off everything, but he forgot about Chu Pavilion Lord’s Dumb Hair.","Mainly because Chu Pavilion Lord’s Dumb Hair had been on him for so long, Song Shuhang had started to see it as his own dumb hair...","“Senior Chu, let me send you back first,” Song Shuhang said, stretching his hand, ready to pluck off Chu Pavilion Lord’s Dumb Hair.","Chu Pavilion Lord’s Dumb Hair nimbly avoided Song Shuhang’s big hand and spoke, “Not yet... I want to meet Daozi.”","She had not reminded Song Shuhang to pluck her off his head before... because she had something on her mind and wanted to meet Daozi.","Song Shuhang: “!!!”","Meet Daoist Senior?","Pavilion Master Chu, are you planning to take this opportunity to enter a prolonged sleep state to slack off?","I thought Pavilion Master Chu had already exited her ‘Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion lazy state,’ but now it seems she still wants to return to that salted fish state?","“What are you wildly imagining?” Pavilion Master Chu’s dazed hair forcefully whipped Song Shuhang’s head.","Song Shuhang touched his head: “I didn’t say anything though.”","“Your face then?” Pavilion Master Chu replied, “I want to see Daozi and then ask him a question.”","Her voice was filled with determination.","Upon hearing this, Song Shuhang slightly paused.","A moment later.","He softly said, “Let me ask instead.”","While speaking, he reached up to grab the dazed hair on his head and plucked her off—this time, he used his left hand, which was blessed with Senior White’s lucky charm.","Pavilion Master Chu replied, “You don’t even know what I want to ask.”","“Don’t worry, I know.” Song Shuhang gently said, “You’ve been rooted on top of my head for so long... Pavilion Master, I couldn’t be clearer about what question you want to ask Daoist Senior. Besides, the question you want to ask ‘Daoist Senior’ is basically just that one after all.”","Pavilion Master Chu’s dazed hair: “...”","This suddenly gentle Song Shuhang, she couldn’t help but be reminded of a certain woody debris.","These Song guys, always becoming suddenly gentle at critical moments.","Could this be the ‘Song’s’ innate skill?","Holding the dazed hair, Song Shuhang continued, “If you directly contact Daozi, it could easily cause trouble. Even at the Immortal Realm, impacted by eternal information, you could still fall into a prolonged slumber... Even I might not be able to awaken you quickly.”","“Moreover, you and Daoist Senior don’t have much of a relationship. So, let me ask about the matters of the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion. Daoist Senior, at least, will give me some face and answer my question.”","Pavilion Master Chu’s dazed hair fell silent.","Song Shuhang truly knew what she wanted to ask and understood her thoughts.","This was really quite different from the usual Song Shuhang.","Pavilion Master Chu wanted to see Daozi, and the thing she wanted to inquire about... indeed was only about the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion.","She wanted to inquire if the Heavenly Dao had any means to liberate the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion.","Logically speaking, Pavilion Master Chu had already split the ‘obsession with the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion,’ handing it over entirely to Chu Two, assigning her full responsibility for it. But emotions aren’t mere data that can be cleanly cut from one disk and pasted onto another.","“However, Senior Chu. Even the Heavenly Dao isn’t omnipotent. So, you should be prepared mentally,” Song Shuhang reminded her.","He was a man who had seen the myriad realms through the ‘Heavenly Dao’s View,’ so he knew the Heavenly Dao was almost omnipotent, but only ‘almost.’","“Mhm,” Pavilion Master Chu’s dazed hair responded softly.","“Then, Senior Chu, please wait for my news in the main world,” Song Shuhang said as he gently flicked his hand, sending the Pavilion Master Chu’s dazed hair into the main world.","Then, Song Shuhang stepped onto the void, blooming lotuses with each step, heading towards ‘Senior White’s group.’","“Here you come, Shuhang.” Senior White in the main world waved at him.","Following Senior White’s gesture, Song Shuhang’s left hand also began to glow.","—With the arrival of Song Shuhang’s main body, the existence named Senior White was truly complete!"]},{"number":2985,"title":"Chapter 2985 - 2983: Always Think Beautifully in Difficult Times","paragraphs":["Chapter 2985: Chapter 2983: Always Think Beautifully in Difficult Times","Senior White’s primordial soul’s left hand still projected inside Song Shuhang’s left elbow.","Thus... it was not until Song Shuhang’s main body arrived in this interspatial Dream Realm and entered the information reception range of ‘Senior White’s Group’ that a truly ‘complete’ Senior White was assembled.","Gathering a complete White held a very special significance. Just like a set needed to be complete to unleash its maximum hidden attribute!","Noticing his left hand glowing, Song Shuhang raised it and asked, “Senior White, do you need me to return this hand to you first?”","“No need, just stand there,” Senior White serenely replied.","“Alrighty~” Song Shuhang moved to the side and activated spectator mode.","Sealing was not his forte.","Observing, however, was his speciality.","One must always learn to do what they are good at to avoid wasting resources.","...","...","On the other side, Daozi held the ‘Purgatory Small World’ in his palm and called out, “FellowDaoist White, then I shall start sending the ‘Purgatory World Ball’ into the seal.”","“I’m ready, go ahead,” Senior White nodded.","He was in a hurry.","Immortal Fairy Bie Xue’s next dish of ‘Year Beast Cuisine’ could be served at any moment, so Senior White wanted to rush back as soon as possible.","Daozi pressed his hand down.","His palm crossed through the ‘space gate,’ appearing directly above the Unknown White No. 31’s seal, lightly touching it.","The Purgatory World, containing the ‘Dark Sun,’ dropped from his hand cleverly into the sealing array.","Unknown White No. 31 teamed up, together raising the three sets of ‘Combined Magical Treasures of the Thirty-Three Animals.’","The magical treasures aligned with the sealing large formation, starting to operate along a certain trajectory.","This trajectory vaguely contained some profound rules.","At the center of Unknown White’s formation, Senior White’s golden thigh, as if being pulled, had its hidden function activated, and a string of hidden runes popped out from it.","Each of these runes was attached with immortal information.","Senior White two: “...”","He finally understood why he could not attach this golden thigh; Wielder of the Will White had still hidden many things inside it!","Under these circumstances, it would be a miracle if he could attach this thigh back!","That damned guy even left runes inside his thigh!","Sealing Array, three sets of ‘Combined Magical Treasures of the Thirty-Three Animals,’ and the golden thigh’s immortal information, all originated from the same source, resonating with each other.","When the resonance reached its peak, the figure of a white horse emerged from the golden thigh.","This time, without White two stopping it to strike a pose, it eagerly performed the ‘standing’ trick as soon as it appeared.","Daozi: “...”","This was the contingency left by the previous, previous Wielder of the Will?","Suddenly, he felt the previous, previous Wielder of the Will was somewhat unreliable. What to do?","Could this sealing formation truly be effective against the ‘eternal’ Dark Sun?","[Hehehe... hehe...]A laugh worth only two dollars came from Daozi’s Purgatory World.","After escaping from Daozi’s hands, the sealed Purgatory World no longer suppressed the Dark Sun.","It gradually regained its state, and its thoughts could now slightly seep out of the ‘Purgatory World,’ sneaking a peek at the outside.","While sneaking a peek, it just happened to see Daozi putting the Purgatory World into the ‘Sealing Array.’","To its surprise, this sealing formation seemed not as powerful as it had imagined.","Moreover, this Sealing Array did not look like it was personally designed by the ‘Will of the Heavens.’","[Using a seal not personally designed by the Will of the Heavens to trap me? Although I don’t know what you are trying to do, I like this.]The Dark Sun began to feel pleased.","Whether this was because the ‘Will of the Heavens’ couldn’t deal with it and casually created a ‘seal’... or the ‘Will of the Heavens’ underestimated it, thinking such a seal could trap it.","No matter the reason, it was all good for him.","Such a weak seal only required him to regain a bit of strength, break out from the Purgatory World, and then he could break the seal again within minutes and return to the main world.","[Maybe when I come out of the Purgatory World... I might just see the ‘Will of the Heavens’ secretly arranging the ‘Stellar Destruction Virus,’ and then, heh heh heh.]","In tough situations, one must think positively; only then does life have hope.","...","...","“Is it possible?” Daozi asked after hearing the Black Sun’s string of cheap laughter.","He stood by, ready to act at any moment.","If the sealing formation failed, he would be the first to strike, pinning the Black Sun to the ground and giving it a beating.","“No worries, Senior Daozi, don’t be concerned... Senior White is still here; nothing has suddenly gone wrong with him, so everything is alright,” Song Shuhang calmly stated.","Daozi: “...”","This calm reasoning from Tyrannical Song was absolutely brilliant!","How he wished he could borrow even a milligram of Tyrannical Song’s calmness and confidence...","Deep in thought, Daozi glanced at Fellow Daoist White.","At this moment, Senior White from the main world was looking at the trajectory of Unknown White No. 31’s seal, his gaze sweeping over those few Immortal Information Runes projected from Netherly White’s golden thigh.","Then, White drifted off again, starting to process information anew.","Drifted off... again?","At such a time?","That’s too exhilarating, isn’t it?","Daozi: “...”","“This is even better,” said Tyrannical Song, as calm as ever.","A distracted Senior White wouldn’t suddenly remember something and take off.","Secure.","Even if Senior White was distracted, his function wouldn’t change.","A white horse combined with White Two’s golden thigh could secure the seal, and having Senior White stay here could serve to stabilize the situation.","Boom, a faint rumbling sound, as loud as firecrackers exploding.","In the Purgatory Small World, the Dark Sun began to regain strength, its body’s eternal attributes clashing with the unsupported Purgatory Small World.","Senior White from the main world remained in a trance, yet his body moved on its own.","He raised both hands above his head.","Song Shuhang’s left hand also raised up.","The authority of the Dream Realm, the projection of the World Tree from the Dream Realm transmitted here, entered this interspatial pocket.","The projection of the World Tree held the entire seal up and linked the main world’s White with the seal through the projection.","Boom...","Another burst of rumbling, this time the sound effects were definitely worth ten dollars!","This time, the small amount of strength the Dark Sun had just recovered began to seep out of the Purgatory Small World, testing the waters.","At the core of the seal, the white horse grinned and lifted its hoof, stomping down.","With one hoof, it completely crushed the energy of the Dark Sun along with its aura of eternity.","The Dark Sun’s testing strength retreated.","But the multitude of Whites were not about to let it go.","The white horse took steps with its long legs, heading straight toward the Purgatory World.","It valiantly strode to the edge of the small world, and just as it was about to enter, it suddenly turned its head, winked at the passerby Song Meng in a particularly guilty manner—as if asking Shuhang to quickly pull it back!"]},{"number":2986,"title":"Chapter 2986 - 2984: Evolution of the Sage’s Eye","paragraphs":["Chapter 2986: Chapter 2984: Evolution of the Sage’s Eye","[Hurry and pull me up, grab onto me, or I’m going to go in!] Fellow Daoist Ma didn’t make a sound, but his eyes were like windows to his soul, eyes that seemed to speak.","Song Shuhang: “...”","Since he had chickened out, why still put on a bold and spirited front?","Helping others is the source of joy, and if it was within his ability, Song Shuhang would not refuse to lend a helping hand.","But now, pulling Fellow Daoist Ma was too dangerous and had surpassed the bounds of Song Shuhang’s capabilities. If he carelessly failed to hold onto Fellow Daoist Ma, he might find himself being dragged in instead.","Moreover, the Purgatory World was overly dangerous. It housed the ‘Immortal Attribute Dark Sun’, a special existence that even Daoist Senior using ‘Heavenly Dao Authority’ couldn’t eliminate.","Therefore, Song Shuhang ruthlessly turned his head away, pretending he hadn’t seen anything.","As the timid Song Shuhang, this time he definitely wouldn’t change his stance just because the acting-maniac horse acted cute—Senior White had previously made it clear that he should just watch from the side.","This round, he decided to be an invisible spectator, Song.","Only by doing so could he live a long life, striving to live past a century!","The acting-maniac horse: “...”","He actually turned his head away?","Brilliant!","As expected from Tyrannical Song; the coordination was perfect!","This way, it had given itself an excuse to back out.","Hence, just as he was about to step into the ‘Purgatory World’, Fellow Daoist Ma suddenly turned around and barreled towards where Song Shuhang was, seizing the chance to exit the stage.","Song Shuhang: “!!!”","Fellow Daoist Ma, your way of stepping down is too blunt!","I haven’t been able to chew well lately; I don’t want to eat such a stony step!","Just as the white horse was about to knock over Song Shuhang, Senior White from beside him suddenly stretched out his hand, gently encircling the white horse’s neck.","Before the white horse could react, Senior White had skillfully and swiftly mounted it.","At this moment, Senior White’s eyes were still distracted, seemingly not fully awake yet.","Behind him, faintly, a ‘Law Star River’ was spinning... just like how it had appeared after being subjected to the ‘time-reversal’ by the fat ball.","All of this seemed to be related to Senior White’s ‘Will of the Heavens’?","The absent-eyed Senior White, riding on the white horse, gently patted its neck.","The white horse paused—now facing Song Shuhang head-on, only a few centimeters away.","Song Shuhang could feel the white horse’s breath on his face: “...”","Then,","the white horse blinked at him.","In Song Shuhang’s puzzled face, with the distracted Senior White on its back, the white horse got up and headed towards the Purgatory World.","“Wait a second, Fellow Daoist Ma,” Song Shuhang called out. “I thought about it, how about I go with you too!”","If Senior White was going to enter the Purgatory World with the white horse, could that imply that the Purgatory Small World would actually be the ‘safest’ place?","Fellow Daoist Ma snorted—then, with a Speed Boost, squeezed into the Purgatory World.","But just as half of its body had entered, a figure suddenly emerged and clung to the rear of the white horse, following it into the ‘Purgatory Small World’.","It was Old Tyrant Song!","Old Tyrant Song, who had always used the ‘dreamland skill’ to possess the Heavenly Dao ‘Daozi’, had now shifted his dreamland target, attaching to the rear of the white horse and disappearing into the ‘Purgatory Small World’.","...","...","A few minutes after the white horse had carried Senior White and Old Tyrant Song into the Purgatory Small World,","another aura similar to “eternity” burst forth from that same world.","It was entirely different from the aura of eternity emanating from the Dark Sun.","“It’s Wielder of the Will White,” Song Shuhang recognized the identity of this newly erupted “eternal aura” immediately.","However, compared to the Dark Sun’s eternal aura, Wielder of the Will White’s aura unmistakably felt “lifeless.”","Wielder of the Will White appeared in this manner, based on the collective composition of the White Gang, supplemented by Assistant Daozi’s 8.5 Will of the Heavens, similar to the way in which Senior White had appeared after being subjected to a “time-reversal.”","The “Wielder of the Will White” that emerged this way was not the true Heavenly Dao Body but merely a projection of Heaven’s Will power.","Nonetheless, this time, with the help of external interference, Wielder of the Will White’s power could last longer than when fat ball utilized the “time-reversal” method.","Inside the Purgatory Small World,","the Dark Sun, which had been continually emitting cheap laughter, suddenly could not laugh anymore.","The suddenly appearing power of “Wielder of the Will White” was actually suppressing it!","It was at a disadvantage!","It’s one thing to be unable to defeat the current Heavenly Dao, but an evidently incomplete and “lifeless” unknown “eternal power” could suppress it as well?","Even though it had been thoroughly beaten by the “liquified metal ball” before, its energy was drained, and it hadn’t recovered yet—his opponent was also in an incomplete state, equal to it.","Being dimly suppressed by this “lifeless” mysteriously eternal power made the Dark Sun doubt its existence.","As the Dark Sun was being suppressed again... the final step was completed for seals 1-33 of Unknown White.","The seals closed, the sealing techniques connected into one.","Song Shuhang looked at the Purgatory Space, somewhat anxious. He was also concerned—since Senior White himself had transformed into one of the “seals,” what would happen next in proving the “Ninth Heavenly Dao”?","Could they manage the simultaneous ascension of two different “entities” without Senior White?","[Shuhang, take out the ‘Scholarly Sage’s Eye’.]At this moment, Senior White’s voice suddenly rang next to his ear.","“Now?” Song Shuhang pressed around his eyeballs—but Fairy Creation wasn’t there, the virtuous lamia wasn’t there either, and he wasn’t adept at plucking out his own eyeballs.","[Hurry, transfer the ‘Sage’s Eye’ to the Purgatory Small World; this opportunity must not be lost.]Senior White urged.","Previously, he, his hometown’s Senior White, and Song Shuhang had discussed how to turn the “Scholarly Sage’s Eye” from a single-use item into a rechargeable treasure.","They aimed to reduce the cost of “using one path to immortality + one Scholarly Sage’s Eye” to the minimum.","Now, the opportunity had arrived!","“Let me help you,” seeing Song Shuhang fumbling, Daozi sighed and pressed his fingers against Song Shuhang’s eyeballs, skillfully removing the Sage’s eyes,","Expertly!","Song Shuhang received the Scholarly Sage’s eyes, waved his hand gently, and using mental power, sent them cascading towards the Sealing Array.","Unknown White No. 1-33 was already prepared, coordinating to send the Sage’s eyes into the ‘Purgatory World’.","[Twenty-two days.]At this moment, Senior White’s voice was heard by both Song Shuhang and Daozi.","Song Shuhang, “Will the Scholarly Sage’s Eyes evolve in twenty-two days?”","“No, it’s our sealing array that can only hold for twenty-two days,” Senior White answered, “You all had better find a thorough solution to the ‘virus’ and this guy within this timeframe.”","“So, does it mean Senior White will have to stay inside for 22 days?” Song Shuhang asked.","The most reliable plan to resolve these issues was to prove the Ninth Heavenly Dao,","but Senior White had to maintain the seal.","So, with the simultaneous ascension of two different “entities,” could they really miss Senior White’s presence?"]},{"number":2987,"title":"Chapter 2987 - 2985: Comprehensive Packaging Plan","paragraphs":["Chapter 2987: Chapter 2985: Comprehensive Packaging Plan","“`","“Only able to seal for twenty-two days?” Daozi rubbed his brow with a troubled expression.","Then, he looked at Tyrannical Song, who had a conflicted look on his face.","This is too hard!","Even with his support behind the scenes and Tyrannical Song’s fame that has now spread throughout the myriad practitioners in the universe... making Tyrannical Song ascend as the 9th Heavenly Dao within twenty-two days is as difficult as ascending to the heavens.","According to the historical records of previous Heavenly Dao ascensions, the battle for each one lasted at least several decades, and sometimes even several hundred years.","Sometimes, battles between Immortals of equal strength can last several years!","Thus, this short amount of time is insufficient, it’s too difficult!","“I must do something while I am still in charge,” Daozi thought to himself.","As the temporary 8.5th Heavenly Dao, he could be replaced at any time.","Unused power is wasted power.","So, while he was still the Heavenly Dao, should he give Tyrannical Song another push?","To elevate his prestige and strength to another level?","“First of all, it’s Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song’s Second Immortality Path... I must find a way for him to experience the ‘Heavenly Dao Eye’ once more, to bring him into contact with more of the ‘Heavenly Dao Immortal Knowledge’, in order to help him as much as possible to complete the Second Immortality Path. If his Second Immortality Path is perfected, his strength can definitely reach the very top tier in one fell swoop.”","Daozi had studied Song Shuhang’s Second Immortality Path and knew the complexity and power it held. It was virtually impossible to perfect without a perspective and knowledge transcending the mundane, but once perfected, it would be terrifyingly strong.","“Then... The Constant Star Destroyers and the Void Sun Guardians, I need to secretly capture a batch of them and refine them into ‘Immortality Material Elixirs’ to boost Tyrannical Song.”","After Tyrannical Song has proven his Dao for immortality, the only thing he lacks compared to veteran Immortals is the time spent in cultivation. And the ‘Immortality Material Elixir’ can help narrow the gap between Tyrannical Song and the veteran Immortals as much as possible.","“Next is prestige... Tyrannical Song’s prestige is already high in the myriad practitioners in the universe, but it can still be elevated further. For instance, we need to create headlines even more shocking than ‘slaying an undefeatable Heavenly Emperor’ like how Tyrannical Song, while still a mortal, overpowered a formidable enemy with ‘eternal attributes’ who also sought to obliterate the myriad practitioners in the universe.”","With such an accomplishment, Tyrannical Song’s prestige, coupled with the added afterward merits of being a ‘savior + slaying the eternal’, will truly reach the peak, rendering all Immortals in the myriad practitioners in the universe both respectful and convinced.","However... how to orchestrate the scene of ‘Tyrannical Song overpowering the enemy with eternal attributes’ needs further consideration.","Fortunately, the ‘Black Sun’ is already in our hands, and the antagonist can’t escape.","First, I’ll power up Tyrannical Song’s abilities then consult with ‘Fellow Daoist White’s group’ to prepare a grand event for Tyrannical Song vs. the Dark Sun.","This will also serve as a good opportunity to practice the battle experience between Tyrannical Song and the ‘Dark Sun’, so that when Tyrannical Song ascends to the Heavenly Dao in the future, he’ll be more adept at handling the ‘Dark Sun’.","Moreover, during the life and death battle against the enemy with eternal attributes, Tyrannical Song’s understanding of the ‘Second Immortality Path’ may also advance further.","After all, it’s during adversarial battles that one’s potential is truly activated!","A myriad of ideas kept surfacing in Daozi’s mind.","These ideas covered all bases, strengthening and packaging Song Shuhang from every angle without any blind spots!","“Time waits for no one, my tenure is very unstable... I must act quickly. And if necessary, even I can become a link in strengthening Tyrannical Song.”","— Inside Tyrannical Song’s body, there is already an ‘undying fat whale golden core’, which bears a remarkable resemblance to Fairy Skylark’s ‘bone of eternity’.","“`","As an 8.5-generation Daozi who presides over the Will of the Heavens, he should be able to use his own ‘eternal attribute’ to further enhance Tyrannical Song’s fat whale golden core.","Truthfully, if it were possible, Daozi really wished to hand over his Body of Eternity to Tyrannical Song when he was about to ‘collapse’ himself.","Unfortunately, the Body of Eternity is something no one can chew on.","“Senior Daozi,” Song Shuhang spoke up while pondering.","Daozi came back to his senses and said, “I know, time is of the essence. So, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, let’s now enter your comprehensive Reinforcement plan! I will give you special training. As the Will of the Heavens... I can open up a ‘time-distorted secret realm’ with the greatest limit to stretch the twenty-two days to the extreme. Inside, you can fully comprehend your Second Immortality.”","“The Ninth Heavenly Dao?” Song Shuhang understood the meaning behind Daozi’s words.","“Yes,” Daozi nodded.","“I can only do my best, but I can’t guarantee that I will certainly become the Ninth Heavenly Dao,” Song Shuhang warned Daozi in advance—when he wasn’t pompous, Tyrannical Song was still very humble and cautious.","After all, even if he spoke with grandeur, he was just a new Immortal who had recently entered the Immortal Realm.","“At this time... it’s enough to do your best,” Daozi sighed.","“By the way, Senior Daozi, I have something to ask for your help” Song Shuhang remembered about Pavilion Master Chu.","Daozi asked, “Is it about the doubts regarding the immortal path?”","“No, it’s about the Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion. Senior Daozi, do you know about the Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion?” Song Shuhang inquired.","Daozi nodded, “The dazed hair rooting on your head belongs to Pavilion Master Chu of the Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion, right? I’ve also learned a thing or two about the Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion.”","Song Shuhang asked, “Then, with the authority of the Heavenly Dao... is it possible to reconvene the members of the Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion who were obliterated into nothingness back in the day?”","Daozi replied, “The obliteration of the Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion has been too long ago. Moreover, unlike the younger brothers and sisters of Confucianism... none of the members of the Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion left behind a ‘resurrection technique’ of any sort.”","After the destruction of Confucianism... in secret, Sages laid down many ‘resurrection techniques’ for their disciples. Though these resurrection techniques were somewhat incomplete, they represented hope, a channel.","Since becoming the Will of the Heavens, all Daozi needed to do was erase the imperfections of the resurrection techniques, and then allow the members of Confucianism to go through the resurrection process.","But the Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion was different.","The members of the Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion didn’t leave behind any resurrection techniques, and too much time had passed since they were gone.","“Is there no hope at all?” Song Shuhang sighed. Sometimes, not knowing the answer fostered hope.","After truly hearing the news of despair, he didn’t know if Pavilion Master Chu could maintain her state of mind.","“If the Heavenly Dao can’t do it, perhaps... being detached from the Heaven’s Will might make it possible?” Daozi suggested.","After detachment, perhaps time, space, and dimensions would all be on a different level from now.","If one truly transcended time and space, theoretically, it should be possible to extract the members of the ‘Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion’ directly from the river of time.","Daozi reminded, “But I am just a temporary Heavenly Dao, and detachment from the Heaven’s Will and the like, is something I haven’t even thought about. It’s purely theoretical speculation.”","“Having hope is better than having none,” Song Shuhang said with an easy smile.","And truth be told... what he and Senior White had been researching on, wasn’t it precisely ‘detach from the Heaven’s Will’?"]},{"number":2988,"title":"Chapter 2988 - 2986: Do whatever you want to do!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2988: Chapter 2986: Do whatever you want to do!","Seeing Song Shuhang’s carefree appearance, Daozi nodded inwardly.","Tyrannical Song’s face can’t lie!","When he mentioned the possibility of ‘detaching from the Heaven’s Will and saving the members of the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion,’ a resolute look appeared on Tyrannical Song’s face, and then after thinking it through, it turned into nonchalance.","Tyrannical Song’s desire to become the Heaven’s Will +1, Tyrannical Song’s motivation to detach from the Heaven’s Will +1.","This was the result that Daozi wanted!","He would use all kinds of methods to boost Tyrannical Song’s motivation to pursue immortality.","—Since interacting with Tyrannical Song, Daozi had faintly perceived that Tyrannical Song didn’t have as strong an urge for ‘proving his Dao’ as other cultivators did.","This might be because Tyrannical Song knew too many secrets of the ‘Heaven’s Will,’ having encountered much of the Heavenly Dao and the ruler of the Netherworld.","Some things, before they are obtained, people will desperately yearn for them.","But once they are obtained, a rebellious mentality may arise.","Just like the Heaven’s Will and immortality.","If not for external interference, Tyrannical Song would probably live out his immortality like a salted fish, the saltiest fish king in the myriad practitioners in the universe.","But now, with ‘liberating the members of the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion’ and ‘preventing the myriad practitioners in the universe from being obliterated by the Dark Sun,’ Tyrannical Song’s motivation for ‘proving immortality’ has surfaced!","This is just like Daozi himself; if he didn’t have the motivation to ‘resolve the resurrection aftereffects for his junior sisters and brothers,’ he wouldn’t have proven the 8.5 Heavenly Dao.","[Like this kind of motivation, the more the better. Tyrannical Song’s inner desire to become the ‘Heaven’s Will’ is much more effective than me imposing it.] Daozi’s ‘Heavenly Dao’s View’ scanned the Myriad Realms.","He was sorting out Tyrannical Song’s social connections in the dark, looking for individuals like Pavilion Master Chu in Tyrannical Song’s relationships—those who had a good relationship with Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, who concealed a deep sorrow or had some major issues that required the intervention of the Heaven’s Will.","If there were any, Daozi could trigger all these ‘subplot events.’","Tyrannical Song valued ‘his own people’ very much.","As long as someone was recognized by him as ‘his own,’ even at the cost of his life, he would be willing to protect them.","It’s precisely because of this characteristic that Daozi is willing to fully support him, helping him become the Ninth Heaven’s Dao.","“So, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, go prepare a bit... In half an hour, I will open a ‘time-distorted secret realm’ specifically for you. We’re about to start a long period of cultivation,” Daozi nodded to Song Shuhang.","Once the seclusion begins, Tyrannical Song will have to spend ‘decades’ of years in that time-distorted secret realm.","Therefore, he gestured to Song Shuhang to go prepare himself, to say goodbye to his family or daoist friends in the main world or something like that.","“I understand, Senior Brother Daozi. Then... see you in half an hour,” responded Song Shuhang.","“Go ahead,” Daozi waved his hand gently.","Song Shuhang stretched out his fingers and tapped gently on the void.","A space gate opened.","Song Shuhang stepped into it, escaping through the space gate back to the modern world – Earth.","However, when his figure emerged from the ‘space gate,’ he had changed from ‘one person’ to ‘two people.’","Himself, and Senior White’s clone.","Song Shuhang: “Senior White? Where did you come from?”","“This old and worthless one vanishing forth from little friend Song Shuhang’s arm,” the clone of Senior White laughed heartily, a loud and carefree sound.","Song Shuhang: “...”","Senior White’s clone had a constantly changing personality, every time a different clone of Senior White would appear — Song Shuhang always suspected that Senior White’s clones were like a huge “harem,” with countless Senior White clones waiting eagerly in their “Avatar Space.”","When Senior White used his “Clone Technique,” it was as if an ancient emperor were flipping a sign to decide which clone would emerge and enter the main world.","Song Shuhang had grown somewhat accustomed to this setting, but it still felt especially weird whenever he saw a clone of Senior White looking just like “Senior White” and declaring himself “old and worthless” with an elderly tone.","——It felt like this particular clone was a true troller, sneakily ribbing on Senior White’s age.","“My true self needs to stay in the ‘Sealing World’ for some time, perhaps a few days, or maybe for over ten days... Therefore, I have sent this old and worthless one to attend the ‘New Year’s event’ of the Nine Provinces Number One Group’s fellow friends on behalf of him and to distribute New Year’s red packets to fellow friends attending this year. Incidentally, to partake in Fairy Bie Xue’s immortal dishes,” the clone stroked his smooth chin while doing the ‘stroking beard’ gesture.","“Wonderful.” Song Shuhang said.","Soon, he could also leave his ‘steel manifestation’ in the main world to act on his behalf.","The Three Corpses Avatar, however, needed to accompany him into the ‘time-distorted secret realm’ of Daoist Senior for cultivation.","[Speaking of which, neither my clones nor Lady Onion were found through the ‘Heavenly Dao’s View’ this time. Will I have to wait until I prove the ‘Ninth Heavenly Dao’ before I go looking for them?]","Hold on, speaking of Senior White’s clone...","Song Shuhang glanced at the ‘aged White’ beside him.","If he remembered correctly, shouldn’t the ‘Tribulation Crossing Avatar’ that Senior White previously split off still exist?","If it hadn’t dissipated, does that mean there are ‘three Senior White clones’ in the main world right now?","The ‘aged White’ before him, the ‘Tribulation Crossing Avatar’ that was sliced in half, and the ‘youthful Senior White clone’ from Song Shuhang’s real illusion.","Perhaps Senior White’s ‘clone technique’ doesn’t necessarily require calling them out one by one, but rather allows summoning several at once?","The ‘Clone Technique’ of Senior White was getting weirder and weirder.","“Little friend Song Shuhang, don’t zone out, come join the banquet with this old man,” the clone grabbed Song Shuhang and used some kind of Evasion Technique. In an instant, the two turned into streaks of light and dashed into the New Year’s banquet held by the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","At that moment, on the stage of the New Year’s banquet, Soft Feather, the MC, was holding the mic and announcing loudly: “Next, please welcome Young Master Phoenix Slayer and Doudou to the stage for their performance of ‘Young Master Phoenix Slayer Beating Doudou’.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","Doudou looked confused: “Meow?”","Young Master Phoenix Slayer pushed up his glasses, letting out a laugh that was easily worth a thousand yuan: “Hahahaha, Doudou, it’s our turn for the show!”","“I don’t remember agreeing to perform with you on stage,” Doudou bared his sharp dog teeth at Young Master Phoenix Slayer.","“Come on, it’s the New Year, just have fun,” Young Master Phoenix Slayer stepped forward, grabbed Doudou, and dragged him onto the stage.","Doudou angrily said, “Fun my furry butt... Let go of me, or I’ll bite you.”","“Come on, bite me,” said Young Master Phoenix Slayer handsomely tilting his head back.","You need to bite me so I can collaborate with the ‘Young Master Phoenix Slayer Beating Doudou’ act.","Song Shuhang and Senior White’s clone quietly took their seats.","“Have you fully resurrected?” Senior Yellow Mountain asked with a smile via Sound Transmission.","“Mhm,” Song Shuhang nodded slightly.","At the same time, each of his pendants began to return to their places.","“Go and do whatever you want,” Senior Yellow Mountain said while watching the performance on the stage, “The members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group will support you from behind.”","Song Shuhang’s heart warmed up."]},{"number":2989,"title":"Chapter 2989 - 2987: I want to sprinkle cumin on you!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2989: Chapter 2987: I want to sprinkle cumin on you!","Senior Yellow Mountain’s words steadied Song Shuhang’s previously restless heart.","“Thank you, Senior Yellow Mountain... I will strive to do my best,” Song Shuhang replied through sound transmission.","All the seniors in the ‘Nine Provinces Number One Group’ were supporting him.","From the moment he stepped into cultivation until now, he was not alone!","Now, not only the seniors from the ‘Nine Provinces Number One Group’ but also a group of powerhouses from Father Goudan’s side were his strong support.","Therefore, even if it’s the ‘Will of the Heavens’, or the challenge of becoming ‘detached’, he will try his best to do well.","No matter whether he succeeds or not, having fought and struggled would be the most brilliant experience!","Without needing Senior Yellow Mountain to say more, Song Shuhang self-mentally supplemented a large pot of ‘mind-soothing chicken soup’, satisfying and entertaining himself.","After drinking the self-brewed mind-soothing chicken soup, Tyrannical Song became full of motivation!","Senior Yellow Mountain slightly smiled and continued watching the New Year’s drama between Young Master Phoenix Slayer and Doudou on the stage.","This might very well be the last peaceful New Year for the ‘Nine Provinces Number One Group’.","Cherish it while it lasts.","...","...","Following the return of Senior White’s clone, Immortal Fairy Bie Xue’s ‘Year Beast Immortal Dish’ also began to be served successively—if Senior White hadn’t come back, the other dishes would have been served as planned, but the Year Beast Immortal Dish would definitely have been delayed.","The best should be reserved for warming the stomach of Senior White.","Song Shuhang sat in his seat and casually asked, “Speaking of which, what about my share of the immortal dish before I was resurrected?”","He saw that some ‘Year Beast Immortal Dishes’ were served individually for everyone, right?","No sooner had he spoken than the recently returned virtuous lamia, Fairy Creation, and black-skinned Soft Feather simultaneously tilted their heads.","Song Shuhang: “...”","Alright, he already knew the answer.","Above his head, Pavilion Master Chu’s dazed hair was swaying in the wind, as if hesitant to speak.","She was extremely nervous now.","Eager to get the information on the ‘Crystal-clear Water Pavilion’ from Song Shuhang’s mouth as soon as possible.","But also afraid of receiving a despairing response.","Wanted to ask, yet didn’t dare to ask.","Feeling the rhythm of the dazed hair moving on his scalp, Song Shuhang transmitted his voice: “Pavilion Master Chu, regarding the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion, I have already communicated with Daoist Senior.”","Sometimes, Tyrannical Song actually understood hearts quite well.","“What did the Will of the Heavens say?” Pavilion Master Chu’s dazed hair couldn’t help but ask.","“Rest assured, there’s a chance,” Song Shuhang replied, his voice gentle yet firm, instilling a sense of confidence.","Upon hearing this, Pavilion Master Chu’s dazed hair instantly flopped down limply.","It was good news, so delightful that it made her entire body feel weak with joy!","From ancient times to the present, what she most wanted to hear was actually this phrase.","“However, to resurrect the members of the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion... we cannot depend on Daoist Senior’s power. So, we need to wait a little longer,” Song Shuhang added.","Pavilion Master Chu’s dazed hair nodded slightly.","Being unable to borrow the power of Daoist Senior meant that the Will of the Heavens ‘Daozi’ had more important matters to deal with, so it could not lend a hand.","About this point, Pavilion Master Chu was very understanding.","There was no karmic tie between her, Daozi, and the scholarly system, and neither Daozi nor the scholarly system owed her any favors. So if they helped her, it would be a favor; if not, it would be the norm.","Even Daozi willing to tell her the answer and give her a glimmer of hope was already a favor.","Although she was impatient to bring back the members of the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion... Pavilion Master Chu was quite rational at heart and did not have an unreasonable temperament.","This is one of the signs in judging whether a person is mature.","“I’ve waited from the ancient past until now, all these years I’ve made it through. So long as there is hope, I can keep waiting,” Pavilion Master Chu’s dazed hair slowly said.","“It won’t take long, I promise,” Song Shuhang said.","After all, the myriad practitioners in the universe might only have 22 days of peace left.","...","...","The New Year’s feast continued.","After three rounds of drinks, the members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group, slightly tipsy, took to the stage one by one to show off their special talents.","Even True Monarch Eternal Fire, always so steady, couldn’t help but perform a sword dance—the Confucianism school had been celebrating one joyous event after another, and as a disciple, True Monarch Eternal Fire’s mood had been full of joy lately.","Amid the boisterous banquet, Song Shuhang quietly masked his presence and summoned his steel manifestation to take his place.","His real body stealthily slipped away and, after a short while, arrived at Su Clan’s Sixteen’s tribulation site.","Sixteen’s heavenly tribulation was entering its final stage.","With the White Dragon acting as her protector, and the flaws in her techniques having been removed, her strength had long surpassed that of the Sixth Stage; this transition from the Sixth to Seventh Stage Tribulation was a walk in the park for her.","She even had spare energy to capture and seal some of the more ‘juicy-looking’ tribulation lightning bolts, contributing bricks and mortar to Tyrannical Song’s food storage.","Looking at the light of virtue on Sixteen, Song Shuhang murmured, “I owe Senior Scarlet Heaven and Daozi another favor.”","Thanks to these seniors, who had given the precious opportunity to Su Clan’s Sixteen—allowing her the chance of ‘aiding Daozi in proving his Dao’ and thus receiving the blessings of the Heavenly Dao’s feedback.","With such a blessing, Sixteen’s tribulation went exceptionally smoothly.","After watching for a moment, Song Shuhang used his spiritual power to leave a ‘message’ and his figure once again quietly disappeared.","...","...","Several breaths later.","Song Shuhang slipped into the location of the mysterious island.","In a space temporarily created by a powerful individual with great magical techniques.","The glass-colored Cheng Lin and the son of the Heavenly Emperor were engaged in battle.","Upon seeing the appearance of Song Shuhang, the two exchanged a palm strike and separated, retreating.","“Senior Song, what’s up this time?” The Heavenly Emperor’s son looked dissatisfiedly at Song Shuhang—didn’t he see she was busy beating up Cheng Lin?","“Ah Song, the Heavenly Emperor is bullying me!” the glass-colored Cheng Lin called out to Song Shuhang, and at the same time, her figure began to fade, as if she might disappear at any moment.","Song Shuhang: “...”","“If it’s nothing, then scram,” the Heavenly Emperor’s son said, seeing Song Shuhang’s silence, she waved her hand, shooing him away.","“I do have a bit of business,” Song Shuhang sighed and looked at the glass-colored Cheng Lin: “I’m going into the ‘Heavenly Dao space’ that Daozi has opened for secluded meditation, what do you think?”","“I will decide after I finish fighting with the Heavenly Emperor’s son,” the glass-colored Cheng Lin replied, patting her chest.","“You’ll be dead after we finish,” the Heavenly Emperor’s son said coldly, in her soft voice.","Song Shuhang: “...”","[Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, are you ready?] At this moment, Daozi’s voice reached his ears.","Less than half an hour had passed, and Daozi had already created the space.","“I’m ready, Daozi Senior Brother,” Song Shuhang replied.","He then waved at the glass-colored Cheng Lin and the Heavenly Emperor’s son, took one last look at the location of the ‘mysterious island’ below,","Originally, he had thought about making a trip to the mysterious island, but it turned out that Senior Brother Daozi had moved up the schedule.","He could only wait for another opportunity to visit the mysterious island.","Daozi: “Then I’ll bring you in.”","The next moment, Song Shuhang’s figure vanished from the spot, disappearing from the myriad practitioners in the universe and entering the ‘Space-time Secret Realm’ specially created by Daozi.","Once Song Shuhang’s figure had dissipated, the glass-colored Cheng Lin’s figure began to solidify again.","“Let’s continue, Heavenly Emperor’s son,” the restored glass-colored Cheng Lin declared arrogantly: “The timing is about right. Today, you and I will decide life and death... either you eat me, or I’m going to put you on the grill and sprinkle you with cumin!”"]},{"number":2990,"title":"Chapter 2990 - 2988: Dark Song, arrange!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2990: Chapter 2988: Dark Song, arrange!","“You really are arrogant, Cheng Lin,” the Heavenly Emperor’s son said as he held his long sword and gently moved it through the vacuum.","As she moved her sword, the entire space’s ‘Time’ began to act strangely.","“Necessarily! Because the result is the same for me regardless,” Cheng Lin in glass gemstones said proudly across from him: “Whether you eat me, or I roast you, the outcome is a fusion between you and me.”","Heavenly Emperor’s son: “...”","Upon careful thought, Cheng Lin’s words in glass gemstones seemed to really hold no flaw... not at all.","A tiger eating a human and a human eating a tiger, could the two be the same?","Additionally.","From the moment of contact until now, he had realized that the personality of Cheng Lin in glass gemstones was off, not like the Jade Lake Empress Cheng Lin from the ancient Heavenly City era.","Instead... she resembled a certain Song Shuhang, who was always causing trouble and bizarrely popular among women.","He had also noticed another detail.","When Shuhang’s real body appeared, this ‘Cheng Lin’ in front of him seemed to be rejected, and her state became illusory to the point of nearly dissipating.","But once Shuhang left, she immediately recovered and even became arrogant again.","Can Cheng Lin in glass gemstones and Shuhang not coexist in the same space?","And, when Senior Song was about to close up just now... he clearly wanted to take Cheng Lin in glass gemstones with him?","“What is your relationship with Senior Song?” asked the Heavenly Emperor’s son.","“It’s like that of a father and a child, note: I am not the father,” Cheng Lin in glass gemstones blurted out.","The Heavenly Emperor’s son began to form a seal with his left hand: “I might kill you, but I don’t necessarily have to absorb you immediately... I can seal you until the distant future, and wait for the end of all events before fusing you, it’s not too late.”","The Cheng Lin in glass gemstones across from him stiffened clearly.","“Furthermore, even if you don’t say it, I have already guessed it... you are Shuhang plus Cheng Lin,” the Heavenly Emperor’s son said as his beautiful eyes slightly narrowed, seemingly trying to see through Cheng Lin in glass gemstones.","She was Cheng Lin, yet not the pure Jade Lake Empress from the ancient era; coupled with her personality similar to ‘Song Shuhang’; and on top of that her arrogant words about fusing with him.","Cheng Lin and Shuhang, two existences, fused together?","Did Shuhang play a trick on Cheng Lin and fuse her?","Or did Cheng Lin plot against Shuhang and incorporate him into her own body?","“Overall, you’re correct.” Cheng Lin in glass gemstones nodded.","The Heavenly Emperor’s son: “Cheng Lin’s identity clearly doesn’t have much to do with Senior Song, she and Senior Song, even if they are in the same space-time, have no reason to reject each other. But Shuhang, who also shares the surname Song... that’s cause for speculation.”","“You really can’t hide anything from you, Heavenly Emperor’s son. Given your ‘Time-Space Traversal’, you should have noticed something wrong with me already, right?” Cheng Lin in glass gemstones lifted her head proudly: “That’s right, I am actually Shuhang’s child from the distant future, who traveled back to the past!”","Heavenly Emperor’s son: “!!!”","“As for why I am a Ghost Body, the answer is simple. Because I am the child of Tyrannical Song and his ghost spirit fairy maiden! You should know that Tyrannical Song has a spirit ghost that is a fairy maiden,” added Cheng Lin in glass gemstones.","Heavenly Emperor’s son: “!!!”","“Since the real ‘me’ has not yet been born, I still cannot meet Tyrannical Song. Even if I use Cheng Lin’s form to interact with Tyrannical Song, if we stay in the same space for too long, I will be rejected,” Cheng Lin in glass gemstones explained more fluently: “So, Heavenly Emperor’s son, do you still want to make a move against me now?”","As soon as Cheng Lin in glass gemstones finished speaking, the Heavenly Emperor’s son’s sword had already appeared by her side, stabbing toward her waist!","Clang~","The sword tip stabbed her waist side, where the main defensive ‘saber intent armor’ seemed to undergo countless ages in an instant, manifesting a corroded form and was easily pierced through.","This time the blade of the Heavenly Emperor’s sword didn’t slip, it directly penetrated the lustrous body of Cheng Lin, going in three parts deep!","Intense pain spread like a bitter taste around her waist.","Golden Tranquil Cheng Lin: “!!!”","She had been locking onto the position of the Heavenly Emperor, when did he launch the surprise attack?","While she was thinking, the figure of the Heavenly Emperor that had been communicating with her all along, dissipated with the ‘passage of time’, disappearing without a trace!","Behind her, the Heavenly Emperor’s pale fingers emerged, clenching the sword hilt. Her form began to take shape rapidly starting from this arm, as if it were a sand painting.","It was the Heavenly Emperor’s technique utilizing the ‘Space-Time Traversal’.","“Your grasp over the power of time has reached this extent?” Golden Tranquil Cheng Lin said with a calm face—as if the sword stabbed at her waist was not piercing her at all. Or perhaps, this pain was not worth mentioning to her?","“In fact, my mastery over the Space-Time Traversal... even surpasses the ‘Heavenly Court Immortality.’ This is the true path to immortality that belongs to me,” the voice of the Heavenly Emperor drifted.","She pushed the long sword forcefully, thrusting half of the blade into Golden Tranquil Cheng Lin’s waist.","Golden immortal blood emerged, dripping.","“Aren’t you worried that I might be Tyrannical Song’s child?” Golden Tranquil Cheng Lin weakly said.","“Senior Song... he has already been sterilized, ta!” The son of the Heavenly Emperor slightly withdrew the immortal sword, then thrust it in again forcefully!","She laughed while repeatedly stabbing Cheng Lin madly with the sword, causing blood to splatter.","The scene was bloody and violent.","“Sterilization of an Immortal is not completely hopeless. The way of life element for immortality is the gospel for the desperation of an Immortal,” Golden Tranquil Cheng Lin argued.","“But... Senior Song, he is about to prove his Dao and become undying,” the son of the Heavenly Emperor squinted his eyes.","Sterilization of an Immortal is not actually a terminal condition.","However, sterilization by the Immortal Heavenly Dao is indeed terminal.","“How do you know he is about to prove the Heavenly Dao?” Golden Tranquil Cheng Lin’s complexion shifted slightly.","“As the one who controls the Space-Time Traversal, my ability to predict the future is only stronger than yours,” the son of the Heavenly Emperor cruelly stirred the immortal sword in his hands.","“Ahhhh—ah—” This time, Golden Tranquil Cheng Lin could not resist and screamed loudly.","With her repeated screams, her body began to lignify.","In the blink of an eye, she transformed into a towering tree full of vitality.","The immortal sword of the Heavenly Emperor was stuck in the trunk of this mighty tree.","The originally golden blood also turned into green tree sap.","The Heavenly Emperor frowned slightly.","He looked up at the top of the tree.","Then, he saw a flower bud beginning to form at the tip of the tree—a lotus shape.","The lotus opened.","A brand new Golden Tranquil Cheng Lin stepped out from the lotus bud, clad in fresh ‘saber intent armor.’","“If our ways of immortality hadn’t already fused into this entirely new combination, I really would have been killed by your stroke,” Golden Tranquil Cheng Lin said with a lingering fear.","Heavenly Emperor’s son: “...”","“How about we stop here for today? You have already killed me once just now... and besides, I still have to do something important for Tyrannical Song,” Golden Tranquil Cheng Lin looked down and inquired.","“What is it?” The Heavenly Emperor shook off the blood on his sword.","“I need to go and give birth to ‘Dark Song’ of the Netherworld Realm,” Golden Tranquil Cheng Lin gave a thumbs up to the Heavenly Emperor’s son: “Dark Song is very important to Shuhang, so, we cannot let him simply vanish.”"]},{"number":2991,"title":"Chapter 2991 - 2989: Qiu Youyou, Dark Song, Netherly White","paragraphs":["Chapter 2991: Chapter 2989: Qiu Youyou, Dark Song, Netherly White","The glassy Fairy Cheng Lin had already begun to grasp some of the changes in the Heavenly Emperor’s child during their short contact.","For instance, right now, the Heavenly Emperor’s child placed great importance on “Tyrannical Song.”","In many matters, she was willing to give Song Shuhang some face.","Even in the midst of battle, when encountering matters of great relevance to Song Shuhang, she would pause slightly.","It seemed that some time ago, the moment she “died under Tyrannical Song’s blade,” she and Song Shuhang had established a deep karmic connection. Song Shuhang’s future had already become linked with hers.","Therefore, facing such a situation, the glassy Fairy Cheng Lin directly revealed her true intentions.","She knew that Song Shuhang was aiming to prove his “eternity” as well.","Daozi had already informed their alliance members about the “Stellar Destruction Virus + Dark Sun” affair.","One’s power is limited; to push “Tyrannical Song” to the position of the ninth Heavenly Dao, Daozi still needed the assistance of alliance members.","Among the members of the alliance, the Eight-Armed Primordial Heavenly Demon had sworn to assist Tyrannical Song in proving his Dao, Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven had a hobby of nurturing the Heavenly Dao, the Great Master of Buddha Temple held Song Shuhang, who had cultivated the ?Basic Buddhist Fist Technique?, in high regard, and Song Shuhang and Fairy Cheng Lin had always been Tyrannical Song’s backers.","So, when thinking about giving “Tyrannical Song” a push, Daozi immediately thought of his group of friends.","“Giving birth to Dark Song?” The Heavenly Emperor’s child looked at Cheng Lin with a strange gaze.","“Don’t look at me like that... In fact, one of our main functions when we were created by Heavenly Dao Goudan’s father through secret techniques was to preserve Sovereign of the Nine Hells Father Goudan,” the glassy Fairy Cheng Lin said slowly.","The Heavenly Emperor’s child: “Us?”","“Yes, us,” the glassy Fairy Cheng Lin said. “And the cost of the secret technique was that the original ghostly body of Cheng Lin shattered into countless pieces. These fragments, after countless years of evolution, gave birth to ‘petty ghost spirits.’ A portion of them were collected by Father Goudan and transformed into ‘Cheng Lin.’ Another portion was collected by the liquefied metal ball, underwent a series of experiments, and became you.”","The Heavenly Emperor’s child: “Is this why you want to merge with me?”","“Actually, whether we merge or not doesn’t have much significance anymore. The companions from the ancient Heavenly City have already broken free... You no longer hold any significance for a merger to me,” said the glassy Fairy Cheng Lin with a look of disdain.","Her initial intention of wanting to swallow the Heavenly Emperor was mainly to sabotage the ‘Heavenly City plan’ and incidentally free her precious friends from the pathway of the Heavenly Emperor.","Now, with the help of the 8.5 Daozi plan, she had achieved her goal.","Currently, she wanted to use the secret techniques to preserve ‘Dark Song.’","Although Dark Song possessed the ‘ruler of the Netherworld authority,’ it was barely considered a ruler of the Netherworld, but there was still a distinction from the true ruler of the Netherworld.","The cost to preserve Dark Song would not be as severe as preserving Father Goudan back then. They could even manage it without merging with the Heavenly Emperor’s child.","The Heavenly Emperor’s child: “...”","Why did being disdained make her feel so uncomfortable?","“Although I don’t know which path to immortality Tyrannical Song will specifically use to prove ‘eternity,’ I have a feeling that preserving Dark Song will be very important,” said the glassy Fairy Cheng Lin seriously.","That was her genuine thought.","She had learned from Cheng Lin that Tyrannical Song and Senior White were discussing the possibility of ‘two different entities achieving immortality simultaneously’ and using such an approach to perfectly prove their Dao.","Tyrannical Song and Senior White had already worked out a roughly feasible plan—using the Scholarly Sage’s Eye to absorb half of one another and then combining with complementary ‘ways to immortality,’ theoretically achieving the possibility of ‘simultaneous proving of the Dao.’","Theoretically, this was a feasible plan.","But plans are always risky when placing all your bets on them... it’s best to have a Plan B, and even better to have Plan C, D, E, and so on.","What she wanted now was to quietly prepare a Plan B for Song Shuhang and Senior White.","—What are the characteristics of the Heavenly Dao?","They are the eternal attribute, the laws of the Heavenly Dao held in hand, and the ruler of the Netherworld.","Though Tyrannical Song had not yet proved his Dao, he already had an ‘undying fat whale golden core’ and the ‘ruler of the Netherworld.’ Moreover, he had entered the dreamland of ‘Daozi’ and obtained some of Heaven’s Will...","So, if Song Shuhang and Senior White’s ‘first plan’ failed, they could try to let Song Shuhang ‘not follow the conventional path of proving eternal life’ and see if, by gathering all the characteristics of the Heavenly Dao, he could create a ‘man-made Heavenly Way’ that might meet the requirements?","“`","Across from him, the child of the Heavenly Emperor fell silent for a long while.","“I’ll help you,” she suddenly spoke up.","“You’re actively going to fuse with me?” Glass Gemstone Fairy Cheng Lin exclaimed in surprise, “Then we could change our name to Cheng Mudi, or Cheng Tiantou.”","The child of the Heavenly Emperor: “...”","Farewell!","...","...","In the Netherworld Realm.","Dark Song suddenly shivered, “I have this constant feeling that someone is plotting against me.”","He shook his head and stood up.","Under his feet lay the ‘Demon Sea World’ which had been transformed by the head of the Limitless Demon Sect—the Demon Emperor Og.","Originally, the plan was to incorporate this Demon Sea World into the ‘Overlord World,’ making it correspond with it.","However, due to the main body always getting inexplicably involved in various incidents, this matter had been delayed.","Dark Song was not in a hurry—as the Sovereign of the Netherworld, he vaguely sensed that the time to fuse with the ‘Demon Sea World’ had not yet come.","“Speaking of which, isn’t that ‘Demon Emperor Og’ still getting struck by lightning at Senior Three-Eyed’s place?” Dark Song stroked his chin.","That is an Immortal level existence; it would be better to bring him back when free to work for me than to let him continue getting struck by lightning.","There’s also the final bet with that three-eyed young senior that I need to push the main body to complete. If I don’t finish it soon, what’s the point of the bet once I become the Heavenly Dao?","While thinking, Dark Song turned his gaze towards the source of the Netherworld Realm.","There, a ball of liquid metal had finally finished maturing!","Senior White two’s languid figure also finally stepped out of the Sinful Black Lotus World.","“Senior White, how are you feeling?” Dark Song asked with some concern.","“Not too good... Normally, this would be the time for my hibernation. But there have been so many events in the past year, I’ve hardly had time to even take a nap,” sighed Senior White two.","He is a unique Sovereign of the Netherworld, continuing to assert his authority in the Netherworld Realm even though his corresponding Heavenly Dao Body is gone.","But there is a price to pay. The compulsory hibernation from time to time is that price.","Now, he is extremely tired but has to keep pushing through.","After all... the fat ball is back.","“Netherly White~~” Just then, a sharp voice rang out from the source of the Netherworld Realm.","“Tsck, it seems it still has its memories. What a troublesome fellow,” Senior White two said, the corners of his mouth slightly lifting.","He had thought the reborn fat ball might suffer from amnesia.","Now, from its endearing call, it was apparent that it remembered him.","Boom~","The Netherworld Realm exploded.","The fat ball crossed through the space gate and appeared directly in front of Senior White two.","One ball, one White, one Song—three powers in a standoff."]},{"number":2992,"title":"Chapter 2992 - 2990: Plotting to Usurp the Throne","paragraphs":["Chapter 2992: Chapter 2990: Plotting to Usurp the Throne","“`","The fat ball roared in, like a tiger descending the mountain!","To this day, it still remembered the moment when the liquid metal ball suddenly collapsed; its plan hadn’t even been completed, and it could only dissipate unwillingly.","And just before it was about to vanish for good, Netherly White had already emptied several of its treasures!","Is that what a person would do?","At that time, the fat ball could be said to have died with a grievance.","Therefore, the moment it resurrected, it thought of ripping Netherly White apart!","Although it had no idea why it was resurrected again, that didn’t matter.","What was important was to blow up Netherly White first!","In the instant it crossed through space, the fat ball had already envisioned ten thousand ways it would bombard Netherly White.","Carrying a fury set to explode, it crossed through space—and as it stepped out of the space gate, the fat ball engaged its armed mode, transforming into a massive spherical armored fortress.","It wanted to use the most intense barrage of fire to blast Netherly White!","However...","As soon as it appeared, the fat ball was frozen in place.","Because on the other side, there stood two rulers of the Netherworld!","It wasn’t mistaken, there were two!","One was Netherly White, the creature it hated the most in this lifetime.","The other was Tyrannical Song, the person it hated just as much.","The two most detestable beings were now standing together, both as ‘rulers of the Netherworld’ opposite it.","2 against 1, the situation was unfavorable for our forces.","The explosive rage of the fat ball was forcibly suppressed, and it began to calm down a bit.","—This was like when a person encountered a detested enemy on the street, preparing to sneak up and smack them with a brick, only to suddenly realize that the enemy was accompanied by a group of burly men, causing their anger to instantly turn cold.","“Yo, fat ball,” said Senior White two with a tranquil smile, waving at the fat ball.","“Good morning, fat ball lord,” Dark Song greeted in echo.","Originally, Dark Song was maintained by a wisp of consciousness from the main body.","But facing the formidable enemy, the fat ball, the majority of the main body’s consciousness had to transfer out of the ‘Heavenly Dao Seclusion Time Secret Realm’ to confront the fat ball directly.","[Can’t I just have a good seclusion? In 22 days, the world is going to face a calamitous destruction anyway.]","Tyrannical Song felt tired at heart, longing to return to his seclusion.","...","...","In the vacuum of space.","Seeing the two smiling and waving at it, the fat ball couldn’t help but conjure taunting images in its mind.","At last, the fat ball couldn’t suppress its inner turmoil.","Facing the two most hated foes, although it was at a disadvantage in a fight, if it blew them up together, it would be double the pleasure!","Even if it would be at a disadvantage later, right now, it just wanted to obliterate these two thorns in its side.","“You two, go die!” bellowed the fat ball as its Iron Fortress sprouted thousands of cannon barrels and launchers.","A sky full of firepower, with the added afterward blessings of the ruler of the Netherworld, poured down on Song Shuhang and Senior White two.","There were tangible shells as well as beams of mental energy, super railguns, microwave bombardments, Space Annihilation...","In the Netherworld Realm, a full-powered strike from a ruler of the Netherworld was the basic starting move that could destroy worlds.","The endless stream of firepower wove into a scene that was as beautiful as drizzling rain across the sky, dazzling and practically artistic.","Are you still wielding ancient sabers and swords?","Are you still wearing heavy iron armor and helmets?","“`","“Are you still practicing with swords and sabers day after day?”","“Sir, the era has changed!”","“Now it’s the era of firearms—more is beautiful, bigger is better, caliber is justice, and explosions are art.”","“The truth lies only within the range of the cannon!”","“So, Tyrannical Song and White two, you who still wield swords and sabers, the times have changed, you’re eating shit!”","“No... It hasn’t changed!” Below, Dark Song, as if he could read the fat ball’s innermost thoughts, responded with precise timing.","At the same time, he activated ‘Overlord Mode’—as his main body had now ascended to the Immortal Realm, Dark Song naturally received synchronous feedback and reinforcement!","The foundation of the Immortal Realm + Overlord Mode + the expansion effect of the laws of the Netherworld instinctively filled Dark Song with immense confidence!","Next, saber intent armor encased his body.","With a reach of his hand, the primordial treasure ‘Nine Transformations Phoenix Saber’ cut through space to arrive in his palm.","Dark Song gripped the Nine Transformations Phoenix Saber and proactively met the barrage of fire headed his and Senior White two’s way.","‘True Heavenly Peng Evasion’ was deployed with ease, allowing Dark Song’s movements to be as fast as a Heavenly Peng, fast enough to stroll through the barrage of fire!","Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven’s ‘Heaven Burning Flaming Saber Technique’ blazed to life, a top-tier saber technique in the world!","Streaks of flaming saber lights sliced through the sky, heading towards the artillery fire bombing him and Senior White two.","Whether it was the huge solid artillery shells, the dense armor-piercing shells that fell like rain, or the energy beams, all were split apart by Dark Song’s blade strike after strike!","Once the firepower was split, even the residual explosive waves that arose were nullified by the ‘saber intent armor.’","Two minutes later...","The fat ball ceased the bombardment.","Below, the bombarded area had been practically leveled to the ground.","Yet, the spot where Dark Song and Senior White two stood remained undisturbed!","Dark Song and Netherly White were as if standing on a towering giant pillar.","Completely unharmed.","Dark Song stylishly flicked the Nine Transformations Phoenix Saber, scattering the pitch-black flames, which splattered into the abyss below the pillar.","Netherly White’s long hair fluttered, hands crossed before him, peerlessly handsome.","“Good thing, it was only a two-minute bombardment,” the stylish Dark Song thought, his inflated ego deflating somewhat, with lingering fears.","If the fat ball had bombarded for one more minute, he would have been exposed.","After all, his true grit mode lasted only for three minutes, not a second more.","Above their heads.","The fat ball watched this scene with clenched teeth.","Its bombardment had been full force without any reservations and was not a probing attack either.","But Tyrannical Song below was able to withstand it all...","Meaning, this Tyrannical Song was truly an ‘Overlord of the Netherworld,’ standing on equal footing with it and Netherly White.","“What a dazzling display of fireworks, it reminds me of the moment we first met,” Senior White two spoke with a tone of sigh: “Time flies, in the blink of an eye, we’ve known each other from the ancient era until now.”","The fat ball: “...”","Seeing the fat ball had no intention of making another move in the immediate future, Dark Song stealthily exited the ‘True Man Netherworld Ruler Mode’ which had less than a minute remaining and stylishly sheathed the saber, fastening the Nine Transformations Phoenix Saber at his waist.","One ball, one White, one Song, fell into silence again.","A wind blew through the three of them, ruffling Tyrannical Song’s hair.","The fat ball in the sky finally couldn’t bear it any longer.","“Tyrannical Song, what’s going on?” An icy lone eye emerged on the fat ball’s body, staring intently at Dark Song: “Why, why have you become the Overlord of the Netherworld?”","Senior White two explained: “It’s simple, because you died, Tyrannical Song seized the opportunity to plot a coup and took your place.”","The fat ball: “???”"]},{"number":2993,"title":"Chapter 2993 - 2991: Are You Mad?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2993: Chapter 2991: Are You Mad?","“What kind of dog crap logic is this?”","“Why would Tyrannical Song benefit from my death and get to usurp the throne?”","“Tyrannical Song isn’t even related to me.”","“Even if it were arranged by a will, even if you skipped seven or eight turns, it still wouldn’t be Tyrannical Song’s turn. So why does he get to take a higher position?”","The skepticism filled the ‘eyes’ that the fat ball had temporarily manifested.","Seeing the fat ball’s confused eyes, Senior White Two felt happiness well up inside—he struggled to suppress his smile, puffing his cheeks into dumpling shapes.","When the fat ball saw Senior White’s terrible effort to hold back his laughter, he knew he was being mocked.","Tyrannical Song wasn’t actually plotting a coup at all.","So, there’s only one possibility left...","“Tyrannical Song, has your main body achieved immortality and become the Will of the Heavens?” the fat ball asked despairingly.","Indeed, when it disbanded last time due to the ‘crash of the Heavens Will ball’, Tyrannical Song had already shown signs of becoming one of the top bosses in the world—although at that time, Tyrannical Song hadn’t even started on the path to immortality.","Throughout history, most masters of the Heavens had early fame that shook the world.”","Tyrannical Song was a troublemaker. From ancient times to the present, the fat ball had never seen anyone shake the myriad practitioners in the universe quite like Tyrannical Song.","Those who stir things up yet survive, usually end up accomplishing a lot.","“No, Tyrannical Song has not yet achieved his Dao,” laughed Senior White Two heartily. “Qiu Youyou, do you think you’ve been dead for thousands of years, so Shuhang must have proved his Dao? But let me tell you the cruel truth. It hasn’t even been a month since you last died.”","Fat ball: “!!!”","Less than a month?","Impossible. How could Tyrannical Song have changed so much in such a short time?","The fat ball directly accessed the ‘Netherworld Realm’s’ time records.","—That’s the advantage of being the ruler, not needing a watch to check the time.","A moment later.","“How could this be.” The fat ball began to doubt life itself, staring at Song Shuhang, who apparently hadn’t really achieved immortality.","Not achieving immortality yet was somehow the equivalent to the Netherworld ruler.","What kind of hair-raising operation was this?","“That’s why I said, Tyrannical Song was usurping the throne, taking your place. Tyrannical Song isn’t the ‘ruler of the Netherworld’ correlated with the Ninth Heavenly Dao, he just took your spot. Don’t believe it? I have proof!” said Senior White Two, reaching into the void with his hand.","He played some videos he had been recording.","Some of these were personally recorded by Senior White Two... and some were provided by Dark Song, from the memories of Song Shuhang.","The video starts with the first meeting between Fat Ball and Song Shuhang.","In the video, Fat Ball suddenly appears beside Tyrannical Song.","“Found you~ Are you my main body?” Fat Ball spoke.","On the other side, it seemed Tyrannical Song was startled at first but eventually regained his composure, “I didn’t expect that my hiding was so deep and yet you still noticed... Yes, just as you guessed, I am your main body!”","They looked into each other’s eyes.","Then they entered the part where Fat Ball and Tyrannical Song recognized each other as relatives.","For a while, the scene became very warm.","Senior White Two even specifically added a moving, heartwarming background music.","The fat ball’s lone eye fixed on the screen, its entire body darkened to the point it seemed it might ooze ink!","Seeing this, Senior White Two’s dumpling-shaped, tearful eyes from holding back laughter bulged even more.","But the video hadn’t ended yet.","Besides the recognition scene, there were many harmonious scenes between Fat Ball and Song Shuhang.","For example... Song Fat Ball was unbeatable on Mars and became the pioneer of Tyrannical Song proving his Dao!","There was also the video recorded by Senior White Two not long ago, where Song Fat Ball transformed into a cloak... meticulously caring for the main body “Tyrannical Song”!","Song Fat Ball, in the guise of a cloak, considerately filtered out the ‘Void Sun Guardians,’ and under its command, Song Shuhang’s pendants sprang into action, converting the remnants of the ‘Void Sun Guardians’ into ‘Immortal Material’ for Tyrannical Song to absorb.","The whole segment was so heartwarming it made the ball’s heart and liver cramp.","Adopting a thief as a father!","This is adopting a thief as a father!","Fat Ball freaked out so much that it couldn’t utter a word. Its spherical body plummeted from the sky, forming a huge crater where it sat brooding—so deep it sank at least a hundred tons!","Moreover, apart from nearly bursting from anger, Fat Ball noticed something else—behind Tyrannical Song’s forehead, there actually hung a ‘full moon’!","Crude language—crude language!","Deep down, Fat Ball muttered all the profanities it knew.","He was once a mere unkillable little bug that it could squish dead with a finger hundreds of times over. Now, he had risen to an Immortal!","How did he manage that?","The legendary Immortals, each had to painfully seek enlightenment, reflect on their past, and carve out their own rules and techniques before they could prove their immortality.","But Tyrannical Song, only a few months?","Even if one didn’t order food and just drank liquor, one couldn’t come up with a drunken tale like ‘Tyrannical Song proved his immortality from a little unkillable bug in a few months’.","Fat Ball was bitterly upset.","“Pfft—” Senior White Two covered his mouth, turned his head away, and didn’t look at the enraged Faint Ball.","Senior White Two’s happiness value +1, +1, +1...","Sometimes, people’s happiness is just that simple.","As long as there’s a suitable object, and then add some simple things, it adds up to endless happiness.","“I’m going to rip that manifestation to shreds right now,” Fat Ball grumbled in embarrassment and anger.","That treacherous clone no longer needed to exist.","Only by shredding that manifestation could he undo its disgrace.","Senior White’s eyes curved into beautiful crescents—not a comical one, but a good-looking crescent smile, “You can’t blame that little manifestation... after all, Tyrannical Song plotted his way to your throne. So, in that clone’s view, Dark Song is its main body.”","Fat Ball: “...”","So, had Tyrannical Song really used some means to replace its existence?","But no matter what, even if it was a misunderstanding, that manifestation... still had to die!","Fat Ball secretly activated a technique, wanting to remotely explode that manifestation.","However, when it activated the technique, it found that the connection between itself and that manifestation had already been severed.","“How is that possible?” Fat Ball’s single eye bulged.","A manifestation was a part of its body; there was no possibility of it being separated.","How did Tyrannical Song manage that?","[Nothing is impossible!] At that moment, a vast and majestic voice, coming directly from the skies into the Netherworld Realm, reached Fat Ball’s ears.","It was the sound of the Great Way...","The Will of the Heavens was speaking!","[I’ve had my eye on Tyrannical Song’s cloak for a long time, I’ve been guarding against you... I severed the connection! Are you mad!] The dignified voice of the Will of the Heavens thundered: [And besides, between us, it’s not over yet!]",".",".","The 15th of the month is here, and in the blink of an eye, another half a month has passed... so, the pure little dragon’s new book “Mo Lin,” is hot off the presses, a newly baked hot book."]},{"number":2994,"title":"Chapter 2994 - 2992: True Transmission – Confucianism Sage Fist!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2994: Chapter 2992: True Transmission – Confucianism Sage Fist!","There was a deep-seated hatred between the scholarly system and the liquefied metal ball, just as there was a feud of annihilation between them and Netherworld’s fat ball.","Originally, in the last battle of the Heavenly Dao seat war, even if the scholarly Sage had been defeated and died at the hands of the liquefied metal ball, his scholarly disciples would have no complaints.","The battle for the Heavenly Dao seat was a matter of life and death by its very nature, not child’s play. There was no option for a peaceful battle.","As such, even if one died, they could not blame others.","You couldn’t expect every major player to have the upright disposition of a scholarly Sage.","——Back then, those Immortals who came to challenge the scholarly Sage—if they did not thoroughly provoke him or cross his bottom line—generally ended up being rubbed against the ground by the Sage until they were severely injured, but still left alive.","Challengers left with seals by the scholarly Sage after being severely injured like Demon Emperor Og were few.","And this was the reason why the scholars unanimously acknowledged the Sage...","However, an accident occurred in the final battle between the scholarly Sage and the liquefied metal ball. A piece of the latter’s existence was cut away, rendering it incomplete.","Upon becoming the Heavenly Dao, its first act was to annihilate the scholarly system, seeking to recover the portion of its existence that had been taken by the scholarly Sage...","Actually, both sides had their reasons for action.","But for the scholarly disciples, the annihilation of their system naturally led to a blood feud.","Hate, in many cases, doesn’t really pick sides between justice or the foulest evil.","Reality is not simply black or white.","But in any case, hate is hate.","A blood feud is a grudge.","Moreover... later on, Netherworld Ruler Fat Ball would send demons at regular intervals to wipe out the scholarly system in the main world, thoroughly suppressing them and preventing any chance for growth.","Therefore, no matter the reason, if the scholarly disciples got a chance, they would absolutely not let either the liquefied metal ball or Netherworld’s fat ball off the hook.","How to repay a favor? Return the favor directly for a grudge, and repay kindness with kindness!","To those who had shown great kindness to the scholarly system, the scholars would seek to repay in full... for those who bore a grudge against them, they would be met with an iron fist.","Now, ‘Daozi’, serving as 8.5’s incarnation of the Heavenly Dao, had caught the opportunity for direct retribution.","[It’s not the liquefied metal ball?] Netherworld’s fat ball was taken aback.","Finally, it realized the anomaly in its resurrection—it wasn’t the ‘liquefied metal ball’ that had come back to life, but a strange existence that had taken the place of the ‘liquefied metal ball’.","Just as the Netherworld had seen Tyrannical Song scheming for a throne usurpation, was there someone else challenging the position of the Heavenly Dao too?","At this moment, Netherworld’s fat ball truly wanted to kill its counterpart, the liquefied metal ball, and then drag it out for a posthumous whipping.","That idiot had made a mess of things, turning a perfectly good situation into the current one!","Even more exasperating was that after all its meddling, the stupid liquefied metal ball had just disappeared, leaving behind a mess for it to clean up.","It was having such a hard time.","Looking over the numerous rulers of the Netherworld, it might just be the most miserable one.","Others like Netherly White had it easy. Before dissipating, the Sky’s Will ensured Netherly White was preserved and lived a comfortable life.","And what about itself? During its reign, it had to clean up the mess of its stupid Heavenly Dao counterpart, confronting the scholarly system on its behalf, searching for that portion of ‘existence’ that the scholarly Sage had cut off, and finding ways to make up for the deficiency in the Heavenly Dao.","In the end, it still had to find a way to just barely survive!","Compared to White, Netherworld’s fat ball’s tears almost fell.","It was so tragic.","[I may have forgotten who I am, but... you will definitely not forget this fist.] At this time, Daozi’s voice rang out once more.","“Not good, Daoist Senior is about to lose his temper,” Dark Song said.","Senior White Two reached out to grasp Dark Song, and his figure slightly retreated, distancing them from Qiu Youyou.","Following this, a space gate opened beside Netherworld’s fat ball.","“Come, die!” Daozi’s voice thundered.","The next moment, a series of punches burst from the space gate, hammering on fat ball’s body.","The punches were like meteors, resembling Tyrannical Song’s ?Basic Buddhist Fist Technique? Number Two mode—Meteor punches!","“`","Fist against flesh!","With each punch, mercury-like liquid metal splattered from the fat ball’s liquid metal body.","Boom, clap, boom, clap—","The crude and simple ‘Knowledge’s Iron Fist’ made fat ball recall the once dominating fear of being ruled by the iron fists of the Sage of Confucianism.","What made it suffer even more was that it was now being hit by the Dao of Heaven... moreover, by a Heavenly Dao that had usurped the liquefied metal ball.","The other party had some control over the ‘Heavenly Dao ball,’ possessing functions specifically targeting Netherworld’s fat ball.","Under such targeting, fat ball simply couldn’t dodge or resist when the other party punched.","All it could do was grit its teeth and endure the brutal beating.","It was all the damn fault of that stupid Heavenly Dao ball!","If the other party hadn’t ascended by borrowing the position of the Heavenly Dao ball, it wouldn’t be able to target him... and under the authority boost of the Netherworld Realm, it at least wouldn’t seem so powerless, so weak.","It’s just too face-losing.","...","...","After a series of visually explosive fist techniques, fat ball’s form kept shrinking, from an initial radius of a hundred meters as a large ball until it was beaten down to the size of only one meter.","It had been reduced to its core!","The fist technique of Daozi had truly mastered the sacred teachings of the Sage of Confucianism.","After a round of ‘Knowledge’s Iron Fist,’ the grievances in the heart of the Daozi facing him had been somewhat vented, and he stopped the action of opening spatial passages to violently hammer the fat ball.","— If Daozi weren’t in a good mood right now, having resolved the side effects of the resurrection of his Confucian brothers and sisters, a full round of his iron fists would have left fat ball in a state where it couldn’t recover for hundreds of years.","“Member of Confucianism.” Fat ball eyed the spatial passages, his voice so pained it was nearly distorted.","Opposite him, Daozi spoke slowly, “Daozi, the Chief Disciple of Confucianism!”","When he had just made his move, like the last time he battled the Black Sun, he controlled his strength, not completely exploding the fat ball in one go—because he wanted the other party to know who was bursting it!","Vengeance felt pointless if you just exploded the other party; there was no sense of accomplishment.","You had to let the other party know who was taking revenge on them before being completely exploded for revenge to be meaningful.","Otherwise, if the other party closed their eyes and died without knowing who killed them, what was the point?","“I never expected you guys to usurp your way onto the Heavenly Dao seat.” Fat ball was shaking so much in pain that it felt like his liver hurt—even though it didn’t have a liver, it might be because of the illusory pain from studying Tyrannical Song’s necrotic kidney a few months ago.","Confucianism, the last system that should have become the members of the Heavenly Dao, had usurped their way to its position.","That stupid Heavenly Dao ball!!","Even giving the ‘Heavenly Dao seat’ to White or Tyrannical Song would have been better than giving it to members of Confucianism.","“Now that you know who I am, let us settle our score once and for all,” Daozi said as he clenched his fists again.","This next punch would end the long-standing grievances between Confucianism and the Netherworld’s fat ball!","In the future, once he’d completely vanished from the Heavenly Dao seat, the ruler of the Netherworld’s fat ball would also dissipate.","...","...","Meanwhile, to the side.","Next to Dark Song, a spatial passage opened up.","Glass gemstone-colored Cheng Lin and the child of the Heavenly Emperor arrived together!","The two beings who had previously been at each other’s throats were now coexisting peacefully.",".",".","Check out the new book by author Qing, whose bed I once slept in at a QiDian company annual meeting twelve years ago: “The Tales of Gentlemen in the Sui and Tang Dynasties”!"]},{"number":2995,"title":"Chapter 2995 - 2993: One Day, the Fake Will Become Real!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2995: Chapter 2993: One Day, the Fake Will Become Real!","Meanwhile, Senior White two was watching Daozi thrashing the fat ball boss, and he felt somewhat sentimental inside.","After all these years of conflict with Fat Ball, seeing it suddenly about to resurrect brought a few strands of joy to Senior White two’s heart.","He could even muster up the will to stay awake and meet the resuscitated Fat Ball.","Yet, unexpectedly, just as Fat Ball emerged, before it had a chance to show its power, it was crushed by 8.5 Heavenly Dao Father Goudan.","Pitiful...","But Senior White two’s stance prevented him from intervening in the grievances between Heavenly Dao and Fat Ball.","From his standpoint, he should side with Tyrannical Song, joining 8.5 Heavenly Dao to oppose Fat Ball.","Thus, aside from feeling somewhat sentimental inside, Senior White two did not have much to say.","It all seemed to be fate.","After sighing, Senior White two and Dark Song turned their heads again, looking towards the arriving glass gem-colored Cheng Lin and the Child of the Heavenly Emperor.","“Why have you come?” Dark Song asked, puzzled.","“Well, I am here to lend you a hand,” the glass-gem colored Cheng Lin said.","“I’ll just watch from the side,” the Child of the Heavenly Emperor said.","Dark Song: “...”","[Goudan, are you really going to do this?] As he pondered, the voice of the striped dragon suddenly rang out.","The striped dragon had clearly noticed what Cheng Lin intended to do, which was evidently to help Dark Song achieve reincarnation.","“Rest assured, Father Goudan. This time, I am quite certain that I will not shatter. Moreover, even if something unexpected happens, with you all here... you can put me back together again,” the glass-gem colored Cheng Lin said.","This time, her tone of voice had switched to another manner; now it truly sounded like Cheng Goudan’s tone and voice.","Boom~~","Across from them, Daozi’s Heavenly Dao strike descended, covering all of Fat Ball boss’s ‘liquid metal body,’ including the parts that had been dispersed by Knowledge’s Iron Fist.","After covering them, Daozi’s movements suddenly paused, stopping his action of ‘directly smashing Fat Ball to bits, so it couldn’t recondense for a hundred years.’","As a Heavenly Dao, he had an acute sense of the events about to unfold in the future.","Especially if the future events were to involve him somehow, this intuition would become even clearer.","For instance, at this moment, Daozi sensed that Cheng Lin seemed to want to perform a series of actions on ‘Dark Song,’ which appeared beneficial.","Moreover, these actions would relate to his plan of ‘pushing Tyrannical Song to become the Ninth Heavenly Dao.’","Thus, driven by intuition, Daozi stopped his action.","“Cheng Lin, what do you intend to do? Do you need my assistance?” Daozi asked Cheng Lin—his attitude towards Cheng Lin and Song Wood was one of gratitude.","“I want to use an ancient secret technique to reincarnate ‘Dark Song,’ allowing him to remain unaffected and become a fully realized Netherworld Ruler individual,” Cheng Lin explained.","At the same time, she briefly shared with others the issue about ‘the original petty ghost spirit – ghostly body’ that she had previously discussed with the Child of the Heavenly Emperor.","Heavenly Dao Father Goudan is a prodigy among the historical Heavenly Daos... Many of the things he came up with are still indecipherable to the current Heavenly Dao.","“To retain Tyrannical Song’s ‘Netherworld Ruler persona’? I see,” Daozi nodded slightly. With his current status as a Heavenly Dao, he could roughly deduce what Fairy Cheng Lin wanted to do by considering Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song’s current state.","“If you wish to preserve the ‘Netherworld Ruler’s Authority’ for the incarnation of Dark Song... then perhaps, we could go even further,” a thread of Daozi’s intent materialized and spoke out.","“The ruler of the Netherworld, huh?” Father Goudan immediately guessed Daozi’s thought.","“Yes... Anyway, if I dissipate, it will disappear once more.” Daozi’s intent looked toward the Netherworld’s Fat Ball, which he was suppressing.","He then glanced at Dark Song.","This ‘ruler of the Netherworld,’ Dark Song, actually still depended on Senior White to exist.","His Netherworld ruler privileges and power were ‘borrowed’ from Senior White and couldn’t be considered as those of a truly independent entity. He was a ‘pseudo-Netherworld ruler.’","However, Fat Ball was a genuine ‘ruler of the Netherworld,’ recognized by the Netherworld Heaven and Earth.","If Fat Ball could be used to compensate for Dark Song’s deficiencies... and if Fairy Cheng Lin could then reincarnate Dark Song, then a complete and perfect True Netherworld Ruler Tyrannical Song could be left behind.","“Is that possible?” Senior White two asked curiously.","If Qiu Youyou could be transformed into Dark Song, that would indeed be quite interesting.","At that time, Dark Song would be both Great Ruler Song and Fat Ball Ruler; incredibly powerful.","“If it were another ruler of the Netherworld, like Fellow Daoist White, for example, it would absolutely be impossible to supplement Dark Song’s deficiencies. But with Fat Ball Ruler, it’s entirely possible,” Daozi confidently stated.","Daozi briefly explained a few key points to everyone.","Firstly, Daozi had assumed the position of Heavenly Dao using the shell of the Heavenly Dao Fat Ball, suppressing Fat Ball, and knowing several of its weaknesses.","Secondly, in Daozi’s hand was an example of a successful ‘Netherworld ruler fusion’—the Black Sun, which was a special existence merged by its corresponding Heavenly Dao, using ‘immortal material.’","Daozi needed only to study the structure of the Black Sun thoroughly and, by working backward, could deduce the technique.","Coincidentally, Song Shuhang possessed an ‘undying fat whale golden core’ which should meet the requirements for fusion.","Lastly... there was the Scholarly Sage’s Eye!","After Tyrannical Song obtained a pair of Scholarly Sage’s Eyes, he had shared the related clues with Daozi.","With just the Sage’s Eye + a path to immortality, one can inherit the Sage’s ability to ‘devour existence.’","Combining these three, it suddenly seemed feasible for Tyrannical Song to use Qiu Youyou to fill the deficiencies in Dark Song.","There was no need to completely devour Qiu Youyou; just a portion needed to be devoured and fused, combined with Dark Song himself, to meet the requirements.","After concocting a complete Dark Song... then Fairy Cheng Lin could use secret techniques to reincarnate him, preserving Dark Song perfectly.","Again, Daozi, with the help of the Heavenly Dao Calculation Ability, meticulously calculated from start to finish and confirmed that the plan was feasible!","“So you mean, gnaw away part of Qiu Youyou? Not bad,” Senior White two nodded.","“I’ll give it my all, just as long as the Heavenly Emperor’s Son is willing to help me, my problem won’t be big,” Fairy Cheng Lin pondered.","“Then lastly, inheriting the innate ability of my teacher goes up on the schedule now,” Daozi said as he stretched out his hand, temporarily sealing the fat ball.","Only waiting for Song Shuhang to inherit the Sage’s ability, and once that side figured out the fusion technique for the Black Sun, this plan could commence.","“Before using the Sage’s Eyes... we should first try if we can turn the Sage’s Eyes from consumables into power banks,” Dark Song reminded.","“Brilliant, perfect,” Daozi was thrilled.","If possible, he also hoped that the eyes left by his teacher wouldn’t disappear.","“I’ll divide a portion of my spirit and lend you a helping hand on this research project. You can use my spirit to borrow Heavenly Axiom-level Calculation Ability,” Daozi promised."]},{"number":2996,"title":"Chapter 2996 - 2994: Close-up Homework Schedule (Additional 1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 2996: Chapter 2994: Close-up Homework Schedule (Additional 1)","If he could inherit the teacher’s secret techniques without having to use up an eyeball, Daozi would be very pleased.","Although both ‘Sage’s eyes’ had already been given to Tyrannical Song, and ownership had gone over to the other party.","But after all, this is one of the teacher’s few remaining legacies.","There are only so many relics left by the Sage, and each one used is one less, never to be replenished.","If it could be made recyclable, Daozi would naturally support it with all his might.","...","...","After making the agreement, the Will of the Heavens + several rulers of the Netherworld + several of the top Immortals + Lady Kunna, who silently contributed behind the scenes, joined hands to tackle a technical problem together.","After contributing his ‘Heavenly Dao Level Computational Ability,’ Daozi then immersed himself in researching the ‘Dark Sun’ project—he aimed to rapidly develop the technology for [If Merged with the Ruler of Netherworld].","Senior White two would assist Daozi’s research, as he is one of the few existences who can look directly at ‘immortal information’ without being greatly affected, so during the research of the Dark Sun, Senior White two would use the ‘golden thigh’ as a carrier to participate in Daozi’s project.","At the same time, Senior White two has a group of ‘research-oriented clones’ who will study with Cheng Lin and the ninth dragon pattern on [how to connect the Sage’s eye with the undying fat whale golden core], turning the Sage’s eye from a one-time-use battery into a power bank.","Cheng Goudan will split into two parts, with the extra part preparing to make contact with the sealed fat ball big shot in advance, getting to know the fat ball’s aura, power attributes, body data and so on in preparation for the ‘perfectly reincarnated Dark Song’.","As for the core person of this project, ‘Dark Song’, he only needs to preside over the ‘Demon Sea World’ and quietly wait for the big shots to finish their preparations.","At most, like Tyrannical Song himself, he’d occasionally act as the subject of research.","After all, the main task for Dark Song and Tyrannical Song isn’t ‘research projects,’ but closed-door cultivation.","In order to take care of Song Shuhang, and to enable researchers from both the Netherworld and the main world to conduct experiments in the same environment, Daozi thoughtfully set up Tyrannical Song’s secluded cultivation time in a rift between the Netherworld and the main world.","Thus, whether it is the ruler of Netherworld Senior White two, or Cheng Lin, Heavenly Emperor’s child, and others, they all can enter the time-distorted secret realm, and using the ‘time extension’ of the secret realm, they will be able to carve out more time for research.","...","...","Inside the time-distorted secret realm.","Song Shuhang’s main body bathed and changed clothes.","He donned a set of plain white garments and even specially burned incense and lit candles, filling the air with a sense of ceremony.","“So, what should I do next?” Tyrannical Song asked aloud.","This was his first time making such formal and serious preparations for seclusion. Moreover, this time he wasn’t closing up for just a day or two, or a month or two—he was mentally prepared to be in closed-door cultivation for decades!","“You don’t even know what to do? Then why are you closing up? Forget closing up, wash up and sleep.” Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword’s technique for poking Song Shuhang’s solar plexus had already reached an effortless level.","Song Shuhang: “...”","“Our main purpose for this closed-door cultivation is to ‘perfect the Second Immortality’,” Song Shuhang announced. His shoulder hosted Song Fat Ball, who had switched from a windbreaker to a dashing cape, and spoke up with a reminder.","“Not achieving our goal, we swear not to emerge from seclusion!”","The connection between Song Fat Ball and the fat ball of the Netherworld Realm had now been personally shielded by Daozi—before long, once Dark Song and Qiu Youyou fully fused, Song Shuhang would become the true main body of Song Fat Ball!","Even the Daoist Senior had a deeper plan—he was secretly observing Song Fat Ball and if he felt it appropriate, the Daoist Senior was prepared to have Song Fat Ball join in the fusion of Dark Song and Qiu Youyou. At that time, the newly-born Song Qiu Youyou would become a true asset to Song Shuhang, just like Song Fat Ball is now. No longer would Tyrannical Song have to multitask and control them separately.","With him guiding in the dark, there’s no worry Song Fat Ball will revert to being a fat ball... even if he collapsed from the Heavenly Dao position, at least for the next eighty to a hundred years, Song Fat Ball’s consciousness would not change.","As for what happens after a hundred and eighty years... there’s even less worry about that.","By then, either Tyrannical Song would have proved his Dao and achieved immortality, and Song Fat Ball would forever be Song Fat Ball.","Or, everyone’s plan failed, and the myriad realms perished in the ‘Dark Sun’ scheme... if the world is doomed, what’s there to worry about?","“A study schedule? Indeed, I need such a thing,” Song Shuhang said as he threw off his cape and sat down cross-legged.","“Firstly, the ultimate goal is to ‘perfect the Second Immortality’, so all our lessons should be arranged with this as the premise.”","Chu Pavilion Lord’s Dumb Hair gently perked up, “Do you have any ideas?”","“I do, after borrowing Daoist Senior’s ‘Heavenly Dao’s Vision’ to observe myriad realms, I’ve been inspired. Moreover, accessing the immortal information of Daoist Senior and the Dark Sun has given me much to benefit from,” Song Shuhang answered with a nod.","After speaking, he took out paper and pen, and wrote down, “First Lesson: Study the Way to Immortality!”","After some thought, he added two words—Plenty!","Song Shuhang’s ‘Second Immortality’ is too vast; he needs plenty of theories on the way to immortality to inspire him.","Stones from other mountains can be used to polish jade.","“We can offer our own information on the path to immortality,” Zither Master’s Claw said, “But if you want plenty, I’m afraid a few of us won’t be enough, right?”","Song Fat Ball’s cape said, “This issue is a minor one! Next, I will actively replace the main body and venture into the myriad realms to battle. This time, I will be the one to initiate challenges... Any defeated foes will have to pay a price. I will bring all the losers here, and have them personally explain the mysteries of the ‘Way to Immortality’ to the main body!”","“Brilliant!” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet nodded, “I can lend a helping hand to Cape Friend, take me with you. Furthermore, bring that Eight-Armed Ancient Heavenly Demon big shot; he can split up with us to challenge myriad realms.”","“Does the main body have any specific requirements for the Immortals?” Song Fat Ball asked again in his cape form.","After pondering for a moment, Song Shuhang replied, “Hmm, preferably those related to the categories of ‘Virtue’ and ‘Life and Death’ for the way to immortality, with priority given to them. Moreover... it would be best if we had samples from the Immortals of every major race in the myriad realms. If there aren’t any Immortals for a certain power system, top Tribulation Immortals are also acceptable.”","After entering the dream of Daozi, he had gained some clues about the Second Immortality.","Different races, different power systems, whether human, monster, demon, or ghost... in the Second Immortality, they all had a place.","Moreover, the Second Immortality doesn’t need to be comprehended all at once like the First Immortality.","His Second Immortality... could be assembled modularly, piece by piece.","This possibility gave Song Shuhang hope for perfecting the Second Method."]},{"number":2997,"title":"Chapter 2997 - 2995: Being Polite and Civilized (Supplement 2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 2997: Chapter 2995: Being Polite and Civilized (Supplement 2)","Attempting to understand the entire Second Immortality Method in one breath is overreaching, and is bound to lead to failure.","However, if one were to comprehend each small module of the path to immortality individually, and finally combine them, the seemingly impossible-to-perfect Second Method might actually become attainable.","“My path to immortality is the cycle of life and decay, related to life and death... Perhaps you can make use of it,” said Chu Pavilion Lord’s Dumb Hair. “Then, shall I start the first lesson of observing the Way to Immortality?”","“That’s fine, but Senior Chu, although we’re quite familiar with each other, I still need to remind you. What you’re about to share with me isn’t just any Daoist Canon, but the secrets of your own path to immortality. So... during the presentation, if you don’t want to disclose any information when I ask, feel free to refuse my inquiries,” Song Shuhang earnestly said.","The secrets of the path to immortality are the core elements, the greatest secrets of Pavilion Master Chu’s way to immortality.","Therefore, it’s essential not to put the seniors in an embarrassing situation.","“All right, we understand these matters better than you,” said Chu Pavilion Lord’s Dumb Hair, swaying in the wind, gracefully. “If there’s anything we’re unwilling to share, there’s no need to force us. Those willing to share will explain their path to immortality without coercion.”","“Then Senior Chu, when you explain the ‘secrets of the path to immortality,’ may I record part of it? I will give you the recording afterward, for you to edit and delete as you wish,” Song Shuhang continued, seeking consent.","Without much thought, Chu Pavilion Lord’s Dumb Hair immediately guessed Song Shuhang’s intentions: “Do you intend to record these teachings and use them for the ‘Cultivator Chat System’ live broadcasts in the future?”","“That’s the plan, but I will set access permissions for the more profound content to be for internal use only. It’ll only be available to the seniors of the ‘Nine Provinces Number One Group’ and a few fellow friends with whom I share a good relationship,” replied Song Shuhang. “Regarding the spirit stones earned, we’ll split them fifty-fifty.”","“That’s fine, you take care of these arrangements,” said Chu Pavilion Lord’s Dumb Hair, fluttering—she never valued spirit stones much. Back when her Crystal-clear Water Pavilion held numerous natural treasures and spirit stones, she hardly grieved over losing them.","After all, she was different from Song Shuhang; she knew how to save money!","Once her main body fully recovers, she could earn as many spirit stones as she wished.","Song Shuhang beamed with a smile.","After this episode, his ‘Cultivator Chat System’ will amass a huge collection of ‘Daoist Canon’ benefits... In the future, to view these ‘Daoist Canon’ videos, countless cultivators will renew their VIP subscriptions and spend spirit stones to watch the teachings.","A future filled with rolling riches awaited him.","And that future was not too distant... perhaps in just over a dozen days, he could become a person with spirit stones.","“Then, main body, I’ll arrange to meet that Eternal cosmic demon and join forces with it,” said Song as the Fat Ball Cloak volunteered, rolling on the spot into a rounded shape.","Since there’s a vast difference between the external world’s time and this ‘time-distorted secret realm,’ it’s imperative to hurry and bring back more treasured immortals for the main body.","For instance, those who recently lost to it on Mars could be gathered as a starting point.","“Go ahead, but let’s be slightly more gentle and courteous in our approach. After all, we still need them to divulge the secrets of their path to immortality,” Song Shuhang said.","“I understand; this is your way of benevolence and kingship,” declared Song as the fat ball with an ‘I get you, main body’ attitude.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said, “I’ll accompany you.”","By following Song as the fat ball, it could observe the status of the other party and notify Song Shuhang immediately if any issues arose with the fat ball.","Moreover... compared to confronting the ‘Eternal Dark Sun,’ a fusion of the ruler of the Netherworld and the Will of the Heavens, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet felt it would rather face immortals!","Now, after being strengthened by Ruler of the Netherworld White, it had reached the level of an immortal divine weapon. Given enough spirit stones and mental energy, it could even unleash the transient power of a primordial treasure.","The fat ball’s spherical form slightly bobbed in agreement.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet flew and hung itself onto Song Fat Ball.","“Speaking of which, who wrote the characters on you? Why do they always give me a sense of familiarity?” Song Fat Ball asked while carrying Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet and fleeing outside the ‘time-distorted secret realm’.","[Familiar?] Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet was slightly startled and said, “It was inscribed by a reliable senior of Shuhang’s.”","“I see, it’s the main body’s reliable senior... No wonder these characters feel both familiar and intimate. I vaguely have the urge to surpass it. The main body’s seniors must be very important to him,” Song Fat Ball sighed.","“Yes,” replied Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet.","It suddenly regretted deciding to go out with Song Fat Ball.","...","...","At this moment.","The cultivators of the myriad realms were calming their hearts that had been pounding like startled deer.","“Is it over?” they wondered silently.","That incessant forced Heart Movement seemed to have finally come to an end.","Had the shenanigans of the Will of the Heavens ‘Daozi’ and Tyrannical Song finally finished?","“As expected of Tyrannical Song, usually when the Will of the Heavens proves to have a pseudo-immortal body, the most sensational is the Will of the Heavens itself. But this time, while Daozi proved immortality, Tyrannical Song actually managed to be on par with Daozi, resonating with the world and matching him blow for blow,” marveled the cultivators from the ‘Book World’ of the myriad realms.","In the Book World—right after the era of the Heavenly Emperor in the ancient era—a big shot who proved the path to immortality lamented.","This Immortal big shot, with his eyes closed tightly, waved his pen and started recording the event.","The Book World is one of the ‘myriad realms’ special worlds, slightly smaller than the Dream Realm, and this Immortal is its ruling authority—not the Sector Lord.","His interest lies in recording significant events occurring throughout the myriad realms.","Recently, most of the major events he recorded were related to ‘Tyrannical Song’.","To facilitate recording, this Book World Immortal had already set up a separate file for ‘Tyrannical Song’.","“Who knows what changes Tyrannical Song will bring to the myriad realms in the future?” The Book World Immortal paused from writing and looked at a good friend next to him. “What do you think about this, Wu Yu?”","“What else can I think? I was recently spectating near Mars in the solar system and watched as a clone of Tyrannical Song hammered one Immortal after another. Now, I just hope I can choose to lie down and look up to Tyrannical Song,” replied his friend, Immortal Fairy Wu Yu, as she looked up at the sky.","Fairy Wu Yu’s path to immortality was the special metal-based system.","Her real body was unknown, and she cultivated Gold Element techniques. After achieving metal-based immortality, her physical state would transform from one metal to another every thousand years, from gold to silver, or from silver to chromium. Every millennium, she could freely change once.","Every transformation was a process of shedding the old and evolving...","‘Knock, knock~’ Right then, there was a knocking sound from outside the Book World.","“Hello, was someone calling me just now?” A kind voice sounded from outside the Book World—it was Song Fat Ball following the instructions from his main body to be polite to others!"]},{"number":2998,"title":"Chapter 2998 - 2996: When Tyrannical Song Comes Knocking","paragraphs":["Chapter 2998: Chapter 2996: When Tyrannical Song Comes Knocking","“Who?” Fairy Wu Yu reflexively responded—she felt that the voice of the fellow friend knocking from outside the Book World was very familiar, causing her hair to stand on end.","However, because the voice was deliberately kept low and sounded incredibly gentle, Fairy Wu Yu couldn’t immediately link this voice with the ‘familiar one’ from her memories.","After responding, Fairy Wu Yu turned to look at her good friend, the Immortal of the Book World.","This Book World was her friend’s territory, and even though her friend was not the official ‘Sector Lord’ of the Book World, he was the actual ruler, lacking only the official recognition.","“Whose name did I just call?” Fairy Wu Yu looked at her friend and asked.","“Tyrannical Song,” the Book World Immortal replied indifferently.","Fairy Wu Yu: “...”","What’s going on?","I just casually mentioned Tyrannical Song, and Tyrannical Song appears knocking at the door?","How is one supposed to enjoy themselves in peace?","Moreover, I didn’t speak ill of Tyrannical Song, did I? On the contrary, I was recounting Tyrannical Song’s impressive past to my friend.","Why am I being ‘checked’ by Tyrannical Song under such circumstances?","“Shall we open the door?” asked the Book World Immortal—actually, with Big Shot Tyrannical Song’s strength, it didn’t matter whether the door was open or not. Even without opening the door, he could still easily break in.","After all, the ‘Book World’ is just one of the myriad practitioners in the universe. And since he’s not the true Sector Lord, he couldn’t claim it as his own private domain.","“Let’s open it,” Fairy Wu Yu decided after a moment.","——mainly because outside, Tyrannical Song’s voice sounded very gentle and seemed to be devoid of malice.","Polite and gentle, if we let him in, he surely wouldn’t do anything to harm me, right?","“Alright, then I will let Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song in,” the Book World Immortal said, gesturing with a hand. He added, “To be accurate, it should be a clone of Tyrannical Song. The one you saw, hammering down fellow Immortals in the universe on Mars.”","Fairy Wu Yu: “...”","A spatial gate slowly opened.","The clone of Tyrannical Song, formed from a ball of liquid metal, wearing a small stone tablet at his waist, and maintaining a rigid ‘kind’ smile, arrived before the Book World Immortal and Fairy Wu Yu.","“Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, I trust you are well,” said the Book World Immortal, nodding with closed eyes and a smile.","“I am Fairy Wu Yu. Welcome, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song,” Fairy Wu Yu also paid respects to Tyrannical Song’s clone.","Although it was just a clone, it possessed extraordinary combat power, and one must treat it as if Tyrannical Song himself had come.","“I am Tyrannical Song’s fat ball clone, greetings to both fellow Immortals,” said Song’s fat ball, imitating the gentle tone of his main body.","Fairy Wu Yu shivered slightly—even though the ‘Tyrannical Song’s clone’ in front of her wore a gentle smile, the core of its being still radiated a violent and destructive aura.","This incarnation of Tyrannical Song was born for slaughter!","“Did you call for me just now? I happened to be passing by and upon hearing fellow friends calling for me, I decided to drop by,” said Song’s fat ball politely.","——It was originally looking for Fellow Daoist Scholar Yue Ruhuo.","That was the first Immortal who had lost to it during the battle on Mars but then had a cheerful exchange of music and poetry with it, becoming a good friend.","The fat ball felt that, considering his relationship with Fellow Daoist Scholar Yue Ruhuo, it wouldn’t be a problem to ask him to share the ‘Mysterious Principles of Longevity’ with his main body.","But en route, it suddenly heard someone calling its name.","Sensing this, it approached and knocked on the door.","This knock revealed two great surprises—two living Immortals!","Moreover, they were Immortals it had not hammered yet.","Especially this fairy, look at her body with its metal Attribute, it looked valuable at a glance and had a predestined connection with its “Liquid Metal Body”.","And the fairy’s path to immortality seemed to subtly contain an essence of “Rebirth”, vaguely related to the principles of “Life and Death”, meeting the requirements and conditions of Tyrannical Song’s main body.","The Immortal next to her, exuding a scholarly aroma, though his path to immortality was not visible, such a bookish path to immortality would surely delight Tyrannical Song’s main body as well.","The more the fat ball observed, the brighter the eyes that formed on its body became.","How wonderful!","The main body was indeed right, being polite really is a good thing.","It was precisely because it was polite that it encountered these two Immortal friends.","“Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song’s clone, you’ve misunderstood; my good friend Fairy Wu Yu and I were just talking about your battle in place of Tyrannical Song on Mars, mentioning the name ‘Tyrannical Song’, which might have caused you passing by to sense it,” explained the Book World Immortal slightly smiling and in an organized manner.","“I see, so this is fate. [Hahaha laughter]” said the fat ball Song.","Fairy Wu Yu: “It is fate, and fate always comes in such mysterious ways.”","In short, casually chat with Tyrannical Song’s clone for a bit, then find a chance to send him away.","“Since we are fated, then Fairy Wu Yu, let’s have a battle first,” said the fat ball Song as it began to move its body around, assuming a ‘I’m going to hammer you’ posture.","Fairy Wu Yu: “!!!”","What the hell, so heartless!","Didn’t you say we had fate with you?","And your “fate” is to hammer us?","Utter madness!","Fortunately, the Book World Immortal maintained his composure: “Fellow Daoist Ball, there is no need to be hasty. Our Book World is quite small amongst the myriad practitioners in the universe, and it can’t withstand too much turmoil. Since we are fated, why don’t you first tell us what it is that you want to do? If it’s not necessary, we might be able to skip the ‘battle’ phase.”","Even with his eyes closed, the Book World Immortal continuously sensed the state of the fat ball Song.","He possessed a secret technique that allowed him to make some predictions about ‘the other party’ through things like ‘aura’.","Upon discovering himself and Fairy Wu Yu, the other party displayed an ‘excited’ aura.","Then, it seemed to ponder.","And subsequently, it suggested a battle—clearly, this clone of Tyrannical Song was searching for people like him and Fairy Wu Yu with a certain goal in mind.","He and Fairy Wu Yu shared several similarities, the most significant being their identities as Immortals.","[Now that the Will of the Heavens has proved his Dao, there is no chance to ‘compete for the Heavenly Dao seat’ in the near future; why then does Tyrannical Song still seek to provoke battles with Immortals?]","“Skip the battle?” The fat ball felt somewhat disappointed; it still wanted to do the hammering first.","At this point, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, who had been hanging at its waist all the while, couldn’t hold back and spoke up: “Actually, we are searching for Immortals to challenge them and hope to establish a covenant. If possible, we would like these Immortal friends to meet with Tyrannical Song’s main body.”","“Meet the main body? What for... what for?” Fairy Wu Yu was a bit panicked.","“The main body wants to understand the various Mysterious Principles of the immortal paths,” said the fat ball Song. “If you agree, Fairy, I will take you to meet my main body right now. If you disagree, then we will have a battle.”","“Don’t worry, after the fairy meets with Tyrannical Song’s main body, we will not shortchange you. The current Tyrannical Song main body is a great Treasure; just by meeting him, you are sure to gain much,” added Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet.","The fat ball Song was responsible for playing the heavy, and Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet took on the role of the good cop."]},{"number":2999,"title":"Chapter 2999 - 2997: This is Tyrannical Song, How Terrifying!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2999: Chapter 2997: This is Tyrannical Song, How Terrifying!","Moreover, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet did not lie—Song Shuhang, to the myriad practitioners in the universe seeking immortality, indeed represents a great treasure!","It is known that Tyrannical Song had always maintained a close connection with “Daozi.” Moreover, he had just experienced the “Heavenly Dao’s View” and exited from the dreamland.","On Song Shuhang now resided some “immortal information residues” that had been transformed by his body.","—Directly viewing immortal information, even the top Immortals would fall into eternal sleep. However, these transformed “immortal information residues” could be captured and analyzed by Immortals.","If they are lucky enough to lay down a foundation, they might be able to go further in the future and access deeper immortal information.","Not only that.","Tyrannical Song was now perfecting his “Second Path to Immortality.” During this period, he was essentially looking at things from a perspective “beyond Immortals.”","If Immortals show Tyrannical Song their “Mysterious Principles of Immortality,” they might receive some feedback from Song Shuhang, supplement themselves, and advance their path to immortality even further!","This is truly a win-win situation.","—The only difficulty is that most Immortals would not want to explain their “Mysterious Principles of Immortality” to others.","...","...","After leaving Song Shuhang, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet exhibited its keen survival instincts!","Confronting big shots is indeed thrilling, but one can’t do such exciting things every day, right? It’s not good for the heart.","Exciting activities should be enjoyed once a month or every few months; doing them daily would be unbearable.","Thus, when fat ball was trying to steer things towards “combat,” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet was in the background, doing his best with his verbal skills to shift things toward a “peaceful resolution.”","Any battle that can be resolved with words should avoid going to fists!","If they really cannot be resolved peacefully, then let fat ball take the stage later—it would also fully assist fat ball!","The forehead of fat ball wrinkled slightly, feeling a bit regretful for bringing along Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet.","As an avatar of the ruler of the Netherworld, it craved battle and destruction.","At its waist, the Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, with an unprecedented strong desire to live, instantly sensed the fluctuation in fat ball’s mood and deduced its feelings.","Thus, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet secretly transmitted a sound to fat ball: “We have limited time, the flow of time outside passes much faster than our main body in the ‘time-distorted secret realm.’ Therefore, we can’t afford to waste time, we need to try to send as many Immortal friends into the time-distorted secret realm as fast as possible, for our main body to absorb.”","“That makes sense! I almost forgot about that!” fat ball suddenly realized.","It seems that apart from the Three Corpses Avatar in its body’s pendants, which seems a bit unintelligent, the other pendants are still very reliable.","“Then, for those we can quickly resolve through verbal communication, let’s communicate well. Even if we have to resolve it through battle, I will also try to unleash the big moves right from the start, aiming to eliminate the enemies in the shortest time possible,” fat ball also secretly responded with sound transmission.","On the other side.","The corner of the mouth of the Book World Immortal twitched slightly.","Although his secret techniques could not fully decipher the detailed exchange between fat ball and Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, through the changes in their “aura” and the transformation in fat ball’s emotions, the Book World Immortal could vaguely guess some aspects.","Such as... if they did not agree, he and his friend Fairy Wu Yu might get hammered.","“Wu Yu, if the two of us join forces... do you think we have a chance to beat the Tyrannical Song’s clone over there?” the Book World Immortal maintained a calm smile while secretly inquiring.","“If it’s only Tyrannical Song’s clone, you and I together might have a slight chance of winning. But if we include that stone tablet at his waist, I feel our chances of winning are slim,” Fairy Wu Yu responded.","She was a spectator of the Mars incident and had a very direct understanding of fat ball’s combat power.","At the same time, she noticed that the stone tablet bore four extremely frightening characters... those characters made her heart palpitate.","“Then, do you want to fight?” the Book World Immortal asked.","“Am I confused?” Fairy Wu Yu rolled her eyes.","What a silly question.","Why would I want to fight Tyrannical Song’s clone?","Even if we together could defeat Tyrannical Song’s clone, but there is still a more awesome Tyrannical Song main body behind him!","If the main body of Tyrannical Song came over and just gave a glare, we might end up getting pregnant.","As a man who ascended to the heavens with the “Will of the Heavens,” Tyrannical Song’s “Impregnating Gaze” had likely been strengthened to the level of a Confucian Sage from long ago.","In the myriad realms and heavens, there are likely not many who could withstand it.","Plus, unlike the Confucian Sages—whose characters were upright and who rarely resorted to using the “Impregnating Gaze” even in battle—","Tyrannical Song, according to reliable information, had initiated battles with the “Impregnating Gaze”!","“Then let’s not fight, and by the way, let’s go see Tyrannical Song’s main body,” said the Book World Immortal, smiling.","Honestly, he was very interested in Tyrannical Song’s main body.","Having recorded a thick volume of the “Biography of Tyrannical Song,” there was much he wanted to personally verify with Tyrannical Song.","Moreover...","“Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, are you searching for Immortals?” asked the Book World Immortal.","“Mister guessed exactly right,” replied Song Fat Ball politely.","“Well then, I actually hold the coordinates of several Immortals, which I could provide to Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song,” the Book World Immortal said, his eyes opening slightly, revealing a cold glint as sharp as a blade.","Song Fat Ball: “???”","He’s actually offering us the coordinates of Immortals voluntarily?","“In fact, those fellows and my Book World have a bit of a grudge. Over the centuries, there have been endless minor frictions. So, if possible, I hope Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song can pay them a visit and give them a little surprise,” said the Book World Immortal.","Fairy Wu Yu: “!!!”","So, there are such maneuvers too!","No wonder people say that scholars are the darkest.","“In a stone realm adjacent to mine, there’s a miniature fairyland called the ‘Mo Pool,’ where a ‘Ran Mo Daoist’ resides. He is a very interesting Immortal, another sovereign Immortal of the Stone Realm after the ‘Stone Emperor.’ Their lineage of Immortals has a particularly strong resilience when beaten,” the Book World Immortal recommended.","Afterward, the Book World Immortal recommended the abodes of two more Immortals to Song Fat Ball.","After making his recommendations, he began to gather his belongings and, taking Fairy Wu Yu with him, headed to the spatial gate opened by Song Fat Ball to meet the legendary Big Shot Tyrannical Song in person.","...","...","In the time-distorted secret realm.","When Fairy Wu Yu and the Book World Immortal stepped in, they immediately felt the flow of ‘time’ being twisted.","“Such a technique has completely surpassed the level of an Immortal, right?” Fairy Wu Yu was shocked right from the start.","Then, the two Immortals directed their gaze towards the location of Tyrannical Song’s main body.","There, Tyrannical Song’s dazed hair, the claws on his shoulders, and the long sword at his waist were all sparkling, radiating the brilliant light of the path to immortality.","At the same time, one Immortal after another was crossing through space to arrive.","The Great Northern Emperor, the master of the Titanium Temple, Immortal Fairy White Bones, the divine dragon of the Beast Realm, the white-robed Golden Trigram, and Sister White Dragon...","A string of ‘Immortal full moons’ was so bright it hurt to look at.","Moreover, in the vacuum, more spatial gates kept opening relentlessly.","Even more Immortal big shots were on their way!","Were Tyrannical Song’s social connections this extensive?","Or were all these beings ones Tyrannical Song had hammered before?","Either relationship illustrated the terrifying extent of Big Shot Tyrannical Song!",".",".","I’m such a salted fish, please give me a monthly pass~~~"]},{"number":3000,"title":"Chapter 3000 - 2998: Multithreaded Fellow Daoists Discussion","paragraphs":["Chapter 3000: Chapter 2998: Multithreaded Fellow Daoists Discussion","In some ways, Song Shuhang indeed had impressive connections.","Since he started his cultivation journey, the number of immortal big shots he knew and had confronted could fill more than two tables at a banquet — and even in the ancient Heavenly City at its peak, gathering the elite from myriad realms, there were only about two tables worth of immortals!","Moreover, the process of Song Shuhang inviting these immortal big shots was quite straightforward — he simply used two different messages, then mass sent them via the “Cultivator Chat System.”","One message was, “Seniors, help me out — coordinates ‘Heavenly Dao Time Secret Realm’, enter from the main world XXX coordinates or the Netherworld Realm YYY coordinates!”","This message was for the particularly close immortal big shots, such as Immortal Fairy White Bones, the Great Northern Emperor, and the White Dragon who had just witnessed Sixteen transcend her heavenly tribulation, among others...","The other message was, “Seniors, do you want immortal information? Want to touch upon the source of immortal information that only ‘immortals’ can access? Come, come to me, I will give all the immortal information to you — please enter from the main world XXX coordinates or Netherworld YYY coordinates — hurry over!”","This message was sent to some immortal big shots whom he had met, added as friends, and had a decent relationship with, like the Senior Dragon from the auxiliary book of Garre’s Holy Mountain in the Beast Realm, the recently departed white-robed Golden Trigram, and the blacksmith sovereign Great Eastern Emperor...","One message was meant to ask for help from the seniors.","The other was for the seniors to come and share treasures.","The effects of these two messages were as seen by the Book World Immortal and Fairy Wu Yu. Two groups of immortals, almost simultaneously, continuously crossed over through spatial means.","For those big shots with spatial abilities, the most convenient feature was their ability to travel!","...","...","“Happy New Year, seniors, please have a seat,” Song Shuhang said.","“Black-skinned sister, Fairy Creation, virtuous lamia, please bring some cushions over, today we shall have a good discussion with the seniors.”","“Great Northern Emperor, you’re here too? You also contacted a master from Buddha Temple? Welcome, of course welcome! No matter how many seniors come, as long as they are at the Immortal Realm, we welcome them all!”","“Senior Dragon from the Beast Realm, is everything still peaceful in the Beast Realm? You also want to call a friend? No problem, of course, no problem!”","Today, Song Shuhang, like a busy little bee, was mingling among the various big shot immortal seniors, welcoming each immortal senior as they arrived.","What’s more delightful, these invited immortal seniors usually had a few close fellow friends, and among these friends, one or two might be at the ‘Immortal’ realm as well.","Thus, just like a rolling snowball, one bringing two, and one bringing three, more and more immortals were invited.","Even if only one in ten of these invited immortals could attend, it was a win for Song Shuhang.","— After all, immortals are not common cabbages, there are only so many in the myriad realms, they truly are precious resources!","The reason Song Shuhang had such a large gathering of immortals was primarily thanks to the ancient Heavenly City.","The big shot immortals from the ancient Heavenly City era, now, many had some ties to Song Shuhang.","...","...","After hosting a round, Song Shuhang approached Book World Immortal and Fairy Wu Yu, “Happy New Year to the two fellow daoists, may I ask your esteemed titles?”","The echoes of fat ball’s presence lingered around these two, evidently, they had just been in contact with fat ball... Song Shuhang immediately understood their origins.","Now experienced in weathering great storms, Song Shuhang naturally wouldn’t point it out, but rather warmly welcomed and seated them, conversing politely and civility!","The Book World Immortal and Fairy Wu Yu exchanged glances—Tyrannical Song’s main body appeared unexpectedly kind and harmless, and when receiving people, he even gave off a refreshing aura.","Fairy Wu Yu smiled slightly and bowed, “I am Wu Yu, I have the pleasure of meeting Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, happy New Year to you.”","“I am the Book Immortal from the Book World, fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, happy New Year to you as well. I recently have been documenting some deeds regarding Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song... If you have some time, I would like to verify some of these deeds with you,” the Book World Immortal initiated.","“Documenting my deeds?” Song Shuhang was taken aback.","“Yes, the ‘Biography of Tyrannical Song,’” the Book World Immortal nodded.","“Haha, haha... If you have things you wish to verify, let’s have a good talk about them afterward,” Song Shuhang said somewhat shyly.","Hearing that someone wanted to write his biography, he felt a strange sense of embarrassment, but also thought it was very interesting and cool.","Thus, Song Shuhang took out his ‘friend QR code’ and said, “Let’s add each other as friends!”","This was an internal friend QR code, different from the ‘Cultivator Chat System’ QR code that was available to the general public. Adding this QR code meant becoming a true friend of Tyrannical Song!","After the friend operation, Song Shuhang guided the Book World Immortal and Fairy Wu Yu to their seats.","Then, he dispatched his three corpses separately to the three-eyed young senior and Senior White to pick up two former ‘spoils of war.’","These were likely still undergoing tribulation bolts and King Kun, who had turned into an egg and was collected by Senior White.","These were also two genuine Immortals, and Song Shuhang naturally wouldn’t overlook them—Immortals were treasured resources that Song Shuhang couldn’t afford to be choosy about.","Meanwhile, Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword had also returned once to seek out Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven, saying he would bring a surprise back for Song Shuhang.","After the Book World Immortal sat down, he glanced around at the glaring circle of ‘Immortal full moons’ and frankly said, he had never seen so many Immortals gathered together in his lifetime!","“I’m pleased to meet all the seniors this New Year... Although I would love to catch up with the seniors, because I’m under a time constraint right now, let’s get straight to the point,” Song Shuhang seated himself cross-legged and said with a smile.","“Wait a moment, Shuhang,” Immortal Fairy White Bones raised her hand and said in a pleasant voice, “You invited so many fellow daoists in one breath, and then you want us all to share the ‘Mysterious Principles of Immortality’ together, isn’t that a bit inappropriate?”","They agreed to share the Mysterious Principles of Immortality with Song Shuhang, but that didn’t mean they were willing to share the core principles with so many other Immortals.","“Fairy, don’t worry, with help from Daozi Senior, I am well prepared,” Song Shuhang replied with a slight smile.","While speaking, a ‘law of the Heavenly Dao’ descended from the void and landed on Tyrannical Song.","Every Immortal present felt a stir in their hearts, staring at Tyrannical Song as they faintly felt a sense of enlightenment.","At that moment, Tyrannical Song made a series of fierce operations in the void.","[Ding~[Server?Cheng Goudan]Tyrannical Song has initiated a ‘Heavenly Axiom-level?One-to-One Private Tutoring Session’ with you, do you agree to start?]","The same notification popped up in the minds of all the Immortal big shots present.","All the seated Immortals exchanged glances, seeing the intention in each other’s eyes—Tyrannical Song was inviting everyone at once.","Was he planning to multi-thread, and grasp the ‘Mysterious Principles of Immortality’ of all the Immortals in one breath?","“Shuhang, is your head not going to explode?” Immortal Fairy White Bones asked.","“Don’t worry, the Heavenly Dao’s protection is with me,” Song Shuhang pointed at his head, confidently stating."]}]);
